{"id": "17751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17751", "title": "Uburezi bw'abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda", "text": "Imibare myinshi kurubungubu irimo kugaragaza ko mu bantu bafite ubumuga bagera kuri 64,69% batigeze bagera mu ishuri ibi bikaba bigaragaza ko\nhakiri icyuho kinini kukugera kuri bwa bukungu bushingiye kubumenyi mu Rwanda. iri ni ibarura ririmo gukorwa mu mwaka\nwibihumbi bibiri na makumyabiri nitanu n'itandatu (2022-2026).\nM'uburezi bwo mu Rwanda..\nHaracyakenewe intwambwe ikomeye mu burezi bw'Abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda mu rwego rwo kugera kuri gahuunda\ny'ubukubgu bushingiye ku bumenyi leta yu Rwanda yiyemeje.\nMu mashuri yo mu Rwanda, hari aho abana bafite ubumuga bigira hamwe nabatabufite hakaba ahandi bigoye bitewe n'ubwoko bw'ubumuga Umwana afite hakaba hakewe amashuri yihariye.\nUmunyamuryango nshingwabikorwa w'umuryango w'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, kutabona, no kutavuga Musabyimana Joseph mu kiganiro yagiranye n'ikinyamakuru yavuzeko abagera kuri 60% mu banyamuryango ari abana bagejeje igihe cyo kwiga ariko ariko ari ntanumwe wigeze arikandagiramo.\nIngamba zafashwe kubafite ubumuga..\nMinisiteri y'uburezi igaragazako urugendo rwo gufasha abana bose bafite ubumuga rukiri rurerure nubwo hashyizweho gahunda y'uburezi budaheza mu Rwanda.\nMinisitiri w'uberzi Twagirayezu Gaspard, yagize ati icyambere twashyizeho ni gahunda y'uburezi budaheza yo gufasha amashuri yacu ngo abana bafite ubumuga babe bakwitabwaho mumashuri asanzwe abarimu biga munderabarezi bahabwe ubushobozi bwo kubafasha ariko hari ababa bafite ibibazo bisaba ko bitabwaho muburyo bwihariye. gusa abo nabo hari amashuri abafasha ikibazo gihari nuko amenshi ari ayigenga. icyo turimo gukora ni ugushakira ayo mashuri ubufasha bwihariye kugirango nabana badafite ubushobozi babe babasha kuyigamo.\nIbarurishamibare ryo gusoma no kwandika kubantu bafite ubumuga..\nIri barura kandi ryasuzumye ibijyanye nubushobozi bwo gusoma no kwandika mu bafite ubumuga. bigaragara ko abagera kuri 44% batabizi Abagore 46% n'abagabo 40% nta bushobozi na buke bwo gusoma no kwandika bafite. mubabizi nabwo abenshi bagarukira ku Kinyarwanda gusa."}
{"id": "17752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17752", "title": "Troupes des Personnes Handicap\u00e9es Twuzazanye-THT", "text": "Itsinda ry\u2019abafite ubumuga Twuzuzanye (mu igifaranza: Troupes des Personnes Handicap\u00e9es Twuzazanye- THT) \nRyashinzwe n'itsinda rito ry\u2019abafite ubumuga muri Nzeri 2007 hagamijwe kunganira no gutumanaho imyitwarire ihinduka ku bumuga binyuze muri siporo n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019imibereho n\u2019umuco. THT igizwe numubare wamatsinda atandukanye yitabira muburyo butandukanye kugirango intego zumuryango zigerweho.\nTHT n\u2019umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta, wanditswe mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko ku nshuro ya mbere mu 2009 kandi kwiyandikisha byongerewe muri 2012 n029 / 11 kugira ngo birangize itegeko rishya nimero 04/2012 ryo ku wa 17/02/2012 rigenga imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta muri RWANDA"}
{"id": "17753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17753", "title": "Idirishya ry'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona", "text": "Idirishya ry'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona ni ubwoko bw'idirishya. Hariho ubwoko bwinshi bw'amadirishya ahuma akoresha sisitemu zitandukanye zo kugenzura. Ubusanzwe idirishya rihumye rigizwe n'ibice byinshi birebire bitambitse cyangwa bihagaritse by'ubwoko butandukanye bw'ibintu bikomeye, harimo ibiti, plastiki cyangwa ibyuma bifatanyirizwa hamwe n imigozi inyura mu bice bihumye bifasha abafite ubumuga. Abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bahagaze bagenda bakurikirana sisitemu ishobora gukingura no gufunga no kwimuka kuruhande. Abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kudirishya bashobora gukoreshwa hamwe n'igitabo cya none cyangwa kigenzurwa muguhinduranya uhereye kumwanya ufunguye, hamwe nibisate byashyizwe hanze, kumwanya ufunze aho ibice bifatanye kandi bigahagarika urumuri rwinshi. Hariho kandi ubwoko bwinshi bw'amadirishya atwikiriye, bita igicucu, gikoresha igice kimwe cy'ibintu byoroshye aho gukoresha ibice.\nIjambo idirishya rihumye rishobora no gukoreshwa mugusobanura idirishya ryagutse. Muri iyi miterere idirishya rihumye harimo hafi y'ubwoko bwose bw'idirishya, niba ari ibintu bikomeye cyangwa byoroshye; ni ukuvuga shitingi, igicucu cya roller, igicucu cya selile (nanone bita igicucu cy'ubuki), abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, igicucu cyAbaroma, impagarike isanzwe, hamwe n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona batambitse (nanone bita Venetiya). Mu Bwongereza, rimwe na rimwe babita abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa ababona igicucu.\nIncamake.\nAmadirishya ahumye agurishwa nk'ibiteguye cyangwa bikozwe kugirango bipime. Nkuko amazina abigaragaza, amadirishya ahumye yateguwe yakozwe kugira ngo bashyirireho ubunini bushingiye ku bipimo bisanzwe by'idirishya, mu gihe amadirishya ahumye yakozwe mubipimisho yaciwe mubugari bwihariye hanyuma bakamanuka kugira ngo bihuze idirishya. Ibyiza by'amadirishya ahumye yiteguye nukuboneka kwabo n'igiciro, mu gihe idirishya rihumye ryakozwe mu gupima rizaba rihenze ariko rihuye neza nubunini bw'idirishya.\nUsibye kuza mubipimo bitandukanye, idirishya rihumye naryo rishobora kuza mu buryo butandukanye, ibikoresho, amabara nuburyo. Hasi n'urutonde rw'uburyo butandukanye buzwi bw'amadirishya ahumye:\nIdirishya rihumye rirashobora gushushanywa n'intoki ukoresheje umugozi, cyangwa zikoresha moteri. Igenzura ryidirishya rihumye rifite moteri zishobora kuva k'umurongo w'urukuta cyangwa kugenzura kure, cyangwa mudasobwa, kuvanaho gukenera imigozi no kwemerera kugenzura ubundi idirishya ridashoboka. Amazu menshi agezweho arimo guhuza amadirishya ahumye hamwe na C-Bus ibisubizo hagati. Igenzurwa ritanga ubworoherane bwo gukoresha kandi rifite akamaro mukugenzura imikorere idahwitse kugira ngo igabanye ubushyuhe mu gihe cy'itumba cyangwa kugabanya ubushyuhe buturuka ku zuba mugihe cyizuba.\u00a0&lt;/link&gt;[\"citation ikenewe\"]\nUbwoko.\nIkibaho.\nIkibaho cy'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, rimwe na rimwe n'ibyakoreshwaga n'Abayapani kuko zishingiye ku kiyapani sh\u014dji, ni ikibaho gihumye cyoroshye mu buryo bw'ikibaho bigenda bikurikirana. Imyenda cyangwa impapuro hafi ya zose zirashobora gukoreshwa, nubwo 90% by'ikibaho cya shoji byose bikoresha polyester yera kugira ngo bigane ' washi ' impapuro zabayapani.\u00a0[\"ibisobanuro bikenewe\"]\nIgicucu cya selile.\nIgicucu cya selile cyangwa selile ihumye, rimwe na rimwe byitwa igicucu cy'ubuki, ni ubwoko bw'idirishya rihumye rikozwe mu mwenda muremure kandi uhoraho ufite imiterere ya selile iyo ufunguye ukizunguruka ubwazo iyo ufunze. Imyenda ikorwa mu bipapuro byoroshye cyangwa imyenda isa nigitambara kandi iraboneka mu buryo butandukanye burimo selile imwe, selile ebyiri cyangwa selile eshatu. Selile ihumye ikora mu gutega umwuka imbere y'imiterere ya selile imaze gufungura no gukora inzitizi hagati y'idirishya n'icyumba. Bitewe no kutaboneka kw'ibizamini bisanzwe, nta sisitemu yo gutondekanya ibaho kugira ngo igereranye imikorere ya amadirishya ahumye.\nIshami rishinzwe ingufu m'Ubwongereza rivuga ko amadirishya n'inzugi bigera hafi kuri kimwe cya gatatu cy'urugo rwatakaje ubushyuhe bwose. Ibi bireba gutakaza ubushyuhe mu gihe cy'imbeho kimwe no kwinjiza ubushyuhe butifuzwa mu gihe cy'izuba. Iyo umwuka uri mucyumba uhuye n'amadirishya, irakonja cyangwa igashyuha. Mu cyumba, uyu mwuka noneho uzenguruka icyumba. Imiterere ya selile mu rihumye ifata umwuka wafashwe kandi ikora inzitizi hagati y'idirishya ry'icyumba, bityo bikagabanya ihererekanyabubasha. Igicucu, ariko, gitanga gusa kugenzura gato kwinjira kw'ikirere. \nMubisanzwe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bose, igicucu cya selile kirashobora kugabanya izuba mu gihe cy'izuba kandi bigatanga icyumba cyijimye cyangwa umwijima wo gusinzira. Kimwe n'ubundi buryo bwo kuvura idirishya, burazamurwa kandi bukamanurwa hamwe n'umugozi. Igicucu kitagira ingirabuzimafatizo kirahari kugira ngo kigabanye ibyago byo kuniga abana bato. Umuntu ashobora kandi kugira uburyo bwo kumanura hejuru yigitutu hasi, cyangwa munsi yigitutu hejuru; mubisanzwe byitwa Hejuru-Hasi-Hasi-Hejuru.\nRoman.\nRoman shades ni ubwoko bw'idirishya rihumye rikoreshwa mu guhagarika izuba. Nubwo bakunze kwita idirishya rihumye, mu byukuri byitwa \"idirishya ry'igicucu\" mumadirishya atwikiriye inganda. Bakunze kwitwa (Roman shades) cyangwa amadirishya abafasha abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona mu Bwongereza. Iyo Abanyaroma bakinguye, barundanye; iyo utwikiriye idirishya ryuzuye, biroroshye bitarenze.\nAmadirishya ahumye y'Abaroma ashobora kugurwa hamwe n'umukara wijimye inyuma kugira ngo uzimye izuba. Nyamara, hazajya habaho icyuho gito cy'umucyo kumpande z'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona niba gishyizwe imbere mumadirishya cyangwa ukareba inyuma y'amadirishya ahumye niba ishyizwe k'umurongo ukikije idirishya.\nBitandukanye nandi ahumye, nk'imyenda imwe ikoreshwa kuri Roller Shades, Vinyl Vertical amadirishya y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, cyangwa idirishya rihumye rya Vinyl Horizontal, Roman Shades ntabwo ari amahitamo meza ku bice bifite ubushuhe bwinshi, nk'ubwiherero cyangwa amadirishya hejuru y'icyari.\nRoller.\nRoller blinds ni ubwoko bw'amadirishya buhumye busanzwe bukozwe mumyenda ya polyester yazengurutse plasitike cyangwa icyuma. Uruziga rushobora kugaragara cyangwa gufungirwa imbere y'ikadiri kandi rushobora gushyirwa hejuru yikiruhuko cy'idirishya cyangwa hanze yikiruhuko. Kugenzura idirishya rihumye rya roller mubusanzwe hariho urunigi cyangwa umugozi kuruhande rw'idirishya rihumye. Iyo urunigi rw'uruhande rukwegejwe icyerekezo kimwe uruziga ruzamura, kandi niba rukwegejwe mu buryo bunyuranye ruzamanuka aho.\nBamwe mubakora kandi bakora verisiyo ya roller blinds zifite ibice bibiri by'imyenda, rimwe na rimwe byitwa ahumye abiri, kugira ngo bigenzurwe cyane no kuyungurura urumuri binyuze mu madirishya. Mubisanzwe, igipande kimwe kiba gikozwe mumyenda yuzuye ishobora gukoreshwa kugira ngo igabanye urumuri, hamwe nigice cya kabiri gisanzwe kirimo umurongo wirabura kugira ngo ushungurwe cyane mu gihe bibaye ngombwa.\nVenetian.\nVenetian ni ubwoko bw'amadirishya ahumye bukozwe mu buryo butambitse busanzwe bumanurwa kandi bugashushanywa hamwe mugukuramo umugozi. Ibice bisanzwe bikozwe hifashishijwe ibikoresho bikomeye nka aluminium, plasitiki, cyangwa ibiti kandi bigenda hamwe binyuze mumurongo winsinga zinyura mu buryo rihumye.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19 no mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, amadirishya ahumye ya Venetian yemewe cyane cyane mu nyubako z'ibiro kugira ngo ziyobore urumuri n'umwuka mu mazu. Inzu nini igezweho muri Amerika yakiriye amadirishya ahumye ya Venetian ni inyubako ya (RCA ya Rockefeller Centre) izwi cyane ku nyubako ya Radio City mu mujyi wa New York, yuzuye mu mwaka 1930. Kimwe mu bintu binini byategetswe kumadirishya ahumyue ya Venetian zigeze gushyirwaho ni i Burlington Venetian Blind Co, ya Burlington, muri Vermont, yatangaga amadirishya ahumye ku madirishya y\u2019inyubako ya Leta y'Ubwami mu mujyi wa New York. \nMu mwaka 1994, igishushanyo cy\u2019amadirishya ahumye yo muri Venetiya yahujwe n\u2019ibirahuri by'idirishya. Ubu bwoko bushya bw'amadirishya ahumye bunesha ibibazo bijyanye no kwangiza no gukora nabi. Mubisanzwe, magnesi zikoreshwa mugukwirakwiza moteri kugira ngo ubungabunge kashe imbere yikirahure.\u00a0&lt;/link&gt;[\"citation ikenewe\"]\nVertical.\nBitandukanye n'amadirishya ahumye atambitse, amadirishya ahumye ahagaritse ntashobora kwegeranya umukungugu kuko ahagaze neza. Kubera ko bashushanya kuruhande aho guterura no kumanura, biroroshye kandi byihuse gukora. Bakora neza kumiryango ya patio no kunyerera idirishya ritembera kuruhande. Mu myaka ya za 70, hari amahitamo make yimyenda ubusanzwe beige cyangwa umweru, yagombaga gushyirwamo imbaraga kugira ngo ikumire, aho nko kumyenda ihuma ariko ikoresha umwenda mwinshi.\nAmadirishya ahumye ahagaritse yabonetse muri plasitiki iringaniye (PVC), fabric, embossed PVC ishushanyijeho, na S-curved slats. Ihinduka rigezweho ni ukubaha ibiti byo hejuru no hepfo rimwe na rimwe hagati kandi ibi bisobanurwa nk \" Abayapani Vertical blinds 'kubera ko akenshi bihuzwa n'Ubuyapani bwa Shoji buhumyi ukoresheje ibiti bimwe. Impumyi zihagaritse kwamamara cyane mu Bwongereza mu myaka ya za 90, kuva icyo gihe ibicuruzwa byagabanutse kuko byatakaje icyamamare hamwe n\u2019abakiri bato.\nAmadirishya ahumye ahagaritse amanikwa kumuryango w'amazu nubucuruzi bimwe na bimwe usanga umuryango ufunguye. Kwimuka kw'amadirishya ahumye bishobora kwerekana impinduka z'umuyaga, cyangwa umuntu winjira m'umuryango. Mubisanzwe, ariko, amadirishya ahumye ahagaritse akozwe muri plasitiki yuzuye. Mu byumba bikonje by'ubucuruzi bw'ibiribwa, ibi bidindiza ubushyuhe mucyumba gikonje. Mu bihe bishyushye, amadirishya ahumye ahagaritse abuza isazi n\u2019utundi dukoko kwinjira mu nyubako. Mu turere tumwe na tumwe two mu Bwongereza amadirishya ahumye akoreshwa mu guhisha ko ibiro bifite PC muri byo kandi bigakoreshwa mu gukumira ubujura.\nIbindi.\nUbundi bwoko bw'iamadirishya ahumye zirimo amadirishya mato (mubisanzwe aluminium, Venetiyani-Style amadirishya ahumye afite uduce duto cyane, mubisanzwe ubugari), amadirishya mato (mubisanzwe ubugari), louvers, jalousies, brise soleil hamwe pleated blinds..\nIbikoresho.\nAmadirishya y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona ashobora gukorwa mubikoresho bitandukanye; bimwe bihenze nibindi bike.amadirishya ahumye ahenze bisanzwe akorwa muri polyester, aluminium, cyangwa PVC. Ibi n'ibikoresho bihendutse byose byoroshye kuboneka nyamara biramba mu gihe kimwe.\nIdirishya rihumye nu buryo bwo kwerekana idirishya, kugera kubisubizo bisa kubiboneka muguhuza umwenda. Amadirishya ahumye mubisanzwe ni ubugari n'uburebure nk'idirishya ubwaryo cyangwa ryagutse gato kandi rirerire ukurikije niba ryashyizwe imbere (Ikiruhuko) cyangwa hanze (Facefix) idirishya ryerekana (ni ukuvuga ikiruhuko cy'urukuta kirimo idirishya ubwaryo ryaba rishyizwemo).\nAmadirishya ahumye afite ingaruka zitandukanye z'ubushyuhe, zishobora guhagarika ubushyuhe butifuzwa n'izuba kandi zishobora kugumana ubushyuhe mu gihe cy'ubukonje. Ariko muri ibyo byombi, bigabanya kandi urumuri ku rwego rutandukanye, bitewe n'igishushanyo. Ubwoko bwinshi bw'amadirishya ahumye bugerageza gutandukanya uburinganire n'igicucu. Amadirishya ahumye ashobora gukorwa mubikoresho byinshi kandi bigakorwa muburyo butandukanye. Ibi mubisanzwe bigena izina amadirishya ahumye azwiho.\nFabric.\nBumwe mu bwoko bw'amadirishya y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona (ubundi zitwa \"igicucu\") akozwe mu mwenda ashobora kuzunguruka (ku muyoboro; Roller shades), kuzingirwa (Roman shades) cyangwa gusunikwa mu buryo bwa bordone (Pleated and Cellular shades). Imyenda myinshi ikoreshwa harimo ipamba, polyester, ubwoya, viscose na silk kugira ngo ikore kuburyo buhumye. Igitambara c'ubudodo kirashobora kuba gihari cyangwa kudoda, bizatanga imyenda itandukanye.\nIgiti.\nAmadirishya ahumye y'imbaho (Venetian blinds).\nIbiti by'amadirishya nk'iby'amadirishya ya Venetian. Umubare w'ibiti bitambitse by'imbaho bifatanyirijwe hamwe nu mugozi ushobora guteranya ibice byose hejuru y'idirishya kugira ngo ugaragaze ibiboneka cyangwa uhagarike gusa ibice mu gihe urumuri runaka rugenda runyuze mu madirishya ahumye nyamara rukagumana urwego runaka rw'ibanga. Amadirishya ahumye akoze mu giti kiza mu mubare wuzuye (ugenwa n'ubwoko bw'ibiti byakoreshejwe, biva ku irangi kugeza ku bwoko bwinshi bw'amoko akomeye) n'ubunini (bigenwa n'ubugari bwa buri kibanza gikunze kuboneka muri bumwe mu bugari butatu - 25\u00a0mm, 35\u00a0mm cyangwa 50\u00a0mm). Amadirishya ahumye y'imbaho za Venetian nayo aboneka nkahumye ahagaritse. Ubusanzwe ibyo bigizwe nibice bigari kandi bigakora mu buryo bumwe na bagenzi babo batambitse (nukuvuga aho gushushanya hejuru kugira ngo bagaragaze idirishya, bashushanya kuruhande rumwe bateranyiriza m'umurongo uhagaze).\nPinoleum blinds.\nAmadirishya ahumye ya pinusi agizwe n'uduti duto tw'ibiti dushyizwe kuri horizontal duhujwe nu mugozi uhagaze. Ububoshyi bwavuyemo, nk'igisubizo, gusa buhindagurika kandi bushobora gushushanywa hejuru iyo bumaze gukorwa nk'amadirishya ahumye ya roller cyangwa mu buryo busa n'ahumye ya Venetian. Amadirishya ahumye ya conservateur zikorwa kenshi na Pinoleum.\nMuri Maleziya, amadirishya ahumye yo hanze rimwe na rimwe yitwa \"chik\". Ijambo ryakuwe mu Buhinde n\u2019abongereza mu gihe cy'abakoloni.\nFaux wood.\nAmadirishya ahumye y'inkwi za faux n'ubundi buryo bwo guhuma ibiti. Ibiti bya faux bizwi kandi mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe nka Plaswood (Plastike &amp; Wood). Ikozwe mu bikoresho byakozwe n'abantu hamwe n'ibiti bisanzwe, ibiti bya faux bishobora guhitamo ibihenze kuruta ibiti bisanzwe. Amadirishya ahumye amaze kumenyekana cyane kuko ibicuruzwa bimaze gukura, bigenda bihendutse kandi bihindagurika icyarimwe bitanga byinshi mu biti bisanzwe. Amadirishya ahumye y'imbaho zubu zishobora guhangana n'intambara, zifite UV zingana na 500 kandi ziza mumabara, byagorana kubona mubihumye by'ibiti bisanzwe. Kubera ko barwanya kurwara, ahumye amadirishya y'ibiti bikwiranye nibice bifite ubushyuhe bukabije cyangwa ubuhehere bukabije, nk'ubwiherero nigikoni.\nIbindi bikoresho.\nIhumye ya Venetiya, yombi yitambitse kandi ahagaritse, araboneka mubikoresho byinshi byakozwe n'abantu (bisa n'ibiti cyangwa ibyuma cyangwa plasitiki gusa). Ibi bikwiranye n\u2019ahantu ubushuhe cyangwa guhura n\u2019amazi bishobora gutera ikibazo, nkubwiherero n'igikoni. amadirishya ahumye akunze kuboneka hamwe na micro slate (ntoya nka 16 mm cyangwa munsi). Igisubizo cy'ibice bito ni uko byinshi bigomba gukoreshwa kugira ngo uhishe idirishya burundu. ahumye ya konserwatori (ni ukuvuga igisenge cyashyizweho hakoreshejwe umubare utambitse wa (horizontal) akenshi bikozwe mubikoresho byakozwe n'abantu.\nUmutekano.\nAmadirishya ahumye afunze idirishya agaragaza ingaruka zo kuniga abana, bigatuma muri Amerika hapfa abantu 184 hagati y'umwaka 1996 na 2012. Kwibuka idirishya ritwikiriye ibicuruzwa ntabwo byagabanije cyane umubare wimpfu kuva mu mwaka 1980. Ibikoresho bya Retrofit byakoreshejwe kuva mu mwaka 1995 kugira ngo \"bigabanye\" ibyago byo kuniga; ariko, abana banizwe ku bikoresho bya retrofit kuva mu mwaka 1995. CPSC yo muri Amerika irasaba gukoresha idirishya ridafite umugozi cyangwa idirishya ridafite aho abana baba cyangwa basuye. Kubifuniko by'idirishya bikoresha sisitemu ikomeza-izunguruka, nk'amadirishya ahumye ahagaritse, uruzitiro rw'urukuta rushobora gukoreshwa mu guhuza umugozi neza kurukuta kandi bikabuza abana kutabona umugozi wimanitse. Idirishya rihumye ibice bifatanyirizwa hamwe n'insinga zemerera kugoreka ibice, kuzamura cyangwa kumanura, kandi birashobora guteza akaga iyo bidakabije. Nukwiyongeraho kwirinda, guhagarika umugozi bigomba gushyirwaho neza kandi bigahinduka kugira ngo bigabanye kugenda kw'imigozi y'imbere. \nVehicle blinds.\nImodoka zimwe zirimo cyangwa zashyizwemo amadirishya y'abatabona z'izuba ku madirishya y'inyuma. Reba kandi ikirahure cy'imodoka. Ay'abatabona zikoreshwa mukurinda ikinyabiziga n'abagenzi izuba ryinshi.\nIgicucu cy'imodoka nubundi buryo busanzwe bwo kurinda ikinyabiziga. Igicucu cy'inyuma y'imbere cyagenewe gukingurwa no kwicara imbere y'idirishya. Bishobora kuba bikozwe muri plasitiki cyangwa ikarito. Igicucu kijya kumadirishya k'uruhande rw'ikinyabiziga gisanzwe gifatanye ukoresheje ibikombe cyangwa gufatana neza."}
{"id": "17754", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17754", "title": "James Gillingham", "text": "James Gillingham 1839\u20131924\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nGillingham yize mu ishuri rya Chard.\nUmwuga.\nGillingham yari azwi ku nkweto za Victorian no kudoda inkweto mu iduka rye ryitwa Zahabu y'inkweto kugeza mu mwaka 1863, ubwo yatangiraga gukora ibihimbano byakozwe mu ruhu kandi abumba nk'inkweto. Igihimba cye cya mbere cy\u2019ubukorikori ni icya William Singleton, umugabo wari wabuze ukuboko arasa imbunda kurugamba kuba atabasha kugira ngo asuhuze mubirori, Gillingham yakoze nta kiguzi Singleton. Yahise akora protezi ku buryo buhoraho. Chard, nk'igisubizo, yabaye ikigo kinini cy'inganda z'ubukorikori bw'abongereza. Ingero ziva mu mahugurwa ya Gillingham zirerekanwa mu nzu ndangamurage ya Chard. \nIkinyamakuru cy\u2019ubuvuzi \"cya Lancet\" mu kiganiro cyo mu mwaka 1868 cyasobanuye ko prostheses ya Gillingham ari ikomeye, yoroheje, kandi iramba kandi ifata iminsi 10 kandi yo gukora, \"kwambara byoroshye kandi ntibishoboka ko byava mu gusana, byoroshye mu bwubatsi, kandi ni byiza k'ubuzima muko igaragara. \" Yiswe 'Ukuguru kw'uruhu', Gillingham yahinduye uruhu ku gihimba cy'umurwayi mbere yo gukomera. Kugeza mu mwaka 1910, yari amaze kugarura imikorere ku barwayi barenga 15.000. Yafashe amafoto yumukara n'umweru kugirango yerekane ibisobanuro kandi bikwiranye na buri prostate. \nInkuru ya Gillingham yashyizwe mu ibarankuru r\"ya BBC One\" 2017 yagaragazaga inzu ndangamurage ya Chard. \nIgitabo.\nMu mwaka 2001, umwanditsi Derrick W. Warren yanditse igitabo \"James Gillingham: Surgical Mechanist &amp; Manufacturer of Artific Limbs\", cyanditswe na Somerset Industrial Archaeological Society. "}
{"id": "17755", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17755", "title": "Sisitemu ya SynCardia", "text": "SynCardia Systems, LLC, ifite icyicaro i Tucson, muri Arizona, yashinzwe mu mwaka 2001 kandi ni yo yonyine ikora kandi itanga isoko yonyine byemewe ku isi kandi yemewe mu bucuruzi bw'Umutima wuzuye w\u2019ubukorikori cyangwa umutima mukorano. \nSynCardia by'agateganyo Umutima ukorwa uzwi kuzina rya (Total Artificial heart) umaze imyaka irenga 35 ukoreshwa mubuvuzi. \nAmateka.\nSynCardia yashinzwe mu mwaka 2001 n\u2019umuganga ubaga umutima witwa Jack G. Copeland, MD; injeniyeri m'ubuvuzi Richard G. Smith, MSEE, CCE; n'inzobere mu b'ijyanye n'indwara z'umutima Marvin J. Slepian, MD; hamwe na Steven Langford BSEE, nk'umuyobozi mukuru. Uyu munsi, SynCardia ni ishami ryuzuye rya Picard Medical kandi rikomeza kuba uruganda rukora kandi rutanga isoko rwo nyine ryemewe ry'umutima. Mugukoresha amavuriro mu myaka irenga 35, SynCardia y'igihe gito y'umutima wakozwe cyangwa w'ubukorikori (TAH-t) niyo ikoreshwa cyane kandi yizwe na (Total Artificial Heart) Umutima mpimbano kwisi.\nMu mwaka 2004, FDA yemeje SynCardia TAH (yahoze yitwa \"CardioWest by'agateganyo Umutima mpimbano wa Artificial Heart\") nk'ikiraro cyo gutera inkunga cyangwa gufasha abafite ikibazo cy'umutima ku bakandida baterwa n'umutima wemerewe ibyago byo gupfa byatewe no gutsindwa kwa biventricular. \nIbicuruzwa bya SynCardia birimo umwimerere wa 70cc TAH; bishya, bikiri bitoya 50cc TAH, yagenewe guhuza abarwayi bafite uburebure buto, harimo abagore n'ingimbi benshi, Umushoferi w'ibitaro 2 (C2), utanga imbaraga za pneumatic power kuri TAH binyuze mugukiza abarwayi mubitaro na Freedom Portable Driver, pompe ntoya, yimuka ya pneumatic ya TAH ituma abarwayi bahagaze bujuje ibyangombwa bisohoka bishimira ubuzima murugo mu gihe bategereje umutima w'umuterankunga. \nUsibye kuba yarakoreshejwe nk'ikiraro cyo guhindurwa muri Amerika, Kanada n'Uburayi, 70cc TAH yashyigikiye abarwayi benshi nk'ubuvuzi bwo kwerekeza ku barwayi bakuze batemerewe guterwacyangwa guhabwa. Umurwayi umaze igihe kirekire ushyigikiwe na SynCardia Total Artificial Heart Umutima muhimbano k'umuntu utemerewe guhindurirwa byari hejuru y'imyaka 6 namezi 9. Yabayeho m'ubuzima busanzwe murugo hamwe n'umugore we. Hafi ya 50cc TAH yemerewe gukoreshwa nk'ikiraro cyo guhindurwa kubarwayi babana ndetse nabakuze. \nMuri Nzeri mu mwaka wa 2016, SynCardia yaguzwe na Versa Capital Management, LLC, ikigo cy\u2019ishoramari ry\u2019imigabane ya Philadelphia ikorera mu mujyi wa Philadelphia muri America hanyuma igurwa na Piccard Medical muri Nzeri mu mwaka 2021, itanga ubundi buryo bw\u2019imari n\u2019ibikorwa byafasha mu buryo bwo kwinjiza. \nInyandiko yerekanwe cyangwa ikiganiro kivuga kuri SynCardia TAH cyasohotse mu mwaka 2016. Patrick Schnegelsberg yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa SynCardia. "}
{"id": "17756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17756", "title": "Umuryango Nyarwanda w\u2019Abagore Bafite Ubumuga-UNABU", "text": "Umuryango Nyarwanda w\u2019Abagore Bafite Ubumuga (Mu icyongereza: Rwandan Organization of Women with Disabilities-UNABU) \nN'umuryango utanga imbaraga zitandukanye, imibereho ndetse nibikorwa byubuvugizi kubakobwa nabagore bafite ubumuga. Mu rwego rwo kugabanya ivangura, kwigunga no kutagaragara by\u2019abakobwa n\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga mu muryango w\u2019u Rwanda, \nAmateka.\nUNABU ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta uhagarariye Aba Nyarwandaw'Abagore Bafite Ubumuga kandi uhindurwa mu Cyongereza nk'Umuryango w'Abanyarwanda bafite ubumuga. Yashinzwe mu 2004 n\u2019abagore 14 bafite ubumuga butandukanye ku bagore bafite ubumuga. Biyandikishije mu Nama y'Ubutegetsi y'u Rwanda biyandikishije No06 / RGB / ONG / 2017. UNABU ikomeje kuba ishyirahamwe ryonyine ry\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga butandukanye batekereza umuryango aho abagore bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ubwoko bwose bafite amahirwe angana kandi angana kandi bakagira uruhare rugaragara mu iterambere ry\u2019igihugu.\nUNABU irimo gutegura ikarita y\u2019abafite ubumuga izafasha aba bakobwa n\u2019abagore kwifatanya neza n\u2019abayobozi b\u2019abaturage kugira ngo bakangurire ivangura n\u2019ihohoterwa bakora mu maso. UNABU iteganya amanota nkuburyo bwo gutanga intambwe zifatika kubatanga serivise nubucuruzi kugirango barusheho kuba abantu bafite ubumuga. Bizera kandi ko ubuvugizi bwabo buzemeza ko abakobwa n'abagore bafite ubumuga bashyirwa mu bice byose bigize umuryango w\u2019abagore bo mu Rwanda, ibyo bikaba byatanga urubuga runini rwo guteza imbere gahunda zabo zo kugera no kudahuza. Binyuze muri Amplify, UNABU izagerageza kandi isubiremo amanota yabashyizwemo kandi ishake inzira zo gushishikariza abatanga serivise nubucuruzi kumenya no kunoza serivisi zabo.\nIntego.\nGuteza imbere uburinganire no gukuraho inzitizi zibuza WWD kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019igihugu. UNABU yashinzwe mu 2002, n\u2019abagore 14 bahagarariye ubwoko butandukanye bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kandi niwo muryango wonyine uhagarariye abagore bafite ubumuga mu Rwanda.\nIbyo bakora.\nUNABU iha imbaraga ababana n'ubumuga kuba intumwa zimpinduka, gusaba uburenganzira bwabo no kwemeza icyubahiro cyabo nkabantu binyuze mubuvugizi no guha imbaraga WWDs kugirango ibikorwa by\u2019abaturage bikomere. Igikorwa cy\u2019ubuvugizi cya UNABU gihujwe n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imyororokere n\u2019uburenganzira, kugera ku butabera, no guteza imbere ubukungu."}
{"id": "17757", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17757", "title": "Family Centered Initiative for Challenged Persons (FACICP)", "text": "Umuryango uharanira inyungu z'abantu bafite ibibazo (Mu icyongereza: Family Centered Initiative for Challenged Persons (FACICP)\nNi umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta, wanditswe muri komisiyo ishinzwe ibikorwa (CAC) muri Nijeriya ufite intego yo guhuza ibibazo by\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga mu nzego zinyuranye z\u2019imibereho n\u2019inzego. Bizera ko ibibazo by\u2019abafite ubumuga ari uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019iterambere kandi SI Ubugiraneza. Bakomeje gushakisha ubushakashatsi hagati y\u2019uburinganire n\u2019ubumuga hagamijwe guteza imbere kugaragara n\u2019iterambere ryuzuye ku bagore bafite ubumuga nk\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUburyo bakora.\nBinyuze mu bushakashatsi, ubuvugizi, guteza imbere politiki n'ubufatanye. Bakora ibikorwa byabo byiterambere birambye kubantu bafite ubumuga\nIcyerekezo:.\nUmuryango uhuriweho aho uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, cyane cyane abagore n\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga byubahirizwa mu nzego zose, guhera ku miryango yabo,"}
{"id": "17758", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17758", "title": "Disability Not A Barrier Initiative (DINABI)", "text": "Disability Not A Barrier Initiative-DINABI n\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu, ubungabunga uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ugamije guteza imbere uburinganire, n\u2019ubutabera bw\u2019abafite ubumuga binyuze mu mahugurwa, ubukangurambaga, ubushakashatsi n\u2019ubuvugizi hagamijwe kubona isi aho ababana n\u2019ubumuga bishyizwe hamwe kandi babishyiramo sosiyete mu bukungu, politiki, amasomo ndetse n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage mu gihe nayo ifite uburenganzira n'amahirwe angana muri sosiyete itarangwamo ivangura n'ihohoterwa kandi ikabasha kugira uruhare rugaragara mu miyoborere no kubaka igihugu.\nAmateka.\nDINABI yashinzwe mu 2011 muri leta ya Ondo kandi ihuzwa na komisiyo ishinzwe ibikorwa hamwe nimero ya CAC / IT / 128725.\nUwashinze DINABI, Olajide Funso yabaye umuntu ufite ubumuga afite imyaka 80 bitewe no guterwa inshinge n'umuforomokazi nyuma yo gushyirwa mu bitaro kubera uburwayi bworoheje. Icyemezo cya Olajide gutsinda kandi nanone kigira ingaruka byatumye atangira DINABI.\nDINABI ni umuryango wibanda ku bumuga uharanira icyubahiro no kubahiriza uburenganzira no gushyira mu bikorwa ubukungu-ubukungu bw\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nIcyerekezo.\nPolitiki &amp; socio-ubukungu.\nKubona isi aho ababana nubumuga bishyizwe hamwe kandi binjizwa muri societe mubukungu, politiki, amasomo ndetse n'imibereho.\nUBURENGANZIRA Buringaniye &amp; UBUTABERA.\nKubona isi aho ababana nubumuga bafite uburenganzira n\u2019amahirwe angana muri sosiyete itarangwamo ivangura n\u2019ihohoterwa.\nLeta &amp; igihugu-kubaka.\nKubona isi aho ababana n'ubumuga bagira uruhare rugaragara mu miyoborere, gufata ingamba no kubaka igihugu."}
{"id": "17759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17759", "title": "Imiryango yabafite ubumuga", "text": "Imiryango yabafite ubumuga.\nImiryango yabafite ubumuga m'Urwanda ihangayikishijwe no gutungwa n'inkunga z'amahanga..\nImiryango yita kubafite ubumuga mu Rwanda ishimako hari byinshi leta yakoze \nbirimo gushyirwaho amategeko akumira ihezwa mubuyobozi cyangwa muri sosiyete\nariko isigaranye ikibazo cy'ingutu cyoguhora iteze amaso inkunga z'amahanga.\nAbahagarariye imiryango bagaragaje izi mungenge munama nkuru yabafite \nubumuga mu Rwanda yateraiye ikigali kuwa 26 kamena 2018. Bizimana Dominique\nuyoboye ihuriro ry'imiryango 13 yita kubafite ubumuga bo m'uRwanda, yavuzeko \nbafite imungenge z'inkunga bahora bateze ku mahanga bakifuzako leta yagira\nuruhare mukubafasha murwego rwo kwijyira.\nYakomeje avuga ko bamaze iminsi mubiganiro na leta y'u Rwnda muri gahunda yo kwigira\nkugira ngo habeho ko yajya ibaha inkunga aho gutegereza inkunga za amahanga.\nYavuze kandi ko imwe muri iyi miryango iri muri NUDOR igenda icika inege hakaba\nn'igenda ifunga imiryangokumamvu za amikoro no kubura aho ikorera. \nindankanuro.\n1.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/imiryango-y-abafite-ubumuga-mu-rwanda-ihangayikishijwe-no-gutungwa-n-inkunga-z\n2.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/imiryango-y-abafite-ubumuga-mu-rwanda-ihangayikishijwe-no-gutungwa-n-inkunga-z\n3.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/imiryango-y-abafite-ubumuga-mu-rwanda-ihangayikishijwe-no-gutungwa-n-inkunga-z\n4.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/imiryango-y-abafite-ubumuga-mu-rwanda-ihangayikishijwe-no-gutungwa-n-inkunga-z\n5.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/imiryango-y-abafite-ubumuga-mu-rwanda-ihangayikishijwe-no-gutungwa-n-inkunga-z"}
{"id": "17760", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17760", "title": "Gendron, Inc.", "text": "Gendron, Inc. ni isosiyete y'abanyamerika ukora ibikoresho by'abamugaye, ibitanda by'ibitaro, n'ibindi bikoresho by'ubuvuzi biherereye i Bryan, Ohio \nAmateka.\nIsosiyete ya Gendron Iron Wheel yashinzwe muri 1872 i Toledo, muri Leta ya Ohio muri Amerika, ishingwa na Peter Gendron (wavutse muri 1844-1910). Gendron yabanje gukora amapine y'insinga z'imodoka. Muri 1890, amapine y'amagare, amapikipiki, intebe, amagare y\u2019abana, y\u2019ibipupe, amapine ya kwasteri, n'ayabamugaye, \nMuri 1927, Gendron yabaye ishami ry'igihugu cy'Amerika. Umunyamerika washinzwe isosiyete ifasha ibigo bitatu: Toledo Metal Wheel, National Wheel, na American Wheel. Ibicuruzwa by'Abanyamerika, Toledo, na Gendron byagurishijwe ku mazina y'ubucuruzi ya Pioneer, Skippy, Express, Reliance, Hi-Speed, Hi-Way, Umuvuduko wihuta, Blue Streak, Sampson, na Streamline. \nMu mpera za 1930, Igihugu cy'amerika yagize ibibazo byamafaranga. Muri 1941, umutungo n'uburenganzira bwose ku murongo w'ibicuruzwa byaguzwe n'itsinda ry'inganda za Toledo ziyobowe na Walter H. Diemer, wahoze ari Perezida wa Amerika. Aho isosiyete nshya yashinzwe nka sosiyete ya Gendron Wheel Company yimukira i Perrysburg, muri Leta ya Ohio. Isosiyete yateguwe na \" gukora, gutumiza mu mahanga, kohereza mu mahanga, kugura, kugurisha, no muri rusange mu igare ry\u2019ibimuga, ibikoresho byo gukoresha n\u2019ibindi byorohereza abana bato \". \nMuri iki gihe Gendron, Inc. kuri ubu ikora nk'isosiyete yo gucunga abarwayi igendanwa yo gutwara, kuvura ihahamuka, gufata amashusho, abarwaye ibibari, ndetse n'uburyo bwihariye "}
{"id": "17761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17761", "title": "Imiryango iba muri NUDOR", "text": "Umuryango NUDOR.\nNUDOR yatangije umushinga wokwita kubana nu urubyiruko bafite ubumuga mumiryango babamo..\nWonjyeye imbaraga muri gahunda zari zisanzweho zo kwita kubafite ubumuga \nTwagirima Euegen, umukozi wa NUDOR, akaba umuhuza bikorwa pogarame \ny'iterambere ridaheza rishingiye kumuryango [SBR], avugako uyu mushinga \nuzibana kubana n'urubyiruko kujyeza kumyaka 25 bafite ubumuga,NUDOR\nikaba aricyo kicukiro yibandaho bakorana na foundation Liliane yo mubuhorandi\nkuko ariyo ibatera inkunga muriyo porogarame.\nNUDOR kandi usibye kwita kurabo bafite ubumuga igira n' uruhare mu kubaka\nubushobozi bw'umuryango uwo muntu ufite ubumuga abamo kujyirango uwomuryango\nugire uruhare mukwita kuruwo muntu ufite ubumuga. Nyuma yoguhura abafatanya bikorwa \nbafasha muishyirwa bikorwa ry'uyu mushinga hazabaho kubarura urugo kurundi\nabana n'urubyiruko bafite ubumuga kugirango bamenyekane ndetse bafashwe. \nINDANGANTURO\n1.https://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amakuru-mu-rwanda/article/nudor-yatangije-umushinga-wo-kwita-ku-bana-n-urubyiruko-bafite-ubumuga-mu-miryango-babamo\n2.https://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amakuru-mu-rwanda/article/nudor-yatangije-umushinga-wo-kwita-ku-bana-n-urubyiruko-bafite-ubumuga-mu-miryango-babamo\n3.https://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amakuru-mu-rwanda/article/nudor-yatangije-umushinga-wo-kwita-ku-bana-n-urubyiruko-bafite-ubumuga-mu-miryango-babamo"}
{"id": "17762", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17762", "title": "Hoveround", "text": "Hoveround ni sosiyete y'Abanyamerika ikora kandi ikwirakwiza ibikorsho by\u2019abamugaye (bizwi kandi moteri by'abamugaye) kandi bigurisha nk'ibifite moteri, lifutu, ibitambambuga hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho bikoresha intebe.\nIsosiyete yashinzwe muri 1992 n'uwahoze ari umuforomo akaba n'uwahimbye nka Tom Kruse, ifite icyicaro i Sarasota, muri Floride. Ibicuruzwa byayo bikoreshwa na batiri, byakozwe mbere na mbere kugirango bifashe abantu bafite ibibazo byo kugenda mu ngo zabo no gukorosha ibikorwa bijyanye na n'imibereho ya buri munsi (MRADLs).\nHoveround igurisha kubaguzi kandi bishingikiriza cyane kuri tereviziyo, amabaruwa n'urubuga bakoresha cyane rwabo kugirango bagurishe.\nMuri 2012, isosiyete yijihije isabukuru y'imyaka 20 kandi ifite abakozi barenga 500.\nMu mpera z'umwaka wa 2015, Ibiro by'Ubugenzuzi Bukuru byasanze Hoveround gusubiza guverinoma miliyoni 27 z'amadolari kugira ngo akoreshe amashanyarazi avuga ko atujuje ibyangombwa bisabwa na Medikare. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nUmuhimbyi Thomas Kruse, hamwe na barumuna be George na Robert, na se wabo Gerald Ewing, bashinze Hoveround Corporation muri Mata 1992. Yubatswe kugirango yongere umuvuduko wabakoresha igare ry'abamugaye, Hoveround yaroheje imikorere, ihumure n'igihe kirekire.\nGukora.\nHoveround gakondo ikoranya intebe zikoresha amashanyarazi mu bikorwa by'uruganda rukora mu majyepfo yuburengerazuba bwa Foloride.\nIbicuruzwa.\nHoveround igurisha intebe y\u2019ibimuga, ibimoteri bifite moteri, kuzamura umuntu ku giti cye, ibitambambuga hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho bitandukanye by\u2019ibimuga."}
{"id": "17763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17763", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'ibigo bya kaminuza z'abafite ubumuga-AUCD", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'ibigo bya kaminuza z'abafite ubumuga (mu icyongereza: Association of University Centers on Disabilities -AUCD) \nNi ishyirahamwe ryabanyamuryango rishyigikira kandi riteza imbere umuyoboro wigihugu wa gahunda zishingiye kuri kaminuza zitandukanye.\nIcyerekezo.\nAUCD iteganya ejo hazaza aho abantu bose, harimo nabafite ubumuga bwiterambere n\u2019abandi bafite ubumuga, barimo, abitabiriye umuryango wabo. Turabona uburyo bunoze bwo kubona inkunga na serivisi byerekana ibyifuzo n'indangagaciro z'imiryango itandukanye kandi biganisha ku kwishyira ukizana, kwigenga, gutanga umusaruro, hamwe n'ubuzima bwiza kandi bushimishije.\nInshingano.\nIntego ya AUCD ni uguteza imbere politiki n\u2019imikorere biteza imbere ubuzima, uburezi, imibereho myiza n\u2019ubukungu imibereho myiza y\u2019abantu bose bafite ubumuga bw\u2019iterambere n\u2019ubundi bumuga, imiryango yabo, ndetse n\u2019abaturage babo bafasha abanyamuryango bacu mu bushakashatsi, uburezi, ubuzima, na serivisi ibikorwa bigera ku cyerekezo cyacu.\nAbawugize.\nAbatari abanyamuryango bakira TA.\nIzi porogaramu zikorera kandi ziri muri leta zose z\u2019Amerika kandi zose zigizwe na kaminuza cyangwa ibigo nderabuzima. Bakora nk'ikiraro hagati ya kaminuza nabaturage, bahuza ibikoresho byombi kugirango bagere ku mpinduka zifatika.\nAUCD ishyigikira uyu muyoboro wigihugu binyuze mu: \nUbuyobozi kubibazo bikomeye byimibereho bigira ingaruka kubantu bose babana nubumuga bwiterambere cyangwa ubundi bumuga cyangwa bakeneye ubuzima bwihariye\nUbuvugizi na Kongere n'inzego z'ubuyobozi nyobozi zitera inkunga kandi zikagenga gahunda zikoreshwa n'ababana n'ubumuga\nGuhuza no gufatanya nandi mashyirahamwe yigihugu kugirango uteze imbere gahunda yigihugu\nGutezimbere itumanaho murusobe hamwe nandi matsinda mukusanya, gutunganya, no gukwirakwiza amakuru kubikorwa byurusobe nibikorwa\nGutanga ubufasha bwa tekiniki kumurongo mugari\nIbyo bakora.\nBinyuze mu banyamuryango bayo, AUCD ni umutungo w\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze, iz'igihugu, iz'igihugu, n\u2019amahanga mpuzamahanga, imiryango, hamwe n\u2019abafata ibyemezo bireba abantu babana n\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019iterambere ndetse n\u2019indi miryango yabo. Abanyamuryango bakora ibikorwa bitandukanye bitandukanye birimo:\nGahunda za AUCD kandi zihugura ab'igihe kizaza cy'abayobozi mu bushakashatsi bujyanye n'ubumuga, amahugurwa, gutanga serivisi, no kunganira politiki kugira ngo iki gikorwa cy'ingenzi gikomeze."}
{"id": "17764", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17764", "title": "Invacare", "text": "Invacare Corporation ni uruganda rw'abamerika ukora kandi rukwirakwiza ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi bidakabije birimo intebe y\u2019abamugaye, abamugaye bagenda,na walker (mobility), hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa by\u2019ubuhumekero. Icyicaro gikuru kiri muri Elyria, muri Leta ya Ohio, kuri ubu isosiyete ikwirakwiza ibicuruzwa byayo mu bihugu birenga 80 ku isi. Muri Gashyantare 2023, Invakare yavuze ko yatanze ikirego mu bice cya 11. \nAmateka.\nAmateka ya Invakare ahera muri 1885 igihe Sosiyete ya Worthington yatangiraga gukora intebe nini y\u2019abamugaye. Imirongo y'ibicuruzwa yaguzwe inshuro nyinshi, ariko intego yibanze yagumye mu magare y'abamugaye.\nUyu munsi,\u00a0 binyuze mu biguzi byinshi bagurishaga, Invacare imaze gukura igera kuri miliyari 1.8 z'amadolari y\u2019isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa by\u2019ubuvuzi, itanga ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi birenga 25.000 n\u2019ibicuruzwa byayo kandi ikabikwirakwiza mu bihugu birenga 80 ku isi. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, Invacare yagiranye amasezerano yo kwemeranya na guverinoma nkuru y\u2019ibicuruzwa n\u2019ibikoresho bimwe na bimwe. \nMuri Mata 2017, ikigo cyamenyesheje ko sosiyete ko yemeye raporo ya kabiri cy\u2019icyemezo cyavuguruwe yemerera ko Invakare gukomeza imirimo yo gushushanya mu kigo cyayo cya Elyria, OH. iyi sosiyete itegereje gusubirwamo no kwemerwa na raporo ya gatatu. \nIgihembo cya Harvard Alumni Achievement Award.\nKu ya 27 Nzeri 2007, A. Malachi Mixon yahawe igihembo cy\u2019ikirenga mu ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Harvard, igihembo cya Alumni Achievement Award, na Dean Jay O. Light. Iki gihembo kandi cyahawe n'umuyobozi wa Ayala Corp. Jaime Augusto Zobel de Ayala, Martin Sorrell, Donna Dubinsky na Hansj\u00f6rg Wyss wa Synthes. "}
{"id": "17765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17765", "title": "Wheelchair cushion", "text": "Wheelchair cushion n' umusego wabugenewe kugirango utange ihumure no kurinda imvune kubakoresha igare ry'abafite ubumuga. Bafasha kandi muburyo bukwiye mukoresha muburyo bukwiye.\nAbakoresha igare ry\u2019ibimuga bafite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara ibisebe. Ibintu byinshi bishyirwa mubikorwa byo gushinga ibisebe harimo:\nUbushakashatsi butari buke bwerekana umuvuduko wimbere hagati yumubiri nubuso bwicara nkumusanzu wambere mugutera ibisebe byumuvuduko. Mu gusubiza, abayikoze bakoze intebe yintebe yintebe yintebe. Kuva mu 2001, imideli irenga 200 y\u2019ibimuga by\u2019ibimuga byari ku isoko.\nIbiranga.\nIbiranga ibintu bitandukanye, bihujwe numubare wibikoresho bifatika, bitanga ibintu byinshi bishoboka, bishobora gukoreshwa mugutanga imikorere itandukanye. Iyi mitungo igamije guha abamugaye ibimuga neza, gutekana, hamwe ninkunga ya posita, hamwe nubufasha mukurinda ibisebe byumuvuduko.\nImikorere yo guhitamo ikintu runaka nigishushanyo gifite itandukaniro ryinshi kubijyanye nubuvuzi bukenewe nibikorwa. Kurugero, niba umukoresha wibimuga yimuka akunze kugenda hejuru yubuso, imyenda ya gel ntishobora kuba nziza kuko idakora neza mugukurura ingaruka.\nKuzunguruka n'abandi. yatanze igitekerezo gikurikira cyo gusobanura no gusobanura ibiranga umusego:\nIbikoresho n'ubwubatsi.\nImyenda ikoresheje ibikoresho bya selile - ifuro (ihindagurika, igabanijwe), matrike yoroheje, ifuro ya viscoelastic ifuro cyangwa matrix, ifuro idakora neza cyangwa matrix\nImyenda irimo amazi - viscoelastic fluid, umusego wo mu kirere, umusego wamazi\nIbindi byubaka - elastomer ikomeye na gel ikomeye, umusego hamwe no kwimura ibintu bikomeye\nUko bigaragara.\nIbiranga ubuso - gupakurura ubujyakuzimu bwapanze, uburebure bwa kontour yuzuye, kontour, gukata, gutandukanya, ifuro ryinshi.\nIbiranga - inkunga ya preischial, infashanyo yinyuma, inkunga yibibero byo hagati, inkunga yibibero\nIbindi - bihujwe, icyumba cyangwa icyumba, gukomera, igorofa cyangwa igoramye"}
{"id": "17767", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17767", "title": "K\u00fcschall", "text": "K\u00fcschall AG, ifite icyicaro i Aesch, muri Busuwisi, ni uruganda rukora amagare y'abamugaye.\nAmateka.\nIsosiyete yashinzwe muri 1978 na Rainer K\u00fcschall wari muri quadriplegike. cyari icyitegererezo cy'ambere cya K\u00fcschall yatsindiye mu irushanwa, ryagaragazaga igishushanyo gishya cyoroshye. Ibicuruzwa bya mbere byakozwe mugutangirara mubyumba by'uwarishinze. Nyuma iyi sosiyete yimukiye mu mutungo wa Allschwil. Muri 1986 \" K\u00fcschall yo muri Amerika \" yafunguwe nyuma y'imyaka ibiri na \" K\u00fcschall wo muri Chili. Ibigo byombi, byasheshwe nyuma y'imyaka mike kugirango babashe gukomeza igihe gito cyo kugabura.\n1995 kugeza uyu munsi.\nKuva muri 1995 iyi sosiyete yabaye umunyamuryango witsinda rya Invacare kandi yakoreraga mu isi yose. Muri 2005 iyi sosiyete yavuye muri Allschwil yerekeza i Witterswil. Urubuga rushya rwateguwe kubyaza umusaruro mwinshi no kwiyongera kwa bantu kandi rufite ibikorwa remezo bigezweho mu ikoranabuhanga rinshya rya Witterswil. \nIkoranabuhanga.\nImirongo ya Vario.\nMu mpera bakoze igare rya cyenda Vario axle yasohotse ku isoko, ryari icyitegererezo cyemereraga kamera guhinduka inyuma. \nIbihembo.\nMuri 1985, Rainer K\u00fcschall yahawe igihembo cy\u2019abamugaye mu ma irushanwa hamwe n\u2019igihembo cyiza cya Designer cyatanzwe na muzehe m\u2019ubuhanzi bugezweho i New York (ari naho yerekanwa). Muri 2003 sosiyete yatsindiye igihembo cya JB Richey Innovation Award kubera igare ry\u2019bamugaye \" cyitwa Nyampinga \", ikurikirwa n\u2019igihembo cya Red Dot Design muri 2004 kubera icyitegererezo cyitwa \" Fusion \". Model ya R33 yahawe igihembo cyihariye cyo gukurura ihungabana muri 2007 hamwe na Janus Award, hamwe naCoup de Coeur muri 2008 hamwe na Rehacare Best Design Award "}
{"id": "17768", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17768", "title": "Millbrook Healthcare", "text": "Ubuvuzi bwa Millbrook butanga serivisi ku baturage, serivisi z\u2019abamugaye, na serivisi zita ku ikoranabuhanga. Ifite kandi ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere i rugo kandi yahawe igihembo cya Fondasiyo HIA Service y'umwaka 2017. \nAmateka.\nNi uruganda rufite icyicaro i Southampton, aho rwashinzwe muri 1946 m'ubucuruzi butandukanye. Ikora kandi amamodoka 400 avuye muri depot yo mu majyepfo yUbwongereza. Yatanze serivisi z\u2019abamugaye bya Plymouth na South Hams kuva muri 2011. \nYatwaye amasezerano yo gutanga amagare muri Hampshire muri 2014. Icyo gihe yari k'urutonde rwo gutegereza hafi amezi 18. Yatangiye imirimo muri Kent muri Mata 2017. Yatwaye kandi serivisi yo kwita no gusana mu Nama Njyanama y'akarere ka West Dorset muri 2015. \nMuri Gashyantare 2021, Millbrook yaguze Ross Care, \" aho itanga serivisi zikomeye z\u2019ibimuga n\u2019ibikoresho bigenda \". "}
{"id": "17769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17769", "title": "Mogo Wheelchairs", "text": "Mogo Wheelchair ni uruganda rwo muri Ositaraliya rukora igare y'imikino yashinzwe na Michael Callahan aho yarushanijwe muri basketball y\u2019abamugaye muri Ositaraliya mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 1984 no muri Paralympike yo muri 1992. \nInkomoko.\nCallahan ntabwo yashoboye kubona ibwisanzure zibereye za basiketibali mu irushanwa ry'abamugaye, aho yatangiye kwiyubaka mu ntangiriro ya za 1980. Muri 2000, Callahan yabwiye Sydney Morning Herald ko isosiyete ye y'ubakaga muri 600 kugeza 700 ku mwaka hafi AUD 2000, kandi iyi kipe ya basketball y\u2019abamugaye hafi ya yose ya Ositaraliya yakoreshaga icyo cyubahiro ifite. \nMogo yabanje gushyiramo uruziga rwa gatanu, ubu isanzwe muri basketball y'abamugaye. \nUbuvugizi.\nAbamugaye hamwe n'umuvugizi wa rubanda Matt Glowacki niwe ubunganira muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "17770", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17770", "title": "TiLite", "text": "TiLite nisosiyete ikora ibikoresho by'abamugaye, z'ikozwe muri titaniyumy ndetse nibikoresho bya aluminiyumy. Isosiyete izwiho gukora intebe z\u2019abamugaye zihariye binyuze mu nzira ya TiFit, ikubiyemo guhuza buri ntebe y\u2019abamugaye ku bisobanuro nyabyo by\u2019umukoresha.\nAmateka.\nTiLite ishushanya kandi igakora intebe z\u2019abamugaye, ndetse ifite nimwe mu ngero zayo ni \" CrossSport \" Igihe isosiyete yaguze ibindi bikoresho kugirango itangwa ryayo ndetse n'ibikoresho byayo nki ntebe z\u2019abamugaye zikoze muri titaniyumu na aluminiyumu bigende neza.\nAs a division of TiSport, LLC, TiLite's headquarters are located in Pasco, Washington. In 2014, the company was acquired by Permobil, a Swedish company that makes power wheelchairs and seating systems.\nIkoranabuhanga.\nTiLite ikoresha Titaniyumu ku magare y'abamugaye n'omumarushanwa. Titaniyumu ifite imiterere yihariye, ariko kubera ko Titaniyumu igoye kuyitunganya kandi ibikoresha ibikoresho bihenze cyane. TiLite ikora amagare y'abimugaye muri Titaniyumy na Aluminiyumu. Mugihe intebe za Titaniyumu zu ruganda zoroheje gato mu buremere kandi ziraramba, intebe zabo za Aluminiyumu zifite imbaraga kandi zirirahagije kubayikoresha benshi. Igishushanyo cyayo gikoresha m'uburyo bwo kwerekana imiterere yayo, mudasobwa ifasha mukubonaneza igishushanyo cyayo, hamwe na tekinoroji yo gusesengura ibintu bitagira ingano. "}
{"id": "17771", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17771", "title": "Imyigire y' abafite ubumuga", "text": "Abafite ubumuga baracyafite imbogamizi mu kwiga cyane cyane Abana, mu bihugu binyuranye imbogamizi ku bafite ubumuga bunyuranye baracyagorwa no kwiga kubera impamvu zitandukanye nko kubura ibikoresho byabugenewe, ubumenyi bwangombwa mukubigisha n' ibikorwa remezo. \nImyigire y' abafite ubumuga muri AfriKa.\nMuri rusange abafite ubumuga muri AfriKa imyigire yabo iracyagoranye nkuko byagaragajwe na \nraporo ya Bank y' isi muri 2011, ivuga ko nibura muri Afrika abana 6.4% mubafite ikigereranyi cy' imyaka 14 bafite ubumuga bworoheje cyangwa ubukabije kandi abitabira ishuri ntibarenga 10% by'abo bana bafite ubumuga. kugeza ubu abana bari mu mashuri abanza n' ayisumbuye abayinga miliyoni 65 bafite ubumuga abasaga kimwe cyakabiri bose ntibitabira ishuri, ariko nubwo byari bimeze bityo mu mwaka wa 2017 Bank y' isi na USAID bifatanyije na leta z' ibihugu binyuranye bashyizeho ingamba zinyuranye ndetse bashyira mubikorwa za porogamu zifasha abafite ubumuga mu myigire harimo \" Uburezi kuri bose, Uburezi budaheza nizindi ndetse no kwisanga kwisoko ry' umurimo kuko ibi byose bigira ingaruka ku mibereho yabo, ubukungu bw' imiryango, ahobatuye n' igihugu muri rusange.\nImyigire y' abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda.\nnubwa iki kibazo giteye inkeke nkuko ihuriro ry' imiryango y' abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda NUDOR ryabigaragaje muri 2019 ko mu bana 10 bafite ubumuga mu Rwanda 9 muribo ntibitabira ishuri bityo bikaba imbogamizi ku iterambere n' imibereho byabo. Mu Rwanda hashyizweho ingamba na porogaramu zitandukanye murwego ryo gufasha abatishoboye mukwisanga muri gahunda z' uburezi nizindi kuko kugeza ubu abasaga 65% babasha kwitabira ishuri ugereranyije na 81% badafite ubumuga, ibi byagezweho binyuze muri gahunda za leta nka: uburezi budaheza (Inclusive Education), Uburezi kuri bose (Education for all) nizindi leta ifatanya nabafatanyabikorwa bayo banyuranye. \nBinyuze muri gahunda za leta zinyurande abafite ubumuga bariga kandi bigana nabandi nubwo imbogamizi zigihari ariko zaragabanyijwe bigaragara nkuko imibare ya UNICEF Ibigaragaza kandi leta y' u Rwanda ikomeje gushyira imbaraga mu burezi muri rusange ariko byumwihariko uburezi bw' abafite ubumuga. \nAmashuri yihariye y' abafite ubumuga.\nMu rwanda nubwo hashyizweho politiki yuko abana bafite ubumuga bigana na bagenzibabo batabufite ariko hasanzwe hari amashuri yihariye ku bana bafite ubumuga, ayo mashuri akigisha kuburyo bwihariye abafite ubumuga cyane cyane ubumuga bukomeye. muri ayo mashuri twavuga: amashuri ya GATAGARA agiye ari ahantu hanyuranye mu gihugu nka: HVP GATAGARA Rwamagana, HVP GATAGARA Gikondo, HVP Humure, HVP Ruhango, HVP Huye na HVP \nGATAGARA Nyanza. "}
{"id": "17772", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17772", "title": "RoughRider wheelchair", "text": "Intebe y'abafite ubumuga ya RoughRider ni intebe y'igiciro gito, iramba kandi ifite ikoranabuhanga igare ry\u2019ibimuga ryagenewe gukoreshwa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Igishushanyo cya RoughRider mu ntangiriro cyari kandi cyavuguruwe hifashishijwe ibitekerezo by\u2019abakoresha amagare y\u2019ibimuga mu bihugu birenga 40 kuva mu 1980. RoughRider yashizweho kugirango yuzuze icyifuzo cy\u2019intebe y\u2019ibimuga yizewe ku bamugaye barenga miliyoni 20 mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere bakeneye igare ry\u2019ibimuga kandi badafite. \nAmateka.\nAmateka ya mbere yanditsweho intebe y\u2019ibimuga yanditswe mu ibuye kuri yo mu Bushinwa mu kinyejana cya nyuma ya Yesu. n'ibiranga imyanya. Kugeza vuba aha amagare y\u2019ibimuga yari agenewe ahantu hasa neza no ku mihanda ya kaburimbo kandi ntabwo yagenewe ibidukikije bigoye. Imyaka mirongo itatu irashize, &lt;/link&gt;, injeniyeri ufite akaba akunda no kujya mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, yabonye ko hakenewe intebe yo mu rwego rwo hejuru kandi igoye ishobora kwihanganira imiterere y'ubutaka bubi. Yatangiye imyaka mirongo itatu yo gushushanya hifashishijwe ibice biboneka hamwe nigiciro gito gihagije kugirango abamugaye mukarere kateye imbere. Mu myaka myinshi, Ralf hamwe nitsinda bajyaga mumaduka mato mato mubihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kugirango bigishe ubumenyi bwa tekiniki bukenewe mu musaruro waho wa RoughRider. Amenshi muri ayo maduka aratera imbere mu bice bya Afurika, Aziya, Amerika y'Epfo ndetse n'icyahoze ari Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abasoviyeti.\nImiterere.\nIbishushanyo mbonera bya RoughRider birimo: amaboko make kugirango ashobore kwimura byoroshye kuva ku ntebe akajya ku yandi masura, amapine yinyuma asimburwa mu maduka yamagare ku isi yose, hamwe nu mwanya w\u2019ibiziga by\u2019inyuma ushobora guhindura imikorere yimikorere no gukora kubatwara ubushobozi butandukanye. Igishushanyo kirimo ibiziga birebire bifite ubugari bwimbere bwimbere bwa caster ibereye munsi yikirenge kandi ikabuza kugana imbere kandi byoroshye gusunika kuruta ibimuga bisanzwe byabamugaye. Ubunini bwagutse bwa \"Zimbabwe\" caster butanga kugenda neza hejuru yubutaka bubi mugihe ugishoboye \"kureremba\" hejuru yubutaka bworoshye nkumucanga utarinze gukomera. Ihindurwa X-brace yemerera kubika no gutwara no kwemerera ubugari bwintebe guhinduka. Ibindi byahinduwe kugirango bigabanye cyangwa byongere uburebure bwintebe hamwe nuburebure bwinyuma bigerwaho hongeweho umusego wifuro munsi cyangwa inyuma. Guhindura ibirenge bikorwa mugukuraho Bolt imwe kumaboko yamaguru.\nIbibazo nibishushanyo mbonera bizaza.\nBitewe na 7/8 \"ibyuma byo gukoresha ibyuma bikoreshwa kuruhande, byatoranijwe kubiciro bidahenze kandi kuboneka kwisi yose, RoughRider ipima nka 40\u00a0lbishobora kuba biremereye cyane kubatwara abagenzi bashya bakomeretse ku misozi ihanamye. RoughRider ifite umurongo urwanya anti-tip ituma uyigenderaho agira umutekano mugihe yinyuma kandi yongeyeho gusa ibimuga bigabanya ibyondo namazi atemba kuri uyigenderaho. Ibi bintu byombi biranga ubu &lt;/link&gt; mu iterambere. Harakenewe kandi intebe ikora cyane kubana bamugaye mubihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kandi verisiyo yumwana ya RoughRider kuri ubu &lt;/link&gt; kugeragezwa muri Afrika yepfo. "}
{"id": "17773", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17773", "title": "Wheelchair", "text": "Intebe y\u2019ibimuga ni uburyo bwimikorere y'intebe ikoresheje amapine 2 cyangwa menshi, ikirenge hamwe n'intoki zisanzwe zometse. Ikoreshwa mu gihe cyo kugenda bigoye cyangwa bidashoboka kubikora kubera uburwayi, uwakomeretsa, ubumuga, cyangwa ubuzima bujyanye nu buzima.\nAmateka.\nInyandiko za mbere zerekana ibikoresho bifite amapine, ni inyandiko iboneka ku rubaho rw'amabuye mu Bushinwa ndetse n'uburiri bw'umwana bugereranywa na freze kuri vase y'Abagereki, byombi byabaye hagati y'ikinyejana cya 6 n'icya 5. Inyandiko za mbere z'intebe ziga zikoreshwa mu gutwara abamugaye guhera mu binyejana cya gitatu nyuma mubushinwa; abashinwa bakoresheje abamugaye kare kugirango bimure abantu kimwe n'ibintu biremereye. Itandukaniro riri hagati yi mirimo yombi ntiryakozwe muyindi myaka nka magana, kugeza nko mu 525, igihe amashusho y'intebe zi gare zakozwe mu buryo bwihariye bwo gutwara abantu zitangira kugaragara mubuhanzi bwubushinwa. \nKwicara hamwe no kugoreka intebe.\nIntebe zicaye cyangwa zihengamye mu mwanya w\u2019abamugaye bifite imyanya yo kwicara ishobora kugororwa ku mpande zitandukanye. Igitekerezo cya mbere cyateguwe n\u2019umuhanga mu by'imikorere, Hugh Barclay, wakoranye n\u2019abana bamugaye kandi akareba ko ubumuga bw\u2019imyanya nka scoliose bushobora gushyigikirwa cyangwa gukosorwa igice cyemerera umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga kuruhuka ahantu hahanamye. Ikiranga nacyo gifite agaciro kubakoresha badashobora kwicara neza igihe kinini kububabare cyangwa izindi mpamvu.\nIterambere ry'ikoranabuhanga.\nHabayeho imbaraga zikomeye mu myaka 20 ishize kugirango duteze imbere ibibuga byabamugaye bihagaze bishobora gufasha abakoresha amagare gukora imyitozo nkuko umuntu yabikora kuri podiyumu cyangwa umutoza wamagare. Ibikoresho bimwe byarakozwe bishobora gukoreshwa bifatanije ningendo zisanzwe hamwe nudukino twa interineti dusa na podiyumu ya byose. Uku guhuza kwukuri kwukuri hamwe no gukandagira byakoreshejwe mugusubiza abana hamwe nabakuze kugirango bagarure ubuhanga bwo kugenda. \nInyubako.\nGuhuza ibidukikije byubatswe kugirango birusheho kugera ku bakoresha amagare y\u2019abamugaye, ni bumwe mu bukangurambaga bw\u2019ingendo z\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019amategeko y\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019ibanze nk\u2019abanyamerika bafite ubumuga muri 1990. Urugero rw\u2019imibereho y\u2019ubumuga rusobanura 'ubumuga' nk'ivangura rikorerwa abantu bafite ubumuga biturutse ku kuba sosiyete yarananiwe gutanga imiterere ikenewe kugira ngo bagire uruhare muri sosiyete kimwe. Ibi bikubiyemo guhuza n'imiterere y'ibidukikije byubatswe no guhuza imiterere n'imibereho n'imitekerereze. Ihame shingiro ryo kugera ni igishushanyo mbonera - ko abantu bose batitaye ku bumuga bafite uburenganzira bwo kugera ku bice byose bya sosiyete nko gutwara abantu n\u2019inyubako. Umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga ntamugaye cyane mubidukikije bidafite ingazi.\nUbutegetsi rusange.\nBimwe mubintu byo hanze y'rusange byerekana inzitizi zikoreshwa mukigare cyibimuga, nkibice bitandukanijwe n\u2019amanota aho nta mpamba zitangwa. Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Ubwongereza busaba ubugari ntarengwa bwa 1.5m kubakoresha igare ry\u2019ibimuga hamwe n\u2019umunyamaguru utwara ambulanse kugenda ku rundi; hamwe na gradiyo ntarengwa ya 8% yo gukoresha intoki yimuga (5%). \nIbikoresho.\nHano hari ibikoresho byinshi byintebe yimuga. Hano hari umusego, abafite ibikombe, umukandara, imifuka yo kubikamo, amatara, nibindi byinshi. Umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga akoresha umukandara wumutekano cyangwa igihagararo. Bamwe mu bakoresha ibimuga bifuza gukoresha umukandara kugirango barebe ko batazigera bagwa mu kagare. Abandi bakoresha igare ry\u2019ibimuga bakoresha umukandara kuko badashobora kwicara bonyine."}
{"id": "17774", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17774", "title": "Ububiko bwa Scooter", "text": "Ububiko bwa Scooter (Mu icyongereza: The Scooter Store) Ltd yari ifite abikorera ku giti cyabo batanga ibicuruzwa bigenda byingufu, harimo intebe z'amashanyarazi (cyangwa intebe y\u2019abafite ubumuga ifite moteri) hamwe n\u2019ibimoteri bigenda hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa bifitanye isano n\u2019ibindi bikoresho, bishingiye i New Braunfels, muri Texas. Isosiyete yakoreye intara 48 zo muri Amerika n'akarere ka Porto Rico.\nNyuma y\u2019igitero cyagabwe na muri Gashyantare 2013, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwatanze ikirego mu kandi gihagarika kugurisha amafaranga yose ku baturage.\nGuhera ku ya 26 Ukwakira, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwatakaje amasezerano y\u2019ubumwe na bukuraho ubushobozi bwo kugurisha umutungo mu gice cya 11 gihomba. Isosiyete yinjiye mu iseswa kandi ihagarika abakozi bayo ku ya 13 Nzeri 2013. \nMuri Gicurasi 2016, ryatangaje ko nta byaha aregwa abahoze ari abayobozi b\u2019Ububiko bwa Scooter. \nAmateka.\nDoug na Susanna Harrison bashinze Ububiko bwa Scooter mu 1991 i New Braunfels, muri Texas. Mu 2003, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwatanze ikirego cya federasiyo (HHS) kubera guhakana nabi Medicare. (CMS) cyavuze ko \"Icyemezo cy\u2019ubuvuzi gikenewe\" batagaragaje ko bakeneye ubuvuzi. Reta ya reta yarwanije isosiyete. Ububiko bwa Scooter bwemeye gukemura amakimbirane yari afitanye na guverinoma mu 2007, bumaze kugarura ibyinshi mu birego bivugwa.\nMu 2007, isosiyete yashinze ishami ryayo rya Alliance Seating &amp; Mobility Division.\nKugeza mu 2009, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwari bufite ahantu 129 muri Amerika, bukoresha abantu 2,368, kandi bukorera abakiriya barenga 400.000. \nMuri Nzeri 2010, isosiyete yatangaje ko hashyizweho ishami rishya ryibanda ku bikoresho byo mu rugo, ibikoresho, na serivisi zijyanye nabyo kugira ngo byuzuze ubucuruzi bw\u2019imikorere gakondo. Igice cyo kwita ku rugo gitanga intebe z\u2019ibimuga, abagenda, guterura abarwayi, nebulizeri, ibitanda byibitaro, ubufasha bwibikoresho hamwe nibikoresho bya ogisijeni ku masoko yatoranijwe.\nMuri Gashyantare 2011, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwatangaje ubufatanye bushya n\u2019ishami rya mu gutera inkunga kugira ngo isosiyete ikure neza ndetse n\u2019ibishobora kugenerwa kugira ngo Abanyamerika bakuze.\nKu ya 22 Werurwe 2012, Doug Harrison yeguye ku mirimo ye nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa Ububiko bwa Scooter. Harrison ninama yubuyobozi bemeje ko aricyo gihe cyiza kubuyobozi bushya. Jay Randal Bishop yatangiye kuba umuyobozi mukuru w'agateganyo kugeza igihe inama y'ubutegetsi yaboneye uzamusimbura. Harrison yakomeje kuba umwe mu bagize inama y'ubuyobozi kandi yari umwe mu bafite imigabane minini y'isosiyete. \nKu ya 20 Gashyantare 2013, abakozi ba federasiyo bafite impapuro zo gushakisha bagabye igitero ku cyicaro gikuru cya Scooter Ububiko bwa New Braunfels. Nk\u2019uko amakuru atandukanye abitangaza, abakozi ba FBI bari bahari kugira ngo bakore iperereza ku bikorwa byo kwishyuza sosiyete. Abavugizi b'ikigo banze kugira icyo batangaza ku banyamakuru.\nKu ya 8 Werurwe 2013, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwashyize abakozi bose kuri \"furlough itishyuwe\" usibye bimwe. Ibi byakozwe na imeri rusange yatanzwe numuyobozi mukuru. \nKu ya 19 Werurwe 2013, abakozi 1.500 bakiriye imeri y\u2019umuyobozi mukuru Marty Landon itangaza ko \"furlough itarahembwa\" izarangira ku ya 31 Werurwe 2013, nyuma baza kwirukanwa ku mugaragaro. Abakozi 300 basabwe kugaruka mugihe kitazwi. \nKu ya 16 Mata 2013, Ububiko bwa Scooter bwatanze igice cya 11 gihomba. "}
{"id": "17775", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17775", "title": "Wheelchair accessible van", "text": "Imodoka y\u2019abamugaye ishobora kugerwaho, ni imodoka yahinduwe hongerwa ubunini bw'imbere bwikinyabiziga no kuyiha ibikoresho byinjiramo igare rya wheelchair, nk'abamugaye cyangwa kuzamura moteri.\nGuhindura.\nIntambwe rusange abayikora banyuramo kugirango bahindure imodoka igiye ifite itandukaniro cyane nunundi wabikoze i. Guhindura biri mu byiciro bibiri: icya mbere niho umuntu uri mu kagare k'abamugaye ari umushoferi naho icya kabiri niho umuntu uri mu kagare k'abamugaye ari umugenzi.\nIbikoresho byinjira.\nHariho ubwoko bubiri bwo kwinjiza iboneza: uruhande rwinjira ni nyuma rwinjira. Ahantu hinjirira bigira ingaruka kumyanya y'abamugaye, guhitamo parikingi, ubushobozi bwo kwakira abandi bagenzi, hamwe nububiko buhari.\nKwinjira kuruhande.\nIbyiza byo ku ruhande byinjira muburyo bwo kubamo harimo ubushobozi bwo gutwara abamugaye cyangwa kwicara imbere y'abagenzi imbere y'intebe y'abamugaye cyangwa abashoferi, ubushobozi bwo kwinjira no gusohoka kumuhanda kure yumuhanda, hamwe nububiko bwinshi. Ibibi byubu buryo ni uko bisaba umwanya waparika cyangwa icyumba cyinyongera cyo koherezwa kandi ko inzira zimwe zitagutse kuburyo bwakirwa neza. Hafi muri 65% y'imodoka yihariye yimuga ya bamugaye ikoresha ibice byinjira. Ibinyabiziga byinjira ku ruhande birashobora kwakira abagenzi 5 cyane kandi mubisanzwe bigarukira kumutwaro ntarengwa kubera uburemere bwikirenga bwo guhinduka kandi akenshi ntibishobora kwicara abagenzi barenga 2 kugeza 3 ukurikije uburemere bwuzuye.\nUbundi bwoko.\nKuzamura ubwoko bwa Crane byahujwe n'intebe zihinduka zikamanuka hasi nku buryo bwo gutanga intebe ya bamugaye kubinyabiziga bimwe.\nIbigo bimwe bitanga uburyo bwo \" kwimura intebe \", aho icyicaro cy'imbere cyu mushoferi cyangwa umugenzi kigenda kumurongo ugaruka kumwanya wibimuga byemerera umukoresha wibimuga kwimukira mucyicaro cy'imbere cya OEM hanyuma agasubiza intebe mu mwanya w'ambere.. Guhindura biroroshye cyane kandi ntabwo bitwara ibintu bigoye bya injeniyeri na elegitoroniki mubisanzwe biboneka muruhande rwinjira. Kubera iyo mpamvu, bikwiranye cyane nubucuruzi nuburemere bukabije (ni ukuvuga tagisi, ambulance yihutirwa, paratransit, ifasha kubaho, hamwe no guhamagara-kugendana) hamwe n\u2019akarere gakunze kwibasirwa n\u2019imodoka ziva mu munyu n'imikoreshereze ya choloride mu mihanda mugihe cyitumba."}
{"id": "17776", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17776", "title": "Leveraged Freedom Chair", "text": "Intebe Yigenga (LFC) ryari igare ry'abamugaye byose bikozwe mubice by'amagare. \nAmateka.\nAmos Winter, yari afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD muri MIT, yagiye muri Tanzaniya mu gihe cy'akazi, asanga abamugaye basanzwe baramugaye bidahagije abaha ubufasha bujyanye n'ubumuga rwabo. We hamwe n'abanyeshuri be bo mu mashuri y'ubukanishi bakoranye muguteza imbere umushinga. Ibizamini bya LFC byakorewe muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, Gatemala n'Ubuhinde. \nIbisobanuro.\nUsibye intebe isanzwe y\u2019abamugaye, intebe y\u2019ibamugaye yari ifite moteri yi modoka ituma uyikoresha afata leveri kure yiziga kugirango urumuri rwinshi rugananuke. Imyenda irashobora gukurwaho ikabikwa ku ntebe, ikayemerera gukoreshwa nk'intebe isanzwe y\u2019abamugaye mu nzu. Intebe z\u2019ibimugaye zagenewe gukorwa ku giciro gito kiva mu bice bisanzwe by\u2019amagare, no gusanwa no kubungabungwa mu maduka y\u2019amagare yaho.\nCfl yakoze inzira ya GRIT Freedom y'Intebe, intebe y'abamugaye y'ubutaka yose yagenewe ibihugu byateye imbere. Uyu ubwoko bwa mbere bwi bicuruzwa by'intebe by'igenga by'atangijwe kuri Kickstarter hamwe n'igiciro gito cya madorari y'Amerika 2,195, yagurishijwe. "}
{"id": "17777", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17777", "title": "Intebe ihagaze y'abafite ubumuga", "text": "Intebe ihagaze y'abafite ubumuga (mu Icyongereza:Standing wheelchair) (izwi kandi nk'intebe ihagaze, ikiziga kizunguruka cyangwa igihagararo) ni, isa n'ikadiri ihagaze, ituma umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga azamura intebe kuva yicaye kugeza aho ihagaze. Intebe yimuga ihagaze ishyigikira umuntu mumwanya uhagaze kandi igafasha imikoranire nabantu nibintu kurwego rwamaso.\nIshusho n'imikorere.\nMugihe bose bafite imikorere yibanze, hari byinshi bitandukanye mubimuga bihagaze. Nibikoresho bifasha, intebe zintebe zihagaze zakozwe mbere na mbere ukurikije ibyo abakoresha babo bakeneye. Uburyo bwo guterura bwinjizwamo bushobora gukoreshwa nintoki cyangwa gukoreshwa bigereranya imbaraga. Ibiziga birashobora kandi gukoreshwa nimbaraga cyangwa intoki. akoreshwa mubyuma bikoreshwa mubikorwa kugirango habeho kuringaniza kuramba, imbaraga, guhinduka no kumurika, icyakora hariho ibyuma biremereye kandi byoroshye birahari. Moderi yihariye yubatswe kugirango ikoreshwe buri gihe mugihe izindi zifasha gusa mubikorwa byihariye. Intebe zimwe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze zishobora no kwirukanwa aho zihagaze, icyakora hari impungenge z\u2019ubuvuzi zongera ibyago byo kuvunika amagufwa mugihe utwaye kubera amaguru ari munsi yumutwaro uremereye. \nGusuzuma no kubakoresha.\nIntebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagarara zikoreshwa n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bworoheje kandi bukabije harimo:,,,, nibindi byinshi.\nIntebe zihagaze zikoreshwa nabantu bafite na, kubera ko uburyo butandukanye bwo guhagarara burahari kugirango habeho ubumuga bworoheje-bukabije.\nInyungu zubuzima.\nUbushakashatsi bwinshi bwerekana ibimenyetso byintebe zintebe zihagaze zitanga inyungu zubuzima kurenza bagenzi babo badafite imashini. Zimwe muri izo nyungu zirimo neza, hamwe ningaruka nke zo no guhindura skelete. Abashakashatsi benshi hamwe n\u2019abakoresha bavuga ko inyungu atari umubiri gusa - uburyo bunini bwo kugenda butangwa n\u2019ibimuga by\u2019ibimuga bihagaze bifasha abakoresha kubaho ubuzima bwigenga, bikavamo ubuzima bwiza bwo mu mutwe ndetse n\u2019ubuzima bwiza. \nInyandiko n'inkunga muri Amerika.\nIntebe zimuga zihagaze ziza kubiciro benshi batekereza ko bitagerwaho, hamwe na verisiyo zikoreshwa kuva $ 10,000- $ 15,000. Uku kutagerwaho kwatumye ibigo byubwishingizi byinjiza ikoranabuhanga muri gahunda zabo zisanzwe. Mu mwaka wa 2020, Ubwigenge Binyuze mu Kongera Ubuvuzi n\u2019Ubuvuzi (ITEM) bwiyambaje Ikigo gishinzwe (CMS), busaba intebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze hamwe n\u2019ibimuga by\u2019ibimuga bifite intebe zashyizwe hejuru n\u2019ingufu zishyirwa mu. Icyo cyifuzo cyatanzwe igice muri Gicurasi 2023, kubera ko CMS yashyizemo intebe y\u2019ibimuga ifite intebe yazamuye ingufu mu nyungu kandi bivugako intebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze zizasuzumwa ejo hazaza. \nKugeza ubu, Medicare irashobora gufasha gutera inkunga igice cyintebe y\u2019ibimuga ihagaze, mugihe inkunga ya Medicaid iratandukanye bitewe na leta zitandukanye muri Amerika Amasosiyete menshi yubwishingizi, imiryango ishinzwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe imyuga, hamwe n\u2019abashinzwe ibibazo by\u2019ubuvuzi bagenda batera inkunga intebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze kubera ubuzima bw'igihe kirekire n'ubwiza bw'ubuzima buturuka ku guhagarara gusa.\nInyandiko nziza.\nInkunga (inkunga ya leta cyangwa ubwishingizi) kubikoresho bihagaze birashoboka, ariko mubisanzwe bisaba gutsindishirizwa mubuvuzi hamwe nibaruwa ikenera (ibisobanuro birambuye) byanditswe numuvuzi wumubiri cyangwa inzobere mubuvuzi.\nInkomoko y'inkunga.\nMuri Reta zunzubumwe za Amerika hariho uburyo butandukanye bwo kugura (DME) nkibimuga bihagaze:\nIntara nyinshi zifite amikoro nka PAAT (Kurinda ubuvugizi bufasha mu ikoranabuhanga) hamwe n\u2019imishinga ifasha ikoranabuhanga rya Leta bikaba umutungo w\u2019abaguzi bashaka inkunga cyangwa banyura mu nzira z\u2019ubujurire."}
{"id": "17778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17778", "title": "Humanity and Inclusion", "text": "Humanity and Inclusion yahoze yitwa (Handcap International) ni umuryango mpuzamahanga wita ku bafite ubumuga n' abantu bari mukaga, washinzwe muri 1982. \nAmateka..\nUyu muryango Humanity &amp; Inclusion washinzwe muri 1982 ukaba umuryango w' ubufasha n' ubugiraneza, muri icyogihe hariho abantu benshi bamugaye kubera intambara zari zirambye kwisi kandi ntawundi wari yitaye kubyarimo kubo. \nIntego.\nHumanity and Inclusion ni umuryango wigenga kandi ufasha muburyo budaheza, ugafasha abugarijwe n' ubukene, abahezwa, abari mu makimbirane ndetse na abibasiwe n' ibiza. bakorana byahafi n'abantu bafite ubumuga n' abantu bari mubihe by' amage (bitoroshye), bakabafasha kunyuramo ndetse no kubona ibyibanze nkenerwa, bita kumibereho, agaciro n' uburenganzira bwibanze byabo.\nIcyerekezo.\nBaterwa agahinda n' ubusumbane ku bafite ubumuga n' abari mukaga, bifuza isi y' ubufatanye no kudaheza bishingiye k' ubudasa bwabo, aho buriwese ashobora kubaho afite agaciro kuzuye.\nHI mu Rwanda.\nUmuryango Humanity and Inclusion ukora ibikorwa binyuranye mu gihugu byibanda mu gufasha abafite ubumuga n' abanyantegenke muru rusange. kugeza ubu umuryango HI mu Rwanda uko kuri Porogaramu zo gufasha abana kugera ku burezi bufite ireme kandi kuri bose ndetse na porogaramu zo kwegereza umuvuzi abafite ubumuga n' abanyantegenke. "}
{"id": "17779", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17779", "title": "Motorized wheelchair", "text": "Intebe y\u2019abamugaye ifite moteri, igare ry\u2019ibimuga cyangwa intebe y\u2019ibamugaye ikoreshwa n\u2019amashanyarazi ni igare ry\u2019ibimuga rigenda rikoreshwa na moteri y\u2019amashanyarazi (ubusanzwe ikoresha ibiyiyobora bitandukanye) aho gukoresha imbaraga z'amaboko. Intebe y\u2019abamugaye ifite akamaro kubadashobora gutwara intebe y'imugaye yi ntoki cyangwa bashobora gukenera gukoresha igare ry'abamugaye intera cyangwa hejuru yu butaka bwaba bunaniwe mu igare rya bamugaye. Bashobora kandi gukoreshwa gusa n'abantu bafite ubumuga bw'imikorere gakondo, ariko kandi nabantu bafite ibibazo by'umutima nimiyoboro yu mutima.\nAmateka.\nIkinyabiziga gikoresha amashanyarazi cyakozwe na sosiyete ya RA Harding mu Bwongereza mu myaka yo muri 1930. Intebe y\u2019ibimuga ikoreshwa n\u2019amashanyarazi yahimbwe na George Klein wakoraga mu Nama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubushakashatsi muri Kanada, kugira ngo afashe abahoze mu ngabo bakomeretse nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. \nIgishushanyo.\nIgishushanyo cy'intebe gishobora gushyirwa mu bice na sisitemu yo gutwara na chasi, bateri, umugenzuzi, intebe, no gukoresha. Kubera imikoreshereze yabo nkuburyo bwibanze bwa lokomisiyo, bagomba kuba bafite ubwizerwe buhebuje haba mu mashanyarazi ndetse no mu miterere, kandi bagashyirwa mu bikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi burambye na Medicare muri Amerika.\nChassi y'amashanyarazi irashobora kandi gushiraho curb, igikoresho gikoresha imbaraga zo kuzamura ibiziga by'imbere hejuru yu muhanda wa 10 cm cyangwa munsi.\nUmugenzuzi.\nAbagenzuzi mu bisanzwe ni ukuboko kuruhuka kwishyiriraho joystick ishobora kuba ifite ubugenzuzi bw'inyongera kugirango uyitwaye adoda ibyiyumvo cyangwa uburyo bwinshi bwo kugenzura. Uyitwaye ashobora kuba yihuta kugirango afashe kuruhande. Ku bakoresha badashoboye gukoresha umugenzuzi wi ntoki ubundi buryo butandukanye burahari nka sip na puff mugenzuzi, byakozwe no guhuha muri sensor. Rimwe na rimwe, umugenzuzi ashobora gushyirwaho kugirango akoreshwe numufasha ugenda inyuma yintebe aho kubakoresha. Mubushobozi harimo guhindura moteri imwe imbere mugihe iyindi isubira inyuma, bityo ugahindura intebe yibimuga muburebure bwayo (kuyobora bitandukanye."}
{"id": "17780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17780", "title": "UNIFY CHAMPIONS SCHOOL", "text": "Special Olympics nyuma yo gutangiza umushinga wa UNIFY CHAMPIONS SCHOOL ugamije gukura abana bafite ubumuga mu bwiyunge, bahurira mu mikino hamwe n'abadafite ubumuga Ubuyobozi bwayo buratangaza ko iyi gahunda imaze gutenyura abatari bake mu bana bafiite ubumuga mu Rwanda.\nUnify Champions School.\nUmushinga wa UNIFY CHAMPIONS SCHOOL watewe inkunga na Mohamed ben Zayed Igikomangoma cya Leta zunze ubumwe z'abarabu binyuze muri Special Olympics International Byemezwa na Minisiteri y'uburezi aho Special Olympics ubusanzwe ari umuryango mpuza mahanga ushishikajwe no kuvana abafite ubumuga mu bwigunge hifashishijwe imikino.\nUko umushinga wa Unify Champions School watangiye.\nUyu mushinga wa Unify Champions Schools muri Special Olympics watangijwe mu mwaka wa 2021, utangirira mu mashuri 40 yo mumujyi wa Kigali, ubu ukaba umaze kugera mu mashuri 70 yo muntara y'uburasirazuba, ugakomeza no mumashuri 120 yo muntara y'Amajyepfo, n'Amajyaruguru, hanyuma no mu mashuri 140 yo mu burengerazuba, ukaba ari umushinga watewe inkunga na Muhamed Ben Zayid igikomangoma cya Leta zunze ubumwe z'abarabu. hanyuma byemezwa na Minisiteri y'uburezi mu Rwanda.\nIntego ya Unify Champions School.\nJean Bosco avuga ko ubu buryo buzagezwa mumashuri maganane 400 mu Rwanda hose aho bahisemo kunyuza uyumushinga mu mashuri, mu gutegura abana bafite ubumuga kugirango bazavemo ingirakamaro, twifuzako abafite ubumuga nabo bavamo ingirakamoro, kuko akenshi wasangaga bakunda guhora bigunze, bakabura uko bakina na bagenzi babo, akenshi bikanabaviramo guta amashuri, uburyo bwa UNIFY CHAMPIONS SCHOOL, ni ugufasha hose aho, bahisemo kunyuza uyu mushinga mu mashuli, mu gutegura Abana kugira ngo bazavemo ingirakagusabana, abafite ubumuga bagakina n'abadafite ubumuga.abanyeshuri bose Jean Bosco avuga ko ubu buryo buzagezwa mu mashuli maganane mu Rwanda "}
{"id": "17781", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17781", "title": "Wheelchair power add-on", "text": "Intebe y\u2019ibimuga yongerwaho cyangwa ifasha imbaraga n'igikoresho cy'ubuvuzi, Icyiciro cya mbere gifasha abakoresha intoki byoroshye-gukoresha imbaraga cyangwa amaboko. Yagenewe abantu badashobora kugenda ariko bashobora kwigenza mu igare ry\u2019abamugaye. Turabikesha uburyo bwihuse bwo guhindura ibintu hamwe na clip byoroshye kuri sisitemu zitandukanye z'intebe z\u2019abamugaye, inyongeramusaruro zishobora gukoreshwa n'abantu bafite inzitizi zitandukanye zo kugenda.\nUbwoko.\nHariho ubwoko butandukanye bw'intebe y'abamugaye byongeweho, bitandukanye nu buryo bwo kugerekaho, imbaraga zongerwaho, uburyo bwo kugenzura, hamwe n'ikoranabuhanga rikoreshwa. Imbaraga zimwe zongeweho zoroheje kandi zagenewe gukoreshwa muri rusange b'urimunsi, izindi zirakomeye cyane kandi zuzuye mubikorwa bimwe, cyangwa kugirango zikemure ibikenewe byihariye. Guhanga udushya ku isoko birasanzwe, ariko udushya twinshi amaherezo tugwa mu nzira, haba muburyo budasanzwe cyangwa kunanirwa kuza ku isoko ku giciro cyagenwe.\nYinjijwe mu ruziga rw'ibimuga.\nUbu bwoko bw'imbaraga zongeraho gufasha abamugaye cyangwa intebe yumwimerere hamwe na moteri. Muri moderi ziheruka za bateri, umugenzuzi wa moteri byose byubatswe mu ruziga kandi uruziga rukomeza gutandukana no gutwara byoroshye. Intebe y\u2019abamugaye irashobora kugenzurwa no gusunika uruziga cyangwa irashobora guhindura byimazeyo intebe y\u2019abamugaye mu igare ry\u2019ibimuga wongeyeho joystick yashyizwe ku kuboko. "}
{"id": "17782", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17782", "title": "Wheelchair ramp", "text": "Ikibuga cy'abafite ubumuga ni indege yegeranye yashyizwemo cyangwa aho kunyura ku ngazi. Ramps yemerera abakoresha igare ryibimuga, kimwe n'abantu basunika ibimuga, amagare, cyangwa ibindi bintu bifite ibiziga, kugirango byoroshye kubona inyubako, cyangwa kugendagenda hagati yu burebure butandukanye. Ibitambambuga byo kugerwaho birashobora kubanziriza intebe y\u2019abamugaye kandi iboneka mu Bugereki bwa kera. \nIbitambambuga bigomba gutegurwa neza kugirango bibe ingirakamaro. Ahantu henshi, amategeko ategeka ubugari ntarengwa n'uburebure ntarengwa. \nIbishushanyo mbonera.\nMuri Amerika, Itegeko ry\u2019Abanyamerika bafite ubumuga risaba ahantu harenga 1:12 ku magare y\u2019ibimuga n\u2019ibimuga kugira ngo bikoreshwe mu bucuruzi no mu ruhame rusange, bikora kuri metero 305 ya rampi kuri buri mm 25.4 yo kuzamuka. K'urugero mm 510 kuzamuka bisaba byibura m6.10 mu burebure. Byongeye kandi, ADA igabanya umwanya muremure wa rampi, mbere yo kuruhuka cyangwa guhindukira, kugera kuri m 9.14. \nIbinyabiziga bigenda.\nIbinyabiziga nka bisi, gariyamoshi, tagisi, imodoka na vanseri bishobora kuba birimo tapi yorohereza kwinjira no gusohoka kuri bose. Ibi birashobora kuba yubatswe cyangwa bigendanwa. Amasosiyete menshi akomeye atwara ibinyabiziga atangira kugabanyirizwa ibicuruzwa byoroshye kandi bigendanwa kubinyabiziga bishya. Kugera kuri bisi na tramamu birashobora kuba bikubiyemo gusubira inyuma."}
{"id": "17783", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17783", "title": "Wheelchair trainer", "text": "Igare ry\u2019abamugaye cyangwa igare ni igikoresho cy'emerera umuyobozi w\u2019ibimuga w'igana ingendo y'umurongo mugihe asigaye ahagarara muburyo busa n'umuntu ambulatori ugenda cyangwa wiruka kuri podiyumu cyangwa umumotari utwara igare ku mutoza wa magare. Inziga y\u2019absmugaye y'inyuma ishyirwa hamwe nu muzingo uhagaritse cyangwa utambitse ushobora kandi kuba wometse kuri flawhehele, kurwanya imashini cyangwa uburyo bwo gufata feri, moteri n'umuvuduko utandukanye hamwe na sensor sensor. [1] Flywheel ishobora kuba nini kugirango itange umukoresha wa misa runaka hamwe na inertiya yo kuzenguruka ihwanye nubusobanuro bwabo kugirango ubashe kugereranya igare ry'abmugaye.\nAmateka.\nIshami rishinzwe ibibazo by\u2019abasirikare muri Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika ryashoye imari mu myaka myinshi ishize, m' ubushakashatsi n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ibikoresho bibiri bitoza abamugaye: Ikimuga cy\u2019abimugaye (WAFT), [2] na GameWheels. [4] Amateka y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abatoza b\u2019abamugaye ashobora kuvunagurwa muri patenti 10 zatanzwe n\u2019ibiro by\u2019Amerika bishinzwe ipiganwa n\u2019ubucuruzi by\u2019abamugaye bahagarariye abamugaye,amagare, ergometero, dinometero, simulator byatanjwe kuva 1980 kugeza 2009. \nIterambere.\nIpatanti iheruka kugurishwa munsi yikimenyetso cya Trekease, cy'ashizweho kugirango kibe impine ya Translation na Rotational Equivalent Kinetic Energy Aerobic Stationary Exertainment kandi nk'izina rya Trekkies abakunzi ba Star Trek bakunda. [7] Nta na kimwe mu bindi bintu byatanzwe, harimo na prototypes zigeragezwa zakozwe na VA, kuri ubu zirimo gucuruzwa; icyakora sisitemu yoroshye iterekanijwe hamwe na sisitemu ya roller isa mubishushanyo na patenti 4,966.362 bigurishwa n'abandi. [9] \nReba.\nImirongo\nInama\nUrubuga"}
{"id": "17784", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17784", "title": "Power hockey", "text": "Imbaraga za Hockey zizwi kandi ku izina rya Powerchair Hockey ni umukino uhiganwa, wihuta cyane umukino, ushingiye ku gukoresha intebe y\u2019abamugaye. Urufatiro rwa siporo rukomoka ku mukino wa Hockey na Hockey hasi, ariko hamwe n\u2019amategeko yahinduwe kugira ngo ababana n\u2019abumugaye, bakoresha igare ry\u2019abamugaye, bakine kandi bagire uruhare mu gushinga amakipe. Siporo yitwa kandi Ikibuga cy\u2019amashanyarazi cy\u2019ibimugaye cyangwa Igorofa ry\u2019ibimugaye ry\u2019amagare mu bice bitandukanye byisi.\nAmateka y'umukino w'imbaraga.\nMu myaka ya za 70, amashuri amwe n'amwe ya leta yatangiye gutanga amasomo ya siporo kubanyeshuri bafite ubumuga. Benshi mu bana bari bafite ubumuga bwumubiri bwabangamiraga cyane kugenda kwabo (dystrofiya yimitsi, ubumuga bw'ubwonko) kandi ntibashoboye kwitabira siporo rusange. Ubu bwoko bwa siporo bwari bwiza cyane mu guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere kuko bwashoboraga gukinwa hifashishijwe gusa ibimuga by'abamugaye, kandi ntibibanda ku kugenda kwinshi kwa moteri n'imbaraga z'imitsi. \nImyanya.\nUmubare wa bakinnyi mu ikipe runaka urashobora guhinduka, ariko umwanya uwariwo wose hari abakinnyi batanu hasi. Mu busanzwe hariho umutoza umwe numutoza wungirije kugirango bayobore imigendekere ya bagize itsinda."}
{"id": "17785", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17785", "title": "Wheelchair Football (American)", "text": "Umupira w\u2019abamugaye ni siporo yihuta cyane ikinwa neza mugihe abakinnyi bameze neza mumubiri, kandi hejuru ni umukino wabo mugukorera hamwe, ingamba hamwe nu buhanga bwo gutwara abamugaya, kubakoresha igare ryintoki hamwe n\u2019abakoresha amagare y\u2019ibimugaye. Muri 2020, USA Football League League yatangijwe na Move United, ku bufatanye na fondasiyo ya Bob Woodruff na National Football League, ikaba itangiriye i Chicago, Los Angeles, Phoenix na Kansas City, Missouri muri amerika. \nAmateka.\nSiporo yu mupira wa maguru w\u2019abamugaye yatunganijwe na Porofeseri Tim Nugent muri 1948. Siporo yu mupira wa maguru w\u2019abamugaye yatejwe imbere mu marushanwa hagati y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyamerika ry\u2019imikino ya Adapted Sports Programme ya Atlanta, Jeworujiya, Amerika, kugira ngo yinjizemo intebe y\u2019ibimugaye n\u2019imbaraga mu gihe cyo gukina. Umupira w\u2019ebimugaye wakozwe nyuma yu mupira wa maguru w'abanyamerika, bityo ukaba utandukanye n'umupira w'amaguru wa Powerchair cyangwa umupira w'amaguru w'ibimuga (umupira wamaguru)."}
{"id": "17786", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17786", "title": "International Wheelchair and Amputee Sports Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abamugaye n\u2019imikino ngororamubiri (IWAS) ni umuryango mpuzamahanga wa siporo ugenga siporo ku bakinnyi bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri.\nIWAS ni umuryango utegamiye kuri leta ufite icyicaro gikuru giherereye muri Aylesbury College i Buckinghamshire. N'inzego nyobozi zawo mpuzamahanga ku mikino Paralympike siporo yo kuzitira abamugaye kimwe na siporo itera imbere ya Hockey. IWAS ifite ibihugu birenga 60 byabanyamuryango kandi itanga inkunga kumahirwe ya siporo kwisi yose.\nIWAS ikora nkuwateguye amarushanwa ya siporo menshi mumikino ya IWAS na IWAS yabatarengeje imyaka 23.\nAmateka.\nImikino mpuzamahanga ya Stoke Mandeville niyo y'abanjirije imikino Paralympike kandi ikurikiza iyerekwa ryabayiremye nuwashinze, Sir Ludwig Guttmann.\nMuri 2021, Inama y\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019imikino y\u2019abamugaye ya IWAS yagaragaje abahagarariye amahanga muri \"komisiyo nshya y\u2019uburinganire\". \nAmateka y'imikino.\nNa none muri Edition ya 12 (2005 - 2016) kubana bato: IWAS Imikino Yabato Yisi\nImikino.\n2023.\nMuri 2023 yahujwe na CPISRA kugirango habeho imikino yubushobozi bw'isi. CPISRA yishimiye cyane gutangira gukorana na IWAS munsi yumuryango mushya watangiye mu ntangiriro za 2023. Andi makuru azakurikira mumezi ari imbere. \nImikino ya mbere y'ubushobozi bwisi yose (56 / 60 Byose)\nAbakinnyi bafite imyaka 16-23, 24-40 na 40+\nGahunda y'imikino y'agateganyo ikubiyemo:"}
{"id": "17787", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17787", "title": "Dancing on Wheels", "text": "Dancing on Wheels ni ikiganiro cyo mu gihugu cyu Bwongereza cyitwa Reality TV cyakozwe na sosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa bya Fever Media kandi cyatangajwe bwa mbere kuri BBC ya gatatu ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2010. Igitekerezo cyo kwerekana ko ibyamamare bishoboye kubyina hamwe n\u2019abamugaye. Abashakanye babyina buri cyumweru, kandi buri cyumweru couple imwe igomba kuba ikomeza kubyina. Ku mukino wanyuma, abashakanye bombi basigaye bombi babyina imbyino ebyiri, kandi couple imwe yatsinze igitaramo maze ihitamo guhagararira Ubwongereza muri Shampiyona yu Burayi y'abamugaye.\nAbacamanza.\nAbacamanza b'uruhererekane rwa mbere ni:\nAbanywanyi.\nAbahatanira urukurikirane rwa mbere ni:"}
{"id": "17788", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17788", "title": "Wheelchair DanceSport", "text": "Intebe y'abamugaye DanceSport ni amarushanwa yo kubyina, umuntu ku giti cye, umufatanyabikorwa, itsinda ni Dancesport aho byibuze umwe mubabyinnyi aba ari mu kagare k'abamugaye.\nSiporo.\nImbyino y'abamugaye y'ibyiniro ni iy'abakoresha amagare abiri cyangwa ku mukoresha umwe w\u2019abamugaye hamwe n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa uhagaze kandi harimo imbyino zisanzwe nka waltz, tango, Viennese waltz, buhoro buhoro foxtrot na yihuta kandi n'imbyino zo muri Amerika y'Epfo nka samba, cha-cha-cha, rumba, paso doble na jive. Hariho n'imbyino zo gushyira ababyinnyi bane, batandatu cyangwa umunani. \nImbyino y\u2019abamugaye yatangiriye muri Suwede muri 1968, mu ntangiriro yo kwidagadura cyangwa gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe, amarushanwa ya mbere yabaye muri 1975. Amarushanwa ya mbere mpuzamahanga nayo yabereye muri Suwede, mu 1977. Amarushanwa menshi yo mu karere no ku rwego mpuzamahanga yarakurikiranye kandi Shampiyona ya mbere y'isi yabereye mu Buyapani muri 1998. Kuva muri 1998, Imikino yabamugaye iyobowe na World Para Dance Sport, wahoze ari komite mpuzamahanga y'imikino y'abamugaye '(IPWDSC), ikaba ari komite ya komite mpuzamahanga y'abamugaye. Siporo ihuza amategeko y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imbyino ku isi (WDSF). \nIbyiciro.\nAbakinnyi bashyizwe muri rimwe mu byiciro bibiri: \nAmasomo.\nMuri Gashyantare, 2008 hashyizweho gahunda ya kaminuza ya Delaware Collegiate DanceWheels Gahunda yo kwigisha abanyeshuri kubyinana n' abamugaye. Nibwo buryo bwa mbere bwemewe muri ubwo buryo muri Amerika. Iyi gahunda yateguwe ku bufatanye na Fondasiyo y'Abanyamerika DanceWheels binyuze ku nkunga yatanzwe na Christopher na Dana Reeve Foundation. "}
{"id": "17789", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17789", "title": "Thora Fiedler", "text": "Thora Nielsen Fiedler (15 Werurwe 1854 i - 13 Werurwe 1941 i Lynge) yari umuforomokazi wo muri Danemarike, prostateiste n'umuyobozi w'ikigo cyita ku bageze mu za bukuru. Yafashaga kwagura inzu yita ku bageze mu za bukuru ku bamugaye, nyuma mu buzima bwe aba umuyobozi w'uru rugo rw'abaforomo. Yashizeho amahugurwa ya prostate kandi ahimba ubwoko bushya bwa prostate.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nFiedler yavukiye i Nyborg ku muhinzi, umugenzuzi w\u2019umuhanda n\u2019 Harald Valdemar Fiedler (1808\u201387) na Marie Sophie Kirstine Jensen (1830-1905). Ababyeyi ba Fiedler ntibashyingiwe kugeza hashize imyaka itandatu avutse. Fiedler yari umwe mu bakobwa batatu, bashiki be bitwaga Thora na Elisif. Bose uko ari batatu batangiye kwiga kuba abaforomo mu 1886\u201387, Fiedler yiga mu bitaro bya komini munsi ya ya Danemark (Danemark: Dansk R\u00f8de Kors). Bashiki ba Fiedler bombi bagiye mu bitaro bya kwiga. Kurangiza amashuri muri Croix-Rouge byatwaye amezi 15. \nUmwuga.\nFiedler yagumanye na Croix-Rouge. Mu 1888 yabaye umuforomo wigenga wa Croix-Rouge naho mu 1893 umwe mu barwayi be yari Johanne Petersen. Petersen kuva mu 1874 yayoboraga ishuri ryabakobwa bamugaye. Yashinze kandi urugo rwa Cripple (Danemark: Hjemmet for Vanf\u00f8re), ikigo cyita ku bageze mu za bukuru cy\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019abafite ubumuga, cyakoreshaga kwimura bashiki ba Croix Rouge nkabaforomo. Johanne Petersen yakundaga cyane Fiedler, wakoraga akazi ko kuba umuforomo w'igihe cyose mu rugo rwa Cripple mu 1894. Inzu yari nto, kandi Fiedler yafashaga kuyagura. Amahugurwa ya prostothique yo murugo yaguwe cyane, munsi ya Fiedler, kuburyo yashoboye gukemura ibibazo byurugo ubwabyo kimwe nibindi bitaro.\nNubwo imirimo ye nyamukuru yari ku buriri bwibitaro, Fiedler yatangiye kubaka bande na prostate wenyine. Yagumye nyuma yakazi, yubaka proth\u00e8tique avuye mu bishaje, akorana n\u2019uruhu, ibyuma n\u2019ibyuma. Amaze kurangiza prototype, yategetse abarwayi bo murugo kubaka prostateque nkubuvuzi bwakazi. Nyuma yigihe, amahugurwa yariyongereye, Fiedler ayobora aya mahugurwa hamwe nakazi ke ko kuba umuforomo, kandi umubare w\u2019abarwayi bafite ubumuga bakoraga muri bo wariyongereye. Abarwayi barahawe akazi kandi bahembwa, babaha akazi. Gukora proth\u00e8tike yabo nayo yazigamye amafaranga yo murugo.\nFiedler yahimbye prostothique nyinshi, ihuza n'umuntu ku giti cye, yemerera abarwayi kwikemurira ibintu byinshi ubwabo, baba bakeneye umuforomo ukundi. Mu 1908 Fiedler yabaye umuyobozi w'ikigo cyita ku bageze mu za bukuru. Mu gihe cy' Yose impuguke zaturutse mu bihugu byagize uruhare mu ntambara zaje mu kigo cyita ku bageze mu za bukuru cya Fiedler kugira ngo bige uburyo bwo gukora bande na prostothique bivuye ku cyitegererezo cya Fiedler. Fiedler yavuye ku mirimo ye mu 1921.\nYahawe umudari w'ishimwe mu 1913. Ku isabukuru yimyaka 25 mu 1919 yarizihijwe kandi ahabwa impano y'amafaranga. Yakoresheje aya mafaranga kugirango abone, Frk. Fiedlers Legat. \nUrupfu.\nNyuma yo kuva ku kazi mu 1921 Fiedler yimukiye i Lynge hafi ya Sor\u00f8, aho ababyeyi be bari batuye. Yapfiriye hano ku ya 13 Werurwe 1941. Yashyinguwe hamwe n'ababyeyi be ku irimbi rya Holsteinborg n'ikigo cya Holsteinborg."}
{"id": "17790", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17790", "title": "Wheelchair curling", "text": "Intebe y\u2019abamugaye ni umukino wo gukinisha abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bigira ingaruka ku maguru yo hepfo cyangwa kugenda. Intebe y\u2019abamugaye igengwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi, kandi ni umwe mu mikino mu mikino Paralempike hakonjea.\nIncamake.\nAmarushanwa y'igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga akinishwa hakurikijwe amategeko yashyizweho na federasiyo yisi yose. Aya mategeko ategeka ko amakipe yaba afite uburinganire buvanze, kandi ko imikino iba umunani irangiye. Igihe ntarengwa cy'iminota 38 yo gutekereza kuri buri kipe hamwe nigihe kimwe cya kabiri cya kabiri kizashyirwa mubikorwa nisaha. Kwemererwa kugarukira kubantu bafite ubumuga kuburyo igare ry\u2019abamugaye rikoreshwa mu kugenda kwa buri munsi cyane abadafite ambilansi cyangwa bashobora kugenda urugendo rurerure cyane."}
{"id": "17791", "revid": "9834", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17791", "title": "Braille translator", "text": "Ubusemuzi bwa braille ni porogaramu y'ikoranabuhanga isobanura inyandiko ya elegitoronike (nka dosiye ya MS-World fille) muri braille ikayohereza kuri periferi ya braille, nk'ibishushanyo mbonera (bitanga kopi ikomeye ya braille nshya). Mubusanzwe, buri rurimi rukenera umusemuzi warwo. Nubwo hakoreshejwe ijambo \"ubusemuzi\", nta busobanuro bw'uru rurimi. Ndetse no mu bihe byoroshye, nka braille y'u Buholandi, ifite amategeko akomeye yo gushyira mu nyuguti nkuru, gushimangira, utumenyetso, ibimenyetso byandika, no gutunganya page.\nIbisobanuro.\nKu ntego z'iki kiganiro cyangwa iyi nkuru, ijambo \"inkprint\" risobanura inyandiko yateguwe gusomwa n'ijisho, yaba yacapishijwe, yerekanwe kuri igaragaze amashusho, cyangwa ibe ibitswe muri mudasobwa; \"braille\" bivuga inyandiko yateguwe kugira ngo usome ukoresheje urutoki, rwaba rwanditseho, rwerekanwe ku gikoresho cya elegitoroniki, cyangwa kibitswe muri mudasobwa.\nPorogaramu y'ubusobanuro bwa Braille cyangwa ibyuma byinjizwamo bigahindura inkprint muri braille cyangwa braille igahindurwa muri inkprint. Mubisanzwe, umuntu afite inkprint muri dosiye itunganya ijambo cyangwa kuri URL kandi ashaka braille. Braille ishobora koherezwa mubudodo bwa braille kugira ngo ikore braille y'umubiri cyangwa kuri irimuburyo bufata bukanabika. Indi mpamvu nuko umuntu afite braille ifata ikabika ya elegitoroniki yerekana ko ashaka gukora muri inkprint kugira ngo asangire n'umuntu udasoma braille.\nPorogaramu y'ubusobanuro bwa Braille isanzwe ishyirwa mubikorwa by'ikoranabuhanga bifasha kuva ibikorwa bya tekinoroji bitanga ubufasha kubafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Abakenera ubusemuzi bwa Braille bushobora gukoreshwa nabantu bafite kuba babona cyangwa batabona.\nUbusemuzi bwa braille bushobora gukora kuri terefone, mudasobwa y'umuntu ku giti cye, seriveri y'urusobe, cyangwa (mu mateka) mini-mudasobwa nini cyangwa ibikorerwa mu bigo binini.\nIndimi zimwe zikoresha braille idasezeranye cyangwa itaremerwa, aho buri nyuguti ikoresha inyuguti yihariye. Braille idasezeranye isaba gukoresha inyuguti nkuru, gushimangira, imibare, no kuruhuka. Indimi zimwe zikoresha braille yagiranye amasezerano, aho amategeko ahinnye y'inyandiko aragoye. Kurugero, mu masezerano y'icyongereza yamasezerano, ijambo \"tekereza\" (inyuguti 5) ryahinduwe nkinyuguti 3:\u00a0 (th) (in) k. Gukoresha cyangwa kudakoresha ibyo kugabanuka bifitanye isano no kuvuga. Kurugero, ikimenyetso \"th\" gikoreshwa \"mubitekerezo\", ariko ntabwo ari \"ibinogo\". Keretse niba byateguwe neza, mudasobwa ishobora gukora ikosa ntamuntu numwe wakora, nko gukoresha igabanuka rya \"nyina\" mw'ijambo \"chimiotherapie\". Igice kigoye cyane cyo gukora braille nugufata icyemezo cy'igihe cyo kudakoresha mukwishurwa. Iyo abantu bafashe ibi byemezo, ni \"transcript ya braille\" ; iyo mudasobwa ifashe ibyemezo, ni \"ubusobanuro bwa braille\".\nAmateka.\nIkoreshwa rya mbere ryo guhindura mudasobwa no gukora braille yakoresheje mudasobwa y'ibanze muri American Printing House for the Blind rya Louisville, Kentucky. \nMu myaka yo muri 1960, habayeho umushinga MIT wo gutangiza umusaruro wa braille. Robert Mann yanditse kandi akurikirana porogaramu yo guhindura inyandiko y'ubusemuzi bwa braille yiswe DOTSYS, mu gihe irindi tsinda ryakoze igikoresho cyo gushushanya cyamenyekanye nka \"MIT Braillemboss.\" Amaherezo, MIT yatanze akazi mu ikoranabuhanga muri Miter Corporation. Itsinda rya Miter Corporation rigizwe na Robert Gildea, Jonathan Millen, Reid Gerhart na Joseph Sullivan kuri ubu ni perezida wa Duxbury Systems bakoze DOTSYS III, ubusemuzi bwa mbere bw\u2019inyandiko yanditswe mu rurimi rw'imikorere. DOTSYS III yatunganijwe kumashuri ya leta yo muri Atlanta nko muri gahunda rusange y'amashuri. \nMu mahugurwa mpuzamahanga ya mbere yerekeranye no gukora mudasobwa ya Braille yakozwe, yabereye i Muenster mugihugu cy'u Budage, muri werurwe mu mwaka 1973, hasobanuwe imishinga myinshi y\u2019ubuhinduzi bwa braille yaturutse hirya no hino ku isi isobanurwa. \nUbubiko bw'inyandiko ku mateka y'ubusemuzi bwa braille, ibisobanuro bya braille, hamwe n'ibikoresho bimwe bya braille bikomezwa na Duxbury Systems. "}
{"id": "17792", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17792", "title": "Adaptive Sports USA", "text": "Move United ni umuryango w\u2019abanyamerika udaharanira inyungu ugamije guteza imbere parasiporo mu rubyiruko ndetse n\u2019abantu bakuru bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri. Uyu muryango ukora gahunda ya parasporti yabaturage ukoresheje ibice birenga 150 byaho mu gihugu hose. Move Unitedi yashinzwe muri 2020 nk'uguhuza imiryango ibiri; Abamugaye muri Amerika, yashinzwe bwa mbere muri 1956 ikaba ifite icyicaro i Rockville, muri Mayilandi, umuryango wa kabiri washinzwe muri 1967. Himura ni umwe mu bagize komite ishinzwe imikino Olempike muri Amerika. Kugeza muri 2020, uyu muryango ukora gahunda zikorera abaturage 100.000 muri leta 43. Muri 2020, iyo miryango yombi yahujwe nka Move, itangiza indangamuntu nshya na Super union. Intego yatangajwe ko uyu muryango uzakorera 90% by'abatuye Amerika hamwe na gahunda zaho mu 2028, mu gihe cy'imikino Paralympike yo muri 2028 yabereye i Los Angeles muri amerika. \nImikino yo kumenyera Amerika.\nImikino ya Adaptive Sports USA (yahoze ari Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abamugaye, Imikino y\u2019ibimuga muri Amerika, na intebe y'abamugaye, muri Amerika) yashinzwe muri 1956, nk\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ry\u2019abamugaye, n\u2019abasirikare bahoze mu gisirikare bamugaye kugira ngo bafashe mu gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abakomeretse mu ntambara bavuye muri Koreya. \nAbamugaye muri USA yashinzwe muri 1967 nkishyirahamwe ry'igihugu ry'imikino ngororamubiri; mubayishinze harimo Jim Winthers, umusirikare waciwe wabaye inararibonye mu gice cya 10 cy\u2019imisozi. \nIgihembo cy'Ubuyobozi bwa Dr. Robert Harney.\nIgihembo cya Dr. Robert Harney Leadership Award ni igihembo ngarukamwaka cyo guha sosiyete, umuryango cyangwa umuntu ku giti cye wagaragaje kandi utanga ubuyobozi budasanzwe mu myitozo ngororamubiri ihuza n'imikino. \"Dr. Bob\" yari umupayiniya wa siporo umenyereye kandi akaba umuyobozi udacogora muri siporo y'abamugaye mu nzego z'ibanze, iz'igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga. Yari indashyikirwa mu rwego rw\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga mu rwego rw\u2019abakinnyi bafite ubumuga. \nNkumukorerabushake, Harney yari mu ikipe mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019abamugaye mu mikino yo gusiganwa ku maguru no gusiganwa ku magare kandi yitabira imikino yose y\u2019imbeho n\u2019izuba kuva mu 1998. Dr. Bob kandi yari umwarimu w\u2019umwuga wabigize umwuga akaba n\u2019igihe cyose akora umwuga wo kubaga amagufwa y\u2019amagufwa i Boston, akaba n'umuganga w\u2019itsinda ryabigenewe mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Winthrop na Melrose mu mujyi yavukiyemo wa Winthrop, Massachusetts mu myaka irenga 20. "}
{"id": "17793", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17793", "title": "Mert Lawwill", "text": "Mert Lawwill (Yavutse ku ya 25 Nzeri 1940) ni wabigize umwuga, nyir'ikipe y'isiganwa ndetse n'umushinga. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya kuva 1962 kugeza 1977. Lawwill azwiho kuba yaratsinze Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya 1969 AMA nkumunyamuryango witsinda ryabasiganwa ku ruganda rwa. Nyuma yumwuga we wo gusiganwa ku ipikipiki, Lawwill yabaye umwe mu bambere bashushanya amapikipiki yo gusiganwa n'abubatsi. Lawwill yahise akoresha ubunararibonye bwe nka moto yubaka moto kugirango abashe gukora igare ryimisozi mishya, atezimbere imwe ya mbere. Yateje imbere amaguru kuri amputees. Lawwill yinjijwe mu mu 1997 no mu mu 1998. \nUmwuga wo gusiganwa kuri moto.\nLawwill yavukiye i. Yatangiye umwuga we wo gusiganwa nkumukinnyi wikinira ku murongo wa TT waho muri Boise, hanyuma, nyuma yo gusiganwa (nyuma uzwi nka) hirya no hino muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru. Mu 1961, yimukiye i Los Angeles, muri Kaliforuniya kugira ngo ashobore gusiganwa ku isiganwa ry\u2019isiganwa rya, icyo gihe kikaba ari cyo cyabaye intandaro yo gusiganwa. Yabonye inkunga na, umucuruzi wa Harley-Davidson i San Francisco. Muri icyo gihe nibwo Lawwill yatangiye kwiga ibijyanye no guhindura amakarita ya moto kumarushanwa yo gusiganwa. Kugeza mu 1963, yari amaze gutwara umukinnyi wabigize umwuga maze mu 1964 asinyana amasezerano yo guhatanira ikipe yo gusiganwa ku ruganda rwa Harley-Davidson azabana na we mu buzima bwe bwose bwo gusiganwa. \nLawwill yatsinze isiganwa rye rya mbere ry\u2019igihugu cya AMA kuri ku ya 19 Nzeri 1965. Mu 1969, Lawwill yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya AMA kandi, yatowe nk'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane muri AMA. Ukwirwanaho kwe muri Shampiyona nkuru y\u2019igihugu mu gihembwe cya 1970 byabaye ingingo ya filime yerekana amapikipiki ya yo mu 1971, \"\" yakinnye n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi. Lawwill yakomeje guhatanira igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya AMA kugeza mu 1977 ubwo, yasezeye afite imyaka 37 kubera ikibazo cy\u2019amatwi y\u2019imbere cyagize ingaruka ku buringanire bwe. Yakusanyije umwuga 161 AMA Grand National arangiza kandi yatsindiye amasiganwa 15 ya Grand National mugihe cyimyaka 15 yo gusiganwa. \nUmwuga wo gushushanya.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya za 70, Lawwill yagize uruhare mu gushushanya igenda yiyongera yo gutwara. Yari umwe mu bapayiniya ba mbere ku isi ku magare yo hanze, amaze kumenyekanisha igare rya mbere ry\u2019umusozi. Yateje imbere kandi ubucuruzi bwa mbere bwubucuruzi guhagarika amagare yo kumusozi kandi atanga patenti. Muri kiriya gihe, yakomeje kugira uruhare mu gusiganwa ku ipikipiki nka nyir'ikipe yo gusiganwa muri Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya AMA kugeza mu 1990 ubwo, yababazwaga n\u2019uburyo AMA yayoboraga shampiyona. Nyuma yayoboye itsinda ryisiganwa irushanwa ryo gusiganwa maze ateza imbere igare ryatsinze Lawwill DH-9 ryuzuye yamanuka. Amagare yo gusiganwa ku magare ya Lawwill yahawe agaciro cyane n\u2019abasiganwa ku isonga ku isi kandi ibishushanyo bye byatsindiye ibikombe byinshi by\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019isi. \nMuri iki gihe Lawwill agira uruhare mu kubaka no kwamamaza ibicuruzwa byemewe n\u2019umuhanda wa gare ya yasiganwe muri Shampiyona nkuru y\u2019igihugu. Ayobora kandi sosiyete idaharanira inyungu itanga amaboko ya prostate kugirango amputees ashobore gutwara amagare cyangwa moto. Hafi ya kimwe cya gatatu cyamaboko ya prostate yose akora ajya, kugirango akoreshwe nabasirikare bahoze mu ntambara yo muri Iraki na Afuganisitani. "}
{"id": "17794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17794", "title": "2021 Wheelchair Rugby League World Cup final", "text": "Umukino wanyuma w'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2021 cyababana n'ubumuga muri Rugby League yari umwe mu mikino itatu yanyuma y'igikombe cy'isi cya 2021 cya Rugby League (cyasubitswe kandi kiba muri 2022). Yakiniwe ahitwa i Manchester Central Convention Complex i Manchester ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2022, ejobundi haba umukino wa nyuma w\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore. \nUbwongereza bwatsinze Ubufaransa muri 28-24 kugira ngo butware igikombe cya kabiri.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nUbwongereza n'Ubufaransa niyo ma kipe abiri yashyizwe ku mwanya wa mbere muri IRL Wheelchair ya World Rankings yagize mu irushanwa. Bari mu matsinda atandukanye ku mikino yo mu matsinda. Ubwongereza bwatsinze irushanwa rya mbere muri 2008, Ubufaransa bwatsinze Ubwongereza ku mukino wa nyuma n'andi marushanwa abiri muri 2013 na 2017. \nInzira ijya ku mukino wa nyuma.\nUbufaransa n'Ubwongereza byombi byatsinze amatsinda amanota atatu, buri wese yatsinze imikino itatu yose yo mu matsinda. Ubufaransa bwatsinze kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza na Ositaraliya n'amanota arenga 40, mu gihe Ubwongereza bwatsinze ubwabwo na Walesi amanota arenga 100 mu mukino yabahuje. "}
{"id": "17795", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17795", "title": "Wheelchair netball", "text": "Intebe ni itandukaniro rya netball yahujwe no gukinira mu ma magare. Ishobora gukinwa n'abantu bombi bafite ubumuga cyangwa kandi badafite ubumuga. \nAmateka.\nImvange ya basketball na netball yatangijwe mu iserukiramuco rikuru rya siporo ya Paraplegike muri 1949. Amakipe atandatu agizwe na bakinnyi 37 yarushanwe muri ibyo birori. Iyi verisiyo ya netball yakinwe m'ubirori byu mwaka kugeza muri 1954; yasimbuwe na basketball y'abamugaye muri 1956. \nUbwoko bugezweho bw'ibimuga bya bamugaye bisa na netball isanzwe, ariko hamwe n'amategeko yahinduwe yerekeye guhuza, kubuza no gutembera. "}
{"id": "17796", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17796", "title": "Dasher (software)", "text": "Dasher n'uburyo bwinjiza n'igikoresho kandi kigera kuri mudasobwa gifasha abakoresha guhimba inyandiko badakoresheje igikoresho cyandika muri mudasobwa, winjiza inyandiko kuri hamwe hagaragara amashusho hamwe n'igikoresho cyerekana kuri mudasobwa cyitiranwa n'imbeba, ahagaragara amashusho ikoraho, cyangwa imbeba ikoreshwa n'ikirenge cyangwa umutwe. Ibikoresho nk'ibi bishobora kuba ibikoresho bya prosthetic k'ubantu bafite ubumuga badashobora gukoresha igikoresho cyandika kuri mudasobwa isanzwe, cyangwa aho gukoresha imwe bigoye cyangwa bidashoboka. \nDasher ni ubuntu kandi ifungura isoko y'ikoranabuhanga, ingingo yabayeho hubahirijwe ibisabwa na GNU (General Public License)GPL, verisiyo ya 2. Dasher iboneka kuri sisitemu y'imikorere hamwe na GTK +, ni ukuvuga Linux, BSDs hamwe na Unix isa na macOS, Microsoft Windows, Pocket PC, iOS na Android. \nDasher yahimbwe na David JC MacKay kandi yatejwe imbere na David Ward hamwe n'abandi bagize itsinda ry\u2019ubushakashatsi bwa MacKay rya Cambridge research group. Umushinga Dasher ushyigikiwe cyangwa uterwa inkunga na Fondasiyo ya Gatsby Charitable hamwe na EU aegis-project. \nIgishushanyo cy'umushinga.\nKubintu byose umwanditsi ashaka kwandika, bahitamo ibaruwa yanditswe yerekanwe ku habugenewe kugaragaza amashusho muri mudasobwa bakoresheje icyerekezo, aho sisitemu ikoresha uburyo bwo guhanura ibintu kugira ngo hamenyekane ibishobora guhuzwa n'ibice bikurikira, hanyuma bihuze ibyo byihutirwa byo kubigaragaza cyane kuruta inyuguti zishoboka. Ibi bizigama umukoresha imbaraga n'igihe mu gihe bagiye guhitamo ibaruwa ikurikira kubatanzwe. Inzira yo guhimba inyandiko murubu buryo yagereranijwe nu mukino wa arcade, mu gihe abakoresha bahinduranya inyuguti ziguruka hejuru ya ahabugenewe kugaragaza amashusho hanyuma bagahitamo kugira ngo bahimbe inyandiko. Sisitemu yigira kuburambe inyuguti zikomatanya nizo zizwi cyane, kandi igahindura protocole yayo mu gihe cyo kwerekana ibi.\nIbiranga.\nPorogaramu ya Dasher ikubiyemo amadosiye atandukanye yubaka kandi yigenga:"}
{"id": "17797", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17797", "title": "Pickleball", "text": "Pickleball ni umukino wa racketi cyangwa padile aho abakinnyi babiri (abaseribateri) cyangwa abakinnyi bane (inshuro ebyiri) bakubise umupira wa pulasitike usobekeranye, wuzuye umwuka hamwe na padi m 0.86 z'inshundura kugeza uruhande rumwe rudashoboye gusubiza umupira cyangwa gukora amakosa. Pickleball ikinirwa mu nzu no hanze. Yavumbuwe muri 1965 nk'u mukino w'inyuma w'abana muri Amerika, ku kirwa cya Bainbridge muri leta ya Washington. Muri 2022, pickleball yiswe siporo ya leta ya Washington muri amerika. \namagambo.\nNk\u2019uko byatangajwe na Joan Pritchard, umugore wa Joel Pritchard, ati: \" Izina ry'umukino ryabaye Pickle Ball nyuma yo kuvuga ko bibyibukije ubwato bwa pickle mu bakozi aho hatoraguwe abasare mu yandi mato. \" Andi makuru avuga ko izina \"pickleball \" ryakomotse ku izina ry\u2019imbwa yo mu muryango wa Pritchards. Pritchards yavuze ko imbwa yaje nyuma yuko umukino umaze kwitwa, kandi imbwa ni yo yitiriwe umukino wa pickleball. Bavuze ko urujijo rwadutse ubwo umunyamakuru yabazaga Pritchards mu ntangiriro ya 70 yemeje ko bizoroha abasomyi guhuza imbwa aho kuba ubwato bworoshye. Abahagarariye Amerika Pickleball bavuga ko ubushakashatsi bwabo bwemeje ko imbwa Pickles yavutse nyuma yuko umukino wari umaze kwitwa. \nAmateka.\nIvumburwa.\nIgihe Pritchard na Bell bagarukaga muri golufi ku wa gatandatu nyuma ya saa sita muri 1965, basanze imiryango yabo irambiwe. Bagerageje gushyiraho badaminton, ariko nta muntu numwe washoboraga kubona shutlecock. Pritchard na Bell bahamagariye abana babo gutegura umukino wabo. Abakuze n'abana barangije mu rukiko rwa badiminton batangira kugerageza imipira itandukanye hamwe na racket, harimo na tennis ya sitade. Urushundura rwa badminton 1.5 metero amaherezo rwa manuwe kugeza kurwego rwo mu kibuno kugirango rwemere gutwara umupira. \nAmarushanwa.\nAmarushanwa yo muri 1976 yabereye muri Southcenter Athletic Club i Tukwila, Washington, ashimirwa ko ariryo rushanwa rya mbere rya pickleball. Yiswe \" Shampiyona ya mbere ya Pickleball ku Isi na Joel Pritchard kandi yakiriwe mu kinyamakuru \"Tennis\" cyo muri Nyakanga 1976. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abanyamerika Amateur Pickleball (USAPA) ryashinzwe muri 1984, ni bwo basohoye igitabo cya mbere cyemewe cy\u2019imikino kandi bakora amarushanwa ya mbere y\u2019igihugu cya kabiri yabereye i Tacoma, i Washington. Kugeza 1990, siporo yakinwaga muri leta zose uko ari 50. Muri 2001, pickle ball yashyizwe muri siporo yo kwerekana mu mikino Olempike nkuru ya Arizona yitabiriye 100. Irushanwa rya pickle ball ryabereye muri Happy Trails RV Resort i Surprise, Arizona, kandi mu myaka itanu harimo 275 bitabiriye. Kwinjiza pickleball muri aso byagaragaye nku musanzu wagize uruhare mukuzamura amarushanwa muri Amerika. \nUrusaku.\nIyo umupira wa pickle ball ukubise umupira ukomeye, utanga amajwi atyaye. Ijwi rihoraho mu gihe cyo gukina ryateje amakimbirane hagati ya nyiri ikibuga cya pickle ball hamwe n'abafite imitungo iri hafi. Urusaku, hamwe n\u2019izamuka ryihuse ry'amamare rya pickle ball, ryateje ikibazo gikomeye muri siporo mu baturage bo muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "17798", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17798", "title": "Wheelchair soccer", "text": "Umupira w'amaguru w'abamugaye ni itandukaniro ry'umupira w'amaguru w'ishyirahamwe, aho abitabiriye bose ari abakoresha amagare kubera ubumuga bw'umubiri. Ubumuga bwo mu mutwe nabwo bushobora kuba ikintu cyingenzi, ariko ntabwo buri gihe aribyo. Intebe y\u2019abaimugaye irashobora kuba moteri, cyangwa intoki.\nMugihe amashanyarazi yose hamwe n'intebe y'imuga y'intoki, umukinnyi arigenda aho bishoboka. Niba ibi bidashoboka ku mubiri, umukinnyi yemerewe gukoresha pusheri kugirango azenguruke mu rukino. Ariko, gusunika ni pasiporo mu buryo badashobora kwishora mu mikino. Umupira wa maguru w\u2019abamugaye urasa cyane nu buryo bushoboye bw'imikino y'umukino ukurikije amategeko n'imiterere - itandukaniro nyaryo ni uko umukinnyi ukoresha igare ry\u2019abamugaye kugira ngo azenguruke mu rukino kandi anazunguruka umupira iyo arenganye, kugira ngo akemure undi mukinnyi n, no gutsinda ibitego. Niba umukinnyi ashoboye gutera umupira, noneho baremerewe kubikora. Nanone, niba umunyezamu ashoboye guhagarika umupira n'amaboko yabo, baremerewe kubikora.\nImikino ikinirwa mu nzu (mu bisanzwe ku kibuga cya basketball cyahinduwe). Umupira nawo munini cyane kuruta umupira wa maguru umupira wamaguru.\nUmupira w\u2019ibimuga wavumbuwe muri Victoriya, Ositaraliya, aho utezwa imbere nkubufatanye hagati ya Scope y na Federasiyo yumupira wa maguru Victoriya. Umupira wa maguru w\u2019abamugaye ugabanijwemo uturere tubiri, Amajyepfo n\u2019Amajyaruguru, hamwe n\u2019ibigega ndetse n\u2019ibice bikomeye. Ikipe ya mbere muri buri cyiciro cy'akarere ihurira kuri Final ya Leta."}
{"id": "17799", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17799", "title": "WCMX (siporo)", "text": "WCMX ni siporo abakinyi y'abamugaye bakora amayeri yakuwe muri skateboarding na BMX, ubusanzwe ikorerwa kuri skatepark. Yahimbwe na Aaron Fotheringham. \nIncamake.\nSiporo ifite amarushanwa yayo hamwe n'intebe y'abamugaye yabigenewe. \nAmateka.\nIjambo WCMX, mash up y'intebe y\u2019abamugaye na BMX, yahimbwe na Fotheringham. Fotheringham yinjije igare ry'ambere ry'ibimuga hamwe ninyuma ya kabiri. \nAustraliya.\nTimothy Lachlan niwe Australiya wa mbere waguye inyuma y\u2019abamugaye. \nUbwongereza.\nLily Rice niwe muntu wa mbere mu Bwongereza waguye inyuma. Yatsindiye igikombe cya mbere cy'isi muri Nzeri 2019. \nIhuriro rya mbere rya WCMX mu Bwongereza ryabaye mu ntangiriro za 2019. \nMu mwaka wa 2016, ubukangurambaga kuri interineti bwa parike ya skate ya Lego yamaganwe. Ariko, WCMX ihagarariwe muri Lego City Skate Park (60290) yashyizwe ahagaragara, yasohotse 2021. "}
{"id": "17800", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17800", "title": "Accessaphone", "text": "accessaphone, yatangijwe bwa mbere mu mwaka 2005 ni CTI (Computer Telephony Integration) ifasha software itanga uburyo bwiza bwo gukoresha abantu bakoresha kumeza nka terefone yoroshye ukoresheje uburyo bwabugenewe bwokwandika muri mudasobwa,imbeba ikoreshwa kuri mudasobwa cyangwa amategeko y'ijwi. Porogaramu ni ingirakamaro cyane kubakoresha bafite icyerekezo gitandukanye n'ubushobozi bwo kugenda.\nUburyo ikoreshwa.\nNk'urugero, mu gihe ukoresheje terefone y'umushinga muri Cisco, NEC cyangwa Tadiran Telecom, imirimo nka Dial, Hold na Transfer ishobora gukorwa hakoreshejwe urufunguzo rushyushye D, H na T (ibanzirizwa n'urufunguzo rwa ALT). accessaphone ikoresha Microsoft Windows Terefone Porogaramu (TAPI) kugira ngo ivugane na sisitemu ya terefone y'umushinga.\nKubahiriza kugerwaho.\nBumwe mu buryo bwa enterineti butuma sisitemu ya terefone igerwaho kandi Igice cya 508 cyujuje ni ugutanga indangamuntu yumvikana. Iki nicyo gisabwa kuri (Voluntary Product Accessibility Template). Ibi ni ingirakamaro cyane kubakoresha bafite igihombo cyo kutabona nkuko kumenyekanisha umuhamagaro winjira bitangazwa no gukoresha ikoronabuhanga. Ikigo gishinzwe kwinjira muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika(United State Access Board) ikigo gishinzwe Igice cya 508, cyohereje accessphone hamwe na sisitemu ya terefone ya Cisco ku bakozi babo basabaga kugera ku bikoresho bimwe na bimwe bya terefone nka Indangamuntu cyangwa abo bakozi bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri bakeneye amajwi kugira ngo babashe kumenya ibijyanye telefone. \nMu mwaka wa 2009, Fondasiyo y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona yakoze ubushakashatsi bwakozwe maze yemeza ko accessaphone ikurikiza ingingo ya 508 kandi mu by'ukuri yazamuye Ijwi hejuru y'ibikoresho bya terefone ku bakoresha bakeneye kubona kuri ibyo bikoresho. "}
{"id": "17801", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17801", "title": "Wheelchair Australian rules football", "text": "Umukino w'ambere w'ateguwe w'abamugaye muri Australiya, amategeko y'umupira w'amaguru yakinwe m'ukigo cya RAAF i Adelaide, Ositaraliya yepfo ku ya 8 Ugushyingo 2015. Umukino wari urimo m' itsinda ry\u2019abasirikare bakomeretse bo muri Ositaraliya (ADF) bakomeretse mu kigo cy\u2019abasirikare ba Darwin cy\u2019abasirikare ba Darwin hamwe n\u2019ikipe y\u2019imikino y\u2019ubumuga ya Ositaraliya (DSA) igizwe n\u2019abakinnyi baturutse muri Ositaraliya yepfo. Umukino wateguwe na ADF, Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru muri Ositaraliya na DSA. Amanota yanyuma yari: Ikipe ya DSA 16.8.104 yatsinze ikipe ya ADF 14.5.89. \nMuri Mata 2015, igikomangoma Harry mu gihe yasuraga Darwin, Intara y'Amajyaruguru yazamuye uyu mukino mushya yitabira umukino w\u2019ibimuga AFL. Umukino warimo abasirikare ba Ositaraliya bakomeretse. \nUgushyingo 2015, hari gahunda yo gushyiraho shampiyona y'igihugu. \nAmategeko.\nAmategeko y'umukino afite aho ahuriye n'amategeko ya AFL k'umategeko ya Australiya umupira w'amaguru kandi harimo: "}
{"id": "17802", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17802", "title": "Wheelchair Cricketers Welfare Association of Bangladesh", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abamugaye muri Bangladesh (WCWAB) ni umuryango w\u2019igihugu utegamiye kuri Leta kandi udaharanira inyungu washyizweho hagamijwe iterambere ry\u2019abaturage bafite ibibazo by\u2019ubumuga bo muri Bangladesh. Uyu muryango washinzwe n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019abamugaye Mohammad Mohasin. Uyu muryango ukorera abamugaye kuva mu mwaka wa 2010 ugamije kwinjiza ababana n'ubumuga no gushimangira umuryango rusange. Muri 2016, umuryango wiyandikishije mu ishami rishinzwe imibereho myiza ya Bangladesh. WCWAB yatoye inama y'ubuyobozi. Intwali ku ntebe ziziga zatangiye urugendo rwo gukina umupira wamaguru muri 2010. Kuva icyo gihe, abakinyi ba Cricket bo muri Bangladeshi bitabiriye amarushanwa akomeye nkaya marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Cricket ya ICRC yabereye muri Bangladesh ndetse nigikombe cya Aziya mubuhinde. \nWCWAB yari umwe mu mashyirahamwe 30 ayobowe n\u2019urubyiruko yahawe igihembo cy\u2019urubyiruko cya Joy Bangla na Young Bangla mu 2017, kubera ibikorwa byabo byo guteza imbere siporo. \nIntebe y\u2019ibimuga yatangijwe muri Bangladesh.\nIrushanwa ry'ambere ry' abamugaye muri Bangladesh ryatangijwe mu mwaka wa 2016 nu buyobozi bwa Imago Sports bufatanije n'ishyirahamwe ry'imibereho y'imikino ya Cricket ya Bangladesh. Abakinnyi mirongo itatu na batandatu (36) b'abamugaye b'amagare (makumyabiri na batanu (25) baturutse hanze ya Dhaka) bitabiriye iri rushanwa ry'umunsi wose. Kubenshi mubakoresha igare ryibimuga bwari ubwambere bitabiriye umukino wa siporo uhatanira.\nWCWAB iyobowe n'inama yatowe. Mohammad Mohsin ni Perezida wa WCWAB. "}
{"id": "17803", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17803", "title": "Wheelchair sport classification", "text": "Intebe y'imikino yabamugaye ni uburyo bwagenewe kwemerera irushanwa ryiza hagati y\u2019abafite ubumuga butandukanye, no kugabanya ingaruka z\u2019ubumuga bwihariye bw\u2019umuntu ku byavuye mu marushanwa. Imikino y\u2019ibimuga ifitanye isano n\u2019imvune y\u2019umugongo, kandi ikubiyemo ubwoko butandukanye bw\u2019ubumuga burimo paraplegiya, quadriplegiya, dystrofiya yimitsi, syndrome ya polio na spina bifida. Ubumuga bugomba kuba bwujuje ibyangombwa byibura by'imikorere y'umubiri. Intebe y'imuga y'imikino na siporo kubantu bafite ibikomere byumugongo akenshi bishingiye kumyanya y'ibisebe by'umugongo hamwe n'ubumuga bwabo n'ubumuga.\nIntego.\nIntebe y'imikino y'abamugaye imwe itandukanye muri siporo mu buryo bwihariye. Mu ruzitiro rw'abamugaye, intego yo gushyira mu byiciro ni ukwemeza ko abaterankunga bashyirwa mu byiciro hashingiwe ku kugenda neza kugira ngo imyitozo yabo, urwego rw\u2019ubuhanga, impano n'uburambe bigena ibizava mu mukino, ntabwo ari ubwoko bwabo bw'ubumuga. Ibi byishingira uburinganire muri siporo. Muri ruhago y\u2019ibimuga, intego yo gushyira mu byiciro ni uguha imiterere siporo hagabanywa ingaruka z\u2019ubumuga butandukanye bw\u2019imikorere ku rukiko kuko bijyanye n\u2019ibyavuye mu mukino. \nAmasomo.\nUbusanzwe, amasomo yakoreshejwe kuri WASI yashingiye ku mikino ngororamubiri hamwe nibisabwa mubindi siporo. Hano hari ibyiciro bine byo gukurikiranwa na munani kubirometero. Impinduka zaya masomo zishingiye ku mikorere yu mugongo zikoreshwa muyindi siporo. Aya masomo yatangiriye kumunsi wa mbere wa siporo yimuga ya bamugaye, mugihe sisitemu yo gutondekanya yari 1A, 1B, 1C, 2, 3, 4, 5 na 6. Habayeho guhinduka kuva icyo gihe mubijyanye nu busobanuro bukora nubwo ibisobanuro by'ubuvuzi byaho biherereye aho igikomere cyo mugongo cyagumye bisa. \nKubona ibyiciro.\nGutondekanya akenshi siporo yihariye. \nIbyiciro by'ubuvuzi by'imikino y'abamugaye birashobora kuba bigizwe n'ubuvuzi bwoherejwe m'ubyiciro byubuvuzi muri federasiyo ya siporo. Umuganga w'umukinnyi wa siporo arashobora gusabwa gutanga amakuru menshi yubuvuzi harimo gupima ubuvuzi no gutakaza imikorere yose ijyanye nubuzima bwabo. Ibi birimo niba imiterere igenda itera imbere cyangwa ihamye, niba ari ibintu byavutse cyangwa byavutse. Irashobora kubamo gusaba amakuru kubijyanye n'ubuvuzi buteganijwe. Irashobora kandi kubamo gusaba imiti iyo ari yo yose umuntu afata. Inyandiko zishobora gusabwa harimo x imirasire, ibisubizo bya ASAI ibisubizo, cyangwa amanota ya Ashworth yahinduwe. "}
{"id": "17804", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17804", "title": "WheelPower", "text": "WheelPower n\u2019umuryango w\u2019igihugu ushinzwe siporo y\u2019abamugaye mu Bwongereza, kandi igamije gufasha ababana n\u2019ubumuga kuzamura imibereho yabo.\nYiswe Fondasiyo y'Ubwongereza ya Wheelchair Sports Foundation, ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta kandi ukaba ubarizwa kuri Sitade Mandeville kuri Buckinghamshire. Abakunzi bayo barimo Baroness Tanni Gray-Thompson na Ade Adepitan.\nAmateka.\nWheelPower yabanje gushingwa muri 1972 (52)\u00a0imyaka yashize (1972) nka Sosiyete y'Abongereza Paraplegike Sports.\nUyu muryango washinzwe na nyakwigendera Professor Sir Ludwig Guttmann, wahinduye uburyo bwo kuvura abantu bafite ibikomere by'umugongo mu bitaro bya Stoke Mandeville mu mpera za 1940. Guttmann yatangiye gukoresha siporo mu rwego rwo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze mu ntambara ya kabiri y'isi yose maze mu 1948 ashyiraho amarushanwa hagati y'amakipi y'imikino n'ibindi bitaro kugira ngo ahure n'imikino Olempike yabereye i Londres.\nImbaraga.\nKuva mu minsi ya mbere ya Guttmann, WheelPower yateje imbere ibikorwa bitandukanye bya siporo kandi muri iki gihe ikorana n\u2019amashyirahamwe ya siporo.\nItangwa ry'imikino ngororamubiri kuri Sitoke Mandeville ryatangiye mu myaka ya za 1940 maze mu 1969 Stade Stoke Mandeville ifungura na Nyiricyubahiro Umwamikazi.\nMuri 1984 iki kigo cyakinnye imikino Paralympike hamwe na bakinnyi bagera ku 1200 bitabiriye ibirori bya siporo.\nImikino.\nWheelPower ishyigikira, mubindi, siporo ikurikira:"}
{"id": "17805", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17805", "title": "Arabic Braille", "text": "Icyarabu Icyarabu (Icyarabu: \u0628\u0650\u0631\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0651\u0629, \"birayl al\u02bfarab\u012byah\") ni inyuguti ya y'ururimi rw'icyarabu. Bikomoka ku nyuguti z'impumyi zazanywe mu Misiri n'umumisiyonari w'Ubwongereza mbere ya 1878, bityo rero ibaruwa yandikiwe muri rusange ihuye n ndetse no kimwe no mu zindi gahunda za braille. Ariko, harigeze kubaho amahame menshi, amwe murimwe (nka) ntaho yari ahuriye na Coptic Braille. Icyarabu cyarabu cyunze ubumwe cyemejwe mu myaka ya za 1950 mu rwego rwo kwerekeza, kandi ni cyo gipimo mu bihugu by'Abarabu. Izindi zifite sisitemu ya braille isa na Braille yicyarabu, nka na Braille, ariko itandukanye mu nyuguti zimwe na zimwe za diacritic. \nBitandukanye n\u2019icyarabu, icyarabu Braille gisomwa uhereye ibumoso ugana iburyo, nyuma y\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga. Imibare nayo isigaye iburyo, nko mucyarabu cyacapwe.\nImbonerahamwe braille y'icyarabu.\nIcyarabu Braille kirimo amagambo ahinnye, amwe yaranzwe nudomo 4 cyangwa akadomo 5 (koma), bidasobanuwe hano. Inama yabereye muri Arabiya Sawudite mu 2002 yashyizeho amahame ahuriweho n\u2019icyarabu, ariko guhera mu 2013 ntabwo ibihugu byose byari byiyandikishije; abadakurikiza amahame barimo ibihugu bimwe byabarabu ariko nibindi bihugu byabayisilamu batari abarabu nka Irani, Maleziya, na Indoneziya.\nInzandiko.\nNubwo inyuguti ngufi-inyajwi atari diacritics mu cyarabu cy'icyarabu, zirahitamo kandi muri rusange zirekuwe, kimwe no mucyarabu cyanditse."}
{"id": "17806", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17806", "title": "Algerian Braille", "text": "Alijeriya Braille yari yakoreshwaga mu kwandika ururimi rwicyarabu muri Alijeriya. Biragaragara ko bishaje. \nMuri Braille yo muri Alijeriya, inyuguti z'inyuguti zashyizweho zikurikirana mu nyuguti z'icyarabu ; kurupapuro rwicyarabu rusanzwe kurundi ruhande rukoresha umukoro utandukanye rwose, ukurikiza ukurikije gahunda yinyuguti yigifaransa. Kurugero, inyuguti ya gatanu ya braille, \u2811, ikoreshwa muri Braille yo muri Alijeriya kuri \u062c \"j\", inyuguti ya gatanu yinyuguti ya Alijeriya / Icyarabu. Mu nyuguti nyinshi za braille muri iki gihe, \u2811 ikoreshwa kuri \"e\", inyuguti ya gatanu y\u2019inyuguti y\u2019igifaransa / Ikilatini, cyangwa ku nyuguti isa na \"e\", aho yaba ari hose muri izo nyuguti.\nGusubiramo ubwoko bwa Alijeriya byari bisanzwe mu guhuza imiterere ya braille hakiri kare, ariko ahanini byaratereranywe hashyirwaho amahame yumvikana guhera mu guhuza Braille y\u2019igifaransa, Icyongereza, Ikidage, n\u2019icyarabu ku rutonde rwambere mu 1878. "}
{"id": "17807", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17807", "title": "Greek Braille", "text": "Greek Braille ninyuguti ya braille yururimi rw'ikigereki. Ishingiye kumasezerano mpuzamahanga ya braille, mubisanzwe bihuye no guhindura ikilatini. Mu kigereki, izwi nka \u039a\u03ce\u03b4\u03b9\u03ba\u03b1\u03c2 \u039c\u03c0\u03c1\u03ac\u03b9\u03b3 K\u00f4dikas Br\u00e9g \"Kode ya Braille\".\nMu byukuri hariho inyuguti ebyiri z'ikigereki z'inyuguti z'ikigereki, zitandukanye mu itangwa ry'inyuguti nke: Braille y'Abagereki ya none ikoreshwa mu Bugereki, na Braille mpuzamahanga y'Abagereki ku nyuguti z'ikigereki cyangwa amagambo yakoreshejwe mu mibare cyangwa ubundi yashyizwe mu Cyongereza no mu zindi ndimi.\nBraille y'ikigereki mpuzamahanga.\nInshingano mpuzamahanga zinyuranye ziratandukanye nimwe hejuru. Mu Bugereki bwa none bw'Ikigereki, urugero, inyuguti ya omega (\u03c9) yanditswe kimwe n'ikilatini \"j\", mu gihe mu nyandiko y'Icyongereza cyangwa Igifaransa cyanditswe mu nyandiko y\u2019igifaransa cyanditswe nka \"w\", gisa n'icapiro. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, Ikigereki cya none upsilon cyanditswe nk'ikilatini \"y\", ariko mu kigereki mpuzamahanga cyanditswe nka \"u\", kandi inyuguti ya eta ihindagurika.\nIyi nyuguti ikoreshwa, kurugero, mumibare yanditswe mubindi bitabo byikilatini-braille. Ikora kandi ishingiro ryinyuguti z'ikigereki muri kode ya na. Ntabwo ikoreshwa mu Bugereki cyangwa Kupuro. Imbonerahamwe ikurikira, inyuguti zitandukanye na Braille ya none yubugereki iragaragara."}
{"id": "17808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17808", "title": "Gardner\u2013Salinas braille codes", "text": "Kode ya Gardner - Salinas nuburyo bwo gushushanya imibare nubumenyi bwa siyanse ukoresheje kugirango usome neza nababana nubumuga bwo kutabona. Uburyo bukunze kugaragara bwa Gardner - Salinas braille nubwoko 8-selile, bakunze kwita GS8. Hariho kandi ifishi 6 ihuye yitwa GS6. \nKode yatunganijwe mu rwego rwo gusimbura na John A. Gardner, umuhanga mu bya fiziki muri, na Norberto Salinas, umunyamibare wo muri Arijantine.\nKode ya Gardner - Salinas ni urugero rwururimi rworoshye rwabantu. Syntax ishingiye kuri sisitemu ya yo kwandika siyanse."}
{"id": "17809", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17809", "title": "Nemeth Braille", "text": "Nemeth Braille Code for Mathematics ni code ya yo gushushanya imibare na siyansi umurongo ukoresheje zisanzwe zitandatu-Utudomo two mu bwoko bwa Braille kugirango dusome neza nabafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Kode yatunganijwe na. Kode ya Nemeth yanditswe bwa mbere mu 1952. Yavuguruwe mu 1956, 1965, na 1972. Nintangarugero yimvugo isomeka yumuntu isomeka \nNemeth Braille ni code imwe gusa ikoreshwa mukwandika imibare muri braille. Hariho uburyo bwinshi bukoreshwa kwisi yose.\nAmahame ya Code ya Nemeth.\nIgitabo cya Nemeth Code Book (1972) gifungura n'amagambo akurikira:\nIyi kode ya Braille kubiharuro na siyansi yateguwe kugirango itange sisitemu yibimenyetso bizemerera ibitabo bya tekiniki kwerekana no gusomwa mu nyandiko. Kode igamije gutanga ibisobanuro nyabyo bishobotse kubasoma braille yumwandiko wanditse, kandi iki nikimwe mubintu byingenzi biranga. Iyo umusomyi wa braille afite imyumvire isobanutse yumwandiko wanditse, aho itumanaho riri hagati ye na mwarimu we, abo bakorana, abo bakorana, ndetse nisi muri rusange ryagutse cyane. Ikizamini cyukuri kode itanga amakuru kuva icapiro kugeza umwandiko wa braille ni ugukora inyandiko mvugo yerekeza. Ingano yamasezerano hagati yumwimerere wacapwe nuwandukuwe muri braille ni igipimo cyukuri kode.\nIngaruka imwe nuko uwandukura braille adakeneye kumenya imibare ishingiye. Umwanditsi wa braille agomba kumenya ibimenyetso byanditse kandi akamenya kubitanga muri Nemeth Code braille. Kurugero, niba ikimenyetso kimwe cyimibare gishobora kugira ibisobanuro bibiri bitandukanye, ibi ntacyo bitwaye; ingero zombi zashyirwa ahagaragara kimwe. Ibi bitandukanye na Code yumuziki mpuzamahanga ya Braille, aho braille iterwa nubusobanuro bwumuziki wino. Rero ubumenyi bwumuziki burasabwa kubyara umuziki wa braille."}
{"id": "17810", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17810", "title": "Abraham Nemeth", "text": "Abraham Nemeth (16 Ukwakira 1918 - 2 Ukwakira 2013) yari umunyamerika. Yabaye umwarimu w\u2019imibare muri kaminuza ya Detroit Impuhwe i Detroit, muri Leta ya Michigan. Nemeth yari afite ubumuga bwo kutabona kandi azwiho guteza imbere Nemeth Braille, sisiteme y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona yo gusoma no kwandika imibare.\nUbuzima bwe bwo hambere.\nNemeth yavukiye mu mujyi wa mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Manhattan mu Muryango mugari w\u2019abimukira b\u2019Abayahudi b\u2019abayahudi bavugaga Yiddish. Yabaye impumyi kuva akivuka avanze na macula degeneration na retinitis pigmentosa.\nYabanje kwiga amashuri ya leta ariko amashuri menshi abanza nayisumbuye muri Guild yAbayahudi y\u2019ishuri ry\u2019abatabona i, muri New York. Amashuri yisumbuye yari muri College aho yize psychologue. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi muri psychologiya yakuye muri.\nNemeth yize imibare na fiziki muri. Ntabwo yize imibare kuko abajyanama be mu masomo bamuca intege. Icyakora, arambiwe ibyo yumvaga ari imirimo ituzuye mu bigo by'impumyi, kandi abifashijwemo n'umugore we wa mbere Florence, yahisemo gukomeza amashuri ye mu mibare. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. mu mibare yakuye muri.\nUmwuga w'amasomo.\nNemeth yigishije amasaha make muri kaminuza zitandukanye i New York. Nubwo abakoresha be rimwe na rimwe batashakaga kumuha akazi azi ko ari impumyi, izina rye ryarushijeho kwiyongera kuko byagaragaye ko yari umuhanga mu mibare n\u2019umwarimu. Nemeth yitandukanije nabandi bantu benshi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona abasha kwandika inyuguti zanditse zerekana amashusho nibimenyetso by'imibare ku mpapuro no ku kibaho kimwe n'abantu babibona, ubuhanga yize akiri umwana. Nemeth avuga ko ubwo buhanga bwamwemereye gutsinda mu mibare, mu gihe kidafite ikoranabuhanga ryinshi, ubwo na Braille byari bigoye gukoresha mu mibare. Mu myaka ya za 1950, yimukiye i muri Leta ya Michigan kugira ngo yemere umwanya muri kaminuza ya Detroit ukorana na Keith Rosenberg. Yagumyeyo imyaka 30, asezera mu 1985. Mu mpera za 1960 yize siyanse ya maze atangira gahunda ya kaminuza muri iryo somo.\nAkamaro ku imibare n'ubuhumyi.\nMugihe amasomo yarushagaho gutera imbere, yasanze akeneye kode ya braille yakoresha neza ubwoko bwimibare nubumenyi yakoreshaga. Amaherezo, yashyizeho amategeko ya Nemeth Braille Code for Mathematics and Science Notation, yasohotse mu 1952. Kode ya Nemeth yanyuze mu 4 ivugurura kuva yatangira iterambere, kandi ikomeje gukoreshwa cyane muri iki gihe.\nNemeth ashinzwe kandi amategeko ya MathSpeak, sisitemu yo kuvuga kumvugo inyandiko. Mu masomo ye, Nemeth yasanze akeneye gukoresha abasomyi bareba kugirango basome ubundi imibare yimibare itagerwaho nibindi bikoresho. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, yari akeneye uburyo bwo gutegeka imirimo ye y'imibare n'ibindi bikoresho byo kwandukura. Amasezerano Nemeth yateje imbere gusoma neza imibare yimibare n'ijwi rirenga ihinduka MathSpeak.\nNemeth yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019Ubwongereza Bumwe (UEB) kuva mu 1991 kugeza nibura mu 2001, nubwo yaje gutandukana n\u2019abandi batezimbere iyo code, ahubwo akora ku mbaraga zisa nazo zitwa Universal Braille System (rimwe na rimwe mu magambo ahinnye yitwa NUBS hamwe na we izina ryongewe imbere). Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2012, UEB yemejwe na BANA nk'urwego rusanzwe rw'imyandikire y\u2019ubuvanganzo, ariko Code ya Nemeth nayo yagumishijwe mu buryo bwuzuye nka sisitemu yo kwandika ku bushake. Imirimo kuri NUBS irashobora gukomeza, cyangwa irashobora guhuzwa mumategeko azaza-kuvugurura amategeko yemewe ya Nemeth (amategeko aheruka-kuvugurura amategeko ya Nemeth yari muri 2013).\nNyuma yizabukuru.\nNemeth yari agikora kuri code ya Nemeth igihe yapfaga. Nemeth yari umunyamwete mu muryango w'Abayahudi kuva mu bwana, kandi kuva mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru avuye mu mibare y\u2019amasomo, yandikaga igitabo cy'amasengesho cy'igiheburayo muri Braille.\nNemeth yari umunyamwete mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatabona. Yanditse inkuru ngufi kandi atanga disikuru kuri NFB kubyerekeye ubuzima bwe nkumubare wimpumyi. Ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2006, Nemeth yagize ikibazo gikomeye cy'umutima, ariko arakira kandi yari ahagije kugira ngo yitabe ikoraniro rya NFB muri Nyakanga 2006 kandi yemera igihembo cya Louis Braille 2006 uyu muryango wamuhaye. Ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2009, yahawe icyubahiro na NFB nk'umufatanyabikorwa wahawe igihembo cya Dr. Jacob Bolotin.\nUtuntu n'utundi.\nIgitekerezo cya Nemeth cyasohowe imburagihe mu binyamakuru by\u2019Abayahudi n\u2019ubuhumyi, igihe abakozi bo muri ibyo binyamakuru bemezaga ko yapfuye mu gihe musaza we n\u2019umugore we bapfuye.\nNemeth yari umwe mu bari bagize ishyaka riharanira demokarasi muri Amerika ariko yashyizweho na guverineri wa republika ya Michigan nka perezida wa komisiyo ya leta ishinzwe impumyi, umwanya yakoreyemo imyaka ibiri, nubwo yavuze ko adakunda politiki.\nYari umuhanga mu gucuranga piyano wakundaga gushimisha abandi, akagira kwibuka bitangaje kumatariki namakuru kandi akishimira kuvuga urwenya ninkuru yashoboraga guhuza nibintu byose cyangwa ibihe."}
{"id": "17811", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17811", "title": "Urdu Braille", "text": "Urdu Braille\nNi inyuguti ya ikoreshwa ku. Hano hari inyuguti ebyiri zisanzwe za braille zikoreshwa muri Urdu, imwe muri Pakisitani indi mu Buhinde. Inyuguti zo muri Pakisitani zishingiye ku nyuguti z'Ubuperesi kandi zikoreshwa mu gihugu hose, mu gihe inyuguti z'Ubuhinde zishingiye kuri y'igihugu.\nItandukaniro nu Buperesi na Bharati Braille.\nUsibye kongeramo inyuguti zihariye za Urdu zisa n\u2019inyuguti ziyongereye mu nyuguti zanditse zitwa ugereranije n\u2019inyuguti z\u2019, Urdu braille yo muri Pakisitani itandukanye na Udru y\u2019Abaperesi mu iyandikwa ry\u2019inyuguti yacapishijwe \u017e, yanditswe nk'igishushanyo mu rurimi rwa Udru. kuruta nk'Igifarisi \u282c, mu Urdu rikoreshwa kuri \u0688 \u1e0d..\nUmuhinde Urdu Braille itandukanye nizindi nyuguti za Bharati braille mu kugira inyuguti nyinshi yatijwe mu Giperesi,such as \u281f for \u0642 \"q\" (Bharati \"k\u1e63\"), \u2831 for \u062d \"\u1e25\" (Bharati \"j\u00f1\"), and \u2837 for \u0639 \"\u2018\" (Bharati \"\u1e3b\"). Another such letter, \u282d for \u062e \"x\", is shared with \u0a16\u0a3c \"x\" but with no other Bharati alphabet, where \u282d is otherwise the vowel \"o\"."}
{"id": "17812", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17812", "title": "Braille technology", "text": "Ikoranabuhanga rya Braille ni ifasha ituma abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gusoma, kwandika, cyangwa gukoresha hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga. Iri koranabuhanga ryemerera abakoresha gukora imirimo isanzwe nko kwandika, kureba kuri interineti, kwandika mu nyandiko ya Braille no gucapa mu nyandiko, kwishora mu biganiro, gukuramo dosiye n'umuziki, gukoresha imeri ya elegitoronike, gutwika umuziki, no gusoma inyandiko. Iyemerera kandi abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa ubumuga bwo kutabona kurangiza imirimo yose mwishuri nkabandi banyeshuri bigana kandi ibemerera kwiga kumurongo. Ifasha abanyamwuga gukora akazi kabo nabarimu gutanga ibiganiro bakoresheje ibyuma na software. Iterambere mu ikoranabuhanga rya rifite ireme kuko impumyi zishobora kubona inyandiko nyinshi, ibitabo, n'amasomero, kandi bikanorohereza gucapa inyandiko za Braille.\n\"N'ubwo gahunda ya Braille igera ku isi hose, Ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona rivuga ko 10 ku ijana gusa by\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bashobora gusoma Braille\".\nPorogaramu.\nZimwe muri software ziboneka muri iki gihe:\n ni gahunda yo guhindura inyandiko ya braille isobanura inkprint kuri braille na braille kuri inkprint yindimi zirenga 180.\n, ni porogaramu isoma amagambo kuri ecran kandi igafasha gushakisha ububiko, inyandiko na porogaramu kuri Microsoft Windows. Amagambo ari kuri ecran arashobora no koherezwa kuri Braille yerekana.\n, igikoresho gisikana inyandiko muri mudasobwa kandi kikavuga.\n, isoko ya ecran yo gusoma software hamwe na braille.\nIbyuma.\nMwandikisho ya Braille, yakoreshwaga gusa nimyandikire ya Braille. Braille isoma abakoresha mudasobwa bahitamo clavier isanzwe nkinyandiko ihimba ibikoresho byinjiza. Mwandikisho ya mudasobwa ya Braille ni gake cyane.\nIcyapa cyandika\n bya e-Braille, ukoresheje amashanyarazi, kugeza ubu nkigishushanyo mbonera"}
{"id": "17813", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17813", "title": "Kurzweil Educational Systems", "text": "Kurzweil Education (yahoze yitwa Kurzweil Educational Systems) ni isosiyete ikorera muri Amerika itanga ikoranabuhanga mu.\nKurzweil Uburezi butanga ibisubizo byo gusoma no kwandika, ibikoresho n'amahugurwa kubafite imyigire itandukanye nibibazo, cyangwa abantu bafite cyangwa \nIsosiyete yashinzwe mu 1996, yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere rya ifasha Icyicaro cyayo kiri i, muri Texas.\nIsosiyete itanga ibicuruzwa bibiri byingenzi bya software kubakiriya bayo-Kurzweil 1000 na Kurzweil 3000. Kurzweil 1000 ni porogaramu ituma uyikoresha ubumuga bwo kutabona ashobora kubona ibikoresho byifashishwa ku rubuga, ibyuma bya digitale cyangwa bisikana binyuze mu OCR hamwe n\u2019inyandiko ku mvugo. ; Porogaramu ya Kurzweil 1000 itanga uburyo bworoshye bwo kubona impapuro nyinshi kandi ikayerekana hamwe nimirima, ibirango, agasanduku, hamwe n\u2019ahantu handitse kugirango ubone uburyo bwo gusoma kugirango ushobore kuzuza impapuro ukoresheje mudasobwa.\nKurzweil 3000 ni tekinoroji yuburezi, cyangwa tekinoroji ifasha, itanga urubuga rwo gusoma, kwandika no kwiga rugamije ababana nubumuga bwo kwiga cyangwa ubundi bumuga butuma gusoma cyangwa kwandika bigorana. Kurzweil 3000 ikoreshwa mugushigikira abafite dyslexia, dysgraphia, abiga ururimi rwicyongereza mwishuri, amashuri makuru, murugo no mukazi. Kurzweil 3000 irashobora gusoma mu ijwi riranguruye ishingiye ku mbuga za interineti, ibikoresho bya digitale cyangwa bisikanye, bigahindura urubuga rushingiye ku mbuga za interineti, ibikoresho bya digitale cyangwa bisikana muri mp3 kugira ngo bitange dosiye zumvikana kugira ngo wumve kugenda cyangwa binyuze muri porogaramu y\u2019urubuga rwa firefly urashobora gusoma kuri iPad.\nNubwo iyi sosiyete yashinzwe mu 1996, inyandiko yayo kuri porogaramu yo kuvuga mu by'ukuri ni ikintu cyatangiye mu myaka ya za 70, igihe yatunganyaga imashini ye ya mbere ya Kurzweil yo gusoma, igikoresho gishobora gusikana no kuvuga inyandiko.\nMuri 2005, Educational Systems yaguzwe na. Cambium ifite andi masosiyete menshi ajyanye n'uburezi. "}
{"id": "17814", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17814", "title": "K-NFB Reader", "text": "Umusomyi wa K-NFB (mu magambo ahinnye ya Kurzweil - Ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abasoma impumyi) ni igikoresho cyo gusoma cya elegitoroniki cyifashishwa n'abafite. Yakozwe ku bufatanye hagati ya na federasiyo y\u2019abafite \nInyandiko yumwimerere yabasomyi yari igizwe na kamera ya na, yarimo software yihariye ya hamwe na yo kuvuga kugirango basome ibikoresho byabitswe mu ijwi riranguruye. Yasohotse ku giciro cya $ 3.495. \nPorogaramu yaje koherezwa muri sisitemu y'imikorere ya, kugira ngo ikoreshwe kuri terefone ya, igiciro gishya cy'amadorari 1.595.\nYatunganijwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatabona na Sensotec NV mu 2014, icyambu cya cyasohotse ku giciro cy\u2019amadolari 99. Verisiyo ya yasohotse nyuma gato.\nUmusomyi wa KNFB arashobora gusoma:"}
{"id": "17815", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17815", "title": "JAWS (screen reader)", "text": "JAWS (\" Akazi Kubona Akajambo \") ni porogaramu ya mudasobwa ya yemerera abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gusoma ecran haba mu cyangwa mu. JAWS ikorwa nitsinda ryimpumyi nicyerekezo gito.\nGicurasi - Kamena 2021 ubushakashatsi bwakoreshejwe nabasomyi ba ecran bwakozwe na, isosiyete ikora urubuga, yasanze JAWS ariwe musomyi wa ecran uzwi cyane kwisi yose; 53.7% by'abitabiriye ubushakashatsi babikoresheje nk'umusomyi wibanze wa ecran, mugihe 70.0% byabitabiriye babikoresheje kenshi. \nJAWS ishyigikira na hamwe na verisiyo zose za Windows Server yasohotse kuva. Hano hari verisiyo ebyiri za porogaramu: \"Urugo\" rwibanze rwo gukoresha ubucuruzi nubucuruzi bwumwuga \"kubidukikije\". Mbere ya JAWS 16, \"Urugo\" rwiswe \"Standard\", kandi rwakoraga gusa muri sisitemu y'imikorere ya Windows. Verisiyo ya, rimwe na rimwe izwi nka \"JDOS\", ni ubuntu.\n uyikoresha gukoresha porogaramu zidafite igenzura rya Windows risanzwe, na porogaramu zitagenewe kuboneka.\nAmateka.\nJAWS yarekuwe bwa mbere mu 1989 na, wahoze asiganwa ku ipikipiki wabuze amaso mu mpanuka y'imodoka yo mu 1978. Mu 1985, Henter, hamwe n\u2019ishoramari US$ 180.000 yatanzwe na Bill Joyce, bashinze \"ikigo cya Henter-Joyce\" i. Joyce yagurishije inyungu ze muri sosiyete asubira muri Henter mu 1990. Muri Mata 2000, Henter-Joyce, Blazie Engineering, na Arkenstone, Inc. bahujwe no gukora.\nJAWS yabanje gukorwa kuri. Wari umwe mubasomyi benshi ba ecran baha abakoresha impumyi kubona inyandiko-yuburyo bwa MS-DOS. Ikintu cyihariye cya JAWS muri kiriya gihe kwari ugukoresha menus zishimishije, muburyo bwa porogaramu izwi cyane ya Lotus 1-2-3. Icyatandukanije JAWS usibye nabandi basomyi ba ecran yiki gihe ni ugukoresha yemerera abakoresha guhitamo imikoreshereze yimikoreshereze kandi bagakora neza hamwe nibikorwa bitandukanye.\nTed Henter na Rex Skipper banditse kode ya JAWS y'umwimerere hagati ya za 1980, basohora verisiyo ya 2.0 hagati ya 1990. Skipper yavuye muri sosiyete nyuma yo gusohora verisiyo ya 2.0, hanyuma amaze kugenda, Charles Oppermann yahawe akazi ko kubungabunga no kuzamura ibicuruzwa. Oppermann na Henter bahoraga bongeramo ibintu bito kandi byingenzi kandi bakarekura verisiyo nshya. Freedom Scientific ubu itanga JAWS kuri MS-DOS nkikururwa kurubuga rwabo. \u00a0\nMu 1993, Henter-Joyce yasohoye verisiyo yahinduwe cyane ya JAWS kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kwiga. Iki gicuruzwa, cyitwa WordScholar, ntikiboneka. \nJAWS kuri Windows.\nMu 1992, uko yamenyekanye cyane, Oppermann yatangiye gukora kuri verisiyo nshya ya JAWS. Intego nyamukuru yo gushushanya ntiyari ukubangamira imiterere isanzwe yukoresha ya Windows no gukomeza gutanga ibikoresho bikomeye bya macro. Ikizamini na beta verisiyo ya JAWS kuri Windows (JFW) yerekanwe mu nama mu 1993 na 1994. Muri kiriya gihe, uwatezimbere Glen Gordon yatangiye gukora kuri kode, amaherezo atangira iterambere ryayo igihe Oppermann yahawe akazi na Microsoft mu Gushyingo 1994. Nyuma yaho gato, muri Mutarama 1995, JAWS ya Windows 1.0 yasohotse.\nIsubiramo rishya rya JAWS kuri Windows risohoka hafi rimwe mu mwaka, hamwe nudushya duto hagati.\nIbiranga.\nJAWS yemerera ibikorwa byose byingenzi bya sisitemu y'imikorere ya kugenzurwa na hamwe n'ibitekerezo byavuzwe. Izi shortcuts zibikwa zihoraho zishoboka muri gahunda nyinshi, ariko umubare munini cyane wimirimo ikenewe kugirango ukoreshe neza software ya mudasobwa igezweho bisaba neza ko umukoresha wa nyuma gufata mu mutwe ibintu byinshi byingenzi. Mubyukuri buri kintu cyose cya JAWS gishobora gutegurwa numukoresha, harimo urufunguzo rwose nibintu nkumuvuduko wo gusoma, ubunini bwakoreshejwe mugusoma utumenyetso, nibitekerezo. JAWS ikubiyemo kandi ururimi rwimyandikire kugirango ihindure imirimo kandi ihindure byinshi bigoye kumyitwarire ya gahunda. \nPorogaramu ikubiyemo uburyo butandukanye bwagenewe umwihariko wa, ikora iyo mushakisha iri imbere. Iyo ushakisha urubuga, JAWS ibanza gutangaza umutwe numubare wibihuza. Imvugo irashobora guhagarikwa hamwe, imirongo igendana nurufunguzo rwo hejuru / hepfo umwambi, kandi rugenda hagati yibihuza nubugenzuzi. Urufunguzo rwinyuguti rwihariye kuri clavier rushobora gukanda kugirango ruyobore ibikurikira cyangwa ibanziriza ubwoko bwubwoko runaka, nkibisanduku byanditse cyangwa agasanduku. JAWS irashobora kubona imitwe muri na PDF inyandiko zisa. \nIkiranga JAWS cyashyizweho hamwe nuburinganire bwacyo byasobanuwe nk \"bigoye\", hamwe namahugurwa asabwa kubakoresha nkabashushanya urubuga bakora ibizamini byoroshye, kugirango birinde gufata imyanzuro itari yo muri ibyo bizamini. "}
{"id": "17816", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17816", "title": "WebAIM", "text": "WebAIM (Urubuga rwa interineti mu bitekerezo) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu ukorera muri i. WebAIM yatanze ibisubizo kuva 1999. Intego ya WebAIM nukwagura ubushobozi kubantu bafite ubumuga batanga ubumenyi, ubumenyi bwa tekinike, ibikoresho, ingamba zo kuyobora imitegekere, hamwe nicyerekezo giha imbaraga amashyirahamwe kugirango ibikubiyemo bigere kubantu bafite ubumuga. \nIbicuruzwa na serivisi.\nWebAIM itanga ibicuruzwa byinshi na serivisi byinjira kurubuga. Igikoresho cyo gusuzuma WAVE igenzurwa na WebAIM. Iki gikoresho cyubuntu, kumurongo gitanga ibitekerezo byerekana page. WAVE Toolbar nayo iraboneka nkiyagurwa kuri mushakisha zombi za Firefox &amp; Chrome.\nSerivise zo kurubuga rwa WebAIM zirimo amahugurwa yo kugerwaho, gukurikirana urubuga no kugenzura, gutanga ibyemezo, kugisha inama, gushushanya urubuga, no gusana ibiboneka.\nUmuryango.\nWebAIM iyobora kumurongo wurubuga. Umutungo wabaturage urimo akanyamakuru, urutonde rwibiganiro kuri imeri, kurubuga rwiminsi 2, hamwe na.\nIbikoresho.\nUrubuga rwa WebAIM rutanga amakuru arambuye, nabandi bashishikajwe no kugera kubintu byurubuga kubumuga bukurikira:\nReba ibindi.\nUrubuga rwa WebAIM ruvuga ingingo zitandukanye zo kugera kurubuga, harimo:"}
{"id": "17817", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17817", "title": "Paraplegia", "text": "Paraplegia, cyangwa paraparesis, ni ukubangamira imikorere ya moteri cyangwa ibyumviro byimpera zo hepfo. Ijambo ryaturutse mu kigereki cya Ionic (\u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03c0\u03bb\u03b7\u03b3\u03af\u03b7) \"gukubitwa kabiri\". Agace k'umuyoboro w wibasiwe na paraplegia ni thoracic, lumbar, cyangwa. Niba ingingo enye zatewe nubumuga, tetraplegia cyangwa quadriplegia nijambo ryukuri. Niba ingingo imwe gusa ifite ingaruka, ijambo ryukuri ni monoplegia. Paraplegia ya spastique nuburyo bwa paraplegia isobanurwa nubwinshi bwimitsi yanduye, aho kuba paralike ya flaccid.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imvune z\u2019 ryashyize mu majwi ubukana bw\u2019umugongo mu buryo bukurikira. ASIA A nugutakaza rwose imikorere yimyumvire nubuhanga bwa moteri munsi yimvune. ASIA B ifite imikorere yunvikana munsi yimvune, ariko ntamikorere ya moteri. Muri ASIA C, hari imikorere ya moteri iri munsi yurwego rwimvune, ariko kimwe cya kabiri cyimitsi ntishobora kugenda irwanya imbaraga. Muri ASIA D, kimwe cya kabiri cyimitsi iri munsi yurwego rwimvune irashobora kugenda irwanya imbaraga. ASIA E nugusubiza ibikorwa byose byubwonko\nUmuti.\nAbantu bafite ubumuga barashobora gutandukana murwego rwubumuga bwabo, bisaba ko imiti itandukana bitewe nibibazo. Gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe bigamije gufasha umurwayi kugarura imikorere n'ubwigenge bushoboka bwose. Physiotherapie irashobora gufasha kunoza imbaraga, urwego rwo kugenda, kurambura no kwimura ubuhanga. Abamugaye benshi bazashingira ku kagare k'abamugaye nk'uburyo bwo gutwara abantu.Ibikorwa by'ubuzima bwa buri (ADLs) birashobora kuba ingorabahizi kubantu bafite ikibazo cyumugongo (SCI). Hifashishijwe abavuzi ba physiotherapiste hamwe nabavuzi babigize umwuga, abantu bafite SCI barashobora kwiga ubumenyi bushya kandi bagahuza nubwa mbere kugirango barusheho kwigenga, akenshi babaho mu bwigenge mu baturage.\nKuvugurura uruti rw'umugongo.\nReba kandi: Gukomeretsa umugongo direction Icyerekezo cyubushakashatsi\nOlfactory ensheathing selile (OEC) yatewe mu ntsinzi y\u2019umugongo w\u2019umugabo wo muri Polonye witwa Darek Fidyka, warokotse igitero cy\u2019icyuma cyamuteye ubumuga mu 2010. \nMu mwaka wa 2014, Fidyka yabazwe ubupayiniya bw'umugongo bwakoresheje imitsi y\u2019imitsi, kuva ku kaguru, kugira ngo 'akureho icyuho' mu ruti rw'umugongo yaciwe ndetse na OEC kugira ngo akangure ingirangingo z'umugongo. Kubaga byakorewe muri Polonye ku bufatanye na Prof. Geoff Raisman, umuyobozi w\u2019ubuzima bushya bw\u2019imyororokere mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuvuzi rya Neurologiya rya kaminuza ya Londere, hamwe n\u2019itsinda rye ry\u2019ubushakashatsi. Uturemangingo twa olfactory twakuwe mu matara y\u2019umurwayi mu bwonko bwe hanyuma akurira muri laboratoire, izo selile zatewe inshinge hejuru no munsi y\u2019umugongo wangiritse.\nFidyka yagaruye ibyiyumvo na moteri mumaguru yo hepfo, cyane cyane kuruhande rwa OEC yatewe. Fidyka yabanje kubona intsinzi nyuma y'amezi atatu abikora, mugihe ikibero cye cy'ibumoso cyatangiye kwiyongera. MRIs zerekana ko icyuho cyo mu ruti rw'umugongo cyafunzwe. Yizera ko ari we muntu wa mbere ku isi wagaruye imikorere y\u2019imyumvire kuva yaciwe burundu imitsi yumugongo."}
{"id": "17818", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17818", "title": "The Body Silent", "text": "Guceceka k'umubiri (mu icyongereza: The Body Silent) \nNi inkuru yanditswe na, umwarimu muri. Iki gice kivuga ku rugamba rwa muntu ku giti cye binyuze mu ruti rw'umugongo, rwasohowe mu 1987 na Henry Holt na Company, Inc. Yasuzumwe ikibyimba kiva mu rubavu rwe rwa kabiri rw'inkondo y'umura kugeza ku munani wa thoracic vertebra mu 1972. Binyuze mu nkuru ye avuga amateka ye y'ubuvuzi ndetse n'uburyo isuzuma ry'ubuvuzi bwa kera (mu mpera za 1920) ryari rizi bike cyane ku bijyanye na neurologiya, kandi agasiga ibibazo bitamenyekanye aribyo yashyizeho ikibazo gishya mu myaka 50. Nkumwarimu wa antropropologiya muri kaminuza ya Columbia, akoresha umurima we murugendo rwe rwubuvuzi. \"Iki gitabo cyatekerejweho no kumenya ko uburwayi bwanjye bumaze igihe kirekire ndwaye indwara y'uruti rw'umugongo bwabaye nk'urugendo rwagutse rwo mu murima wa antropropologique, kuko binyuze muri bwo natuye mu isi mbonezamubano ntarintangaje kuri njye mbere kuruta iy'Uwiteka Amashyamba ya Amazone. Kandi kubera ko ari inshingano za antropropologiste bose gutanga raporo ku ngendo zabo... iyi ni yo mibare yanjye. \" Bitewe nubushakashatsi bwatewe inkunga mubyamubayeho nubuvuzi, aha abasomyi ibisobanuro nibisobanuro kubyo akora, hiyongereyeho kuganira buri gihe kubishobora kubaho hamwe nibitekerezo bye muri rusange.\nUmusaruro.\nIkigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe ubumenyi cyateye inkunga umusaruro w\u2019igitabo, kandi cyanditswe na Holt.\nUbwoko.\nIbice bya Metapathographie ntabwo arinkuru ninkuru zindwara, ahubwo ni umwuga wo kwisuzuma wabigize umwuga no kwandika byimbitse kubyo leta yihariye. Nubwo metapathography atari ubwoko bwihariye, abandi banditsi ninzobere basuzumye ibikoresho bye basobanuye ko bitandukanijwe n\u2019ibitekerezo bwite, kubera isesengura ryimbitse ry\u2019imitekerereze n\u2019umubiri.\nUbuzima.\nIngingo nyamukuru: Robert Francis Murphy (antropropologue)\nRobert Murphy yavutse ku ya 3 Werurwe 1924, avukira i Far Rockaway, muri New York. Yize cyane kandi aba intangarugero ya antropropologue akaba n'umwarimu wa antropropologiya muri kaminuza ya Columbia mu mujyi wa New York, kuva mu ntangiriro ya za 1960 kugeza 1990. Yize imico myinshi itandukanye ku isi, nka Mundurucu wa Amazone n'imiryango yo muri Sahara. Afite imyaka 66, yapfiriye iwe i Leonia, muri Leta ya New Jersey.\nAmateka y'Ubuvuzi.\nMu 1928, Murphy yabuze gukoresha ukuguru. Umuganga wo mu rugo yamusuzumye \"gukoraho \" byamutwaye ibyumweru bibiri kugirango akire. Murphy yatangiye kurwara imitsi mu kibero, no mu nda yo mu 1972, bidatinze agira ikibazo cyo kwihagarika. Yaje gusuzumwa afite ibice byo mu mutwe, bivuze ko gucika gato imitsi. Nyuma yimyaka mike yibimenyetso, yasuye inzobere mu bumenyi bw maze bamusuzumisha ikibyimba cyiza ariko gikura buhoro buhoro mu gice cyo hejuru cy. Mu myaka ibiri, bwarangiritse cyane, kandi yatakaje imikorere myinshi y'umubiri.\nIbihembo.\nMu 1987, igitabo cyahawe igihembo cya Lionel Trilling University cyo muri kaminuza ya Columbia."}
{"id": "17819", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17819", "title": "Freedom Scientific", "text": "Freedom Scientific nisosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa byoroshye kubakoresha mudasobwa bafite. Porogaramu bakora ituma, hamwe no gukoresha hamwe na mudasobwa zigezweho. Isosiyete ni ishami rya Vispero ikaba ifite icyicaro i. \nAmateka.\n wahoze asiganwa ku ipikipiki yateje imbere umusomyi wa JAWS nyuma yo kuba impumyi biturutse ku mpanuka y'imodoka. Henter na Bill Joyce bashinze Henter-Joyce mu 1987 i, muri Floride, bakora ya JAWS nyuma baza kuba. Henter-Joyce yahujwe na Arkenstone na Blazie Engineering mu 2000 bakora Freedom Scientific. "}
{"id": "17820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17820", "title": "Ted Henter", "text": "Ted Henter (wavutse 1950 muri) numunyamerika akaba uzwiho kuba yarahimbye abasoma ecran ya JAWS kubatabona. Yize ibijyanye n\u2019ubuhanga, ariko yiga porogaramu za mudasobwa maze atangira ubucuruzi bwe nyuma yo kugira ikibazo mu mpanuka y\u2019imodoka mu 1978, ibyo bikaba byarangije umwuga utanga ikizere cyo gusiganwa ku ipikipiki mpuzamahanga.\nMu 1987, yifatanyije n\u2019umucuruzi, bafatanya gushinga Henter-Joyce i St. Petersburg, muri Floride. Henter yari perezida kandi ayoboye icyo gikorwa kandi atanga icyerekezo cyikoranabuhanga mugihe Joyce yakoraga nkumufatanyabikorwa ucecetse. Henter-Joyce yakoze JAWS, kuri mudasobwa bwite ukoresheje, hanyuma.\nNyuma yo guhumuka, Henter yongeye kuvumbura amazi yo mu mazi, atangira kwitabira amarushanwa yo gusiganwa ku mazi. Yatsinze inshuro esheshatu mu marushanwa arindwi yabereye muri Amerika ndetse kabiri mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga. Yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 1991 nyuma yo kwegukana umudari wa Zahabu muri Amerika ndetse na Shampiyona y'isi ku bamugaye.\nHenter-Joyce yahujwe na Arkenstone na Blazie Engineering mu 2000 bakora Freedom Scientific. Kugeza ubu Henter asigaye mu nama y'ubuyobozi ya Freedom Scientific, maze mu 2002 ashinga Henter Math, kugira ngo akore porogaramu ifasha \"abadafite ikaramu\" n'imibare."}
{"id": "17821", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17821", "title": "Braille embosser", "text": "Igishushanyo cya Braille nigicapiro zitanga inyandiko ngengabuzima. Ukoresheje porogaramu yo guhindura inyandiko ya braille, inyandiko cyangwa inyandiko ya digitale irashobora gushushanywa muburyo bworoshye. Ibi bituma umusaruro wa braille ukora neza kandi uhendutse. Porogaramu yubusobanuro bwa Braille irashobora kuba ubuntu kandi cyangwa yishyuwe. \nAbakoresha impumyi bakunda kwita izindi \"printer ya wino,\" kugirango babatandukanye na bagenzi babo. Ibi bikunze kugaragara utitaye kubwoko bwa printer iganirwaho (urugero, yitwa \"printer ya wino\" nubwo badakoresha wino)\nKimwe na printer na wino, ibishushanyo biva mubigenewe abaguzi kugeza kubikoreshwa nabamamaji binini. Igiciro cyibishushanyo byiyongera hamwe nubunini bwa braille itanga. \nUbwoko.\nIbishushanyo mbonera by\u2019inganda byihuta cyane ni amadolari 92.000 yakozwe n\u2019Ububiligi yakozwe na NV Interpoint 55, yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1991, ikoresha itandukanye kugira ngo itware umutwe wanditseho kandi ishobora gusohora inyuguti zigera kuri 800 ku isegonda. Kurera umwana byatangiye mbere; mu 2000 ryatangaje ko muri Amerika hari batatu gusa muri bo, imwe ifitwe na NFB ubwayo indi ibiri na sosiyete ya. Kugeza mu 2008, ku isi hose harenga 60. \nIbishushanyo bito bya desktop ya braille biramenyerewe cyane kandi urashobora kubisanga mumasomero, kaminuza, hamwe n\u2019ibigo by\u2019uburezi by\u2019inzobere, ndetse no kuba ari ibya nyir'impumyi. Birashobora kuba nkenerwa gukoresha akabati ya acoustic cyangwa hood kugirango. \nUbudodo bwa Braille mubusanzwe bukenera impapuro zidasanzwe za braille zifite umubyimba kandi zihenze kuruta impapuro zisanzwe. Bimwe mubirangirire-byohejuru birashobora gucapura kumpapuro zisanzwe. Abashushanya barashobora kuba uruhande rumwe cyangwa uruhande rumwe. Gushushanya impande zombi bisaba gutondekanya utudomo kugirango bidahuzagurika (bita \"interpoint\" kuko ingingo kurundi ruhande zishyirwa hagati yingingo kuruhande). Gushushanya impande zombi bikoresha impapuro nke kandi bigabanya ubunini bwibisohoka. \nIyo kopi imwe yinyandiko imaze gukorwa, gucapa izindi kopi akenshi byihuta hakoreshejwe igikoresho cyitwa, gitanga kopi kuri plastiki yoroshye. Nyamara, braille yavuyemo ntabwo isomeka byoroshye nka braille yashizwemo vuba, muburyo bumwe na idafite ubuziranenge idasomeka nkumwimerere. Kubwibyo, abamamaji binini ntibakoresha ubusanzwe.\nIbishushanyo bimwe bishobora kubyara \"Ukwezi kwadomo\", ni ukuvuga, bwakorewe nududomo. "}
{"id": "17822", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17822", "title": "Mountbatten Brailler", "text": "Mountbatten Brailler ni imashini ya elegitoronike ikoreshwa mu kwandika ku mpapuro za braille. Ikoresha \"clavier yandika ya braille\" gakondo ya Perkins Brailler hamwe n'ikoranabuhanga rigezweho, ikayiha ibintu byinshi byongeweho nko gutunganya ijambo, ibitekerezo by'amajwi no gushushanya. Imashini yabanjirijwe kandi itunganyirizwa mu Ubwongereza Royal National College for Blind i Hanoford na Ernest Bate. \nKu ikubitiro Mountbatten yakorewe itunganywa muri Ositaraliya. Ku taliki ya 1 Mutarama mu mwaka 2010, uruganda rwa Mountbatten rwafashwe na sosiyete yo muri Polonye Harpo Sp. z o.o. \nMountbatten yatunganijwe nyuma yuko Lord Mountbatten asize irage m'ubushake bwe bwo guteza imbere ibikorwa by'iterambere, igiciro gito, cyoroshye. cyabonetse kuva mu mwaka 1991. \nKimwe na Perkins, Mountbatten ifite urufunguzo ruhuye na buri tudomo dutandatu kode ya braille. Mu gihe kimwe ukanda icyarimwe guhuza ku ufunguzo rwa gatandatu, abakoresha bashobora gukora inyuguti iyo ari yo yose muri kode ya braille. Usibye izi mfunguzo esheshatu, Mountbatten ifite urufunguzo rw'umwanya, ufungura inyuma, n'urufunguzo rushya. Kimwe n'imyandikire y'intoki, ifite ipfundo ryo guteza imbere impapuro ukoresheje imashini, nubwo bitandukanye na Perkins umurongo ntigenda. Hano hari urufunguzo rwo kugaruka rumera nk'urwo gutwara ibinyabiziga. Ibizingo bifata kandi bigateza imbere impapuro bifite ibinono byabugenewe kugira ngo birinde guhonyora utudomo twazamuye brailler twaremwe.\nUsibye clavier gakondo, Mountbatten ifite ibindi bintu byinshi biyiranga. Ibi birimo kwibuka byemerera dosiye y'inyandiko ya braille kubikwa mu buryo bumwe nk'uko bikorwa hamwe n'ijambo ritunganya na processor, ibitekerezo byatanzwe byemerera umukoresha kumva inyandiko banditse cyangwa kwandika muri dosiye, hamwe no guhindura imbere n'inyuma hagati y'inyandiko na braille. Mountbatten ishobora guhuzwa n'icapiro ryemerera dosiye gucapurwa nk'inyandiko, mu gihe clavier isanzwe ya PC ishobora guhuzwa na Mountbatten ituma inyandiko ishobora gukorwa nk'uko byasezeranijwe cyangwa bidafite amasezerano. \nHari moderi nyinshi za Mountbatten, shingiro ry'umwanditsi wa Mountbatten. Umwanditsi wa Mountbatten Yongeyeho, Pro ya Mountbatten, na Sisitemu yo Kwiga ya Mountbatten."}
{"id": "17823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17823", "title": "Perkins Brailler", "text": "Perkins Brailler ni imashini yandika ya braille ifite urufunguzo ruhuye na buri kadomo dutandatu kode ya, urufunguzo rwumwanya, urufunguzo rwinyuma, nurufunguzo rwumurongo. Kimwe yintoki, ifite impande ebyiri kugirango utere imbere impapuro ukoresheje imashini hamwe nigikoresho cyo kugaruka hejuru yimfunguzo. Ibizingo bifata kandi bigateza imbere impapuro bifite ibinono byabugenewe kugirango birinde guhonyora utudomo twazamuye brailler akora.\nNubwo inyandiko ya braille yagenewe abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gusoma, mbere yo kumenyekanisha Perkins Brailler, kwandika braille byari inzira itoroshye. Abanditsi ba Braille bakoze inyuguti za braille hamwe na (nkuko byakozwe na) cyangwa bakoresheje imwe mumashini yandika ya brille igoye, ihenze, kandi yoroshye yaboneka muricyo gihe.\nAmateka.\nImashini yambere yandika Braille yatanzwe na mu 1892. \nUmwimerere wa Perkins Brailler yakozwe mu 1951 na David Abraham (1896\u20131978), umwarimu ukora ibiti mu utanyuzwe n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ikoranabuhanga risanzweho. Umuyobozi w'ishuri rya Perkins ry\u2019abatabona, Gabriel Farrell, yasabye Abraham gukora imashini ihendutse kandi yizewe kugira ngo abanyeshuri bandike byoroshye. Farrell na Abraham bakoranye na Edward Waterhouse, wari umwarimu w\u2019imibare muri Perkins, kugirango bakore igishushanyo cya Brailler.\nMuri 2008, hashyizweho verisiyo yoroshye kandi ituje. Harimo kandi gusiba urufunguzo hamwe nigikoresho cyo gutwara. Umunyamideli mushya yatsindiye igihembo cya silver muri International Design Excellence Awards 2009. \nGushyira impapuro bigerwaho no kuzunguza impapuro kurugoma rwimbere, kurikingura mugihe umukoresha akanze urufunguzo rwo kugaburira umurongo, no gukoresha guhunga nkisaha kugirango yimure igare ryanditseho impapuro. Sisitemu ya cam esheshatu zigizwe ninkoni hamwe na kare kwambukiranya igice cyohereza urufunguzo kuri stili isa na wire iri muri gare. Ubworoherane buri hafi, kandi kubaka umwanda wamavuta hamwe no gukoresha bisanzwe bisaba koza buri gihe kandi bigahinduka.\nSMART Brailler.\nImiterere mishya ya Perkins Brailler, SMART Brailler, yahimbwe na David S. Morgan isohoka mu 2011. SMART Brailler ishingiye kubikorwa byubukanishi bwa kera bwa Perkins Brailler, kandi, iyo bidafite imbaraga, birakorwa nka Brailler isanzwe. SMART Brailler ikubiyemo ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata imashini ishushanya, kandi, iyo ikoreshejwe imbaraga, ikongeramo ibitekerezo-by-amajwi byerekana amajwi hamwe na sisitemu ya digitale kugirango ikoreshwe nabafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Porogaramu ya SMART Brailler ikubiyemo imvugo y\u2019indimi nyinshi hamwe n\u2019inkunga ya Braille, harimo Icyongereza, Ubwongereza Icyongereza, Icyarabu, Igifaransa, Ikidage, Ubutaliyani, Igiporutugali, Igipolonye, Ikirusiya, na Turukiya. \nAbakoresha braille.\nHamwe na mudasobwa ziza, abakoresha benshi bakora ibisohoka mu nyandiko bakoresheje mudasobwa hamwe duhujwe na mudasobwa. Abakoresha ubumuga bwo kutabona barashobora gusoma ecran ya ukoresheje porogaramu ya mudasobwa ya mudasobwa na / cyangwa. Abakoresha sisitemu nkiyi barashobora gukoresha clavier ya mudasobwa muburyo busanzwe bwo kwandika cyangwa barashobora gukoresha umushoferi udasanzwe wa clavier yemerera urufunguzo rutandatu \"sdf-jkl\" gukoreshwa nkigikoresho cyinjira muri braille gisa na Perkins Brailler.\nKwandika kuri Braille.\nAbakoresha benshi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bakoresha ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki byifashishwa byandika byemerera clavier kwinjira muri braille ukoresheje imiterere-6 yingenzi ya Perkins Brailler hamwe nibisohoka mumvugo ikomatanyije hamwe na / cyangwa umurongo umwe cyangwa ibiri kumurongo ugizwe na pine ntoya ikozwe ibyuma na plastiki.\nNotetakers ikubiyemo ibiranga PDA nkigitabo cya aderesi na calculatrice. Kuberako ibice byinshi byimuka hamwe nuburyo bworoshye bwa braille yerekana ibidukikije, notetakers mubisanzwe bihenze cyane. Byangiritse byoroshye kandi bigomba gusubizwa mugihugu bakomokamo kugirango bisukure buri gihe."}
{"id": "17824", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17824", "title": "Braille e-book", "text": "Igitabo cya e-braille nigitabo cyangwa ibishashara bishyushye aho kuba imashini zikoreshwa kugirango uzamure twerekana. Nubwo bidasanzwe bihenze, kubera igipimo gito cy'umusaruro ntibagaragaye ko ari ubukungu.\nUmusaruro.\nIbitabo bimwe na bimwe e- bitangirwa icyarimwe hamwe nuburyo bwo gucapa, nkuko byasobanuwe.\nIbitabo bya Braille byabanje kwandikwa mu mpapuro, hamwe n\u2019imashini yandika ya Perkins Brailler, imashini yahimbwe mu 1951, inonosorwa mu 2008, ubundi buryo bwo gukora ibitabo bya braille byari hamwe nicapiro rya braille cyangwa ibishushanyo. Muri 2011, David S. Morgan yakoze imashini ya mbere ya SMART Brailler, yongeweho inyandiko kumikorere yo kuvuga kandi yemerera gufata imibare yamakuru yinjiye.\nMu 1960, Robert Mann, umwarimu muri MIT, yanditse DOTSYS, porogaramu yemerera guhinduranya mu buryo bwikora, kandi irindi tsinda ryakoze igikoresho cyo gushushanya cyitwa \"MIT Braillemboss.\" Itsinda rya Miter Corporation rya Robert Gildea, Jonathan Millen, Reid Gerhart na Joseph Sullivan (ubu ni perezida wa Duxbury Systems) bakoze DOTSYS III, umusemuzi wa mbere w\u2019inyandiko yanditswe mu rurimi rwimikorere. DOTSYS III yatunganijwe nka. Abahinduzi ba Braille bemeye guhita bakora inyandiko ya braille cyangwa ibitabo bivuye mumyandikire mucyanditswe cya Braille bitabaye ngombwa ko bandika ibitabo bya braille mumashini yandika, ariko baracyakenera ibishushanyo mbonera kugirango babone ibitabo, iyi ntambwe yanyuma ntabwo ikenewe mugihe e-igitabo gisomwe muri igitabo cya e-igitabo.\nIterambere ry'ubucuruzi.\n cya koreya cyasohowe mu 2009 na Yanko Design cyashimishije abantu. Igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019Abongereza cyiswe \"Anagraphs\" cyashinzwe mu 2013, ariko inkunga yatanzwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi yararangiye mbere yuko izanwa mu musaruro. \nIgitabo cya Braille ebook / tablet cyari giteganijwe gusohoka kugirango kigure mu gihembwe cya 4 cya 2016 na sosiyete yo muri Otirishiya Blitab. Byari biteganijwe ko igiciro kiri munsi ya $ 3000 US $. As of February 2019 isosiyete yatumiye abantu kwiyandikisha nka \"Ikizamini\", hamwe n\u2019ibisobanuro, \"Ba umwe mu ba mbere bakoraho kandi bakumva ejo hazaza h\u2019amayeri manini ya Braille yerekana.\" \nMuri 2018, isosiyete yo mu Budage Metec yashyize ahagaragara E-Book ya Braille, itandukanye n\u2019abayibanjirije, ifite umurima wa 120 x 97\u00a0mm, ishobora kwakira imirongo umunani yinyuguti 16 imwe. Iki gikoresho cyemerera abakoresha impumyi kwiga ibishushanyo namakarita ya geografiya muburyo bworoshye. Igiciro cyigikoresho ni 13.800 \u20ac (muri 2019). Kuva icyo gihe ifite ibice bibiri byiterambere harimo ingano yerekana, ubu igera kuri 260 x 150\u00a0mm.\nMuri 2019, Ubushakashatsi bwa Orbit hamwe n\u2019icapiro ryasohoye igitabo cyitwa e-book Graphiti, cyemerera impumyi gushakisha amakuru ashushanyije. Amanota 2,400 azamuka mu burebure butandukanye arashobora kohereza amakarita ya topografiya nibindi bintu bishushanyije nkigicucu namabara. Igikoresho kirimo kandi umunani-urufunguzo rwa braille kugirango wandike inyandiko. Igiciro cyigikoresho ni $ 24,666 (muri 2021). \nMuri 2020, gutangiza injeniyeri 4Blind, Inc. kuva i Boston yakoze e-book tactile yitwa Braille Pad. Iyi ni tablet ya santimetero 8 (irimo pigiseli 3249 ya tactile) ifite kamera yubatswe, itanga uburyo bwo kubona amashusho yose ashushanyije (amakarita, ibishushanyo, nibindi), kandi ikanemerera uyikoresha gufata amafoto hamwe nogukwirakwiza amayeri ako kanya. "}
{"id": "17825", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17825", "title": "Refreshable braille display", "text": "Refreshable braille display cyangwa imashini ya braille yerekana amashusho nigikoresho cya elegitoroniki-mashini yo kwerekana inyuguti, mubisanzwe hifashishijwe amapine azengurutswe azamurwa mu mwobo hejuru. Abakoresha mudasobwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona badashobora gukoresha monitor ya mudasobwa isanzwe barashobora kuyikoresha kugirango basome inyandiko zisohoka. Abakoresha mudasobwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva barashobora kandi gukoresha ibyerekanwa bya braille.\n ikoreshwa nayo isanzwe ikoreshwa kumurimo umwe, kandi umukoresha wimpumyi arashobora guhinduranya hagati ya sisitemu zombi cyangwa gukoresha byombi icyarimwe bitewe nibihe.\nIbisobanuro birambuye.\nUrufatiro rwerekana impapuro zisubirwamo akenshi zihuza clavier nziza. Bisa na Perkins Brailler, iyinjizwa rikorwa namaseti abiri yimfunguzo enye kuruhande, mugihe ibisohoka binyuze mumyandikire ya braille igarurwa igizwe ya selile-mashini, buri kimwe gishobora kuzamura cyangwa kumanura guhuza umunani uruziga. Izindi variants zirahari zikoresha clavier isanzwe yo kwinjiza na pine ya braille kugirango isohore, kimwe ninjiza-gusa nibikoresho bisohoka gusa.\nUburyo buzamura utudomo bukoresha za kristu zimwe, aho zaguka iyo voltage ikoreshwa kuri bo. Nka kristu ihujwe na lever, nayo izamura akadomo. Hagomba kubaho kristu kuri buri kadomo kerekana (\"ni ukuvuga\" umunani kuri buri nyuguti).\nKuberako bigoye kubyara ibyerekanwa byizewe bizahangana no kwambara burimunsi, ibi byerekanwe bihenze. Mubisanzwe, cells 40 cyangwa 80 gusa. Moderi ifite selile ziri hagati ya 18 na 40 zibaho mubikoresho bimwe byandika.\nKuri moderi zimwe imyanya ya igaragazwa no kunyeganyeza utudomo, kandi moderi zimwe zifite icyerekezo gifitanye isano na buri selile kugirango yimure indanga kuri selile.\nPorogaramu.\nPorogaramu ikusanya ibiri muri ecran kuva muri, ikayihindura inyuguti za braille ikohereza kuri disikuru.\nAbasomyi ba ecran kuri sisitemu y'imikorere ishushanya cyane cyane, kubera ko ibishushanyo nka Windows cyangwa slidebars bigomba gusobanurwa no gusobanurwa muburyo bw'inyandiko. Sisitemu y'imikorere igezweho isanzwe ifite ifasha abasomyi ba ecran kubona aya makuru, nka (UIA) kuri, kuri na, na kuri.\nBraille y'uruziga yerekana.\nIcyerekezo kizunguruka cya Braille cyerekanwe mu 2000 n'Ikigo (NIST) n'indi muri mu Bubiligi. Muri ibi bice, utudomo twa braille dushyirwa kumpera, ituma uyikoresha asoma ubudahwema urutoki ruhagaze mugihe uruziga ruzunguruka kumuvuduko watoranijwe. Utudomo twa braille dushyizweho muburyo bworoshye bwo gusikana-uburyo utudomo ku ruziga ruzunguruka inyuma ya ihagaze ishyiraho inyuguti. Nkigisubizo, inganda zikora ziragabanuka cyane kandi zizunguruka-zizunguruka za braille zerekana, mugihe mubikorwa nyirizina, bigomba kuba bihenze kuruta ibyerekanwa bisanzwe."}
{"id": "17826", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17826", "title": "Braille Note", "text": "Braille Note ni mudasobwa yakozwe na HumanWare kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Ifite cyangwa Mwandikisho, hamwe na 32- cyangwa 18-inkingi 18 ishobora kuvugururwa Braille, bitewe nurugero. \"IjwiNote\" nigikoresho kimwe kiterekanwa na braille. GPS ya BrailleNote ni selile 18 cyangwa 32 ya BrailleNote ifite module yo hanze ya GPS.\nBrailleNote irashobora gukoresha gusa software yatanzwe nuwabikoze, nubwo ibi bishobora kuzamurwa. \nGukoresha BrailleNote birasabwa na Centre ishinzwe ubufasha bwikoranabuhanga kandi rimwe na rimwe igurwa na kaminuza kugirango ikoreshwe nabanyeshuri bamugaye. Ibicuruzwa bya BrailleNote byatangijwe mu 2000, bifatwa nkubwa mbere. \nBirashoboka kubona interineti igaragara kumakuru kuri BrailleNote mugerekaho mudasobwa hamwe na nka. \nIbisanzwe.\nInyandiko ya mbere \"Classic\" ya BrailleNote yasohotse muri Mata 2000. Yakoresheje Windows CE 2.12 kugeza kuri Windows CE. NET 4.2 kuri MIPS R4000 kuri 100\u00a0MHz. \nPK.\nYatangijwe mu 2004, iyi mudasobwa ntoya, ifite isakoshi nini ifite progaramu ya ARM, 40 MB ya RAM, 16 MB ya Flash, Bluetooth na USB ihuza. Iki gice kandi gifite aho gihurira na Compactflash. \nmPower.\nMPower ya BrailleNote yatangijwe muri kamena 2005 kandi ifite 128 yububiko bwa bombo kandi ikoresha ububiko bwa kugirango wirinde gutakaza amakuru niba ingufu zabuze. \nApex.\nBrailleNote Apex, yasohotse mu Gushyingo 2009, ni verisiyo yoroheje kandi yoroshye y'abayibanjirije. Ikoresha. Ikoresha itunganya. Ubusanzwe igurishwa hafi $ 5.500 hamwe na selile 32 ya Braille.\nPorogaramu hamwe nimiterere.\nPorogaramu yimbere ya Apex yitwa KeySoft. Ibiriho ubu ni 9.5. Harimo, umusomyi wibitabo, mushakishambuga y'urubuga, umukiriya wa imeri, amajwi yandika, umukinyi wibitangazamakuru, hamwe numukiriya wa ushingiye kuri witwa KeyChat (ushobora no gukoreshwa hamwe na protocole izwi cyane itari XMPP nka, ariko inzira yo gushiraho ni bigoye). Umusomyi wigitabo ashyigikira dosiye yinyandiko yicyongereza (irashobora guhindura ibi mu buryo bwikora nibisabwa), amadosiye yerekana imiterere yudomo neza (mubisanzwe bifite.BRL cyangwa.BRF), nibitabo byamajwi harimo imiterere ya \nIhuza nzira.\nApex ifite Wi-Fi, hamwe nibyuma bitatu byakira kugirango uhuze printer, ibishushanyo, nibikoresho byo kubika. Apex ifite icyambu cya kane USB gishobora gukoreshwa mu kuyihuza na mudasobwa ya no gukora nka terefone ya Braille kuri mudasobwa. Irashoboye guhuza na yakira. Apex ifite icyambu cya VGA (monitor) cyo kureba amakuru kuri monite. Apex ifite bateri ikurwaho kuruhande rwayo. \nGukora kuri BrailleNote.\nHano hari moderi ebyiri za BrailleNote Touch, ubwayo niyo moderi nshya mumurongo wa BrailleNote. Umwimerere, BrailleNote Touch, yasohotse mu mpeshyi ya 2016. Inyandiko yakurikiyeho, BrailleNote Touch Plus, niyo isimbuye cyane, siporo yibuka byinshi ndetse no kunoza ibintu bitandukanye muburyo bwa tekiniki. Bitandukanye na verisiyo yambere ya BrailleNote, ubu buryo bubiri bushigikira \"gukoraho braille\", sisitemu ishobora gukoreshwa muguhindura imyanya yintoki kuri ecran yo gukoraho, hanyuma ukandika braille mubisanzwe. Ifite kandi clavier ya clavier ishobora kwomekwa kumurongo wambere-winjiza. Irindi tandukaniro rikomeye hagati ya BrailleNote Touch na Touch Plus hamwe na verisiyo zabanjirije iyi ni uko Touch na Touch Plus ikora android, mu gihe verisiyo zabanje zikoresha Windows CE. KeySoft yongeye gusubirwamo kandi ikora nka serivisi igerwaho munsi ya android, ariko irashobora kuzimya no gukora kuri BrailleNote nkaho ari tablet ikoresha Android, haba ukanze inshuro eshatu kanda buto yo murugo cyangwa ufashe hasi urufunguzo rwijwi. ukurikije icyitegererezo. BrailleNote Touch na Touch Plus nayo irimo Umusomyi wa KNFB kubuntu hamwe no kugura. Kamera irimo ikoreshwa muburyo bwo kumenya imiterere ya optique, itanga gusoma byoroshye inyandiko zanditse nabafite ubuhumyi bukabije."}
{"id": "17827", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17827", "title": "Wheelchair tennis", "text": "Umukino w\u2019abamugaye w'amagare nimwe muburyo bwa tenisi bwahujwe n\u2019abakoresha igare ry\u2019abamugaye. Ubunini bw'ikibuga, uburebure bwa net na racketi birasa, ariko hariho itandukaniro i rikomeye na tennis y'abanyamaguru: abakinnyi bakoresha intebe y'abamugaye yabugenewe, kandi umupira ushobora guhagarara inshuro zigera kuri ebyiri, aho guterana kwa kabiri nabyo bishobora kugaragara hanze y'ikibuga. \nAmateka.\nUmukino w'amagare w'abamugaye wiyongereye kwamamara muri 1976 bitewe n'imbaraga za Brad Parks, ufatwa nk'uwashizeho umukino wa Tenisi w\u2019abaamugaye. Muri 1982, Ubufaransa bwabaye igihugu cya mbere mu Burayi cyashyizeho gahunda ya tenis y\u2019abamugaye. Kuva icyo gihe, hashyizweho ingufu nyinshi mu guteza imbere siporo kurwego rwindobanure.\nBane nka Grand Slams - Australian Open, Wimbledon, Roland Garros, na US Gufungura harimo umukino wa tenisi w'abamugaye. Kugeza muri 2018, US Gufungura na Australiya Gufungura gusa ni kimwe cya kane. Abakinnyi bane ba Quad bonyine nibo batumiwe (bitandukanye n'umunani ku bagabo n'abagore). Muri 2018, umukino wa Quad Wheelchair Doubles Exhibition yakiniwe i Wimbledoni. Nyuma y'uwo mwaka, hatangajwe ko Wimbledoni izatanga inshuro enye mu buseribateri ndetse no mu nshuro ebyiri, guhera muri 2019. Mu ntangiriro za Gashyantare 2019, Roland Garros yatangaje ko muri uwo mwaka, amarushanwa yayo azatangira harimo n'amakipi y\u2019abamugaye."}
{"id": "17828", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17828", "title": "Tactile (device)", "text": "Tactile nigikoresho nyacyo cyo guhindura inyandiko-kuri- ubu irimo gutezwa imbere mu. Yatekerejwe nitsinda ryabanyeshuri barangije icyiciro cya mbere, bahatana nka \"Team 100% Enthusiasm\", mugihe cyamasaha 15 MIT \"hackathon\". Igikoresho kiranyerera hejuru yinyandiko yanditse kandi kamera ifata amashusho yamagambo ikayohereza kuri microcontroller. Amakuru yimura pin hejuru no hepfo, ahindura inyandiko muri Braille. Iyo bigeze ku isoko twizeye ko bihendutse cyane kuruta ibikoresho bihari.\nAbantu.\nItsinda ry\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abantu batandatu rigizwe na Chandani Doshi, Grace Li, Jialin Shi, Bonnie Wang, Charlene Xia, na Tania Yu, abanyeshuri bose biga muri MIT igihe Tactile yasama. Ubufatanye bufatika mu, hamwe, Tactile yakunzwe cyane n\u2019itangazamakuru kubera umuvuduko wihuse w\u2019iterambere, ndetse n\u2019abayihimbye bose bakaba ari abagore bo mu bice bafite umubare muto w\u2019abagore bahagarariye. \nIterambere.\nTactile itanga ibisobanuro byumwandiko wicyongereza, byafashwe na kamera ihuriweho, muri braille ihindagurika kuburyo. Igicuruzwa cyanyuma nukwerekana inyuguti 36 za braille icyarimwe kuri Imigaragarire [note 1] hamwe nigiciro cyagenewe kugurishwa hafi US $ 100. Hamwe nibikoresho bisanzwe byerekana braille bigurwa hagati y $ 1.500 kugeza $ 2,500, Tactile yaranzwe nk \"\" kwaduka kwaduka imbere kumpumyi. \" \nItsinda rya Tactile ryahawe inkunga y'amadorari 10,000 $ muri MIT IDEAS Global Challenge kandi yemerwa muri Porogaramu ya Microsoft Patent, ahabwa inkunga n'abajyanama mu by'amategeko baturutse muri kugira ngo basabe kurinda patenti muri Amerika. Gusaba kwatanzwe ku ya 16 Nzeri 2016, kuri ubu bikaba bifite. "}
{"id": "17829", "revid": "12228", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17829", "title": "Australian Paralympic wheelchair tennis", "text": "Umukino w'amagare w'abamugaye winjiye bwa mbere mu mikino Paralympike yo mu mpeshyi muri 1988 nk'umukino wo kwerekana no kuba umudari wuzuye mu mikino ya Barcelona muri 1992. Australiya yitabiriye amarushanwa ya tenisi y'abamugaye ya Paralympike. Hariho ibyiciro bibiri by'imidari gufungura no kugabana kane. \nIbikorwa bizwi muri Ositaraliya:\n1992 Barcelona.\nAustraliya ihagarariwe na: Abagabo - Michael Connell, David Hall Abagore - Randa Hinson, Kurega Cumi na kabiri \nAustraliya ntiyabonye imidari.\n1996 Atlanta.\nAustraliya ihagarariwe na:\nAbagabo - Mick Connell, David Hall Abagore - Daniela Di Toro, Randa Hinson Umutoza - Greg Crump \nAustraliya yegukanye umudari wa feza 1 n'umudari wa bronze.\n2000 Sydney.\nAustraliya ihagarariwe muri tennis y'abamugaye na: Abagabo - David Hall, David Johnson Abagore - Daniela Di Toro, Branka Pupovac Umutoza - Greg Crump (Umutwe)\n2020 Tokiyo.\nAbagabo - Dylan Alcott, Heath Davidson, Martyn Dunn (d) Ben Icyumweru Abatoza - Jessica Moore (Abagabo), Franscois Vogelsberger (Quad) Abayobozi - Umuyobozi w'itsinda - Brenda Tierney Australiya yageze ku musaruro ushimishije yegukana umudari umwe wa zahabu n\u2019umudari umwe wa feza, Dylan Alcott yatwaye zahabu mu bagabo bane bahuje amakipe maze afatanya na Heath Davidson gutwara umudari wa feza mu bagabo babiri."}
{"id": "17830", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17830", "title": "Braille watch", "text": "Isaha ya braille ni cyagenwe gikoreshwa nimpumyi cyangwa abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kuvuga igihe. \nInyandiko.\nIsaha ya Braille ikoreshwa mugukora kuri terefone no kubona ibishushanyo. Byombi bisa ya. Ibigereranirizo bisa bifite ikirahure kirinda cyangwa igifuniko cya kirisiti gifunguye igihe mugihe gikenewe gusomwa kandi amaboko yisaha yubatswe kugirango adashobora kwanduzwa no gukoraho urutoki gusa impumyi ikoresha kugirango yitegereze imyanya yabo. Muburyo bwa digitale, utudomo () komeza uhindure umwanya uko ibihe bihinduka. Kuri iki kibazo, umuntu agomba kumva kugirango asome isaha.\n\"\" kuri elegitoronike, avuga igihe ukoraho buto, nayo arazwi mubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. "}
{"id": "17831", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17831", "title": "Wheelchair tennis classification", "text": "imikino ya Tenisi ni uburyo bwo gutondekanya tennis y'abamugaye igenewe kuzana umukino mwiza urimo guhangana hagati yabo bose. Ibyiciro bigenzurwa na komite mpuzamahanga y'abamugaye (IPC) kandi bigakorwa na federasiyo mpuzamahanga ya tenisi (ITF).\nIbisobanuro.\nIbyiciro bya tenisi by'abamugaye mu mikino Paralympike niyo shingiro ryo kumenya abashobora kwitabira siporo, no mu byiciro. niyo Ikoreshwa mugushiraho amarushanwa akwiye. Kwinjira ni ubuntu kubakinnyi ba bagabo n'abagore bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri bubabuza guhatana neza n'abakinnyi babishoboye. \nImiyoborere.\nImiyoborere yiyi siporo igenzurwa na komite mpuzamahanga y'abamugaye (IPC) kandi ifatanya na federasiyo mpuzamahanga ya tennis (ITF) niyo ikora amategeko n'amabwiriza buri mwaka. Iyi Siporo niyo ya mbere yagize ishyirahamwe ry'abakozi rishobora gukora ibyiciro bitandukanye mugihe ITF yatangiraga kuyobora siporo muri 1998. \nMu mikino y'abamugaye.\nUmukino wa Tenisi imikino y'abamugaye yakinwe bwa mbere muri Paralympikee muri 1992. Mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 1992, ubwoko bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019abamugaye bari bemerewe kwitabira, ibyiciro bigakorwa binyuze mu by'iciro byigenga. Amarushanwa mu mikino Paralympike ya 2012 azabera kuri Eton Manor (Parike ya Olempike), kuva ku ya 1 Nzeri kugeza 8 Nzeri. Biteganijwe ko abagabo bari hagati ya 64 na 80 n'abagore 32 kugeza 48 bazahatanira imidari itandatu. Umubare ntarengwa w'abanywanyi ku gihugu cyemewe ni ibi bikurikira:\nKazoza.\nUrwego rukuru rw\u2019imikino y\u2019abamugaye, Komite mpuzamahanga y\u2019abamugaye, gukora ibishoboka ngo rutezimbere ibyiciro byose kugira ngo bibe uburyo bushingiye ku bimenyetso bitandukanye na sisitemu ishingiye ku mikorere kugira ngo idahana abakinnyi b\u2019indashyikirwa imikorere yabo ituma bagaragara muri a urwego rwo hejuru hamwe na banywanyi bitoza bike. "}
{"id": "17832", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17832", "title": "Free Wheelchair Mission", "text": "the Free Wheelchair Mission ni umuryango mpuzamahanga ushingiye wo kwizerwa udaharanira inyungu, ni umuryango utabara imbabare utanga amagare y\u2019ibimugaye ku bafite ubumuga mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere badafite amikoro yo kubona narimwe, uyu Umuryango wita k\u2019ubuzima ku isi ugereranya ko ufute abanyamuryango barenga miliyoni 70. \nIngaruka.\nUyu w'ahaye abantu barenga miliyoni 1.3 amagare y\u2019abmugaye ku bantu bakeneye ubufasha mu bihugu birenga 94. \nIcyicaro gikuru kiri Irvine, muri Californiya, uyu muryango washinzwe na Dr. Don Schoendorfer, ufite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD muri buhanga bw\u2019ibinyabuzima yakuye muri MIT kandi afite patenti zirenga 60.. Mu mwaka wa 2008, Schoendorfer yahawe umusivile umudari w'icyubahiro na Jenerali Colin Powell wahoze mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu birori byabereye ku irimbi rya Arlington..\nIgitabo \"Cyibitangaza\" Igitabo.\nKu ya 6 Ukuboza 2022, Fondateri ariwe, Dr. Don Schoendorfer yasohoye igitabo yise \"Miracle Wheels: Inkuru y\u2019ubutumwa bwo kuzana ingendo ku isi.\" Muri yo, Schoendorfer asangiza inkuru yitwa \"amagare y'ibitangaza\" yahinduye ubuzima bw'abantu barenga miliyoni 1.3 babana n'ubumugaye mu bihugu 94 bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere. \nKumenyekana.\nMuri Kanama 2019, uyu muryango wagaragajwe na Harry na Meghan, Duke na Duchess wa Sussex, ku mbuga zabo za Instagram hamwe n'indi miryango irimo umuyoboro w'isi ndetse na BlinkNow Foundation."}
{"id": "17833", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17833", "title": "Global Vision", "text": "GlobalVision nisosiyete ikora software ya kabuhariwe mu gupakira no kuranga. \nAmateka.\nGlobalVision Inc. (GlobalVision) yashinzwe na Reuben Malz mu 1990. Ifite icyicaro i, muri Kanada, kandi ifite ibiro by'akarere mu Bwongereza no mu Budage. \nMuri 2013, yagiranye amasezerano na GlobalVision yo gupakira ibicuruzwa byiza. \nGlobalVision yerekanye urubuga rwayo rwa mbere rushingiye ku kugenzura ubuziranenge mu 2013. Ibyo byakurikiwe no gushyiraho verisiyo igezweho ya platform, Proofware, muri 2014. \nMuri 2017, GlobalVision yasohoye urubuga rwo kugenzura ubuziranenge bwa desktop. \nMuri 2018, GlobalVision yafatanije na na gutangiza gahunda ya mbere yo kugenzura amabara ya digitale ku isi yo gucapa no gupakira. "}
{"id": "17835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17835", "title": "Hope Haven", "text": "Hope Haven International ni umuryango w\u2019abatabazi wa 501 (c) (3) ufite icyicaro i Rock Valley, muri Iowa, uzwi cyane muri Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika nko gukwirakwiza amagare y\u2019abamugaye byavuguruwe ku bantu bakuru n\u2019abana. Uyu muryango washinzwe muri 1964 nk\u2019urukundo rwa gikirisitu kugira ngo utange serivisi ku bamugaye aho batuye. Byiringiro Haven ikusanya, igasana, ikanagabanya amagare y\u2019abamugaye imbere mu gihugu ndetse no ku rwego mpuzamahanga, usibye gutanga imyitozo ngororamubiri n\u2019imyuga. Uyu muryango wishingikirije ku bakorerabushake n'abagororwa bafunzwe mu gutwara no kuvugurura amagare y'abamugaye. \nByiringiro Haven yagiye ivugurura, kandi itanga ibyoherezwa hamwe n\u2019abakozi bahuguwe kugira ngo bafashe intebe z\u2019abamugaye, ku bana b\u2019impunzi z\u2019umubiri n\u2019abakene b\u2019Abanyapalestine kuva muri 1998, babifashijwemo na politiki n\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019ikigega cy\u2019abatabazi cya Palesitine. Ibiciro by'abamugaye birenze ubushobozi bw'imiryango myinshi, kandi amafaranga ya leta nayo ntaboneka, mu bihugu byinshi, nka Rumaniya, akoreshwa na Hope Haven hamwe n'impano z'abamugaye n'abakozi kugira ngo abamugaye babone neza. "}
{"id": "17836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17836", "title": "Mobility Worldwide", "text": "Mobility Worldwide ni umuryango ushingiye ku kwizera, abakorerabushake ba 501 (c) (3) umuryango udaharanira inyungu.\nPET ni amagambo ahinnye y'umuryango w\"utwara abantu ku giti cyabo\", imodoka itsinda ryubaka kandi rigakwirakwiza nta kiguzi cyo gutanga impano yo kugenda kubana bamugaye ndetse nabakuze kwisi yose. PET International, Inc. yatangiye gukora ubucuruzi nka Mobility Worldwide muri Kanama 2016, batangira gukoresha izina rya Mobility Cart kuri iyo modoka. Kuva muri 1994, amakarita arenga 80.000 ya Mobility yubatswe kandi agakwirakwizwa n'abafatanyabikorwa barenga 70.\nAmateka.\nPET yakuze mu rugendo rwo muri 1994 n\u2019umumisiyonari w\u2019Abametodisite Reverend Larry Hills yerekeza i Zayirecongo, aho yamenyeye bwa mbere ko iki gikoresho gikenewe igihe yahuraga n\u2019abacitse ku icumu rya polio na mines badashobora kugenda ariko badashobora gukoresha intebe z\u2019abamugaye aho batuye mu cyaro. Hills n'umugore we Laura bavuganye na Reverend Mel West ku ntebe y\u2019abamugaye yahinduwe ishobora gukorera, ifatishijwe intoki n'inziga eshatu. Muri 1995, Uburengerazuba bwagize uruhare mu gukora ibicuruzwa Earl Miner mu gukora prototype yubatswe hagamijwe kunangira, ubworoherane no gukora neza. Muri 1996, enye zashyizwe mu kizamini muri congo. Ukurikije imikorere yabo, PET yagiye mubikorwa kandi yoherezwa gukwirakwizwa muri congo. \nUmwaka ukurikira, umusaruro wa PET watangiye kwaguka mu bindi bihugu, guhera kuri Mozambike. Muri 2000, kugira ngo ibyifuzo byiyongera, Uburengerazuba bwafunguye ikigo muri Columbiya, Misuri, muri Amerika, gikora kwakira ibice byatanzwe, guteranya PET no kubyohereza ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Ikigo cya kabiri cyo muri Amerika cyafunguwe muri Penney Farms, muri Floride (hafi ya Jacksonville, Foloride), na Hills muri uwo mwaka. Muri 2003, ikigo cya gatatu cyashinzwe i Luling, muri Texas muri amerika.\nMuri 2004, kugirango bafashe gucunga iterambere n\u2019umusaruro wa PET, Pet International yashizwemo, hamwe n'inama y\u2019abashinzwe abakozi n\u2019abakozi kugira ngo bafashe gucunga ibibazo byose bijyanye no guteranya no gukwirakwiza PET. Igiciro cyibigize PET ni amadolare 300. \nIbihugu.\nAmagare ya PET yoherejwe muri Afuganisitani, Afuganisitani, Arijantine, Arumeniya, Angola, Bahamas, Bangladesh, Belize, Benin, Boliviya, Bosiniya, Botswana, Brasil, Buligariya, Burkina Faso, u Burundi, Kamboje, Kameruni, Tchad, Ubushinwa, Kolombiya, Kosta Rica, Cuba, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 na Pr\u00edncipe, Djibouti, Repubulika ya Dominikani, Ecuador, El Salvador, Eritereya, Etiyopiya, Fiji, Gabon, Gambiya, Gaza, Jeworujiya, Gana, Guatemala, Gineya, Gineya-Bisawu. Mozambike, Miyanimari, Namibiya, Nepali, Nikaragwa, Niger, Nijeriya, Koreya y'Amajyaruguru, Pakisitani, Panama, Papuwasiye Nouvelle Gune, Paragwaya, Peru, Filipine, Repubulika ya Kongo, Rumaniya, Uburusiya, u Rwanda, Samowa, Senegali, Siyera Lewone, Somaliya, Sri Lanka, Repubulika ya Sudani y'Amajyepfo, Suwazilanda, Siriya, Tajikistan, Tanzaniya, Tayilande, Togo, Tonga, Tirinidada, Turukiya, Uzubekisitani, Uganda, Ukerene, Uruguya, Vanuatu, Viyetinami, Banki y'Iburengerazuba, Sahara y'Uburengerazuba, Zambiya, na Zimbabwe. "}
{"id": "17837", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17837", "title": "Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois-Victor Foucault", "text": "Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois-Victor Foucault (1797\u20131871) niwe wavumbuye mu 1843 ya mashini ya mbere yo gucapa kuri.\nUbuzima.\nUmunyeshuri wa, Foucault yashakanye, umwanditsi w'impumyi, mu 1826. Ubu bukwe bwabyaye abakobwa babiri. Nyuma y\u2019urupfu rw\u2019umugore we mu 1831, nyuma y\u2019umuriro, yashakanye n\u2019umudozi (utari impumyi) mu 1832, Ad\u00e9la\u00efde Louise Juteau. Ibi byamushoboje kuba umuturage wa (byari bibujijwe gushyingirwa hagati yimpumyi), ibyo bikaba byamuhaye amahirwe yo gukorana na.\nIgishushanyo.\nIvumburwa rye ryahawe umudari wa platine na, hanyuma abigaragaza mu (1851) i Londres. \nReba.\nLouis Invents Decapoint"}
{"id": "17838", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17838", "title": "Spinal Cord Injuries Australia", "text": "Spinal Cord Injuries Australia (SCIA) ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta utanga ubuvugizi na serivisi ku bantu bafite ibikomere by'umugongo (parapelegiya, qadiripelegiya) n'ibindi bisa.\nAmateka.\nSCIA yashinzwe muri 1967 nk'ishyirahamwe rya Quadripelegike rya Ositaraliya n'itsinda ry'abarwayi bo mu bitaro bya Prince Henry i Sydney, Ositaraliya. Ntibashoboye kuva mu bitaro kubera ko nta macumbi cyangwa serivisi byabateraga inkunga mu baturage. AQA yahinduye izina muri 2003.\nMu itegeko nshinga rya SCIA byibuze 50% by'inama y'ubuyobozi igomba kugira imvune y'umugongo cyangwa imiterere isa.\nAbanyamuryango bashinze ni Trevor Annetts, Tom Clarke, Graeme Dunne, David Fox, Peter Harris, George Mamo, Jim McGrath, Robert McKenzie, Alan Moore, John Munday, Cecil Murr, Brian Shirt, Paul Sorgo, Stan Wanless, na Warren Mowbray. David Fox niwe wabaye perezida wa mbere. Bashishikarijwe gushinga umuryango n\u2019umukozi ushinzwe imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage Gary Garrison, ushyigikiwe na Dr George Burniston.\nSerivisi.\nSerivisi zitangwa na SCIA uyu munsi n'amakuru, ubuvugizi, amacumbi aboneka, Guhuza gahunda ya NDIS no guhuza ibikorwa, akazi, urungano nimiryango ifasha hamwe na NeuroMoves serivise idasanzwe, yuzuye, ishingiye kubimenyetso hamwe n'ubuvuzi k'ubantu ba bana n'uburwayi bw'imitsi cyangwa ubumuga bwu mubiri.\nItsinda ry\u2019abakiriya ba SCIA ryitaba telefoni zirenga 850 ku mwaka ziva mu Banyaustraliya ba mugaye n\u2019imiryango yabo, kandi rikomeza isomero ry\u2019abamugaye ku biro bya SCIA i Sydney, muri Leta ya New South Wales. Isomero ry'ibitabo bya SCIA ku murongo ritanga ibikoresho bitandukanye ku bantu bafite ibikomere byu mugongo n'imiryango yabo, bikubiyemo ingingo n'ibisobanuro birambuye byu buvuzi, ubufasha na serivisi zu bujyanama. Itsinda rya makuru yo mukarere kandi ritanga ubufasha ninama kugiti cya bantu bafite ikibazo cyu mugongo mugace ka NSW."}
{"id": "17839", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17839", "title": "Wheelchair Foundation", "text": "Wheelchair Foundation (WF) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu wa shinzwe muri Kamena 2000 n\u2019umushinga w\u2019imitungo utimukanwa Ken Behring, ukaba ufite icyicaro i Danville, muri Californiya. Fondasiyo ifatanya n\u2019abaterankunga (abantu ku giti cyabo, amatsinda n\u2019amasosiyete) gutanga amagare y\u2019abamugaye k'ubantu bakeneye ariko badashobora kubigura, cyane mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Kugeza muri Nzeri 2008, umuyoboro wa WF umaze kugeza ibihugu birenga 750.000 by\u2019abamugaye.\nFondasiyo ifatanya n'imiryango itandukanye ya serivise, harimo Rotary Clubs, Knight of Columbus na Sister City International.\nInama mpuzamahanga y\u2019abajyanama ya WF irimo abatari bake ndetse n\u2019abahoze ari abakuru b\u2019ibihugu n\u2019ibyamamare, barimo abayobozi bafatanije Juan Carlos na Sophia wo muri Esipayne, ndetse na Mikhail Gorbachev na Nelson Mandela.\nImiryango yigenga igizwe n'intebe y'abamugaye ni Fondasiyo Yabamugaye yo muri Kanada na Fondasiyo y'abamugaye UK. WF Australiya nayo yabayeho nk'ikigo cy'igenga kugeza muri 2008 ariko ubu ni umushinga wa Rotary Club ya Gosford West (NSW).\nBehring yagize icyo avuga ku kamaro k'imiryango y'itegamiye kuri Leta mu igabana ry'abamugaye:\nImiryango itegamiye kuri Leta ni ingenzi muri buri gihugu. Ndatekereza ko ubu dukorana n'imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta. Igihe twari muri Afuganisitani, twakoresheje abantu bamwe bo mu muryango w'abafite ubumuga, kandi ingabo z'Amerika nazo zaradufashaga. Buri gihe dutanga intebe nke mu Bushinwa, zikorana n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafite ubumuga. Muri Amerika yo Hagati, urugero, dukorana n\u2019abadamu ba mbere. Abagore ba perezida ubusanzwe bafite umusingi kandi bafite aho bahurira n\u2019ibitaro byita ku buzima busanzwe. Babaye rero cyane, cyane ifasha muri Amerika yo Hagati no mu majyepfo mu rwego rwo kudufasha kubona abahawe intebe zibereye. "}
{"id": "17840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17840", "title": "World Braille Day", "text": "World Braille Day umunsi international day ukaba uba taliki ya 4 Mutarama awareness gukangurira abantu kumenya ururimi rwa braille mu buryo rw'itumanaho bigamije kubahiriza uburenganzira bwa muntu visually impaired people. bwanagite ubumuga bwo kutabona United Nations General Assembly itariki y'uyu munsi yatoranijwe ni inteko rusange n'inteko rusange y'umuryango w'abibumbye mu itangazo ryasohotse mu gushyingo 2018,kandi ihurirana nisabukuru ya Louis Braille,Wavumbuye ubu buryo bwo kwandika.\nUmunsi wa mbere w\u2019isi ya Braille wizihijwe ku ya 4 Mutarama 2019. "}
{"id": "17841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17841", "title": "Bertha Gyndykes Dkhar", "text": "Bertha Gyndykes Dkhar n'umwarimu wigisha wo mubuhinde ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona, uzwi cyane nkuwahimbye muri. Mu mwaka wa 2010, Guverinoma y'Ubuhinde yamuhaye, igihembo cya kane cy\u2019abasivili mu Buhinde. \nUbuzima.\nBertha Gyndykes Dkhar yavukiye i Shillong, muri Meghalaya nk'umwana ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona ufite, indwara itera kwangirika kwa retina, maze atabona neza igihe yari muri kaminuza kubera ko yagombaga kureka kwiga.. Nta buryo bwo kwibeshaho, yagurishije imbuto ku isoko kugirango abeho. Mu gukomeza imbaraga zo gutsinda ubumuga, Dkhar yakoze ubushakashatsi muri code ya Braille maze ategura kode muri, ururimi rwaho muri Meghalaya. \nBertha Dkhar ni umuyobozi \"w'ishuri rya Jyoti Sroat\", ishuri riyobowe na Bethany Society kubana bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Yabonye igihembo cya kane cy\u2019abasivili mu Buhinde cya, ubwo yagaragaraga ku rutonde rw\u2019icyubahiro rw\u2019umunsi wa Repubulika y\u2019Ubuhinde mu 2010. Yahawe kandi igihembo cy'igihugu gishinzwe imibereho myiza y'abana na Guverinoma y'Ubuhinde mu 2000. "}
{"id": "17842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17842", "title": "Kunwar Singh Negi", "text": "Kunwar Singh Negi (1927 - 20 Werurwe 2014) yari umwanditsi w'ikinyamakuru cyo mu Buhinde akaba n'umukozi ushinzwe. Yahinduye ibitabo 300 muri braille. Ibikorwa bye bikomeye birimo Bhagwan Buddh Ka Updesh na Hazrat Mohammed Ki Vani, byombi bijyanye n'inyigisho za Gautam Buddha na Muhammad. Yahawe ibihembo by'abasivili b'Abahinde Padma Shri mu 1981 nyuma aza guhabwa Bhushan mu 1990.\nUbuzima.\nNegi yavukiye i Pauri, umujyi ubu uri mu majyaruguru y\u2019Ubuhinde bwa Uttarakhand mu 1927. Yarwanye muri Birmaniya mu rwego rw'ingabo z'Ubuhinde mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Yashimiye abapolisi b'Abongereza kuba baramushizemo impuhwe na disipulini. Mu 1954, nyuma y\u2019Ubuhinde bwigenga ku butegetsi bw\u2019Abongereza, yinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona i Dehradun aho yatangiye gushishikarira braille. Negi yatangiye kwandukura ibitabo mu ndimi zitandukanye z'Ubuhinde nka Punjabi, Bengali, Urdu, Gujarati, Oriya, Marathi ndetse no mu Burusiya. Yakoze ku bitabo 300 birimo ibyanditswe bya Sikh nka Sukhmani Sahib hamwe n\u2019ibitabo byanditswe na Gautam Buddha na Muhammad. \nNegi kandi yagize uruhare mu mibereho myiza y\u2019abatabona kandi yifatanyaga na Bharat Netrahin Samaj muri Punjab ndetse n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatabona i Delhi. Ibikorwa bye bitandukanye by\u2019amadini byatanzwe ku buntu binyuze mu butumwa mpuzamahanga bwa Maharaja Ranjit Singh ku buvanganzo bwa Gurbani Braille. Yahinduye kandi igitabo cy\u2019umunyapolitiki Surjit Singh Barnala cyitwa My Other Abakobwa Babiri. \nNegi yahawe igihembo na Padma Shri, igihembo cya kane cy\u2019abasivili mu Buhinde mu 1981 kubera ibikorwa bye. Mu 1990, yashyikirijwe Padma Bhushan, igihembo cya gatatu mu bihembo byinshi kubera uruhare yagize mu bijyanye n'ubuvanganzo n'uburezi. Yashyikirijwe kandi igihembo cya Sikh Gaurav na komite ya Shiromani Gurdwara Parbandhak. \nMu 2003, Negi yabazwe glande ya prostate n'amafaranga yakiriwe na guverinoma y'icyo gihe ya Uttarakhand iyobowe na N. D. Tiwari nka Minisitiri w\u2019intebe. Mu mwaka wa 2009, Negi yagaragaje ibibazo afite mu bijyanye n'amafaranga mu bitangazamakuru igihe adashobora kwigurira umutima utera indwara z'umutima kandi akaba nta leta yahawe. Yari yaravuwe bituzuye kubera kubura amafaranga mu bitaro bya GB Pant i New Delhi. Yapfuye ku ya 20 Werurwe 2014 i Dehradun."}
{"id": "17843", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17843", "title": "Thakur Vishva Narain Singh", "text": "Thakur Vishva Narain Singh (30 Nyakanga 1928 - 29 Nzeri 2009) ni we mwanditsi wa mbere z\u2019Ubuhinde akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru uzwi. Yabaye umwanditsi mukuru wa braille mu gice cyo gutangaza Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona i. Nyuma yizabukuru, yakomeje kwandika no gukorana n\u2019ibinyamakuru byaho mu mujyi.\nSingh yari umwubatsi mukuru inyuma yo gushiraho isomero rinini kubafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Yari ashinzwe kubona ibitabo by'idini by'Abahindu bihindurwa mu nyandiko.\nThakur Vishva Narain Singh yapfiriye i Amsterdam ubwo yari mu biruhuko by'umuryango ku ya 29 Nzeri 2009."}
{"id": "17844", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17844", "title": "Harris Mowbray", "text": "Harris Mowbray (/\u02c8h\u00e6.\u0279\u026as \u02c8mo\u028a.bre\u026a /; yavutse 1999) ni umuhanga mu by'indimi akaba na programu ukomoka muri Amerika. Azwiho gushyiraho ibyifuzo byinshi byo guhuza indimi nke ku isi muri.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nHarris yavukiye mu mujyi wa New York kwa Michele Madansky, umujyanama w\u2019ubushakashatsi mu kwamamaza, icyo gihe akaba yarabaye umuyobozi mukuru kuri Yahoo na Travis Mowbray, umuyobozi w\u2019ibizamini by\u2019amavuriro. Yakuriye mu kibaya cya Silicon. Sekuru ubyara yari umunyamibare Albert Madansky. Akomoka muri Ashkenazi akomoka mu Bayahudi.\nBraille.\nHarris yatangiye gukora Braille kururimi rwa Gagauz nururimi rwa Sorbian. Yagaragaye cyane mu binyamakuru byo muri Polonye kubera icyifuzo cye cya Kashubian Braille. Ibyifuzo bye byanditse mu nyuguti z'impumyi byemewe ku rurimi rwa Livoniya, ururimi rwa Fulani, n'ururimi rwa Lakota. Yakoze kandi inyuguti y'intoki (inyuguti y'ururimi rw'amarenga) ku rurimi rwa Fulani, ashingiye ku nyandiko ya Adlam. Muri Werurwe 2021, Harris Mowbray yateguye icyifuzo cya Braille ku ndimi ebyiri zemewe zo mu birwa bya Amerika y'Amajyaruguru ya Mariana, Chamorro na Caroliniya Hagati ya 2021, umuryango wa Udi wo muri Azaribayijan wemeye icyifuzo cye cyo kuba Braille mu rurimi rwabo. Mowbray yanafashaga kubara Braille ya Jeworujiya. \nMu mpera za 2021, Harris yateje imbere Braille ku rurimi rw\u2019ibihugu bya mbere Smalgyax ivugwa mu majyaruguru ya Columbiya y\u2019Ubwongereza, ururimi rwa Elfdaliya, n\u2019ururimi rwa Rusyn. \nMu ntangiriro za 2022, Harris yari yarafatanyije na Kongere y\u2019abatutsi ku isi gukora braille y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igitutu abifashijwemo n\u2019abandi bashakashatsi. Yakoranye kandi n\u2019umuryango uvuga Khoekhoegowab wo muri Namibiya kugira ngo bateze imbere Braille ku mvugo y\u2019ururimi rwabo. \nHarris yakoranye neza n\u2019umuryango uvuga ururimi rw\u2019Abasamogite bo muri Lituwaniya mu rwego rwo gushyiraho urwego rwerekana ururimi rwabo mu mpera za 2022. Mu 2023 yakoranye n\u2019Abatutsi ba Crim\u00e9e muri Ukraine guteza imbere Braille ku nyuguti zabo z'ikilatini. \nUbuzima Bwite.\nHarris yize muri kaminuza y'Abanyamerika i Washington, DC, umujyi atuyemo uyu munsi "}
{"id": "17845", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17845", "title": "Wheelchair tennis at the Summer Paralympics", "text": "wheelchair tennis ni umukino wa Tenisi yabigenewe bwa mbere mu mikino Paralympike ya siporo nk'imikino yo kwerekana muri 1988, hakaba harabaye ibirori bibiri (abaseribateri n\u2019abagore). Yabaye siporo itanga imidari kumugaragaro muri 1992 kandi yagiye yitabira imikino Paralympike yose kuva icyo gihe. Ibirori bine byakozwe kuva 1992 kugeza 2000, hiyongereyeho ibintu bine (uburinganire buvanze) mu buryo bumwe no gukuba kabiri muri 2004.\nIbyabaye.\nIbirori bigera kuri bitandatu birahatanwa kuri buri Paralympike. Gusa abagabo n'abagore bonyine babereye mu mikino ya Paralympike yo muri 1988, ubwo yari siporo yo kwerekana. Ibi byahujwe n\u2019ibihe bibiri by\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore nyuma y'imyaka ine ubwo siporo yahinduraga ibirori. Muri 2004, ibintu bibiri bishya byongeweho hamwe na quadriplegiya (nkibyo bizwi kandi nka ibyabaye) kandi bitandukanye nibindi bintu bavanze. Ariko kugeza mu mikino ya 2020, abagore babiri gusa ni bo bitabiriye ibyo birori, Umuholandi witwa Monique de Beer n'Umunyakanada Sarah Hunter, bombi barushanwe muri 2004 na 2008. Nyamara, Abadage baracyari abagore bonyine begukanye umudari muri Paralympike, umuringa mu marushanwa ya kabiri mu 2004."}
