{"id": "17898", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17898", "title": "Twine (device)", "text": "Twine nigikoresho cyonyine cyifashisha kugirango umenye ibice byacyo kandi uhuza umuyoboro wa Wi-Fi kugirango uvugane. Amategeko yashyizwe muri Twine arashobora kugerageza imiterere ya sensor kandi, ashingiye kuri logique, kohereza ubutumwa ukoresheje cyangwa, gukora, cyangwa gucana. Irashobora gukora.\nIgikoresho cyakozwe na Supermechanical muri Amerika giturutse ku nkunga yakusanyijwe kuri. Intego yabo yambere yari $ 35,000 nyamara bakusanyije $ 556.541 kubaterankunga 3.966 ku ya 3 Mutarama 2012. Ibicuruzwa byoherejwe neza mu Gushyingo 2012. Kuva ku ya 5 Mata 2016, Supermechanical ntagikora Twine. "}
{"id": "17899", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17899", "title": "Home lift", "text": "Home lift ntibigomba kwitiranywa na lift yo munzu ni ubwoko bwa bwagenewe cyane cyane amazu yigenga, aho igishushanyo cyita kubintu bine bikurikira: \nHome lift birashobora guhuzwa na code yigihugu cyangwa amabwiriza. Kurugero, uburayi bwibipimo byimashini 2006 42 EC bisaba kubahiriza ibipimo 194 byumutekano kugirango lift ishyirwe mumitungo bwite. \nIncamake.\nGuterura munzu ni lift yoroheje kubantu 2 kugeza kuri 4 basanzwe bakoresha amashanyarazi murugo. Bitandukanye na cyangwa \" hamwe \" ikoreshwa na lift, kuzamura inzu ntibisaba umwanya winyongera mubyumba byimashini, hejuru yumutwe, cyangwa urwobo, bigatuma bikoreshwa cyane murugo no mubikorera. Akenshi, ibiciro nabyo biri munsi yubusanzwe busanzwe.\nSisitemu yo gutwara ibinyabiziga byo munzu irashobora kubakwa imbere yimiterere ubwayo kandi ikagaragaza, hamwe twashyizwe inyuma urubuga rwa lift; byitwa rero sisitemu \"screw na nut\". Iyo lift ikozwe, ihatira ibinyomoro umugozi, bigasunika kuzamura hejuru no hepfo. Inzu nyinshi zo munzu ziza zifite imiterere ifunguye kugirango ibone umwanya munini kandi utange uburenganzira buva kumpande 3 zitandukanye. Ibi birasaba abaproducer bose gushyiramo kandi, mubihugu bimwe, kugabanya umuvuduko wurugendo. \nGuterura munzu biboneka kumasoko mumyaka mirongo, kandi byerekana inzira igenda yiyongera. Abakora ibicuruzwa byinshi byo munzu bagurisha ibicuruzwa byabo binyuze murusobe rwabo, ariko ntibisanzwe kubona batanga lift zabo mumatsinda manini yo kuzamura. Abakora ibicuruzwa byinshi bazamura binjira mumasoko mashya nku Buhinde hamwe nogukora no gufatanya kwishyiriraho ubushobozi bwabo bwa tekiniki. \nUbwoko.\nInzu y'amashanyarazi.\nAmashanyarazi yo murugo akoreshwa na moteri yamashanyarazi icomeka mumashanyarazi ya amp 13, nkibindi bikoresho byose byo murugo. Bakoresha ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata moteri ya moteri bivuze ko yihagije mu gisenge cyimodoka ya lift ubwayo. 'Binyuze mu igorofa' ibyuma bibiri bya gari ya moshi birema ibyubaka-ubwikorezi kandi uburemere bwimiterere yose hamwe na lift biri muri compression binyuze muri gari ya moshi hasi murugo.\nUmugozi utwarwa numuyoboro.\nImashini itwara inzu ya kabili igizwe nigiti, akazu, sisitemu yo kugenzura hamwe nuburemere. Moderi zimwe zisaba kandi. Kuzamura insinga bisa nibiboneka mu nyubako z'ubucuruzi. Izi nzitizi zifata umwanya munini kubera igiti nicyumba cyibikoresho, bityo rero gushyiramo insinga ya kabili munzu nshya biroroshye cyane kuruta kugerageza kuvugurura inyubako ihari. Inzitizi zikurura zikenera sisitemu yo kugenda. Ntibisanzwe ku nyubako nshya, kuko tekinoroji ya hydraulic ikoreshwa mubihe byinshi.\nUrugo rutwarwa numunyururu.\nGuterura iminyururu murugo bisa na lift ikoreshwa na kabili, ariko bakoresha urunigi ruzengurutse ingoma aho kuba umugozi kugirango uzamure kandi umanure imodoka. Iminyururu iraramba kuruta insinga kandi ntigomba gusimburwa kenshi. Kuzamura iminyururu yo munzu nabyo ntibisaba icyumba cyimashini gitandukanye, kibika umwanya.\nImashini icyumba-kitarimo inzu.\nImashini ibyumba bitarimo inzu ikora ikora kunyerera hejuru no munzira y'urugendo hamwe nuburemere. Ubu bwoko ni amahitamo meza yinyubako zo guturamo, kubera ko ibyumba byimashini cyangwa ibyobo bigera kubutaka bisabwa. Nyamara, inzitizi zikurura ziracyasaba umwanya winyongera hejuru yinzu hejuru ya lift kugirango uhuze ibice bisabwa kugirango uzamure kandi umanure imodoka. Inzu itagira shitingi igizwe na kaburimbo ya lift igororotse ihagaze kuri gari ya moshi. Lift igenda munzira iva hasi igana hasi no inyuma.\nInzu ya Hydraulic.\nInzu ya Hydraulic yo guterura itwarwa na piston igenda muri silinderi. Kubera ko sisitemu yo gutwara ibitse neza muri shitingi ya lift, nta cyumba cyimashini gisabwa kandi sisitemu yo kugenzura ni nto bihagije kugirango ihuze na kabine kurukuta hafi ya lift. Kuri sisitemu ya hydraulic ifite umwobo, silinderi igomba kwaguka kugeza mubwimbike bwa etage ihuye nibirenge bya lift, mugihe sisitemu ya hydraulic idafite umwobo idasaba urwobo.\nPneumatic home lift.\nInzu ya pneumatike ikoresha sisitemu ya vacuum imbere muri tube kugirango itware kugenda. Icyobo cyangwa icyumba cyimashini ntabwo bisabwa, bityo kuzamura pneumatike murugo biroroshye cyane guhindura inzu ihari. Indwara ya pneumatike igizwe nigituba cya acrylic cyangwa ikirahure (mubisanzwe nka 80\u00a0cm muri diameter). Irasa na mail tube ushobora kuba uzi muri firime cyangwa inyubako zishaje. Hejuru ya pneumatike ntabwo ihishe murukuta kandi mubisanzwe ishyirwa hafi yintambwe. \nKuramo ibiti byimbere murugo.\nImashini itwara urugo rutwara urugo rwateguwe hafi yigitekerezo cya moteri izunguruka ibinyomoro, ihinduranya imigozi bityo ikazamura kuzamura hejuru no hepfo. Birazwi ko byizewe, umutekano n'umutekano muke, kandi bisaba kubungabungwa bike ugereranije na hydraulic cyangwa umukandara utwarwa n'umukandara. cyane bikoreshwa kugeza kuri etage 6. \nIgishushanyo mbonera.\nGuterura munzu, byabanje gushyirwaho cyangwa retro yashyizwemo mubisanzwe bizana amahitamo amwe, ibi rero kugirango nyirubwite abashe gukora neza inzu yabo. Ibara nubunini nibyo bihitamo cyane nkumweru, imvi numukara. Nyamara, abatunganya ibicuruzwa bimwe barenga ibi kandi bagatanga amahitamo ya artwall (backwall) amabara ya tapi hamwe nibishusho, bigaha abakiriya uburyo butandukanye bwo gutekereza no guhuza buri nzu igishushanyo mbonera."}
{"id": "17900", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17900", "title": "HomeLink Wireless Control System", "text": "HomeLink Wireless Control Sisitemu ni (RF) mumamodoka amwe n'amwe ashobora gutegurwa kugirango akoreshe ibikoresho nk'ifungura, amarembo n'ifunga, harimo n'abafite.\nSisitemu isanzwe igaragaramo buto eshatu, akenshi ziboneka kumurongo wuruhande rwumushoferi cyangwa kuri konsole yo hejuru, ishobora gutegurwa hakoreshejwe imyitozo ikurikirana kugirango isimbuze igenzura rya kure. Ihujwe na benshi bafungura urugi rwa garage igenzurwa na garage, kimwe na sisitemu nkurwo rushingiye kuri protocole.\nYatsindiye mu 1997, kubera gutanga ikoranabuhanga mu binyabiziga hagamijwe kunoza imikoranire y'abaguzi hagati y'imodoka n'inzu. Kugeza 2003, yari imaze gushyirwaho ku modoka zirenga 20.000.000. Ubusanzwe yakozwe na, umurongo wibicuruzwa HomeLink wagurishijwe kuri muri 2013. \nHomeLink irahuza nibikoresho bya radiyo ikoresha hagati ya 288 na 433 MHz. Hitamo 2007 kandi ibinyabiziga bishya birahuye na 433 MHz. "}
{"id": "17901", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17901", "title": "Laundroid", "text": "Laundroid yari hamwe na, yakoreshwaga mu, icyuma, gutondekanya no kuzinga imyenda kugeza mu kabigenewe. Yiswe ku isi, kandi byari biteganijwe ko izabanza kugurishwa mu Buyapani, hanyuma, ku mubare muto, muri Amerika. Itariki yo gusohora yashyizwe muri 2017, mbere yo gutumiza guhera muri Werurwe 2017.\nImikorere.\nSisitemu yo kumenyekanisha amashusho hamwe namaboko ya robo yatwaye iminota 3 kugeza 10 yo gutoranya no kuzinga buri kintu, cyangwa ijoro ryose kugirango umutwaro wo kumesa. \nAmateka.\nLaundroid yatangijwe bwa mbere kandi yerekanwe mu imurikagurisha rya elegitoroniki ry\u2019abaguzi 2015 ryabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. Yatejwe imbere na, na Inzozi zirindwi.\nMu Gushyingo 2016, Indoto zirindwi zatangaje ko zabonye miliyoni 60 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu gutera inkunga Series B iyobowe na Panasonic Corp., Daiwa House Industry Co, na SBI ishoramari \nImashini za mbere zashoboraga gusa kuzinga imyenda yo, ariko ibicuruzwa byanyuma - gukaraba neza, gukama no kubika - byari biteganijwe gusohoka muri 2019. \nKu ya 23 Mata 2019, Inzozi zirindwi zatangaje ko zahombye. Ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi ku nguzanyo Teikoku Databank kivuga ko bari bafite amadeni miliyoni 20 y\u2019amadeni 200."}
{"id": "17902", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17902", "title": "Roborior", "text": "Roborior ni yakozwe na societe yimashini ya Tmsuk ikagurishwa na. Ikoreshwa haba mu gucana no kurinda amazu. Roborior hafi yubunini bwa watermelon kandi irashobora kubyara amabara atandukanye kuva mubururu, umutuku, na orange. Roborior ifite kandi kamera yerekana amashusho ya digitale ishobora guhita yerekana videwo kuri terefone igendanwa ya nyirayo iyo ibonye umucengezi. Roborior irashobora kugenzurwa kure ukoresheje intoki, kimwe. Yatangijwe mu Buyapani mu mpera za 2005 ikaba yaguzwe 280.000. Izina ni ya robot imbere.\nReba ibindi.\nDescription of the Roborior "}
{"id": "17903", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17903", "title": "Laundry-folding machine", "text": "Imashini imesa cyangwa imashini imesa imyenda (Mu icyongereza: A laundry-folding machine or laundry-folding robot) ni imashini cyangwa kuburyo ishobora kubikwa neza kandi neza.\nImashini imesa imyenda irashobora kuba igice cyangwa igahuzwa, imashini yicyuma na / cyangwa. Bamwe bakora inzira zigenga, mugihe izindi zisaba urwego rutandukanye rwo gutabara intoki.\nGukoresha inganda.\nMu gukoresha inganda, hari ubwoko bwinshi bwimashini imesa imyenda mubunini nubwoko butandukanye, murimwe murimwe kabuhariwe kubwoko bumwebumwe bwimyenda, cyangwa nini cyane kugirango ibashe guhunika imyenda minini nko kuryama.\nGukoresha murugo.\nHabayeho kugerageza gukora imashini zicuruza imashini zikoreshwa murugo.\n yari isosiyete y'Abanyamerika yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2010, yerekanaga prototype y'imashini izinga imyenda mbere mu 2016, hanyuma mu muri 2017, na prototype ivugururwa muri CES muri 2018. Imyenda yagombaga kugaburirwa intoki muri mashini kuva hejuru icyarimwe, hanyuma nyuma yiminota mike uyikoresha ashobora gufata imyenda yiteguye hepfo. Intego yabo yari iyo FoldiMate yinjira ku isoko mu mpera za 2019, ariko muri Nyakanga 2021 byaje kugaragara ko iyi sosiyete izahagarika imirimo yayo.\n yari umuyapani wahujwe no gukaraba no gufunga bigamije gushobora gukaraba, gukama, ibyuma no kuzinga imyenda, hanyuma ukabijyana muri imyenda ihuriweho - byigenga rwose, bikaba bivugwa ko igihe cyakazi kizaba nijoro. Yerekanwe bwa mbere mu imurikagurisha rya elegitoroniki y\u2019abaguzi ryerekana mu 2015, kandi ryashyizwe ku isoko nka robot ya mbere ku isi ishobora gukaraba no kuzinga imyenda. Intego yari iyo Laundroid yinjira ku isoko muri 2017 (nyuma yaje guhindurwa kugeza muri 2019), ariko muri 2019 isosiyete iri inyuma ya Laundroid, Seven Dreams, yatangaje ko bahombye. Iterambere ryari rishyigikiwe nabandi na."}
{"id": "17904", "revid": "9834", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17904", "title": "Speech Recognition &amp; Synthesis", "text": "Speech Recognition &amp; Synthesis, yahoze yitwa Speech Services, ni porogaramu isomwa munsakaza amashusho yakozwe na Google kuri sisitemu y'imikorere ya Android. Iha imbaraga porogaramu zo gusoma mu ijwi riranguruye (ivuga) inyandiko ku insakaza amashusho, hamwe n'inkunga y'indimi nyinshi. Umwandiko Kurmvugo ishobora gukoreshwa na porogaramu nka Google Play Ibitabo mu gusoma ibitabo mu ijwi riranguruye, inkoronyamagambo yo gusoma ibisobanuro mu ijwi riranguruye kugira ngo uvuge amagambo, Google TalkBack, hamwe n'ibindi bitekerezo byatanzwe byifashishwa bishingiye kuri porogaramu, kimwe na porogaramu z'ishyaka mucyongereza bita (third-part). Abakoresha bagomba gushiraho amakuru yijwi kuri buri rurimi.\nAmateka.\nBamwe mu bategura porogaramu batangiye guhuza no guhindura porogaramu zabo za Auto kugira ngo bashyiremo Text-to-Speech, nka Hyundai mu mwaka 2015. Porogaramu nka textPlus na WhatsApp zikoresha Text-to-Speech kugira ngo usome amatangazo mu ijwi riranguruye kandi itange imikorere mu gusubiza amajwi.\ninkoranyamagambo Cloud Text-to-Speech ikoreshwa na WaveNet, software yakozwe na Google yo mu Bwongereza ishami rya AI ryitwa DeepMind, ryaguzwe na Google mu mwaka 2014. Iragerageza gutandukanya abobahanganye nabo, Amazon na Microsoft. \nTekinoroji ya AI ya DeepMind ya tekinoroji yateye imbere cyane kandi ifatika. Amajwi menshi akoresha (harimo na Siri y'uruganda rwa Apple) akoresha (concatenative synthesis), aho porogaramu ibika fonema imwe hanyuma ikayicamo hamwe kugira ngo igire amagambo n'interuro.\nWaveNet itanga imvugo isa nk'isanzwe kuruta izindi sisitemu y'imvugo. Ihuza hamwe n'imvugo n'ibindi bisa nk'umuntu mugushimangira no guhindagurika k'umutwe, fonema, n'amagambo. Ugereranije, WaveNet itanga amajwi yo kuvuga abantu bakunda kuruta ubundi buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga. Bitandukanye n'ubundi buryo bwinshi bwanditse bw'imvugo, moderi ya WaveNet ikora amajwi mugutangira yerekana amajwi m'uburyo bwa kera. Icyitegererezo gikoresha urusobe rw'imitsi rwatojwe hakoreshejwe urugero runini rw'imvugo. Mu gihe cy'amahugurwa, umuyoboro ukuramo imiterere y'ibanze y'ijambo, nk'ijwi rikurikira hamwe n'uburyo bw'imvugo ifatika. Iyo uhaye inyandiko yinjiza moderi ya WaveNet yatojwe ishobora kubyara imvugo ihindagurika uhereye k'umurongo, icyitegererezo kimwe icyarimwe, hamwe n'icyitegererezo kigera ku 24.000 ku masegonda kandi cyoroshye hagati y'ijwi ryihariye. \nSerivise yahinduwe (Speech Recognition &amp; Synthesis muri 2023.\u00a0)&lt;/link&gt;[\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "17905", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17905", "title": "Window-Eyes", "text": "Window-Eyes ni umusomyi w'insakaza amashusho kuri sisitemu y'imikorere ya Microsoft Windows, yakozwe itezwa imbere na GW Micro. Inyandiko ya mbere yasohotse mu mwaka 1995. \nIbiranga.\nWindow-Eyes 9.4 ihuza na Windows Vista, Windows Server 2008, Windows 7, Windows 8, na Windows 10. Window-Eyes 7 yongeyeho inkunga y'inganda zisanzwe zandikwa, zishobora gukoreshwa mu guhindura igenamiterere ryihariye muri Window-Eyes, kugenzura ibice bya indangamashusho kubikorwa runaka, mu gusobanura hotkeys, n'isubiramo mu gutangiza imirimo. \nAmateka.\nWindow-Eyes yakozwe na GW Micro, isosiyete ikorera i Fort Wayne, m'Ubuhinde. Window-Eyes yakozwe mu ndimi 14, naho verisiyo y'Icyongereza ikubiyemo indimi icyenda zandikirwa mu rurimi, harimo cyangwa hakubiwemo Icyongereza cyo muri Amerika, Icyongereza cyo m'Ubwongereza, Icyesipanyoli cyo muri Espanye, Icyesipanyoli cyo muri Megizike, Igifaransa, Igifaransa cy'abanyakanada, Ikidage, Igitaliyani, n'Igiporutugali. GW Micro yaguzwe cyangwa yahujwe na AI Squared mu mwaka 2014, isosiyete ikomatanya igumana URL za gwmicro.com, ariko imbuga zahinduwe nka 'AI Squared'. Muri Nyakanga mu mwaka 2017, ibicuruzwa ntibyari bigitangwa mu kugurishwa muri Amerika no mugihugu cya Kanada, kandi n'inkunga yo kugura gusa niyo yari yatanzwe gusa. Ni isosiyete isaba abakiriya bashya aho gukoresha JAWS k'umusomyi mu insakazamashusho. "}
{"id": "17906", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17906", "title": "Skilcraft", "text": "Ubuhanga, bukunze kwitwa SKILCRAFT, n'izina ry'ubucuruzi ryanditswe nakampani y'inganda z'igihugu zita ku bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona (NIB). [1] Ibicuruzwa byakozwe na Skilcraft byakozwe ahanini n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa abamugaye cyane. Ibicuruzwa bifite ikirango cya Skilcraft bikoreshwa cyane mu bigo bya leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, harimo n\u2019amaposita yo muri Amerika. Bakunze kugurishwa no guhanahana ibirindiro bya gisirikare muri Amerika hamwe na ba komiseri.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka 1938, Perezida Roosevelt yashyize umukono ku itegeko rya Wagner-O'Day ryategekaga guverinoma kugura ibicuruzwa byakozwe n'Abanyamerika bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. [3] Robert Irwin, wari umuyobozi mukuru wa Fondasiyo y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, na Peter Salmon, umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe uruganda rw\u2019abatabona, bateje imbere umushinga w'itegeko i Washington, DC [3] Iki gikorwa cyahaye imiryango idaharanira inyungu w'abafite ubumuga ubushobozi bwo kugurisha leta nkuru. [4] Yatanze kandi ishyirwaho rya komite izwi ku izina rya komite ishinzwe kugura ibicuruzwa bikozwe n\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, yari yashyizeho abanyamuryango bahagarariye amashami atandukanye ya leta ndetse n\u2019abenegihugu. [5]\nUruganda rw\u2019igihugu rw\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona (NIB) rwashyizweho nk\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu ku ya 10 Kanama mu mwaka 1938, kandi washinzwe biturutse ku itegeko rya Javits-Wagner-O'Day (JWOD). NIB ifasha guhuza amabwiriza no gutanga amabwiriza mu mahugurwa atandukanye kubafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Perezida wa mbere wa NIB ni Chester C. Kleber, wagize uwo mwanya kugeza mu mwaka 1960. [9]\nNyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, Komite ishinzwe kugura ibicuruzwa byakozwe n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona yemeje ko NIB igomba gutangira kugurisha ku masoko y\u2019ubucuruzi. [10] Mu mwaka 1952, NIB yashyizeho izina ry'ikirango, Skilcraft, ryakoze ikirango kimwe kandi gishimangira ubwiza bw'ibicuruzwa. [12] Izina ry'ikirango kandi ryemereye isosiyete kurushaho gushobora kwaguka ku masoko y'ubucuruzi. \nKugeza mu mwaka 1960, NIB yari ifite amahugurwa 62 yishamikiyeho. [12] Mu mwaka 1970, abakozi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona b'abirabura bagiye mu myigaragambyo ku ruganda rwa Skilcraft i Greensboro, muri Karoline y'Amajyaruguru, bavuga ko akazi gakomeye,ni ivangura n'umushahara muto.\nMu 1971, Senateri Jacob Javits yashyizeho amategeko yongerera iki gikorwa \"abantu bafite ubumuga bukomeye\". [15] JWOD kandi yahaye amahugurwa abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona \"imyaka itanu y'ibanze kumasezerano ya serivisi\". [16] JWOD yashyizeho kandi komite, ishinzwe kugura abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa abamugaye cyane. Iyi komite yabaga igizwe n\u2019abanyamuryango 15 bashyirwaho na perezida, buri muntu ku giti cye akaba ahagarariye ibigo bitandukanye bya leta. [15] Komite kandi yari ifite ingengo y'imari, nkuko byasobanuwe na JWOD. [16]\nKomite ishinzwe kugura yashyizeho NIB n\u2019inganda z\u2019igihugu z\u2019abafite ubumuga bukomeye (NISH) kuba imiryango ibiri yo hagati, idaharanira inyungu ihuza ibikorwa bya leta n\u2019imiryango amagana yigenga ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa abamugaye cyane. [17]\nKugeza mu mwaka 1998, hari ibigo 85 byari bifitanye isano na NIB. \nIbicuruzwa by'ubuhanga.\nIbicuruzwa bya mbere byakozwe muri gahunda ni mope na sima byo gusukura ibiro bya leta. Guverinoma ya federasiyo yatanze amadorari agera ku 220.000 y\u2019amasezerano mu mahugurwa 36 yo gukora mope na sima. [20] Kugeza mu mwaka 1939, NIB yagiye igurisha imisego, isuku, hamwe na matela y'umuryango. [21]\nNyuma, amakaramu n'ibikoresho byo mu biro byatangijwe. NIB yari guha leta amakaramu miliyoni 70 mu mwaka wa 1969. [23] Ikaramu ifite ibyo isabwa bimwe, birimo ubushobozi bwo \"kwandika ubudahwema kilometero imwe no mu bushyuhe bugera kuri dogere 160 no munsi ya dogere 40 munsi ya zeru.\" Amasezerano yikaramu yafashije guhanga imirimo kubakozi bashya 125 bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Kugeza mu mwaka 2014, kugurisha amakaramu byageze kuri miliyoni eshanu z'amadolari, hamwe 60% byaguzwe n'abasirikare ba Amerika. \nMu mwaka 1990, hari ibintu 400 bitandukanye byongewe kurutonde rw'ibintu byakozwe. [25] Muri 2015, Skilcraft yazanye umurongo mushya wibicuruzwa birimo screwdrivers na sock wrenches. \nUyu munsi, izina rya Skilcraft rikubiyemo ibicuruzwa birenga 3.500 birimo ibikoresho byo mu biro, ibikoresho by'isuku, imyenda ya iniforume, n'ibikoresho byo bohereza mu bitaro. Skilcraft kandi ifite serivisi, nko guhamagara byoroshye, hashingiwe ku masezerano ku bigo bya leta. \nGukoresha abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona.\nHafi ya 70% by'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona muri Amerika bafite imyaka yo gukora ni abashomeri. Kubasha gukora bituma abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bashobora kwibeshaho kandi bashobora gufasha abandi. Ubucuruzi bwa Skilcraft bufasha gukoresha Abanyamerika barenga 5.000 batabona bakorera ibigo byaho muri leta 44. Abashoramari bakora ikirango cya Skilcraft, nka Lighthouse kubatabona barashobora guhemba abakozi babo hagati y $ 8 na $ 12 kumasaha, batanga ubwishingizi bwubuzima hamwe na 401 (k)."}
{"id": "17907", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17907", "title": "Reading machine", "text": "Imashini yo gusoma y'abafite ubumuga n'igice cya tekinoroji ifasha ituma abafite ubumuga babona ibikoresho byandika. Isikana inyandiko, ihindura ishusho mu myandiko ikoresheje uburyo bwo kumenya imiterere ya optique kandi ikoresha synthesizer yo kuvuga kugira ngo isome ibyo yabonye.\nIterambere.\nPorotipi ya mbere y'imashini yo gusoma, yitwa optophone, yakozwe na Dr. Edmund Edward Fournier d'Albe wo muri kaminuza ya Birmingham mu mwaka 1913. Fotodetekeri eshanu zahagaritswe zikoreshwa mu gusikana umurongo winyandiko zacapwe. Buri selile yabyaye amajwi atandukanye (G, C, D, E, G8) mu gihe habonetse icapiro ryirabura, ku buryo buri nyuguti yahujwe n'igihe cyihariye gitandukanya amajwi. Hamwe n'imyitozo imwe, abakoresha abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bashoboye gusobanura aya majwi nk'ubutumwa bufite ireme. Nyamara, umuvuduko wo gusoma wiki gikoresho watinze cyane (hafi ijambo rimwe k'umunota). \nKuva mu mwaka 1944 kugeza mu myaka ya za 70, hakozwe prototypes nshya y'imashini yo gusoma muri Laboratoire ya Haskins ku masezerano yatanzwe n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019abasirikare. Umushinga w'ubushakashatsi wakozwe na Caryl Parker Haskins, Franklin S. Cooper na Alvin Liberman. Kugerageza kwabo kwa mbere kunoza optophone byose byarangiye binaniwe cyangwa bitsinzwe, kandi abakoresha ntibashoboye gusoma amagambo arenga 5 k'umunota ugereranije, nubwo nyuma y'imyitozo ndende. Iri genzura ryatumye Liberman atekereza ko imipaka yari iy'ubwenge aho kuba tekiniki, no gushyiraho igitekerezo cye cya moteri yo kumva imvugo. Yatahuye ko ikimenyetso cy'ijambo kitigeze cyumvikana nk \"\" inyuguti \"cyangwa\" cipher \"acoustic, ariko ahubwo byari\" code \"yerekana ibimenyetso bigaragaza imvugo, kubera guhuza ibitekerezo. Kubw'ibyo, imashini yo gusoma ntishobora guhindura gusa inyuguti zacapwe muruhererekane rw'amajwi avangitiranye, ahubwo ishobora kumenya inyuguti no gutanga amajwi y'imvugo nk'ibisohoka ukoresheje cyangwa ugaragaje imvugo ikomatanya.\nImashini ya mbere yo gusoma y'ubucuruzi bw'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona yakozwe na (Kurzweil Computer Productsnyuma yaguzwe na Xerox Corporation) mu mwaka 1975. Walter Cronkite yakoresheje iyi mashini kugira ngo yumve umukono we, \"Kandi uko ni ko bimeze, ku ya 13 Mutarama mu mwaka 1976.\" \nMu myaka ya za 1960 rwagati, Francis F. Lee yinjiye mu itsinda rya Dr. Samuel Jefferson Mason 'Cognitive Information Processing Group' muri Laboratoire y\u2019ubushakashatsi ya Electronics mu kigo cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga cya Massachusetts kugira ngo bakore imashini isoma y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabo, sisitemu ya mbere yari gusikana inyandiko kandi utange imvugo y'ikomezo. Imashini zo gusoma neza zari zishingiye kumeza kandi ari ndende, wasangaga mu bitabo, mu mashuri, no mu bitaro cyangwa ugasanga byari bifite abakire. Mu mwaka 2009, terefone igendanwa ikoresha Kurzweil Ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona ni sofutiweya ikora nk'imashini yo gusoma. "}
{"id": "17908", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17908", "title": "Sisitemu ya Telesensory", "text": "Telesensory Systems Ibicuruzwa bya TSI byafashaga abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gukora mu bwigenge hamwe na mudasobwa hamwe n'ibikoresho bisanzwe byacapwe.\nAmateka.\nOptacon, Igicuruzwa cya mbere cya TSI, yatekerejwe na Porofeseri w\u2019amashanyarazi John G. Linvill nk'uburyo umukobwa we ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona, Candy, yasomaga ibyanditswe bisanzwe. Iterambere rya Optacon, riyobowe na James C. Bliss, ryitabiriwe n\u2019abashakashatsi n\u2019abahanga benshi muri kaminuza ya Stanford no mu kigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Stanford (ubu ni SRI International) guhera mu mwaka wa 1962. Nyuma yo kwerekana neza prototype ikora mu mwaka 1969, TSI yashinzwe mu mwaka 1970 i Palo Alto, California, USA. TSI yateje imbere umurongo w'ibicuruzwa by'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona mu myaka ya za 70, kandi yaguka mu cyerekezo gito mu mwaka wa 1984.\nIbicuruzwa bya TSI ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona hakoresheje uburyo bworoshye bwo kumva amakuru, ibicuruzwa byayo byo kureba byazamutse byiyongera ubunini no gutandukanya ibikoresho byacapwe cyangwa amashusho ya mudasobwa. Ibicuruzwa bimwe bya TSI byari bigizwe na software gusa, ariko ibyinshi byari bikenewe n'ibyuma bya elegitoroniki byabugenewe.\nMu myaka mirongo itatu n'itanu TSI yatanze ibikoresho bifasha bya elegitoronike ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona ku isi. Ni mu gihe kimwe tekinoroji ya mudasobwa yateye imbere kandi sisitemu yo gukoresha mudasobwa yatangiye gushyiramo uburyo bworoshye burimo nko gusoma imvugo igaragara kunsakaza mashusho cyangwa gukuza k'ubusa cyangwa kuba ntakiguzi. Ubwo yari amaze guhindura izina ayita \"TeleSensory\", isosiyete yerekeje ibitekerezo byayo ku bicuruzwa bitagaragara kandi yahagaritse gukora ibicuruzwa bitabona mu ntangiriro ya za 90.\nMuri Werurwe,mu mwaka 2005, TeleSensory yahoze ari TSI, yatangaje mu buryo butunguranye igice cya 7 cyari mumadeni gihomba kandi abakozi bayo bose baherekejwe bavanwa mu nyubako. \nMuri Kanama mu mwaka wa 2005, InSiPhil (S) Pte Ltd yo muri Singapuru m'Ubuhinde yaguze umutungo w\u2019ubwenge wa TeleSensory hamwe n\u2019umutungo usigaye maze ikomeza gukora bimwe mu bicuruzwa bitagaragara neza ku izina n\u2019ikirango cya TeleSensory. Kuva mu ntangiriro zo mu mwaka wa 2010, ibyo bicuruzwa biboneka henshi hatandukanye nko mu bihugu 50."}
{"id": "17909", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17909", "title": "Domo (robot)", "text": "Domo ni yubushakashatsi yakozwe na yagenewe gukorana. Ubwonko bwa Jeff Weber na Aaron Edsinger, abanditsi ba, izina ryayo rikomoka ku mvugo y\u2019ikiyapani ngo \"urakoze cyane\", \"domo arigato\", ndetse n'indirimbo ya, \" \". Umushinga Domo watewe inkunga na, ubu wifatanije na Toyota mu gutera inkunga robot. \nIntego.\nDomo yaremewe kugirango igerageze imiyoboro myinshi ya robo namabwiriza bigoye cyane.\nInkomoko.\nInzu yumushinga wa Domo iri hamwe nitsinda ryimashini za Robo ya Humanoid muri MIT Artific Intelligence Labs. Kubaho kwayo byatewe n'imishinga ya robo yaje mbere yayo.\nUmushinga wa Robo ya Cardea wari umushinga wubushakashatsi uyobowe na Porofeseri mu itsinda ry\u2019imashini za Humanoid muri MIT. Itsinda rya laboratoire ryakoze gukora umugozi-utwara amashanyarazi utagira shitingi ya Elastic Actuator ukuboko kwashyizwe kumurongo wa Segway. Jeff Weber na Aaron Edsinger-Gonzales bagize uruhare muri ubu bushakashatsi, bashinzwe cyane cyane gushushanya no gushyira mu bikorwa ukuboko kwa robo. Ubu bufatanye bwatumye Edsinger-Gonzales na Weber bakora ubushakashatsi bumwe na bumwe babukoresha kuri robot nshya, Domo.\nEdsinger na Weber bakoranye no ku zindi robo nyinshi, kandi uburambe bwabo bwo gukorana nurupapuro rwa hamwe na byagize ingaruka ku gishushanyo cya Domo. Kismet yari umutwe wa robo wakozwe na kugirango ugerageze imvugo mbonezamubano. Uruhare rwa Edsinger muri uyu mushinga kwari ugufasha guteza imbere icyiciro cya mbere cya Kismet cyo kumenya amaso, cyemerera Kismet guhuza amaso mu gihe cyo gukorana. Umushinga wa Cog wari ugamije gucukumbura uburyo ubwenge bukorwa binyuze mubusabane. Imashini ya Cog yagenewe kwigana ingingo z'umubiri z'umubiri hamwe n'ingingo z'umubiri ndetse no kwakira ibitera imbaraga biva muri ibyo kugirango ishobore gukoresha ingingo zayo muburyo busa n'abantu. Umusanzu wa Edsinger mu mushinga wa Cog wari urukurikirane rwa Elastic Actuator hamwe nubugenzuzi bwumubiri wa robo. Nubwo icyerekezo cyubushakashatsi bwizi robo gitandukanye cyane nu mushinga wa Domo, igishushanyo mbonera cyerekana amaso hamwe na Series Elastic Actuator ukuboko byinjijwe mubishushanyo bya Domo. \nIgishushanyo.\nDomo yaremewe murwego rwo gukora ubushakashatsi kuri manipulation no gukorana nogukangura no kwiga imashini yubuhanga bwa sensorimotor. Kugirango ibyo bigerweho, igishushanyo cyasabwaga gutekereza cyane kuburyo robot yashobora guhura nibitekerezo bitamenyerewe. Ubushakashatsi bwasabye kandi Domo kugira ngo abashe kumenya no gukora ku bidukikije. Guhaza izo mpungenge bivuze ko Domo yari akeneye kuba ashoboye gukora adafite icyitegererezo cyuzuye cyisi, ahubwo, yari ifite ubushobozi bwo kwiyubakira icyitegererezo. \nIbice bya mashini.\nUmutwe.\nUmutwe wa robo ya Domo ugizwe na kumutwe wo hejuru ufatanye nijosi hamwe na dogere ebyiri zubwisanzure. Hano hari amaso abiri, buri kimwe gifite kamera imwe yagutse. Kamera zirashobora gufata amashusho kuri 640 \u00d7 480 kuri 30 (ikadiri / s) cyangwa 1024 \u00d7 768 kuri 15 frame / s. Kamera zombi zihengamye ku ntera imwe y\u2019ubwisanzure, ariko zifite urwego rwubwisanzure bwo kwemerera panne yigenga. Igice cyijisho kirimo gukoreshwa kugirango ugaragaze imvugo. \nImitwe ya robo zabanjirije iyi, nka Cog, zabangamiwe n'umugozi w'insinga z'amashanyarazi zagendaga kuri kamera y'amaso na moteri. Igishushanyo cya Domo gikoresha insinga zose zinyuze mu ijosi kugirango zive mu nzira. Ibi bituma Domo atandukana cyane nubwisanzure mumutwe.\nKugenda mumutwe byoroherezwa na. Imyanya yumwanya wa muri moteri itanga ibitekerezo kubyerekeranye numutwe uhagaze neza mugitangira, Domo rero ntisaba gahunda ya kalibrasi mbere yo gukora.\nIntego nyamukuru yibanze kumutwe kwari ukugira ngo Domo abashe kwigana ijisho ryabantu. Amaso yumuntu atandukana cyane cyane kandi aturika kugeza kugenda buhoro kandi neza kugirango akurikire ibintu bitera imbaraga, bityo rero byari bikenewe ko harebwa ubwitonzi kugirango dushushanye umutwe wa Domo. \nAya maso ahujwe na sisitemu yo kumenya ni ihuriro ryimashini ya Linux. Porogaramu ya software ya (Yongeyeho Ubundi buryo bwa Robo) ikoreshwa muri sisitemu yo kumenya gukora gutunganya amashusho. \nIntwaro.\nAho gushushanya amaboko ya Domo kugira ngo asobanuke neza, Edsinger na Weber bateguye amaboko kugira ngo bakore cyane nk'ay'umuntu. Intwaro zabantu zifite ubuhanga bwo kumva no kugenzura imbaraga kuri buri rugingo, zireka neza neza kugirango zubahirizwe. Guhindura ibi kuri robot ya humanoid byasabye igishushanyo cyo gushyiramo kwihanganira no kubahiriza kuri buri rugingo mugihe nanone ubasha gukurikirana no gusohora umuriro.\nAmaboko ya Domo afite dogere esheshatu zubwisanzure, ebyiri ku rutugu na bane mu kuboko no mu kuboko. Ihuriro ni Series ya elastike ikora (SEA) itwarwa na moteri ya DC idafite amashanyarazi. Impamyabumenyi zubwisanzure zirimo sisitemu yo gutwara kabili, hamwe ninsinga zo gutwara zihishe ubushishozi hagati yingingo kugirango bitabangamira kugenda. Imikorere ya elastike ikoreshwa mugutanga imbaraga-zumva imbaraga kubiganza. Rukuruzi rwinjijwe mumaboko yose ihujwe na sisitemu yo kumenya. \nAmaboko.\nIgishushanyo cyamaboko ya humanoid kirasabwa gushyiramo uburyo bumwe bwo gupima no gusohora imbaraga. Ibishushanyo bike bishaje byari bifite sensor sensor zintoki. Mugihe ibi byakorera mubidukikije bizwi, ntabwo bitanga ibitekerezo bihagije byo gukora mubitabo kandi bitazwi. Abagenzuzi bari mumaboko ya Domo bashoboye kumva imbaraga kumutwe umwe. Ibi bituma amaboko akora gufata ikintu nubwo nta cyitegererezo cyubunini bwikintu, imiterere cyangwa ibikoresho.\nBuri kiganza kigizwe nintoki eshatu zikoreshwa na moteri enye. Hariho icyuma kimwe kuri buri rutoki naho icya kane ni ukugenzura ikwirakwizwa hagati yintoki ebyiri. Intoki zombi zirakwirakwizwa hakoreshejwe ibikoresho, mugihe icya gatatu kiguma mu mwanya. \nUbushobozi.\nDomo izahuza nibidukikije igerageza imiterere yumubiri yibintu ubikoraho cyangwa ubinyeganyeza. Mubushobozi bwayo harimo kumenya ingano yikintu, gushyira ibintu kumasahani, gusuka abantu ibinyobwa, guhana ibiganza, no guhobera. \nImyumvire.\nUkoresheje kamera ebyiri zashyizwe kumutwe wacyo hamwe na sisitemu yo gutunganya amashusho, Domo arashobora gusesengura ingano nuburyo imiterere yikintu kugirango yitegure imikoranire. Ibi bikorwa nta bumenyi bwambere bwerekeye ikintu kandi butuma Domo akora imirimo mubidukikije bitazwi.\nKwiga.\nUbwubatsi bwa Domo butuma robot yibuka ibyabaye mbere. Domo ishoboye kwiga kubyerekeye ubushobozi bwayo bwa sensorimotor kandi irashobora guhuza neza modulisiyo yibikorwa byayo ishingiye kubikorwa byakozwe mbere.\nGukoresha.\nAmaboko ya Domo yari yarakozwe muburyo buteye ubwoba kandi bushobora gufata ibintu byinshi bitandukanye. Ariko, ibi ntibishobora kugerwaho hatabayeho gushushanya sisitemu ya software kugirango ibe umuhanga mu gucunga abagenzuzi batandukanye kuri buri ngingo. Ibi bituma robot ibasha gukora vuba no guhindura ibikorwa byamaboko. Ibi nibyingenzi kugirango robot ibashe kugerageza gukora imirimo nyayo yisi."}
{"id": "17910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17910", "title": "EEVE", "text": "EEVE nisosiyete yububiligi itezimbere kandi ikora.\nKuva yashingwa muri 2017, EEVE yakoresheje amazina abiri yandi: AIRobots (2017) na Toadi Order (2018\u20132020). \n bya EEVE, robot itagira ibyatsi itagira ibyatsi Willow, ni robot ishoboye guca nyakatsi no, ifite ubushobozi bwo guha ibikoresho byongeweho kandi ikora gusa mubyerekezo bya mudasobwa. Willow yatangijwe muri Amerika binyuze mu bukangurambaga bwa muri 2020 hamwe no kumenyekanisha ibintu hamwe n\u2019umutekano. Ikizamini cya mbere cya robot cyatanzwe muri Amerika cyabaye mu 2023. \nKugerageza hakiri kare ibisubizo byubusa ni Ambrogio na Husqvarna cyari igisubizo gishingiye kuri RTK cyagenewe ahantu hanini. "}
{"id": "17911", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17911", "title": "Robomow", "text": "Robomow (izwi kandi ku izina rya Robo Yinshuti) ni uruganda zangiza. Isosiyete yashinzwe na, muri Isiraheli mu 1995 na Udi Peless na Shai Abramson, iyi sosiyete itanga ibyatsi bya robo muri Amerika no mu Burayi, ibiciro bikaba kuva ku magana kugeza ku bihumbi by'amadorari / Euro. Imashini za robomow zirashobora kwishyurwa, zangiza ibidukikije zagenewe kubahiriza ibipimo byumutekano byose. Robomow izana kandi (porogaramu ya Robomow) yo kugenzura kure no guhuza ibikorwa. Isosiyete yavuzwe mu binyamakuru byinshi birimo:, Washington Home na Garden na. Muri Gicurasi 2017, Inc yatangaje ko ifite intego yo kugura Imashini za Robo. Muri Nyakanga 2017, yatangaje ko irangije kugura Robomow. \nAmateka.\nImashini za robotic.\nUbusanzwe Robomow yiswe 'Imashini zinshuti' agamije kubaka robot zizakora, nkuko Udi Peless abivuga muri Space Daily, \"kwimuka no kuzenguruka urugo, ukora imirimo ya mundane abantu badakunda gukora\". \nUmunyamideli wa Robomow Classic yerekanwe bwa mbere mu imurikagurisha rya GLEE ryabereye i, mu Bwongereza mu 1997 kandi yari 'se' w\u2019umunyamideli w\u2019inshuti za mbere. Iyi moderi ya Classic yatangijwe kugurishwa mu 1998, igurisha hafi 4000 hagati ya 1998 na 2001.\nIzina ryisosiyete ryahinduwe kuri Friendly Robotics mu 1999. \nMu 2000, igisekuru cya kabiri cyimashini za robo zahageze: urubuga rwa Robomow 'RL'. Ugereranije na Robomow Classic, Robomow RL yari iteye imbere, ntoya, yoroshye kandi igaragara cyane kubakoresha. Ibindi byongeweho harimo Sitasiyo ya Base, ifasha abayikoresha gukora progaramu yo guca nyakatsi.\nMuri 2008, umurongo wibicuruzwa bya Robomow 'RM' watangiye bwa mbere nkigisekuru cya gatatu cyimashini za robotic. Gitoya, yoroshye na verisiyo nziza yumurongo wa RL, RM yateguwe byumwihariko kumurima muto, kugeza ubu, yari yarirengagijwe.\nMuri 2011, Robomow yerekanye umurongo wa 'RED' umurongo wa Robomow; umuto kandi muto ugereranije igiciro cyimikorere ya RL na RM. Izi moderi zari kandi ziracyagurishwa kumurongo wa na, ndetse no kuri enterineti.\nUmwaka wa 2013 havutse umurongo wibicuruzwa bya Robomow 'RS', igisekuru cya kane cyimashini za robo.\nMuri 2014, Robomow yerekanye igisekuru cyayo cya gatanu cyimashini za robo: imiterere ya 'RC'. Izi mashini zagenewe ibyatsi bigera kuri m2 1200 kandi birashobora gutegurwa byuzuye binyuze muri porogaramu ya Robomow.\nImashini zangiza imyanda.\nMu 2002, na Friendly Robotics batangaje ubufatanye bufatika mugutezimbere. Kugeza 2004, moderi yambere, Nshuti Vac RV400, yari ku isoko. Gupima ibiro 23, nicyo kintu kinini gisukura robot mubihe byose. Nyamara, uyu murongo wibicuruzwa warahagaritswe, kandi isosiyete ubu yibanda gusa kumashini yimashini.\nGutema.\nModeri zose za Robomow zigezweho zirashobora guca nyakatsi imbere yikibanza cyagumye mu nsi yo munsi yubutaka, amashanyarazi. Umugozi ushyizwe hafi yikibanza cyo gutema ukoresheje inyundo hamwe nuduti munsi yubuso. Ibyatsi bidatinze bitwikiriye insinga kugirango bitagaragara. Iyo uduce tumwe na tumwe tutagomba gutemwa, 'ibirwa' birashobora gushirwaho mugukomeza imigozi ibiri y'insinga z'amashanyarazi hamwe no gukora uduce twimbere.\nGutema Robomow akora iyobowe na algorithm yayo igenda, itagororotse hejuru no hepfo. Kubwibyo, nubwo nta murongo wo gutema gakondo ushobora kugaragara, Robomow itwikiriye akarere kose ko gutema mubikorwa bike. Hagati ya mows, bateri ya mower yongeye kwishyurwa kuri sitasiyo ya docking / kwishyuza igaruka mu buryo bwikora.\nIcyitegererezo cya Robomow.\nRC / MC: izi moderi zifite 28 cm ubugari buhuye nibyatsi byose bigera kuri 1200m2. Bashobora gushyirwaho hanze ya nyakatsi kubera kutabangamira imikoreshereze isanzwe ya nyakatsi.\nRS / MS: izi moderi zifite 56cm gukata ubugari bushigikiwe na 28 28cm icyuma, kibereye ibyatsi byose bigera kuri 3500m2."}
{"id": "17912", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17912", "title": "Dustbot", "text": "Dustbot yari prototype yakusanyaga imyanda mumazu no mumihanda. Irashobora guhamagarwa no guhamagara kuri terefone cyangwa, hanyuma igakoresha kugirango ihite igana inzira kubakiriya, gukusanya imyanda, no kuyijyana mu mukungugu. Byongeye kandi, Dustbots yatwaye ibyuma byangiza ibidukikije kugirango ikurikirane urugero rw\u2019umwanda, urugero, agace k\u2019abanyamaguru. Prototypes zapimwe mu Butaliyani, muri Suwede, muri no mu Buyapani. Launch yari iteganijwe muri 2009, ariko iheruka gukoreshwa kurubuga rwayo kuva 2011. Umushinga wa Dustbot watewe inkunga na kandi ntabwo wigeze utangiza nkibicuruzwa. \nTekiniki.\nDustbot ikoresha ahantu hatandukanye kandi ikoresha inzira ihujwe namakarita yabanje kwipakurura. Ikoresha kugirango igumane neza, kandi ifite sensor ya ultrasonic, infragre na laser kugirango wirinde kugongana nimbogamizi zihamye kandi zifite imbaraga. \nIrashobora gukurikirana umwanda ikoresheje ibyuma byinshi byangiza ikirere, kandi irashobora kuburira niba urwego ruri hejuru cyane. Ibi ni ingenzi cyane cyane kubijyanye na gaze abantu badashobora kumva cyangwa mugihe hagomba kugenzurwa igihe kirekire guhura nubushakashatsi bwiyongereyeho gato. Ikwirakwizwa rya gaze ryerekanwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwibarurishamibare. \nImashini ebyiri za DustCart zoherejwe mu mudugudu wa Peccioli, muri Tuscany, kuva ku ya 15 Kamena 2010, kugeza ku ya 7 Kanama 2010, zitanga \"urugi ku nzu gukusanya imyanda itandukanye bisabwe\". Sisitemu wasangaga yoroshye kuyikoresha, itanga serivisi ishimishije no kongera gutunganya ibicuruzwa. Raporo yakozwe na Nicola Canelli yerekanye mu nama y'Inama ya ICT 2010 yabereye i Bruxelles, ku ya 27 Nzeri, 2010. Guhera ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 2017, umushinga urasa naho warangiye; haracyariho, urupapuro rwa Dustbot ruri kumurongo kugeza nuyu munsi, ivugurura \"amakuru\" yanyuma bigaragara ko ryakozwe muri 2011. Hariho kandi ibyerekeranye n'umushinga mu kiganiro cyatanzwe na Paolo Dario mu mahugurwa mpuzamahanga yerekeye Autonomics and Legal Implications (Berlin, 2 Ugushyingo 2012). "}
{"id": "17913", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17913", "title": "Google TalkBack", "text": "Google Talkback ni serivisi kuri sisitemu y'imikorere ifasha abakoresha impumyi n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gukorana n'ibikoresho byabo. Ikoresha amagambo yavuzwe, kunyeganyega nibindi bitekerezo byumvikana kugirango yemere uyikoresha kumenya ibibera kuri ecran yemerera uyikoresha gukorana neza nibikoresho byabo. Serivisi yashyizwe mbere mubikoresho byinshi bya Android, kandi yabaye igice cya Android Accessibility Suite muri 2017. Nk\u2019uko Google Play y'Ububiko ibivuga, Suite ya Android Accessibility Suite imaze gukururwa inshuro zirenga miriyari eshanu, harimo n'ibikoresho bifite suite yabanjirije. \nGufungura-isoko.\nGoogle yasohoye kode yinkomoko ya Google TalkBack hamwe nibisohoka bimwe na bimwe bya serivisi igera kuri, hamwe nimpinduka ziheruka kuba kuva ku ya 6 Gicurasi 2021. Inkomoko yiyi verisiyo ya Google TalkBack yasohotse munsi ya Apache uruhushya rwa 2.0. "}
{"id": "17914", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17914", "title": "JAWS Scripting Language", "text": "Ururimi rwa JAWS (JSL) ni imikoranire ya porogaramu yo gusoma ya (Job Access With Speech) kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona nibindi. Ni ururimi rwegeranijwe, rwemerera kurinda inkomoko yo kurinda. \"JAWS scripting\" mubisanzwe bivuga guhinduranya ibintu byubatswe, ukoresha-ukoresha ibikoresho bya JAWS no guhindura amadosiye yabyo, ndetse no kwandika inyandiko zumwimerere. JSL ikora nka API (porogaramu yo gutangiza porogaramu) kandi yemerera abakoresha guhuza inyandiko ya JAWS, inyandiko scripting, hamwe ninyandiko. "}
{"id": "17915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17915", "title": "OutSpoken", "text": "OutSpoken (styled outSPOKEN) yari umwe ba mbere baboneka kubucuruzi (GUI). Udushya twagaragaye cyane ni ugukoresha hamwe nimbeba yerekana nkindorerezi. Inyandiko y'umwimerere ya Macintosh yanditswe na na Bruce Berkhalter muri. OutSpoken yasohotse bwa mbere kuri Macintosh mu 1989, kandi niyo yasomye ecran yonyine yigeze kuboneka kuri Macintosh mbere ya. OutSpoken ya yasohotse muri 1994 kuri Windows 3.1, kandi yamenyekanye cyane nkumwe mubasoma ecran ya mbere ikora neza kuri Windows. OutSpoken ya Windows yatunganijwe cyane cyane na Ben Drees na Peter Korn, hamwe nu gishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019abakoresha cyakozwe na Marc Sutton na.\n yagurishije OutSpoken hamwe nindi mitungo yayo yose igera kuri Alva Access Group yo mu Buholandi mu 1996. Muri Nzeri 2005, Optelec yaguze umutungo wa ALVA BV., isosiyete ikuru ya ALVA Access Group. "}
{"id": "17916", "revid": "9834", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17916", "title": "Projection Keyboard", "text": "Projection ya clavier n'uburyo bw'igikoresho cyinjiza mudasobwa aho ishusho ya clavier isanzwe iteganijwe hejuru, iyo umukoresha akoresha ku buso butwikiriwe n'ishusho y'urufunguzo, igikoresho gikoresha urufunguzo cyandika. Bamwe bahuza ibikoresho bya Bluetooth, harimo byinshi bya terefone igezweho, tablet, hamwe na mini-PC hamwe na sisitemu y'imikorere ya Android, iOS cyangwa na Windows.\nAmateka.\nMwandikisho ya y'insakazamashusho yahimbwe kandi ihabwa patenti naba injeniyeri ba IBM mu mwaka 1992. Ihitamo neza inasesengura imigendekere y'intoki z'abantu, ikanabisobanura nk'ibikorwa ku gikoresho cy'injiza kidahari nk'ubuso bufite urufunguzo rusize irangi cyangwa rugaragazwa. Muri ubwo buryo, irashobora kwigana ubwoko butagira imipaka bw'ibikoresho byinjiza intoki (nk'imbeba, clavier, n'ibindi bikoresho). Ibikoresho byinjiza bishobora gusimburwa nibikoresho nkibi, birashoboka ko byashyirwa mu bikorwa bya porogaramu yihariye no kuri physiologiya y'umukoresha, bikomeza umuvuduko, ubworoherane, hamwe no kudasobanuka kw'amakuru winjiza.\nMu mwaka 2002, isosiyete yatangije Canesta yakoze clavier ya projection ikoresheje \"tekinoroji ya elegitoroniki.\" Isosiyete yaje guha ikoranabuhanga Celluon yo muri Koreya. \nNi sisitemu yatanzwe bitwa P-ISM ihuza ikoranabuhanga na progaramu ntoya ya videwo yo gutangiza cyangwa gukora mudasobwa igendanwa ingana n'ikaramu ya fountain. \nIgishushanyo.\nLaser cyangwa beamer imishinga igaragara ya clavier igaragara k'urwego rwo hejuru. Nibikoresho bigezweho. Rukuruzi cyangwa kamera m'umushinga ufata urutoki. Porogaramu ihindura imirongo kugira ngo imenye ibikorwa cyangwa inyuguti. \nIbikoresho bimwe byerekana isegonda (itagaragara ya infragre) hejuru ya clavier isanzwe. Urutoki rw'umukoresha rukora k'urufunguzo kuri mwandikisho isanzwe. Ibi bimena cyangwa rukananiza urumuri rwa infrared kandi bikagaragaza urumuri rugaruka k'umushinga cyangwa kugikorwa nyirizina. Ikigaragaza urwo rumuri kinyura muyungurura ya infragre kuri kamera. Kamera ifotora inguni y'umucyo winjira. Chip ya sensor igena aho urumuri rwa infragre rwacitse. Porogaramu igena ibikorwa cyangwa imiterere igomba gukorwa.\nIgishushanyo kiboneka mu ntambwe enye zingenzi kandi binyuze m'uburyo butatu, module ya projection, sensor module na illumination module. Ibikoresho by'ingenzi n'ubuhanga bukoreshwa m'ugushushanya ishusho n'ibintu bitandukanya, diode itukura ya laser, chip ya sensor ya CMOS hamwe na diode ya infragre (IR).\nIcyitegererezo.\nInyandiko rugero yakozwe na progaramu idasanzwe kandi ikora neza cyane ya projection hamwe na laser itukura ya diode hejuru y'imbere. Inyandiko rugero ntabwo ariko igira uruhare mubikorwa byo gutahura.\nUbundi buryo.\nUsibye gukoreshwa gusa kugira ngo wandike, sisitemu zimwe na zimwe za lazeri zirashobora gukora nk'imbeba isanzwe ikoreshwa na mudasobwa cyangwa ndetse nka piyano isanzwe, nka iKeybo iterwa inkunga n'abantu. "}
{"id": "17917", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17917", "title": "WebAnywhere", "text": "Urubuga Ahantu hose ni, rwakozwe muri.\nIbirango.\nKubera ko Urubuga Ahantu hose rushingiye kurubuga, iraboneka kuri sisitemu zose zikora. Abakoresha bajya gusa kurubuga rwahantu hose kandi atangira gukora.\nAmakuru.\nUrubuga Ahantu hose rwakozwe mbere muri. Kuri ubu irimo gutezwa imbere muri Laboratwari."}
{"id": "17918", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17918", "title": "Noctograph", "text": "Noctografi nigikoresho kigizwe nimpapuro munsi yacyo hifashishijwe ya wino ya printer hamwe nicyapa cyuma gifite clips kugirango ufate impapuro mumabwiriza hamwe nubuyobozi bwo gukora byanditse mwijimye. Umukoresha yanditse hamwe na yicyuma, bityo ntagomba gusiga ikaramu cyangwa guhangayikishwa no gukubita inkingi hejuru.\nIntego yambere yari iyo kwemerera cyangwa kwandika kwandika byoroshye kuruta gakondo, nubwo yanakoreshejwe nabarebaga neza kwandika mwumwijima. Ubusanzwe yatanzwe na mu 1806.\nReba ibindi.\n\u2014a card template of square holes invented by Lewis Carroll in 1891 to write in the dark."}
{"id": "17919", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17919", "title": "Brainport", "text": "BrainPort ni tekinoroji aho amakuru yunvikana ashobora koherezwa mubwonko bwa muntu binyuze muri electrode array yicaye kururimi. Byabanje gukorwa na mu rwego rwo gufasha abantu, cyane cyane. Bach-y-Rita yashinze \"Wicab\" mu 1998. \nYateguwe kandi kugirango ikoreshwe nkimfashanyo igaragara, yerekana ubushobozi bwayo bwo kwemerera impumyi kubona ibimukikije muburyo bwa polygonal na pigiseli. Muri iki gihe, kamera ifata ishusho yikikikije, amakuru atunganywa na chip ihindura imbaraga zoherejwe binyuze mumashanyarazi ya elegitoronike, ukoresheje ururimi, mubwonko bwumuntu. Ubwonko bwumuntu burashobora gusobanura izo mbaraga nkibimenyetso biboneka hanyuma bigahita byerekanwa kuri cortex igaragara, bigatuma umuntu \"abona.\" Ibi birasa mubice byukuntu ikora, muburyo yohereza amashanyarazi kumashanyarazi yakira mumubiri. \nKu ya Kamena 2015. Ubuvuzi bwa BrainPort V100 bwo mu kanwa bwemejwe n\u2019ubuyobozi "}
{"id": "17920", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17920", "title": "Optophone", "text": "Optophone nigikoresho, gikoreshwa nabantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, gisikana inyandiko kandi kigatanga ibihe bitandukanye byerekana amajwi kugirango bamenye inyuguti. Nibimwe mubikorwa byambere bizwi bya. Dr. wo muri kaminuza ya Birmingham yahimbye optophone mu 1913, yakoresheje amafoto ya kugira ngo amenye icapiro ry'umukara kandi ayihindure umusaruro wumvikana ushobora gusobanurwa n'impumyi. Isosiyete, yagize uruhare mu kunoza imiterere n\u2019imikoreshereze yicyo gikoresho. \nGusa ibice bike byubatswe kandi gusoma byabanje gutinda cyane; imyiyerekano mu imurikagurisha ryo mu 1918 yarimo Mary Jameson asoma ijambo rimwe kumunota. Nyuma moderi ya Optophone yemereye umuvuduko wamagambo agera kuri 60 kumunota, nubwo amasomo amwe gusa ashobora kugera kuri iki gipimo. "}
{"id": "17921", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17921", "title": "Photovoltaic retinal prosthesis", "text": "Photovoltaic retinal prosthesis ni tekinoroji yo kugarura amaso kubarwayi bahumwe nindwara zifata, nka hamwe na (AMD), mugihe abarwayi babuze 'ishusho ifata' fotorepteptors, ariko muburyo bwo gutunganya amashusho. 'Imbere ya retina ibice byabitswe neza. Iyi subretinal yashizweho kugirango igarure amaso ikoresheje amashanyarazi itera imbere ya neurone y'imbere ikiriho, cyane cyane selile bipolar. Photovoltaic retinal yatewe ntago ari simusiga rwose kandi ikoreshwa na hafi-ya-infragre (880)nm) iteganijwe kuva mubirahuri byongerewe-ukuri. Kubura insinga ya trans-scleral byoroshya cyane uburyo bwo guterwa ugereranije nibindi byatewe. Gukoresha optique ya pigiseli ya Photovoltaque ituma gupima ibimera bigera ku bihumbi bya electrode kandi bikagumana guhuza bisanzwe kwimikorere yijisho kumyumvire. Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe ku mbeba hamwe no kwangirika kwa retine bwerekanye ko iyerekwa rya prostate hamwe nimbuto ziterwa na subretinal zirinda ibintu byinshi byerekezo karemano, harimo no guhuza flicker kuri radiyo nyinshi (&gt; 20Hz), guhuza n'amashusho ahamye, antagonistic centre-ikikije organisation hamwe nincamake yumurongo wa subunits mumirima yakira, itanga imiterere ihanitse. \nIgeragezwa rya Clinical hamwe nigisekuru cya mbere cyatewe (PRIMA, Pixium Vision) gifite pigiseli 100\u03bcm yerekanaga ko abarwayi ba AMD babona inyuguti nubundi buryo bufite imiterere ijyanye nubunini bwa pigiseli. Byongeye kandi, iyerekwa rya proth\u00e8que rwagati rifatwa icyarimwe hamwe nicyerekezo gisigaye cya periferique.\nIbisekuru bizakurikiraho hamwe na pigiseli 20\u03bcm byatanze uburyo bwo gusya bujyanye nimiterere karemano yimbeba (28\u03bcm). Kugeza ubu, bene ibyo bisubizo bihanitse birimo gutezimbere retina yabantu nitsinda rya Palanker muri kaminuza ya Stanford."}
