{"id": "17923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17923", "title": "ESight", "text": "eSight nigikoresho cyubuvuzi gishobora kwambarwa kigamije kunoza icyerekezo cyimikorere yababana cyangwa. Iki gikoresho cyakozwe na sosiyete ikorera muri Kanada eSight Corp.\nAmateika.\neSight yashinzwe mu 2006 na Conrad Lewis, injeniyeri w\u2019amashanyarazi muri Kanada hamwe na bashiki bacu babiri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Icyamuteye kwari ukubaka igikoresho cyafasha bashiki be kubona, gushobora gukora no kwigenga gukora (ADLs). \nIgisekuru cya mbere cyibikoresho, eSight 1, cyasohotse mu Kwakira. Igisekuru cya kabiri, eSight 2, cyasohotse muri Gicurasi 2015 kandi kirimo ibyuma byinshi byavuguruwe, birimo, amabara meza hamwe n\u2019ibisubizo bya ecran ndetse nubuzima burebure bwa bateri. \nESight 3 yasohotse muri Gashyantare 2017. Muri Gicurasi 2017, Ikinyamakuru \"Time\" cyashyize eSight ku rutonde rwa \u201cTekinoroji Nziza ya 2017 Kugeza ubu.\u201d \nIgisekuru kiriho, eSight 4 cyasohotse mu ntangiriro za 2020.\nInyandiko.\neSight ikubiyemo amabara abiri ya HD yerekana, imwe imbere ya buri jisho, hamwe ninzira zandikirwa zijyanye nu mukoresha wihariye. Iyerekana ihuza ibice bibiri byigenga, kandi bitandukanye cyane na OLED ya ecran, 1024x768 ikemurwa hamwe na dogere 37.5 yumurima-wo-kureba. Kamera iri imbere yigikoresho ifata amashusho muri Ultra HD kuri 21.5 MP kandi ikemerera zoom zigera kuri 24x. Imikoreshereze ya eSight iragaragaza kandi HDMI na USB yinjiza, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi hamwe namakarita ya SD yakuweho."}
{"id": "17924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17924", "title": "Eyeluminati", "text": "Eyeluminati ni isosiyete yikoranabuhanga ikorera i yateje imbere umushinga na na Neeraj Saini. Binjiye muri 2015 batsindira icyiciro cyo guhanga udushya n'umushinga Manovue. Uyu ni umufasha wubwenge wubwenge muburyo bwa gants kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona busoma inyandiko yacapwe cyangwa ya digitale mu ijwi riranguruye. Ifasha kandi abantu kuzenguruka no gukoresha ikoranabuhanga rya mudasobwa. Yakomeje gutsindira igihembo cyo gutangiza 2018. Batsindiye kandi Cognitive Computing &amp; Internet of Ibintu mu gihembwe cya kane cya Yahoo Accenture Innovation Jockeys muri 2015. \nHasabwe ko Manovue ikuraho Braille ikenewe. Ihuza ubwenge bwo kureba hamwe na enterineti yibintu. "}
{"id": "17925", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17925", "title": "Remote infrared audible signage", "text": "Ikimenyetso cya kure cya infragre yumvikana (RIAS) cyakozwe (nk'ibimenyetso bivuga R), abanyamahanga, cyangwa abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, bazashobora kubona ubwoko bumwe bwamakuru aboneka binyuze mubimenyetso byanditse byanditse mubidukikije byubatswe.\nIgizwe na yohereza inshuro nyinshi verisiyo ivugwa yibiri mu kimenyetso binyuze mu itumanaho. Inyandiko ya mbere mu 1979 yiswe \"Amatara yo Kuvuga\" yazamuwe neza / igurishwa mu bucuruzi nka \"Ibimenyetso byo Kuvuga\" biri gushyirwaho ku isi.\nIkirangantego gifatanye cyangwa ibirahuri byashizwemo na IR yakira ibyerekezo byunvikana kumurongo, urumuri rwumucyo urumuri kandi rutanga umuntu mugutanga ibitekerezo byiza mugihe ikimenyetso cyerekanwe neza kandi kiri hafi.\nSisitemu yageragejwe kandi ikora neza haba mumbere ndetse ninyuma kandi ntabwo ihungabanya ibidukikije kuko imirasire ya IR itagaragara kandi icecekeye.\nIhame rya ya ryatumye habaho iterambere ryibikoresho bishobora kohereza / gutobora imiraba ya infragre muri sisitemu kuva mu itumanaho rya gisirikare binyuze muri sisitemu yo kugenzura kure kuri televiziyo na mudasobwa.\nIbipimo ngenderwaho.\nIbiranga RIAS muri kode yo muri Amerika 703.7. Ibi byavuzwe muri raporo y\u2019ikigo cy\u2019Amerika gishinzwe kwinjira ku buryo bukurikira:"}
{"id": "17926", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17926", "title": "Rehabilitation robotics", "text": "Imashini za robo zo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe ni urwego rw\u2019ubushakashatsi bugamije gusobanura no kongera ubuzima busanzwe hifashishijwe ibikoresho bya robo. Imashini za robo zisubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe zirimo iterambere ry\u2019ibikoresho bya robo bigenewe kuba byafasha imirimo itandukanye irimo iya sensorimotor (urugero: ukuboko, ikiganza, ukuguru, n'amavi), no gutegura gahunda zitandukanye zo gufasha mu mahugurwa yo kuvura, no gusuzuma imikorere ya (sensorimotor) ubushobozi bwo kwimuka k'umurwayi, robo zikoreshwa cyane nk'ibikoresho byo kuvura aho gukoresha ibikoresho bisanzwe bifasha. Gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abantu hakoreshejwe robotike muri rusange byihanganirwa akenshi n\u2019abarwayi, kandi byagaragaye ko ari umugereka mwiza cyangwa inyongera mu kuvura abantu bafite ubumuga bwa moteri y'umubiri, cyane cyane bitewe n'ubwonko.\nIncamake.\nImashini za robo zo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe zishobora gufatwa nk'ibintu byihariye by'ubuhanga bw'ibinyabuzima, hamwe n'igice cy'imikoranire y'abantu. Muri uru rwego, abaganga, abavuzi, n'aba injeniyeri bafatanya mu gufasha abarwayi gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe.\u00a0\nIntego z'ingenzi muri urwo rwego zirimo: guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga rishyirwa mu bikorwa rishobora gukoreshwa byoroshye n'abarwayi, abavuzi, n'abaganga, kuzamura imikorere y'ubuvuzi bwa muganga, no kongera ubworoherane bw'ibikorwa mubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'abarwayi.\u00a0 \nAmateka.\nInama mpuzamahanga kuri robotics yo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe iba buri myaka ibiri;inama ya mbere yabaye mu mwaka wa 1989. Inama iheruka kuba muri Kamena 2019 i Toronto, mu rwego rwa RehabWeek.\u00a0gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe hashize imyaka 20 ku barwayi bafite ibibazo by\u2019imitsi. Abantu uzasanga cyane ukoresheje robot zo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe ni bafite ubumuga cyangwa abavuzi. Igihe hashyizweho robot zo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe ntabwo zari zigamije kuba imashini zisubirana ahubwo zafashaga abantu kumenya ibintu binyuze mukoraho no ku bantu bafite ikibazo cyimitsi. Imashini zo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe zikoreshwa mu buryo bwo kwisubiraho kw\u2019abafite ubumuga bahagaze, baringaniza kandi bagenda. Izi robo zigomba kugendana n'umuntu n'igikorwa cyazo, kubwibyo rero mugukora imashini abayikora bagomba kumenya neza ko izahuza niterambere ry'umurwayi. Imirimo myinshi itoroshye ishyirwa mubishushanyo kuko robot izakorana n'abantu bafite ubumuga kandi ntibazashobora kubyakira vuba mu gihe hari ibitagenda neza. \nImikorere.\nImashini zo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe zakozwe hakoreshejwe uburyo bugena imiterere y\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019umurwayi. Ubuhanga burimo ariko ntibugarukira gusa kumyitozo ifashwa ifatika, imyitozo ikumirwa, imyitozo irwanya imbaraga, imyitozo itajegajega, hamwe n'imyitozo ngororamubiri. Mu myitozo ifasha cyane, umurwayi yimura ikiganza cye munzira yagenwe mbere nta mbaraga zisunika. Imyitozo ngororamubiri ibujijwe ni ukugenda kw'ukuboko k'umurwayi n'imbaraga zirwanya, niba igerageza kwimuka hanze yibyo igomba. Imyitozo ngororamubiri irwanya imbaraga ni urugendo hamwe n'imbaraga zirwanya.\nMu myaka yashize, umubare w\u2019imashini za robo zisubiza abantu mu buzima ariko zaragabanutse cyane kubera ibizamini byo kwa muganga. Amavuriro menshi afite ibigeragezo ariko ntiyemera robot kuko yifuza ko yagenzurwa. Kugira ngo robot zigire uruhare mu kuvura umurwayi bifite ibintu byiza. Kimwe mu bintu byiza ni uko ushobora gusubiramo inzira cyangwa imyitozo inshuro nyinshi nkuko ubyifuza. Ikindi kintu cyiza cyukuri n'uko ushobora kubona ibipimo nyabyo by'iterambere cyangwa kugabanuka. Ushobora kubona ibipimo nyabyo ukoresheje sensor ku gikoresho. Mu gihe igikoresho gifata igipimo ugomba kwitonda kuko igikoresho gishobora guhungabana iyo kimaze gukorwa kubera ingendo zitandukanye umurwayi akora kugira ngo asohoke. Ibindi ku mashini isubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe ishobora kuvura igihe kirekire. Mu buryo bwo gukira robot isubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe ntishobora kumva ibyo umurwayi akeneye nk'uko umuvuzi w'inararibonye yabikora. Imashini ntishobora gusobanukirwa ako kanya ariko mu gihe kizaza igikoresho kizashobora gusobanukirwa. Ikindi cyiyongereyeho cyo kugira robot reabilit\u00e9 ni uko nta mbaraga z'umubiri zishyirwa mu bikorwa na therapiste kuganiza abahungabanye. \nMu minsi yashize, robotike yo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe yakoreshejwe mu guhugura m'ubuvuzi, kubaga,ndetse n'ibindi, ariko hari ibibazo byinshi byavuzwe ku bijyanye na robo itagenzurwa n'abantu. Abantu benshi batekereza ko gukoresha robot y'inganda nka robot yo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe byaba ari bimwe, ariko ibi ntabwo arukuri. Imashini zo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe zigomba guhinduka kandi zishobora gukoreshwa, kubera ko robo ishobora gukoreshwa kubw'impamvu nyinshi. Hagati aho, robo y'inganda ihora ari imwe, nta mpamvu yo guhindura robo keretse ibicuruzwa ikorana nini cyangwa nto. Kugira ngo robot y'inganda ikore igomba kuba ihinduwe n'inshingano zayo nshya zokugira ngo ibashe kuba yakora. \nImpamvu zo gukoresha iki gikoresho.\nUmubare w'abafite ubumuga muri Espagne wariyongereye kubera gusaza. Ibi bivuze ko umubare w'ubufasha wazamutse. Imashini yo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe irazwi cyane muri Espagne kuko ni igiciro cyemewe, kandi muri Espagne hari abantu benshi bafite ubwonko kandi bakeneye ubufasha nyuma. Imashini za robo zo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe zizwi cyane n\u2019abantu bagize ikibazo cy'ubwonko kuko habaye hakoreshwa uburyo bwo koroshya imitsi ya neuromuscular. Iyo ufite stroke sisitemu y'imitsi iba yangiritse mu bihe by'inshi bituma abantu bafite ubumuga mu mezi atandatu nyuma y'uburwayi bwa stroke. Imashini ishobora gukora imyitozo n'umuvuzi yakora ariko robo ikora imyitozo imwe n'imwe itoroshye cyane gukorwa n'Umuntu. Imashini ya pneumatike ifasha abantu bafite stroke cyangwa izindi ndwara iyo ari yo yose yateje akaduruvayo kunanizanya n'amaguru yabo mu gice cyo hejuru \nIsuzuma ryo mu mwaka wa 2018 ryerekeye imikorere y'ubuvuzi bwindorerwamo yukuri hamwe na robo y'uburyo ubwo aribwo bwose bwa patologiya bwanzuye ko,byinshi m'ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku gisekuru cya kabiri cyo kuvura indorerwamo bifite ubuziranenge buke,impamvu zishingiye ku bimenyetso bifatika zo gukora ubwo bushakashatsi zarabuze,ntabwo ari ngombwa gusaba ishoramari n'inzobere mu buzima busanzwe n\u2019ibigo muri ibyo bikoresho. \nUbwoko bwa robo.\nHariho ubwoko bubiri bw'imashini zishobora gukoreshwa mu buzima busanzwe: Imashini zanyuma zishingiye kuri robo na exoskeletons ikoreshwa. Buri sisitemu ifite inyungu zayo nimbibi. Sisitemu yanyuma yihuta gushiraho kandi irahinduka. Kurundi ruhande, exoskeletons itanga ibisobanuro byuzuye bihuriweho hamwe no kunoza imikorere.\nIbice by'ubushakashatsi.\nIbikoresho bya robo bigezweho birimo exoskeletons yo gufasha ingingo cyangwa kugendana n'intoki, kongera imbaraga zo gukandagira, amaboko ya robo kugira ngo yongere kugenda na moteri y'ingingo, n'ibikoresho byo gusubiza urutoki. Ibikoresho bimwe bigamije gufasha imbaraga ziterambere, mu gihe ibindi bishaka gufasha iyi mikorere mu buryo butaziguye. Akenshi tekinoroji ya robo igerageza gukoresha amahame ya neuroplastique mu gutezimbere ubwiza bw'imikorere, no kongera ubukana no gusubizamo umurimo. Mu myaka 20 ishize, ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku buvuzi bwa robo bwifashishijwe mu kuvura abarwayi ba stroke bwiriyongereye cyane kuko hagaragaye ubushobozi bwo kuvura buhendutse kandi bunoze. Nubwo ubwonko bw'ibanze bwiga ku bushakashatsi bwinshi bitewe n\u2019uko bwiganje muri Amerika ya Ruguru, robotike yo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe ishobora no gukoreshwa ku bantu harimo n\u2019abana bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ubwonko, cyangwa abakeye kubagwa kw'amagufwa. \nInyungu y'inyongera kuri ubu bwoko bwo kuvura imiterere ya robo ni ukugabanuka kugaragara kw'imitsi hamwe n'ijwi ry'imitsi mu maboko yangiritse. Icyerekezo gitandukanye cya robo cyemerera gutambuka cyangwa guhagarikwa, cyangwa guhuza indege zitandukanye. Ihagaritse, anti-gravit igenamigambi ni ingirakamaro cyane mu gutezimbere imikorere yigitugu ninkokora."}
{"id": "17927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17927", "title": "Assistive eating devices", "text": "Ibikoresho bifasha kurya birimo ibikoresho kuva mu bikoresho bidafite tekinoroji kugeza ku bikoresho byo kurya bya robo bifite tekinoroji. Ibikoresho bike byo kurya by'ikoranabuhanga birimo ibikoresho, amasahani hamwe n\u2019ibikombe n'iminwa yorohereza kurya biboroheye. Igikombe hamwe n'udukapu, ndetse n'icyansi gisanzwe gishobora gukoreshwa nk'ibikoresho byifashishwa mu kunywa. Bikoreshwa n'abantu mu gihe bafite ikibazo cyo kurya cyangwa kunywa bigenga. Ibi bikoresho mu busanzwe bikoreshwa ku bantu bafite ubumuga, ariko bishobora no gukoreshwa ku bana cyangwa abantu bafite buke. Bashobora kwimakaza ubwigenge mu gihe c'ifunguro, ariko mu bihe byinshi bishobora kandi kugabanya akazi k'abarezi mu gihe cyo kurya. \"Ibikoresho bifasha kurya bishobora gufasha abantu kwiyitaho, kongera kwihesha agaciro bijyanye no kongera ubwigenge, kongera umutekano mu gihe cyo kurya, kandi igihe cyo kurya kikaba cyiza ku bakozi bashinzwe kurera\u2026\". \nUbuhanga buhanitse cyane, busanzwe busobanurwa nk'ibikoresho by'ubuhanga buhanitse, buraboneka kandi kugira ngo abantu babone ibyo bakeneye bafite imbogamizi zikomeye mu bushobozi bwabo bwo kurya no kunywa badafashijwe n'undi muntu. Ku bantu barwaye quadriplegia, Amyotrophique Lateral Sclerose (ALS, izwi kandi ku ndwara ya Lou Gehrig), ubumuga bwubwonko, imitsi yumugongo (SMA), n'ibindi bintu byinshi, igikoresho gikoresha imbaraga gishobora koroshya amaboko kubabara. Ku bafite ubwoba, cyangwa imitsi idakomeye, ituma kurya mu buryo gakondo bigorana, cyangwa bidashoboka, igikoresho cyo kugaburira gifasha gishobora kuba icy'agaciro.\nIbyokurya bihinduka.\nIki cyiciro kirimo n'ibikombe bitazemerera ibiryo kugwa cyangwa gusohoka muri kontineri kandi ntibizanyerera. Bimwe muri ibyo bikoresho biroroshye nka clip ku izamu ifata isahani isanzwe cyangwa igikombe. Hariho amasahani menshi nayo afite umunwa ku nkombe ibuza ibiryo gusunikwa ku isahani igihe irimo gukoreshwa. Ibindi byahinduwe cyangwa bikozwe mu buryo budasanzwe kugirango bidatemba ku meza. Inzira ebyiri zisanzwe zo kubika amasahani n'ibikombe kumeza ni matel hamwe no gufata hasi. Ariko niba umuntu uvugwa afite, noneho ibishingwe bishobora gukoreshwa. Hano hari ibikombe bidasanzwe hamwe n'amasahani afite bizomeka ku meza. Uru rufatiro ruzarinda ibyo kurya kumeneka mu gihe ameza hagize ikiyakoma. \nIbikoresho bifasha.\n, ibyuma n' birashobora gukenera guhuzwa kugira ngo abantu babikoreshe. Umuntu ku giti cye ashobora guhangana n'igitigiri cyangwa ingendo yo gufungura no gufunga ukuboko cyangwa kuzamura ukuboko kugirango yigaburire yigenga. Ibikoresho byahujwe bishobora kuba igisubizo kuri aba bantu. Byinshi nk'ibikapu biremereye bituma abantu bahinda umushyitsi, ibikoresho biremereye bishobora kugabanya guhinda umushyitsi. Ubu bwoko bw'ibikoresho bishobora kugurwa by'umwihariko, ariko imigereka ishobora kandi kugurwa kugira ngo uhuze ibikoresho bigezweho n'ibikoresho bifasha. Iyi migereka ishobora gushyiramo ikintu cyo kunyerera hejuru y'ikiganza kiremereye cyangwa gishobora kuba kinini cyangwa gikozwe mu kugira ngo gifate kandi kibuze ibikoresho kugwa mu ntoki. Amashusho n'imishumi nabyo birashobora gukoreshwa mu gihe umuntu adashoboye gufata ikiganza na gito. \nIbikoresho byo kugaburisha intoki.\nIbikoresho byo kugaburira intoki cyangwa kwikorera byateguwe kugira ngo umuntu uhinda umushyitsi, cyangwa udafite ukuboko no guhuza amaboko kugenzura ibikoresho cyangwa kugenzura ibikoresho bya robo kugirango abone ibiryo hanyuma abizamure mu kanwa kandi yigaburire. Ibikoresho bimwe bihindura gusa ukuboko kwabakoresha. Ibindi bikoresho bitanga ukuboko kuremereye kugabanya umuvuduko udasanzwe. Ibikoresho byinshi bihanitse byemerera uyikoresha guhitamo ibiryo bifuza kurya no kugenzura umuvuduko baryaho. Ibikoresho byinshi cyane bishobora kwakira ubumuga bwinshi. Rimwe na rimwe, igikoresho gisaba ugikoresha gukoresha igikoresho neza kugirango ikiyiko gifate ibiryo hanyuma cyimure ikiyiko ku munwa, bityo bisaba urwego runaka rw'ubushobozi bw'ikiganza cy'umukoresha (ni ukuvuga, bikoreshwa n'abakoresha imitsi). Mu gihe cy'ibikoresho byinshi bihanitse bikoreshwa n'uburyo butandukanye bwo guhinduranya intoki, inzira zose zo gufata no gutanga ibiryo bikorwa n'imashini.\nIbikoresho byo kugaburira.\nIbikoresho byo kugaburira byemerera abantu badashobora kwigaburira bakoresheje ubundi bwoko bwa tekinoroji ifasha kurya, kurya bonyine. Mu bisanzwe, ibyo bikoresho bikora ukoresheje imbaraga ziva muri bateri y'umuriro (kubishobora). Umukoresha agenzura igikoresho akoresheje tablet ya ecran cyangwa guhinduranya ibintu kugira ngo uhindure ibikorwa bitandukanye igikoresho cyihariye gitanga. Ku isi yose, hariho ibikoresho bike byo kugaburira bifite imbaraga mu bucuruzi. Ibishushanyo n'uburyo bikoramo biratandukanye cyane. Bamwe batanga isahani cyangwa isahani yoroshye ibiryo bitangirwamo, mu gihe abandi batanga ibyo kurya bigabanijwe cyangwa ibikombe byinshi bituma ubwoko butandukanye bw'ibiribwa butandukana, kugira ngo birinde kuvanga ibiryo. Byinshi mu bikoresho byo kugaburira kera byashushanywaga byari imashini gusa.\nIbikombe bifasha.\n bishobora guhuzwa cyangwa kugurwa kugira ngo bifashe mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Ibikoresho bifasha cyane kunywa ni. Ibi ntibihendutse kandi bituma umukoresha adakenera gufata igikombe na gato. Amahame amwe yo gufata ifunguro rya nimugoroba ashobora no gukoreshwa mu gikombe cyangwa ibikombe. Ibice bitanyerera birasanzwe ku buryo bitanyerera ku meza, mu gihe babikoresha kugira ngo babuze igikombe gukomanga cyangwa kumeneka. Mu gihe igikombe gikomanze agatanguro katameneka gashobora gukoreshwa. Ibikombe bimwe bigurishirizwa hamwe n'imipfundikizo, ariko hariho n'imipfundikizo ishobora gukoreshwa mu buryo butandukanye bw'ibikombe hamwe na mugs. Ibikapu biremereye nabyo birasanzwe ku bantu bafite ubwoba. Ku bantu bafite ubumuga bugabanya ikoreshwa ry'intwaro na / cyangwa amaboko, ibicuruzwa byo kunywa ku buntu nabyo birahari.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20231121113451/https://feedingthedisabled.com/the-benefits-of-independent-eating-2/"}
{"id": "17928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17928", "title": "AccessiBe", "text": "accessiBe nisosiyete yikoranabuhanga ikora kugirango ikemure ikibazo cyo binyuze muri AI. Isosiyete yakusanyije miliyoni 58 z'amadolari mu byiciro bibiri. \nAmateka.\naccessiBe yashinzwe mu 2018 na Dekel Skoop, Gal Vizel na Shir Ekerling. Abashinze bakoze ibijyanye no guteza imbere kugira ngo imbuga za interineti. \naccessiBe yashyize ahagaragara ibicuruzwa byayo byamamaye, accessWidget, nkigikoresho gisikana kandi kigerageza gukosora imbuga za interineti mugihe nyacyo, igerageza kugera ku kubahiriza ADA binyuze mu gushyira mu bikorwa amabwiriza ya WCAG 2.1. Igicuruzwa kivuga ko cyamamaza abamamaza urubuga ADA kubahiriza amasaha make nyuma yo kohereza kode ya accessiBe, kugirango ababana nubumuga bashobore kubona byoroshye no gukorana nuru rubuga. Muri 2021 accessiBe yongeyeho ecosystem yibikoresho, accessFlow, urubuga rwo kugerageza no gukosora kubateza imbere kurwego rwimikorere ya code.\nGukusanya inkunga.\naccessiBe yabanje gukusanya $ 500,000 kubashoramari bigenga barimo Nadav Dakner, Elad Mor, Itai Elizur, Oron Yaffe. Muri Gicurasi 2020, isosiyete yakusanyije miliyoni 12 z'amadolari muri na K1 ishoramari. Muri Gashyantare 2021, yashoje urukurikirane rwarwo Inkunga yatanzwe na miliyoni 28 z'amadolari yatanzwe na K1 Investment Management, ikigo cy\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo cy\u2019i Los Angeles gishora imari cyane cyane mu masosiyete yigenga ya software n\u2019ikoranabuhanga muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru, yafashe imigabane mike muri accessiBe Systems Ltd igamije gufasha. accessiBe kwaguka muri Amerika ya ruguru. \nMuri Gashyantare 2021, accessiBe yinjiza buri mwaka yerekanaga ko yazamutseho hejuru ya 3.5x mu mezi 12, bigatuma inkunga yiyongera kuri K1, yose hamwe ikaba miliyoni 28. Abayobozi b'ibigo batangaje ko bateganya gukoresha ayo mafranga mu kwagura cyane Amerika muri Amerika, kuzamura ishami ryayo R&amp;D no gukomeza kwigisha isoko ku kamaro ko kugera ku rubuga. \nMuri Kanama 2022 accessiBe yakusanyije miliyoni 30 z'amadolari y\u2019inyongera mu rwego rwo kwagura Urutonde rwarwo A bituma inkunga yayo yose igera kuri Miliyoni 58.\nKunegura no guhangayika.\nImpuguke nyinshi zo kugera kurubuga zemeranya ko porogaramu zirenze urugero nka AccessiBe zishobora gutera ibibazo byukuri kandi bigatera imyumvire itari yo yo kugera kubakiriya babo. \nInzobere mu nganda nyinshi zanenze icyiciro cyose cyibicuruzwa. \nImanza.\nHabayeho imanza zigera ku 100 zirega amasosiyete nyuma yo gushora imari mu gisubizo gishingiye kuri widget, cyane cyane ADP, na babiri bise accessiBe by'umwihariko: \"Thomas Klaus na Robert Jahoda baburana na Upright Technologies\", na \"Kolesar\". \"v. Bylt, LLC\". "}
{"id": "17929", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17929", "title": "Adaptive equipment", "text": "Ibikoresho byo guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere ni bikoreshwa mu gufasha, kwambara, ubwiherero, no kugaburira ni ibikorwa byo kwiyitaho birimo no mu bikorwa bitandukanye by'ubuzima bwa buri munsi (ADL). Jennifer McLaughlin Maly a PT / DPT mu kiganiro cye giherereye mu kinyamakuru Exceptional Parent atanga ibisobanuro byuzuye by\u2019ibikoresho byo guhuza n'imiterere:\nIsoko rigenda ryiyongera kubikoresho byo guhuza n'imiterere ni mugukoresha amamodoka. Muri iki gihe, ibikoresho byo guhuza n'imiterere, bizwi kandi nk'ikoranabuhanga rifasha, birashobora gufasha umuntu ufite ubumuga gukoresha ikinyabiziga gifite moteri mu gihe bitabaye ibyo batabishoboye.\nImfashanyo yimuka.\nIbikoresho byo guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere bikoreshwa mu gihe indwara cyangwa impanuka isize imikorere ya moteri y'umuntu ibangamiye cyangwa idakoreshwa. niba umuntu ku giti cye yabujije imikorere ya moteri, hari ibikoresho nikoranabuhanga bishobora gufasha mukugarura bimwe cyangwa byose.\nUbwoko bwibikoresho bigendanwa.\nWheelchair.\nIntebe y\u2019abafite ubumuga cyangwa moteri ni intebe ifite ibiziga bifatanye byemerera umuntu udashobora kugenda, kubera uburwayi, ibikomere, cyangwa ubumuga, kuzenguruka. \nInkoni.\nInkoni ni ibikoresho bikoreshwa mu kwimura imibiri imizigo kuva mumubiri wo hasi kugeza kumubiri wo hejuru. Inkoni zikoreshwa mugihe umubiri wo hasi wumuntu udahungabana rwose, ariko wangiritse.\nIbikoresho bya prostate.\n nibikoresho byubukorikori bikoreshwa mugusimbuza igice cyumubiri wabuze cyatewe nuburwayi, impanuka, cyangwa inenge yavutse. \nIbikoresho bya orthotic.\nIbikoresho bya orthotic, cyangwa orthose, nibikoresho bikoreshwa muguhuza, gutondeka, cyangwa gukosora ubumuga. Orthose ifasha kandi kunoza urujya n'uruza rw'umuntu, umugongo, cyangwa ingingo. \nUbufasha bwa Sensory.\nIbikoresho byifashishwa mu guhuza imiterere ya Neurologiya bikoreshwa mugihe umuntu adafite imbaraga zo gukangura imyumvire. Kurugero, abantu baba impumyi, ibiragi, ibipfamatwi, cyangwa guhuza kwabo.\nUbwoko bwibikoresho byo guhuza n'imiterere.\nImfashanyigisho.\nImfashanyigisho zo kumva ni ibikoresho bikoreshwa nabantu batumva igice kugirango bagarure igice cyo kumva mukwongerera amajwi. \nBraille.\n ni sisitemu yazamuye yemerera impumyi gusoma inyandiko n'intoki. Braille ni code yururimi ntabwo ari ururimi rwonyine. \nIbikoresho bifasha gutegera (ALD).\nIbikoresho bifasha gutegera (ALD) nibikoresho byifashishwa mu kongera amajwi umuntu ashaka kumva, cyane cyane mubice bifite urusaku rwinshi. ADLs irashobora gukoreshwa hamwe nibikoresho bifasha kwumva hamwe na cochlear yatewe kugirango abantu bumve neza. \nIbikoresho byo gutumanaho no guhinduranya (AAC) ibikoresho.\nIbikoresho bya Augmentative and Alternative Communication (AAC) bikoreshwa mugufasha abantu bafite ikibazo cyitumanaho kwigaragariza abandi. Ibikoresho birashobora gutwara kuva ku mbaho zerekana amashusho kugera kuri mudasobwa ifashijwe. \nIbikoresho byo kumenyesha.\nIbikoresho byo kumenyesha nibikoresho bifasha bihuza inzogera zumuryango, terefone, nibindi bikoresho biteye ubwoba. Ibi bikoresho byongeramo impuruza yihariye ishingiye ku bumuga bw'umuntu. Kurugero, umuntu utumva arashobora kugira inzogera yumuryango ihumura urumuri aho kuba urusaku rwerekana umuntu uri kumuryango. "}
{"id": "17930", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17930", "title": "9-1-1 Tapping Protocol", "text": "9-1-1 Tapping Protocol ni gahunda yateguwe na yo guha abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva n\u2019ubwo kutavuga, hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo kumenyekanisha Tapping Protocol 9 -1-1 uhereye.\nTapping Protocol ishobora gukoreshwa mugihe uhamagaye 9-1-1 ukoresheje cyangwa mugihe ukoresheje kamwe gasanduku k'ibyihutirwa by'umujyi wa New York gusaba ubufasha. Muri ibyo bihe byombi, umuntu utanga amakuru yihutirwa avugana n'umuhamagaye kuri 9-1-1 binyuze mu gukanda mu gishushanyo runaka ukoresheje urutoki, ikaramu, urufunguzo, n'ibindi, ku munwa wa terefone cyangwa igice cy'abahamagaye agasanduku ko guhamagara.\nUburyo bubiri bwo gukanda bukoreshwa mu rwego rwo gutandukanya ubwoko bw'imfashanyo yasabwe: uburyo bwo gukanda buhoraho bwerekana icyifuzo cyo gufashwa n\u2019abapolisi, mu gihe uburyo bubiri bwakorewe inshuro ebyiri bwerekana icyifuzo (\"EMS\"). Umuntu utanga amakuru yihutirwa agomba gukoresha uburyo bukwiye bwo gukanda byibuze amasegonda 90, kandi ni byiza kugeza serivisi zihutirwa zisabwa zigeze. Niba bishoboka, umuntu agomba kuguma kuri terefone yishyuwe cyangwa ahamagara agasanduku kugira ngo yereke abashinzwe ubutabazi bwihutirwa.\nAmateka.\nTapping Protocol yatangijwe mu 1996 hagamijwe kubahiriza icyifuzo cy\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ikirenga basaba ko New York itanga ubundi buryo bwo kumenyesha 9-1-1 \"bwaha abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva uburyo bwo kumenya aho baherereye gusa, ariko kandi ubwoko bwihutirwa buvugwa. \" Muri sisitemu ya New York City (\"E-911\"), buri terefone na terefone byihutirwa bihita byohereza aho bikorera kubakoresha 911, kugirango umukoresha wakiriye terefone azabe afite umuhamagaro kuri -Ibikoresho kandi bizashobora gutandukanya, ukoresheje uburyo bwo gukanda, serivisi zihutirwa zisabwa.\nSisitemu yo gukanda hamwe na E-911 sisitemu yabereye mumujyi wa New York kuva icyo gihe."}
{"id": "17931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17931", "title": "Igenamigambi ry'abafite ubumuga", "text": "Igenamigambi ry'abafite ubumuga.\nInama y'igihugu y'abafite ubumuga (NCPD) iratangaza ko hagiye gukorwa ibarura rusange ry'abafite ubumuga mu gihugu hose, hiyongereyemo n'abana bari munsi y'imyaka itanu (5), bavukanye ubumuga ubwo aribwo bwose kuko mbere batabarurwaga. \nIgenamigambi ry'abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda.\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa NCPD Ndayisaba Emmanuel, kuba abana bagiye kubarurwa, bizafasha kubakorerera ubuvugizi no kuvuzwa hakiri kare kuko ubusanzwe igenamigambi ry'abafite ubumuga ritajyaga ribatekerezaho.\nAvuga ko kuba abana batabarurwaga mu bafite ubumuga, byatumaga hari abatangira kwitabwaho bararengeje igihe cyo kuvuzwa, bigatuma uburwayi cyangwa ubumuga bavukanye burushaho gukomera, umwana akarengerana ntavurwe, ariko ubu bizajya bihita byoroha kuko azajya avuka ahita ashyirwa mu mibare y'abagomba kw'itabwaho.\nAgira ati kuvura ubumuga bukiri buto bizajya bituma umwana wabuvukanye yoroherwa vuba, aho gutegereza kuzakurikiranwa amaze gukura ndetse n'ubumuga afite bwaramuzonze, ikindi kandi iyo ubumuga buvuwe umwana akiri muto ubumuga bushobora gukosorwa, agasubira mubuzima busanzwe,ariko iyo yatinze kuvurwa ubumuga ntago buba bugikunze.\nGushyira abafite ubumuga mu byiciro.\nNdayisaba avugako itegeko rigenga abafite ubumuga rigiye guhindukamo ingingo hagamijwe kumenya neza imiterere y'ubumuga, ndetse n'ingaruka bufite ku muntu ubufite kugirango harebwe uko afashwa."}
{"id": "17932", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17932", "title": "Ikoranabuhanga mu ibarura ry'abafite ubumuga", "text": "Inama y'igihugu y'abafite ubumuga kubufatanye n'abafatanya bikorwa, bagiye gutangira ibaruraryihariye ry'abafite ubumuga. NCPD itangazako abafite ubumuga bose bagiye gutangira kubarurwa hifashishijwe uburyo bw'ikoranabuhanga, buzafasha kumenya abafite ubumug, ibyo bahawe ndetse nibyo bakeneye mu rwego rwo kubafasha binyuze muri gahunda za leta yu \"Rwanda.\"\nIkoranabuhanga mu ibarura ry'abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda.\nUburyo bw'ikoranabuhanga buzifasdhishwa mu kujya babarura abafite ubumuga, bagashyirwa mu ikoranabuhanga, hakerekanwa ibyo bakeneye, ibyo bahawe, ndetse hakagaragara ingorane bafite, cyane cyane imbogamizi bahura nazo mukuba bashobora kujya mubundi buzima busanzwe. \nImikorere y'ibarura.\nUmunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa NCPD ati kuko tuzajya mu rugo kurundi, dushaka umuntu wese waba afite ubumuga aho ari kuko twasanze ubushize ibyo twakoze dukoresheje abaganga, bakajya badusanga kubigo nderabuzima, ugasanga hari abantu bamwe nabamwe bagiye basigara kubera batabasha kuhagera. ubu rero hafashwe umwanzuro wuko tuzajya tugenda tugera kurugo kurundi, ibikoresho twamaze kubigura imashini tuzifashisha zirahari, gusa harasabwa byinshi nkugirango mu mirenge yose y'igihugu. tubone abakora ibyo bikorwa tubahugure, nyuma yaho kandi ibyo byose bikozwe, hazahabwa ubushobozi Imirenge n'uturere kugirango bikoreshe iyo sisiteme."}
{"id": "17933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17933", "title": "ALLPlayer", "text": "ALLPlayer ni umukinnyi hamwe na y'ibitangazamakuru byanditswe na ALLPlayer Group Ltd ALLPlayer iraboneka kuri desktop hamwe na porogaramu igendanwa, nka, na. Porogaramu iraboneka, Ububiko na Microsoft. ALLPlayer ishyigikira imiterere ya dosiye nyinshi, harimo CD ya videwo na ya streaming. Irashoboye gutambutsa itangazamakuru ku rubuga rwa. Ibiranga ALLPlayer byose birimo ivugurura rya codecs zikoresha, ubufatanye na subtitles seriveri (urugero: openubtitles.org) yo gukuramo subtitles mu ndimi nyinshi, hamwe n'ubushobozi bwo gukina filime ya hamwe n'uruhererekane hamwe na subtitles zihuye. ALLPlayer ifite igenzura rya kure na hoteri ya clavier. Irashobora gukina mirongo niba atari yose izwi amajwi na videwo. Abamenyekanye cyane muri bo ni: 3G2, (MKV), DAT, MOV, M2TS, 3GP, VOB, MPG, APE, AU, MKA, MP3, OGG, WAV na AC3, ndetse na CD y'amajwi, hamwe na urls. ALLPlayer irashobora gukina dosiye zuzuye, cyangwa zitarangiye, nkamadosiye agikuramo hifashishijwe (P2P)."}
{"id": "17934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17934", "title": "Camo (app)", "text": "Camo ni porogaramu ya na sosiyete ikora software yo mubwongereza Reincubate yemerera terefone nibindi bikoresho bigendanwa gukoreshwa nka na kamera yinyandiko. \nPorogaramu ikora kuri na kandi irahuza na terefone na. \nPorogaramu ije mu buntu na Pro. Verisiyo yubuntu ikoresha kamera nyamukuru yibikoresho bigendanwa, mugihe Pro verisiyo itanga uburenganzira kuri kamera zose. \nGukoresha Camo bisaba gukuramo porogaramu kubikoresho bigendanwa hamwe na porogaramu igereranya, Studio ya Camo. "}
{"id": "17935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17935", "title": "First Derm", "text": "Derm ya mbere ni yo muri Amerika ikorera kumurongo hamwe nurubuga rwa tele-ubuzima itanga ibisubizo kubibazo byuruhu. Abakoresha bohereza mubibazo kubuvuzi binyuze muri, cyangwa.\nAmateka.\nDerm ya mbere yashinzwe mu 2014 na Dr. Alexander B\u00f6rve mu rwego rwo gushyigikira abahanga mu kuvura indwara z\u2019uruhu mu kuvura abarwayi kuri interineti. Dr. B\u00f6rve yize mu muri, aho yari umushakashatsi mu buzima bugendanwa na tele-dermatology. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ni bumwe mu bwambere bwabwo, bushingiye ku gukoresha ibikoresho bigendanwa nk'igikoresho cyo gusubiza ibibazo n'ibibazo by\u2019aba dermatologiste. Ubushakashatsi bwarimo ubushakashatsi bw\u2019icyitegererezo ku mikorere ya serivisi y\u2019ubuzima bugendanwa muri Suwede, ikoreshwa rya MMS na muri teledermatologiya, no gukoresha nk'igikoresho cyo kohereza abarwayi ba kanseri y\u2019uruhu ku barwayi ba dermatologue. \nImanza zirenga 300.000 zimaze kugenzurwa mu bihugu birenga 160 kandi serivisi iraboneka mu ndimi ndwi.\nIntego.\nIntego ya Derm ya mbere ni ugutanga ibisubizo byihuse kubibazo byo kwita ku ruhu utabanje gusuzuma umurwayi. Ibi bituma umurwayi yihutisha inzira yo koherezwa kandi akakira kubagwa cyangwa kuvurwa vuba kuruta inzira gakondo.\nIgikoresho kandi gikoreshwa na serivisi zubuzima bwigihugu nka bakoresha igikoresho nkigisubizo cya triage kubaganga. "}
{"id": "17936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17936", "title": "MonoMouse", "text": "MonoMouse nigikoresho cya elegitoroniki ikoreshwa na Bierley, yagenewe gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gusoma inyandiko cyangwa amashusho yanditse. \nMu ntangiriro yakozwe na Ian Bierley mu 2003 kugira ngo akoreshwe na nyina wari ufite, nyuma aza kurekurwa nk'ibicuruzwa by'ubucuruzi byatanzwe binyuze muri optique mu 2005. MonoMouse imeze nkimbeba nini nini kandi ihuza televiziyo iyo ari yo yose binyuze mu muhuza wa mu Burayi cyangwa ku isi yose. \nNintangarugero ya ifasha kugirango abantu bashobore kubona amaso nka yo gusoma inyandiko yanditse bakareba amashusho yanditse."}
{"id": "17937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17937", "title": "OATS", "text": "OATS (\" Gufungura isoko yubufasha bwa tekinoroji ya software \") nububiko cyangwa \" \" ya software. Yatangijwe mu 2006 ifite intego yo gutanga \u201ciduka\u201d rimwe kubakoresha amaherezo, abaganga n\u2019abateza imbere amasoko kugira ngo bateze imbere kandi batezimbere porogaramu y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ifasha. Iyemerera kandi abakoresha kubona izindi software zubuntu ariko zidafungura isoko, hamwe na software ifungura isoko yatunganijwe ahandi, urugero, na FireVox. \nUrubuga rwa OATS rwashyizwe ahagaragara nyuma y\u2019umushinga wa OATS, umushinga w\u2019icyitegererezo w\u2019umwaka umwe warangiye muri Werurwe 2006, ukavuga ko ari ububiko bwa mbere bufungura isoko bwagenewe ikoranabuhanga rifasha. Muri Mata 2006, (BCS) yatangaje ko ishyigikiye umushinga wa OATS; muri Kanama 2006, Itsinda ry\u2019inzobere mu bucuruzi rya mudasobwa ry\u2019Abongereza ryateguye inama yerekeye umushinga. \nUmushinga wa OATS wari ugizwe n\u2019imiryango itanu y\u2019abafatanyabikorwa ihuriweho. Ububiko bwa OATS burashaka gutanga uburyo bunoze kandi bwihuse bwo kubona ikoranabuhanga ryiza rifasha. Ububiko bwa OATS butanga ibikoresho bikurikira kubateza imbere: "}
{"id": "17938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17938", "title": "Assistive listening device", "text": "Igikoresho gifasha kumva (ALD) ni igice cya sisitemu ikoreshwa mugutezimbere ubushobozi bwo kumva k'ubantu mubihe bitandukanye aho badashobora gutandukanya imvugo ahantu huzuye urusaku. Akenshi, mucyumba gisakuza cyangwa cyuzuye abantu ntibishoboka ko umuntu ku giti cye gutandukanya ijwi rimwe muri benshi. Ibi bikunze kwiyongera n'ingaruka za acoustique yo mucyumba kumiterere yimvugo igaragara. Imfashanyigisho zumva zishobora kwagura no gutunganya aya majwi, no kunoza. Ariko, niba ijwi cyane mugihe rigeze kubateze amatwi, ndetse n'ibikoresho byiza byumvikana bizarwanira gukuraho ibimenyetso. Ibikoresho bifasha gutega amatwi bitanga ubundi buryo bwo guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere, ariko birashobora kuba bigoye kandi bitoroshye.\nIkoreshwa.\nIkoreshwa rusange mu gufasha abantu bigoye kumva (HOH) mukongera imbaraga no gutanga ibimenyetso byiza kubigereranyo by'urusaku (SNR). ALD irashobora gukoreshwa mu gufasha abantu HOH kumva televiziyo n'ibindi ikoresho by'amajwi, cyangwa gufasha abantu kumva imvugo binyuze muri cyangwa sisitemu, nko ahantu ho gusengera cyangwa gutanga ibiganiro.\nGukoresha mikoro idafite umugozi ishyizwe iruhande rw'umuntu uvuga ikuraho amajwi hagati yabo n'uwumva, ibyo bikaba bigabanya ingaruka zo kwisubiramo biturutse kuri acoustics yo mucyumba kibi, urusaku rw'inyuma ruzenguruka abumva, hamwe n'urusaku rw'inyuma ruzenguruka umuvugizi (ukoresheje mikoro yerekeza). \nIkoranabuhanga.\nIgikoresho gifasha kumva gikunze gukoresha kugirango ifate isoko y'amajwi hafi y'inkomoko yayo kandi ikayitambutsa mu buryo butemewe hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo (FM), (IR), cyangwa ubundi buryo. Umuntu uri gutega amatwi arashobora gukoresha idafite umugozi kugirango ahuze ibimenyetso kandi yumve amajwi akunda. Hariiho kandi n'abandi baguzi ALDs nk'amasaha yo gutabaza hamwe no kunyeganyeza uburiri, stethoscopes yongerewe imbaraga, monitor y'abana, hamwe n'ibimenyetso byerekana inzogera z'umuryango. Ibikoresho byinshi bifasha kumva neza FM bikorera kumirongo cumi n'irindwi hagati ya 72.1000 na 75.800MHz. "}
{"id": "17939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17939", "title": "Auto-text", "text": "Auto-text ni igice cyinyandiko ibanziriza, iboneka nkinyongera ku nshya yahimbwe, kandi igasabwa umwanditsi winyandiko na. Guhagarika auto-text irashobora kuba irimo, cyangwa. Irashobora guhitamo umwanditsi winyandiko ikoresheje menu cyangwa igatangwa mu buryo bwikora nyuma yo amagambo cyangwa inyuguti zihariye (cyangwa guhanura inyandiko), cyangwa ukongerwaho inyandiko mu buryo bwikora nyuma yo kwandika amagambo cyangwa inyuguti zihariye (ijambo / inyandiko irangiye).\nAuto-text ibika umwanya wimyandikire yandika inyandiko nyinshi zisa, cyangwa ikora rifasha abafite ubumuga. Ubu bumuga bushobora kuba ubumuga butinda kugenda, cyangwa bigatera cyangwa, hamwe nindwara (urugero). Abantu bafite ubumuga bwo bandika kubikoresho bashobora kandi kungukirwa na Auto-text, kubera ko ishobora kwihutisha.\nIngero za software zitanga auto-text:"}
{"id": "17941", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17941", "title": "Assistive Technology Acts", "text": "Assistive Technology Acts itanga inkunga ihuriweho na Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi muri Amerika muri buri ntara n\u2019intara kugira ngo ishyigikire \"Imbaraga za Leta zo kunoza itangwa ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha abantu bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ingeri zose binyuze muri gahunda rusange z\u2019ubufasha bujyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga.\" Ifashayobora Technologies ni ibikoresho, ibintu cyangwa ibikoresho bikoreshwa mugutezimbere cyangwa kugumana imikorere yumuntu ufite ubumuga. Ibi bizafasha umuntu ufite ubumuga kwigenga mubuzima, ibi birimo: uburezi, imyidagaduro, nibikorwa byose bya buri munsi. Serivisi zitangwa kubufasha bwa tekinoroji zirimo kuba ushobora gukoresha ibikoresho bya AT, gusuzuma ibikoresho, hamwe no kubungabunga byose birimo, nko kubitunganya, gusana, n'amahugurwa. Mu mategeko agenga ikoranabuhanga, inkunga ya leta ihabwa buri gihugu gutera inkunga umushinga w\u2019ikoranabuhanga (ATAP) utanga serivisi kubantu bafite ubumuga, imiryango yabo, abarezi nibindi byinshi mubuzima bwabo. Igikorwa, cyatowe bwa mbere mu 1988, kirangira buri mwaka kandi kigomba guhora kivugururwa kugirango serivisi zishobore gukoreshwa.\nKugeza ubu, hari gahunda 56 za Leta AT. Hariho gahunda kuri leta zose uko ari 50, intara 4 zo muri Amerika, hamwe na Porto Rico n'akarere ka Columbiya. Ku bantu bagera ku 50.000.000 bafite ubumuga muri Amerika, izi gahunda zirahari kugira ngo zibafashe mu guhitamo no kubona \"\", risobanurwa nk'igikoresho icyo ari cyo cyose cyabafasha gukora imirimo bitoroshye cyangwa bidashoboka. Abahawe inkunga 56 basabwa gukora ibikorwa byabo byubahwa kurwego rwa leta nibikorwa byubuyobozi bwa leta. Abahawe inkunga bagomba kumenyesha abantu bafite ubumuga kuri Technologies Technologies, aho bayakira, nuburyo bwo kubona Technologies Technologies.\nAmateka.\nImfashanyo ijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga ku bantu bafite ubumuga (. 100\u2013407), ryatowe bwa mbere mu 1988, ryemewe mu 1994 (. 103\u2013218) na none muri 1998 (. 105\u2013394 (text)). Yashyizweho nka sisitemu yo guhindura inkunga kandi bakunze kwita \"Tech Act\" mugihe gito. Kongere yemeje iri tegeko hagamijwe kongera uburyo bwo kugera, kuboneka, n\u2019inkunga y\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha binyuze mu mbaraga za Leta na gahunda z\u2019igihugu. Itegeko ryo mu 1998 ryongeye gushimangira ko ikoranabuhanga ari igikoresho cy'ingirakamaro gishobora gukoreshwa mu kuzamura imibereho y'Abanyamerika bafite ubumuga. Hifashishijwe guverinoma abantu benshi bari kwemererwa kubona ibikoresho nibikoresho batigeze batekereza ko bazabona amahirwe yo gutunga.\nIntara zose n\u2019intara za Amerika byahawe umushinga wa Tech Act. Itsinda rya mbere ryimishinga ryatangiye mu 1989. Buri mushinga wa leta wari ufite imyaka itanu yinkunga nkuko amategeko ya 1989 abiteganya. Gusaba inkunga irushanwa byasabwaga kubona andi myaka itanu y'amafaranga. Imishinga yijejwe imyaka umunani inkunga yuzuye; umwaka wa cyenda kuri 75% yinkunga yuzuye; n'umwaka wa cumi nkumushinga wa Tech Act kuri 50% yinkunga yuzuye.\nAmategeko ashyigikira imishinga y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ifasha leta yari ateganijwe kurenga ku ya 30 Nzeri 2004. Itegeko rigenga ikoranabuhanga ryo mu 2004 (.Tooltip Amategeko rusange (Amerika) 108\u2013364 (inyandiko) (PDF)) yemereye porogaramu y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ifasha muri leta zose n\u2019intara mu gihe cyimyaka itanu nka gahunda ishingiye kuri formula, kandi ikuraho amategeko.\nItegeko ry'ikoranabuhanga rifasha mu 2004.\nItegeko rigenga ikoranabuhanga ryo mu 2004, ryashyizweho umukono na Perezida George W. Bush, ryemeje ko inkunga ikomeye y\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha ikomeza. Gukomeza icyo gikorwa byatumye abantu benshi bafite ubumuga bakomeza kwitabira ibikorwa bya buri munsi. Mugihe iki gikorwa cyakozwe mu 1988, impinduka nyinshi zabaye igihe byakomezaga muri 2004. Imwe mu mpinduka zikomeye zazanywe na Active Technology Act yo mu 2004 ni uguhindura intego. Ibikorwa byabanje byibanze ku gufasha ibihugu kubaka \"sisitemu zo kunoza uburyo bwo kubona ibikoresho byikoranabuhanga bifasha ababana nubumuga.\" Itegeko ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Assistive ryo mu 2004 rihindura amategeko abanziriza itegeko rya Assistive Technology ryo mu 1998 kugira ngo rivugurure kandi ryemererwe porogaramu ya Active Technology Act. Impinduka mu itegeko rigenga ikoranabuhanga ryemerera umunyamabanga w\u2019uburezi gutanga inkunga y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ifasha kujya muri Leta gukomeza gahunda z\u2019igihugu cyose. Porogaramu izafasha ababana n'ubumuga, abagize umuryango, abarezi, abahagarariye uburenganzira, n'abunganira kubona Technologies Technologies '. Byongeye kandi, impinduka mu 2004 ku nkunga ya Assistive Technology isaba leta gukoresha amafaranga mu bikorwa bya leta. Ibikorwa byo ku rwego rwa Leta birimo gahunda yo gutera inkunga, ikubiyemo gahunda y'inguzanyo yo gufasha mu kubona no gutera inkunga serivisi zifasha ikoranabuhanga n'ibikoresho. Inguzanyo y'Ikoreshwa rya Tekinoroji Yemerera abantu kuguza Ikoranabuhanga rya Assistive mugihe gito cyo gukoresha no kumenya niba igikoresho cyujuje ibyo bakeneye mbere yo kugura ibicuruzwa bya tekinoroji. Na none, Serivisi ishinzwe gutera inkunga Tekinoroji ya Leta yemerera ababana nubumuga kugura / kubona inguzanyo zamafaranga zitanga ubufasha bwa Technologie kubaguzi ku giciro gito binyuze mumasoko y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ridafasha cyangwa bivuye mu mufuka. Mubyongeyeho, porogaramu izafasha mugukoresha ibikoresho bifasha abaguzi gusana ibicuruzwa byabo, gusanwa, no guhindurwa. Serivise ifasha ikorana buhanga ryemerera abandi bantu bafite ubumuga kongera gukoresha Technologies Technologies itagikoreshwa cyangwa ikenewe na nyirayo wambere. Ibi bituma ababana nubumuga bakira Ikoranabuhanga rifasha hamwe no kuzigama amafaranga menshi. Na none, iyi gahunda izafasha kubona inguzanyo kubikoresho bifite imyiyerekano izafasha mubikorwa byo gutanga amakuru. \nIbikorwa bya gahunda ya tekinoroji ya leta.\nBitewe n'imbaraga za gahunda ya Leta ishinzwe ikoranabuhanga, miliyoni z'abanyamerika bafite ubumuga barashobora kujya ku kazi, kujya ku ishuri, kwitabira ibikorwa by'imyidagaduro, kandi bakagira uruhare mu baturage babo. Ibikorwa bya Leta byagezweho muri make buri mwaka murwego rwo gutanga raporo ya tekinoroji. Incamake y'ibyo byagezweho yateguwe n'ishyirahamwe rya porogaramu ifasha ikoranabuhanga; kopi yuzuye ya buri gahunda ya Leta urashobora kuyisanga muri sisitemu yigihugu yamakuru yo gufasha ikoranabuhanga. \nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019imishinga ifasha ikorana buhanga (ATAP) n\u2019umuryango w\u2019igihugu udaharanira inyungu washinzwe mu 1997 kandi uterwa inkunga n\u2019itegeko rya federasiyo ifasha mu kugenzura gahunda za Leta AT. ATAP yashyizeho umuyoboro w\u2019ikoranabuhanga ufasha ibihugu gusangira umutungo, kuganira ku bibazo, gutanga inkunga, gukora ubushakashatsi, kunganira gahunda n\u2019amategeko, no gutanga uburyo bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha. ATAP irareba, \"kubungabunga no guteza imbere urusobe rukomeye, rukora neza, kandi rukora neza muri gahunda y\u2019igihugu ikoranabuhanga rya Leta...\" urwego. Izi gahunda zigomba kumenyekana kandi mugihe hashyizweho amategeko menshi hazitabwaho cyane tekinoloji yose ifasha yakoze kugirango ifashe ababana nubumuga.\nBuri Leta ifite gahunda zayo bwite zishobora kuboneka muri sisitemu yigihugu yamakuru yo gufasha ikoranabuhanga. Intara imaze gutorwa uzasanga iryo zina ryihariye rya leta ifasha ikorana buhanga hamwe na aderesi hamwe n\u2019aho ushobora kubasanga. Muri ayo makuru uzahasanga ibisobanuro byubuhanga bwa leta bufasha bwashyizweho, uburyo bwujuje ibisabwa na leta, hamwe nubusobanuro bugufi bwikoranabuhanga ryatanzwe. Mubisobanuro, uyikoresha azabona noneho Umwirondoro wa Porogaramu ugabanijwemo ibice bitandatu:\nAmategeko yo guhanga udushya n'abakozi.\nKu ya 22 Nyakanga 2014, Perezida Barack Obama yashyizweho umukono n'itegeko (WIOA) ryashyizweho n'abakozi (WIOA WIOA itanga abantu bashaka akazi bafite amahirwe yo kubona akazi, akazi keza cyane, uburezi, amahugurwa, serivisi zifasha ababana n'ubumuga kandi igahuza abakozi bafite ubumenyi n\u2019abakoresha kugirango bateze imbere abakozi ba Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. WIOA yagize ingaruka ku itegeko rigenga ikoranabuhanga ryo mu 2004 yimura ubuyobozi bwa AT Act mu buyobozi bwa serivisi zita ku buzima busanzwe mu ishami ry\u2019uburezi ku buyobozi bw\u2019umuryango utuye mu ishami ry\u2019ubuzima na serivisi z\u2019abantu. Ubuyobozi bw'Imibereho Myiza y'Abaturage buyobora Igice cya 4, 5 n'icya 6 bya gahunda n'ibikorwa bya AT Act. WIOA yimuye Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe ubumuga, ubuzima bwigenga, n\u2019ubushakashatsi bwo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe kuva mu ishami ry\u2019uburezi kwimurira mu buyobozi bw\u2019umuryango utuye (ACL). Gushyira hamwe gahunda zose zita kubumuga bituma ACL \"yongerera ubwigenge, imibereho myiza, nubuzima bwabantu bakuru ndetse nabafite ubumuga, nimiryango nabarezi bombi\" kandi bagasohoza inshingano zabo zo guha ababana nubumuga a ubuzima bwiza."}
{"id": "17942", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17942", "title": "Curb cut effect", "text": "The curb cut effect ni ibiryo ibintu byateganyijwe gufasha abafite ubumuga bikunda gukoreshwa no gushimwa n'abantu benshi kurusha abo byari byagenewe. Ikintu cyitiriwe curb cuts\u00a0\u2013 miniature ramps igizwe nibice byumuhanda\u00a0 zabanje gukorwa kugirango intebe y\u2019ibimuga igere ahantu runaka, ariko kandi yakiriwe nabantu basunika amagare, amagare cyangwa imizigo. Curb cuts ubu aboneka hose kandi ntakigaragara cyane nk'ikintu-cyagenewe gufasha abafite ubumuga kubona aho banyura. Urundi rugero ni ukumva abantu bakoresha televiziyo ifunze. \nThe curb cut effect ni igice cy'ibishushanyo mbonera rusange, ari cyo gishushanya no gutegura ibidukikije ku bushake kugirango bibashe gukoreshwa n'abantu bose, hatitawe ku bushobozi cyangwa ubumuga bafite. The curb effect gato n'igishushanyo mbonera rusange kuko curb cut phenomenon akenshi iba itabigambiriye aho kuba intego, ariko bivamo ibisubizo bisa.\nIngero.\nHano hari ingero zimwe zo kugabanya ingaruka. \nIngero.\nThe curb effect zabaye ibintu bigaragara mugihe societe igenda ishyira mu bikorwa ibidukikije bigerwaho kandi byuzuye. The curb effect harimo ingaruka zirimo kongera ubumenyi kubijyanye nigishushanyo mbonera rusange mubaturage muri rusange. Kuba ibintu byinshi byaragenewe mbere kugabanya inzitizi z\u2019abafite ubumuga byakoreshejwe kandi bishimwa n\u2019abantu bo hanze y\u2019abaturage bateganijwe mbere byashishikarije abantu bose gushushanya. Kugabanya kugabanya ingaruka byongera inyungu zubukungu harimo gushyiramo amazu menshi yinjira mubucuruzi. "}
{"id": "17944", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17944", "title": "Imodoka ifasha abafite ubumuga", "text": "Chairiot solo ni igare ry'abafite ubumuga rishobora kugerwaho na microcar yakozwe na Chairiot Mobility Inc. Nimwe mumamodoka make kubakoresha amagare yabugenewe y'abafite ubumuga kubw'ibyo, kandi ntabwo ahinduka.\nIbisobanuro.\nYatangijwe mu mwaka 2014, ni imodoka imwe, ifite amashanyarazi yemerera umuntu ufite ubumuga ugenda mu kagare k\u2019abamuga kuzunguruka mu modoka akoresheje icyuma cy\u2019inyuma n\u2019igitambambuga, kandi agakingira intebe y\u2019abafite ubumuga aho atwara. Chairiot solo igenewe gutwara ibinyabiziga mu mijyi, ntabwo ikoreshwa mu nzira nyabagendwa, kandi yujuje ubuziranenge bw\u2019umutekano w\u2019ibinyabiziga bya Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika DOT nk\u2019imodoka yihuta cyangwa ituranye n\u2019amashanyarazi (NEV) munsi ya FMVSS 571.500. Yemerera abashoferi bari mu magare y\u2019abafite ubumuga gukoresha imodoka badasize abafite ubumuga babo, kandi bikekwa ko ari yo modoka ya mbere nk'iyi yagiye kugurishwa ku isoko ry\u2019Amerika. \nIbiranga.\nChairiot solo ntabwo ihinduka, yateguwe kuva yatangira gutwarwa n'umuntu ufite ubumuga ukoresheje igare ry'abafite ubumuga. Ikinyabiziga cyinjira mu muryango munini w'inyuma hamwe n'igitambambuga cyuzuye igorofa yo hasi irinda intebe y'imuga kumodoka. Igenzurwa na ruline ifite ipikipiki, hamwe no guhuza impinduramatwara hamwe na feri yo gufata feri. Igenzura ryose rirakoreshwa hamwe nimbaraga zo hejuru zo m'umubiri. Nta modoka y'ibirenge iri mu modoka. \nChairiot solo igaragaramo umubiri uhuriweho hamwe kuri chassis y'icyuma, umuryango w'inyuma nawo uhujwe, hamwe n'icyuma cyuzuye. Ihagarikwa ry'imbere ni ibyifuzo bibiri hamwe na rack-na-pinion. Ihagarikwa ry'inyuma n'igishushanyo cy'amaboko gikurikiranye hamwe na torsion tube yigenga igenzura ibiziga by'inyuma. Ifite feri y'ibiziga bine.\nChairiot solo ikoreshwa na moteri ya twin hub ifite amanota 3kilo imwe yubatswe mubiziga by'inyuma. Amapaki ya batiri ya volt 48 ya AGM ifite ubushobozi bwa nomero 7.5 kW itanga imbaraga zo gusunika, bateri y'ingoboka ya volt 12 ibikwa n'ububiko bukuru kandi igatanga ingufu kubikoresho by'amashanyarazi. Mu gihe habaye ikibazo cya moteri, Chairiot ishobora gukomeza gutwarwa na moteri imwe gusa. Igishushanyo gikoresha ingufu zitanga intera ya kilometero 40 kugeza kuri 50 k'umurongo wuzuye. Mu gihe cyo gupima imijyi ya EPA, Chairiot solo yageze kuri peteroli igera kuri 157 MPGe. \nImpamyabumenyi.\nChairiot solo yemejwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe umutungo w\u2019ikirere cya Californiya (CARB) nk\u2019imodoka zangiza. Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacuruzi b\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019imodoka (NMEDA) ryatangaje muri Werurwe mu mwaka 2015 ko Chairiot solo yatsinze gahunda yayo yo gusuzuma (CRP); niyo modoka ya mbere yihuta cyane, igare ry\u2019abafite ubumuga ryagerwaho ku isi ryemejwe n\u2019ubuyobozi bwigenga kugira ngo ryubahirize ibipimo ngenderwaho by\u2019umutekano w\u2019ibinyabiziga muri Amerika (FMVSS) 571.500. "}
{"id": "17945", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17945", "title": "Imyandikire y'Amarenga y'intoki y'Abanyamerika", "text": "Imyandikire y'Amarenga y'Abanyamerika (AMA) ni inyuguti y'intoki yongerera amagambo y'ururimi rw'amarenga y'abafite ubumuga b'Abanyamerika.\nInzandiko n'imibare.\nInyuguti n'imibare byashyizweho umukono k'uburyo bukurikira. Mu buryo butemewe, ibiganza by'intoki ntabwo bikozwe neza nkuko biri mu buryo busanzwe.Imyandikire y'intoki ishobora gukoreshwa ku maboko yombi, mubusanzwe ikiganza cyiganje ni ukuvuga ukuboko kw'iburyo kuburyo bw'iburyo, ukuboko kwi bumoso k'ubumoso. Kenshi na kenshi, inyuguti z'intoki zashyizweho umukono munsi y'igitugu cyiganjemo umukono. Iyo ikoreshejwe mu bindi bimenyetso cyangwa m'urwego ibyo bidashoboka, iri tegeko rusange rirashobora kwirengagizwa. \nJ na Z birimo kugenda. J ninjye ufite impinduramatwara y'intoki, ku buryo urutoki ruto rukurikirana umurongo w'uburyo bwanditse bw'inyuguti, Z ni urutoki rwerekanwe inyuma n'inyuma, ku buryo urutoki rukurikirana imiterere ya zig-zag y'inyuguti Z. Izi \"tracings\" zombi zakozwe nkuko bigaragara kubasinyiye niba ari ukuboko kw'iburyo, nkuko bigaragazwa n'amashusho ari muri ibi ingingo. Iyo wasinywe n'ikiganza cy'ibumoso, icyerekezo kiri mu mashusho y'indorerwamo, kubw'ibyo ntibisubizwa kubareba. Ariko, abasinya neza ntibakeneye \"gusoma\" imiterere yibi bikorwa. \nMu bishushanyo byinshi cyangwa amashusho yerekana Inyuguti mfashanyigisho y'Abanyamerika, zimwe mu nyuguti zerekanwa kuva kuruhande kugira ngo zerekane neza imiterere y'intoki. Kurugero, inyuguti \"G\" na \"H\" zerekanwa kenshi k'uruhande kugira ngo zerekane umwanya w'intoki. Ariko, basinyishije ukuboko mumwanya udafite aho ubogamiye, ikiganza cyerekeje k'uruhande n'intoki zerekeza imbere.\nInyuguti nyinshi zifite imiterere y'intoki imwe, kandi itandukanijwe n'icyerekezo. Izi ni \"h\" na \"u\", \"k\" na \"p\" igikumwe ku rutoki rwo hagati, \"g\" na \"q\" kandi, mu buryo butemewe, \"d\" na \"g / q\". Mu gusinya byihuse, \"n\" itandukanijwe na \"h / u\" icyerekezo. Inyuguti \"a\" na \"s\" zifite icyerekezo kimwe, kandi zirasa cyane mu buryo. Igikumwe kiri k'uruhande rw'ikiganza mu nyuguti \"a\", imbere ya \"s\". Iyo ikoreshejwe mu magambo y'icyongereza yanditseho n'urutoki, inyuguti z'intoki zishobora kwerekanwa ukundi kuruta niba zihagarara zonyine. \nInjyana, umuvuduko no kugenda.\nIyo urutoki, n'ikiganza kiri m'urwego rwo hejuru, ntabwo isunika hamwe na buri baruwa. Inyuguti ebyiri mu ijambo zashyizweho umukono mu buryo butandukanye, binyuze m'ukuboko kw'amaboko, kunyerera kw'amaboko, cyangwa gusubiramo ikimenyetso cy'urwandiko. Inzandiko zashyizweho umukono ku muvuduko uhoraho, kuruhuka imikorere nk'ijambo rigabanya. Ibaruwa ya mbere ishobora gufatwa kuburebure bw'inyuguti y'inyongera nk'ibisobanuro uwasinye ari hafi gutangira gutunga urutoki.\nGukoresha.\nUrutoki rukoreshwa cyane cyane mu gutiza amagambo mu cyongereza. Ubusanzwe ikoreshwa gusa mu bihe byihariye. Ibikurikira ni amagambo ashobora gukenera kwandikwa n'urutoki, amazina akwiye, amazina y'ikirango, amazina y'ikibanza, nandi magambo yose adafite ikimenyetso gisanzwe. Mu bindi bihe, koresha urutoki gake.\nGuhinduka no gutandukana mu bitabo by'intoki.\nKimwe n'izindi ndimi, Ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abanyamerika ruhora rutera imbere. Mu gihe impinduka z'intoki zidashoboka, impinduka nke ziracyagaragara mu gihe. Imyandikire y'intoki irasa uyumunsi kuruta uko byari bimeze mumyaka mirongo ishize. Urugero rw'ibanze rw'ubu buryo bwo guhinduka ruboneka muri \"gutaka 'E'\". Ibisekuru byakera by'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva baracyashimangira ko ishusho ya \"E\" isaba ko igikumwe gikora inama y'intoki nintoki zo hagati. Hagati aho, ibisekuru bikiri bito bitangiye kubyara ishusho itandukanya igikumwe n'izindi ntoki k'uruhande rwo hasi rw'ikigazi. \nIcyongereza n'inyuguti z'intoki.\nKubera ko urutoki rwatunganijwe mbere m'urwego rwo kwinjiza ururimi rw'icyongereza mururimi rw'amarenga, bifitanye isano rya bugufi n'icyongereza. Ubushakashatsi bwerekanye ko abatumva batunganya uburyo bwo gusoma no gutunga urutoki kimwe. Kubera iyo mpamvu, gutunga urutoki byagize ingaruka zikomeye ku gusoma no kutumva abana. Uyu mwanzuro waremewe cyane, ariko habayeho impaka zishingiye ku buryo bwo kwigisha bukoresha neza iyo sano. \nUrurimi rw'amarenga na Fonetika yarwo.\nFonetika ntabwo igomba guhagarikwa kumvugo gusa ariko ishobora no gukoreshwa mu gihe wasinyiye abandi. Iyo usinya, imvugo y'umuntu ishobora kumenya cyane ibizava mubyo bagerageza kuvugana n'undi muntu. K'urugero, niba uwasinye yagerageje gusinyira ko basaze, bakoreshaga mu maso hamwe n'ururimi rw'umubiri kugira ngo bamenye neza uko bamerewe. N'ubwo imvugo ivugwa nayo ikoresha ubu buryo bwo kwerekana, ntabwo bashingirwaho cyane nk'ururimi rw'amarenga. Imvugo y'imvugo mvugo n'ururimi rw'amarenga birasa kuko imvugo ivugwa ikoresha ijwi ry'ijwi kugira ngo umenye uko umuntu ameze kandi ururimi rw'amarenga rukoresha isura yo mu maso kugira ngo umenye uko umuntu ameze. Fonetika byanze bikunze bifitanye isano n'ururimi ruvugwa gusa ariko irashobora no gukoreshwa m'ururimi rw'amarenga rw'abanyamerika (ASL). Iyo winjiye muri ASL, abantu ntibasinya amagambo nkuko yavuzwe. Isano iri hagati y'imvugo ivugwa na ASL iratandukanye kuko hariho isano hagati y'ibimenyetso bimwe n'amagambo yabo kandi bigasinywa ukundi kuko ASL itashyizweho umukono nkuko bivugwa. "}
{"id": "17946", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17946", "title": "ElevenLabs", "text": "ElevenLabs ni sosiyete ikora software kabuhariwe mu gutezimbere imvugo yumvikanisha imvugo hamwe na software y'imvugo, ikoresheje ubwenge bw'ubukorikori hamwe no kwiga byimbitse.\nYamenyekanye nka imwe mu ma sosiyete akomeye inyuma ya AI Spring igikomeje. \nAmateka.\nElevenLabs yashinzwe mu mwaka 2022 na Piotr D\u0105bkowski, wahoze ari injeniyeri wiga imashini kubijyanye na Google hamwe na Mateusz Staniszewski, ushinzwe ingamba z'ibijyanye no kohereza Palantir. Bombi bakuriye mu gihugu cya Polonye, kandi imbaraga zabo zo gushinga ElevenLabs bivugwa ko zaturutse mu kureba filime zitwa izidahagije filime zo muri America. \nD\u0105bkowski na Staniszewski babanje gusuzuma uburyo butandukanye bwo gutera inkunga, harimo amahirwe yo gukorana nokwihuta gutangira. Muri Mutarama mu mwaka 2023 bagaragaje ko babonye inkunga zingana na miliyoni 2 z'amadolari yo muri Amerika. Umwihariko wo gutangiza ubwenge bw'ijwi rya AI, ururwego rukomeje kugaragara mu bihugu by'Iburayi, yagize uruhare runini mu gukurura abashoramari. Inkunga yabanjirije imbuto yari iyobowe cyane na Credo Ventures, kandi ifatanya na Concept Ventures. \nMuri Mutarama mu mwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yashyize ahagaragara k'umugaragaro beta yayo. \nMuri kamena mu mwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yakusanyije miliyoni 19 z'amadorali y\u2019uruhererekane A inkunga ingana na miliyoni 100 z'amadolari, nubwo isosiyete idafite ibiro ndetse n\u2019abakozi 15 gusa. Inkunga yatanzwe yari iyobowe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019imari ni shoramari Andreessen Horowitz, Nat Friedman wahoze ari umuyobozi wa GitHub, na rwiyemezamirimo Daniel Gross. Yagaragaje kandi uruhare rw\u2019abantu bakomeye nka SV Angel, Mike Krieger (washinze Instagram), Brendan Iribe (washinze Oculus), Mustafa Suleyman (washinze Deepmind), na Tim O'Reilly (washinze O'Reilly Media). Byatangajwe kandi ko Andreessen Horowitz azinjira mu buyobozi bwa ElevenLabs. \nKu ya 22 Mutarama mu mwaka 2024, ElevenLabs yakusanyije miliyoni 80 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika mu nkunga B yazamuye igiciro cya sosiyete igera kuri miliyari 1.1. Kubijyanye n'inkunga yatanzwe yari iyobowe na Andreessen Horowitz, Friedman, Gross, na Sequoia Capital. Byongeye kandi kuribyo, sosiyete yatangaje urutonde rw'ibicuruzwa bishya, nk'isoko ryabo ry'ijwi, Studio ya AI Dubbing, hamwe na porogaramu igendanwa. \nIbicuruzwa.\nElevenLabs izwi cyane cyane kuri mushakisha ishingiye kuri AI, ifashwa na AI n'inyandiko y'imvugo, Speech Synthesis, ishobora kubyara imvugo ubuzima bwose muguhuza amarangamutima n'ijwi. Isosiyete ivuga ko porogaramu zayo zubatswe mu rwego rwo guhindura intonasiyo n'umuvuduko wo gutanga hashingiwe ku bijyanye no kwinjiza ururimi rukoreshwa. Ikoresha algorithms yateye imbere kugira ngo isesengure ibintu bijyanye n'inyandiko, igamije kumenya amarangamutima nk'umujinya, umubabaro, umunezero, cyangwa gutabaza, ituma sisitemu yumva imyumvire y'umukoresha, bikavamo kugera kubintu bifatika kandi bisa nk'abantu.. Gutangira biri mubikorwa byo gutanga ipatanti. Binyuze kurubuga rwa beta, abayikoresha bashobora gutanga inyandiko no kubyara dosiye z'amajwi uhereye kumajwi asanzwe. Abakoresha bishyura bahabwa ubushobozi bwo kohereza amajwi yihariye kugira ngo bakore uburyo bushya bw'ijwi bakoresheje igikoresho cyogukoresha amajwi y'ikigo. \nIsomero ry'Ijwi ni ikintu kiranga sosiyete mu buryo bwo gusangira imyirondoro idasanzwe y'ijwi ryakozwe hakoreshejwe cyangwa hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga ryabo. Ijwi ryateguwe mbere y'ijwi ryemerera abakoresha mu guhitamo ijwi rihuye neza n'ibyifuzo byabo, aho kurema imwe. Ikindi gikoresho cyitwa VoiceLab cyemerera abakoresha clone amajwi avuye mu bice bike by'amajwi kandi bishobora gukora amajwi mashya. \nKu taliki ya 20 Kamena mu mwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yasohoye igikoresho cyo kumenyekanisha AI cyitwa AI Speech Classifier, ivuga ko ari cyo cya mbere cyacyo. Igikoresho kiragerwaho binyuze muri API kandi cyashizweho kugira ngo hamenyekane niba icyitegererezo cy'amajwi yoherejwe gikomoka kuri tekinoroji ya AI ya ElevenLabs. Isosiyete yagaragaje ubushake bwo gufatanya n\u2019abandi bateza imbere AI mu gushyiraho sisitemu yo kumenya isi yose ishobora kwakirwa mu nganda zose.\nMuri Nyakanga mu kwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yatangaje Imishinga irimo, igikoresho cyo gukora ibintu birebire byavuzwe nk'ibitabo by'amajwi n'ibice by'ibiganiro hamwe n'amajwi akoreshwa neza. Igikoresho cyasohotse muri Nzeri. Muri Kanama, ElevenLabs yagize ubushobozi bwo gutanga amajwi mu ndimi 28. Ukoresheje icyitegererezo cya AI, yahise itahura indimi zirimo nkiza Abanyakoreya, Abadage, na Viyetinamu, bigatuma habaho abakire mu marangamutima bakomoka mu ndimi nyinshi zitandukanye. Isosiyete yatangaje kandi ko ikoranabuhanga ryayo ryasohotse ku mugaragaro icyiciro cya beta. \nMu Kwakira mu mwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yerekanye \"AI Dubbing,\" igikoresho gishobora guhindura imvugo mu ndimi zirenga 20. Ibiranga ubushobozi bwo kurinda ijwi ry'umwimerere w'umuvugizi, amarangamutima, hamwe nintonasiyo, ukoresheje uburyo bwihariye kugira ngo ukemure imirimo nko kuvanaho urusaku, gutandukanya abavuga, kwandukura, no guhuza imvugo yahinduwe hamwe n'ijwi ry'umwimerere ryanyaryo. \nGukoresha.\nImikoreshereze ya cumi na rimwe ikoreshwa mu rwego rw'imirenge.\nAbakora imirimo bakoresheje ElevenLabs kuri podcasts, kuvuga, no kwerekana urwenya. Muri Werurwe mu mwaka 2023, umunyarwenya Drew Carey yakoresheje igikoresho cyo gukoresha amajwi ya ElevenLabs kugira ngo yongere ijwi rye mu gice cya radiyo ye, \"ku wa gatanu nijoro Freakout\". Muri Mata mu mwaka 2023, umunyamakuru wa televiziyo na radiyo yo muri Polonye, Jaroslaw Kuzniar, yakoresheje na verisiyo y\u2019ijwi rye kugira ngo atange urukurikirane rwa podcast ku ntambara yo muri Ukraine. Seth Godin yakoresheje kandi ElevenLabs kugira ngo avuge podcast ye yibanze kuri AI. \nMuri Werurwe mu mwaka 2023, Super-Hi-Fi, serivise yo gutangiza amakuru, yafatanyije na ElevenLabs gutanga serivise yuzuye ya radiyo yiswe \"AI Radio\", ikoresheje porogaramu ya ElevenLabs kugira ngo ivuze uburyo bwo kuvanga imiziki mu buryo busanzwe ivuye mu bisobanuro byatanzwe na ChatGPT. ElevenLabs yakoreshejwe kandi mu kuvuga imikino no kuvuga amajwi y'imikino ku bufatanye n\u2019umushinga w\u2019imikino wo mu gihugu cya Suwede witwa Paradox Interactive hamwe na Magicave ikorera mu gihugu cy'Ubwongereza. \nAbanyamaji n'abanditsi bakoresheje ElevenLabs mu kuvuga ibitabo n'amajwi. Ku ya 13 Kamena 2023, Storytel yatangaje ubufatanye bwihariye na sosiyete. Muri ubwo bufatanye, ElevenLabs ikora amajwi ajyanye n\u2019amasoko yibanze ya Storytel no gukora ibitabo by'amajwi byavuzwe na AI. Imiterere ihindura amajwi yitwa VoiceSwitcher yashyizwe mubikorwa kugirango itezimbere abakoresha, itanga ubunararibonye bwo gutegera bwihariye kuri buri muntu. \nElevenLabs yakoreshejwe mugukora amajwi yo gukina amashusho mu ndimi zitandukanye, harimo nabashinzwe gukora ibintu. Ihuriro rifite ubushobozi bwo kwigana neza imvugo iyo ari yo yose mu rurimi urwo arirwo rwose. Abafana b'ibyamamare bakoresheje ElevenLabs mugukora ubutumwa butera inkunga bakoresheje amajwi y'ibyamamare bakunda. \nMuri Gashyantare, umunyamakuru wa VICE, Joseph Cox, yatangaje ibyagaragaye ko yanditse iminota itanu yivugiye hanyuma akoresha ElevenLabs mu gukora amajwi yimbitse yatsinze sisitemu yo kwemeza amajwi ya banki. \nElevenLabs ishyiraho amabwiriza asobanutse yerekeranye no gukoresha ikoranabuhanga ryayo, ibuza gutondekanya amajwi hagamijwe gutukana nko kuriganya, ivangura, imvugo yangwa, cyangwa guhohotera k'umurongo, nubwo ishyigikira ikoreshwa ry'urubuga rwayo kuri karikatire, parody na satire kandi Imvugo y'ubuhanzi na politiki igira uruhare mu biganiro mbwirwaruhame. Isosiyete yemeza ko ifite uburenganzira bwo guhagarika konti n'ibirimo by'abakoresha basanze binyuranyije n'aya mabwiriza, kandi inagaragaza ko yiyemeje gufatanya n'abayobozi no gutanga raporo ku bikorwa binyuranyije n'amategeko hakurikijwe ibisabwa. \nKwakira.\nNyuma yo gushyirwa ahagaragara muri Mutarama mu mwaka 2023, ElevenLabs yongerewe imbaraga kandi ishimirwa ubwiza bw\u2019ijwi ryayo, ibihe byihuta, ndetse n urwego rw'ubuntu. Yashimiwe kandi k'ubushobozi ifite bwo kuvuga neza amazina afite imvugo idasanzwe, ikemura ikibazo gikunze kugaragara mubikoresho bisa n'ibikunze guhuza cyane cyane amazina y'uburengerazuba. Sosiyete yageze ku bakoresha barenga miliyoni biyandikishije hagati yo kuyitangiza muri Kamena mu mwaka 2023. \nElevenLabs yanenzwe nyuma y\u2019uko abayikoresha bashoboye gukoresha porogaramu zayo kugira ngo batange amagambo atavugwaho rumwe mu buryo bw\u2019ijwi ry\u2019ibyamamare, abayobozi ba Leta, ndetse n\u2019abandi bantu bazwi, bikurura abantu cyane nyuma y\u2019abakoresha kuri 4chan yakoresheje igikoresho cyo gusangira ubutumwa. Ubushobozi bwa software bwo gukoporora hafi amajwi nyayo byazamuye impungenge zimyitwarire, abayinenga babifata nk'uburyo bwimbitse. Mu gusubiza, isosiyete yavuze ko izakora ku kugabanya ihohoterwa rishobora gukoreshwa binyuze mu kurinda no kugenzura indangamuntu. Sosiyete yaje kubona uburyo bwo gukoresha amajwi y\u2019abafatabuguzi bahembwa, ivuga ko hasabwa gutanga amakuru y\u2019ubwishyu mu rwego rwo kunoza ibyo babazwa, kandi ishyira mu bikorwa ibihano ku bakoresha barenze ku masezerano ya serivisi.\nImpungenge zagaragaye z\u2019inyongera zagarutsweho ku bijyanye n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019isoko ku mahugurwa ya ElevenLabs, hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi benshi batandukanye bavuga ko ElevenLabs habayeho kuba yakoresheje ingero z\u2019amajwi yabo batabanje kubiherwa uruhushya cyangwa uburenganzira. ElevenLabs, hamwe nandi masosiyete yo mucyiciro cyayo, byagaragaye rero ko ari ikibazo gishobora gutera urwego rukora amajwi. "}
{"id": "17947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17947", "title": "Gnome Subtitles", "text": "Gnome Subtitles ni umwanditsi wa ya, ishingiye kuri. Ifasha inyandiko zisanzwe zishingiye kumyandikire, kureba amashusho, igihe cyo guhuza hamwe no guhindura ibisobanuro.\nGnome Subtitles ni yasohotse munsi ya.\nIbiranga.\nGnome Subtitles ishyigikira imiterere ya subtitle izwi cyane, nka (kandi na), na.\nIfite interineti, ishyigikira (gushira amanga, italike no gushushanya imiterere) hamwe ninzego nyinshi gusubiramo / gusubiramo. Gnome subtitles irashobora kandi gukora ibikorwa byigihe, guhindura imitwe ya subtitle no gukorana na kodegisi ya subtitle mu buryo bwikora.\nAmashusho yerekana amashusho, umwanya uhindagurika, guhitamo kodegisi hamwe na subtitle guhuza / gutandukana byongewe muburyo bushya.\nPorogaramu nkiyi ni, Jubler, Subtitle Muhinduzi, Gaupol, nibindi"}
{"id": "17948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=17948", "title": "Aegisub", "text": "Aegisub ni yo guhindura porogaramu. Nigikoresho nyamukuru, imyitozo yo gukora cyangwa guhindura insanganyamatsiko zidasanzwe kubitangazamakuru biboneka. Numusimbura wumwimerere na Sabbu. \nIgishushanyo cya Aegisub cyibanda ku, imiterere ya subtitles, no kurema. Iremera amashusho menshi yo gutunganya amashusho gutunganya igihe, nka na. Irashobora kandi kwagurwa hamwe nindimi za na MoonScript. \nImiterere kavukire ya porogaramu ni, ishyigikira imyanya ihagaze hamwe na styling. Aegisub irashobora kohereza subtitles mubindi bikoresho bisanzwe, nka format ya \".srt\", ariko kubiciro gutakaza ibintu byose bizigama inyandiko mbisi nigihe cyibanze.\nMu bafanaubbing, Aegisub ikoreshwa muguhindura, kugihe, gutunganya, kwandika, kugenzura ubuziranenge, igihe cya no gukora karaoke. Amatsinda menshi akoresha ibikoresho bitandukanye kuri zimwe murizo ntambwe, ariko, nka zo kwandika, cyangwa ubwanditsi bworoshye guhindura."}
