{"id": "18015", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18015", "title": "Beatrice Mujawayezu", "text": "Beatrice Mujawayezu ni umunyarwandakazi w'umucuruzi akaba n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa wa B-KELANA International (R) Ltd. Afite uburambe bw'imyaka irenga 18 muri mu bugenzuzi hamwe n'ubujyanama mu by'imari. Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'imari n'impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kaminuza yakuye muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda Ni umucungamari wemewe ufite impamya bumenyi ya CPA yakuye mu gihugu cya Kenya.\nB-KELANA International.\nB-KELANA International n\u2019ikigo gikomeye cy\u2019ubugenzuzi n\u2019ubujyanama mu by'icungamari ikaba ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Iki kigo gifite intego y'ibanze yo kongerera ubumenyi abacuruzi, amasosiyete, n'imiryango guhitamo ndetse no gucunga neza imari, binyuze mu gukora isesengura ryuzuye ry'imiterere y'ubucuruzi bwawe ukoresheje umutungo ufite.\nAho Akora.\nAkora mu isosiyete Ngishwanama na Serivisi, afite uruhare rugaragara mu biganiro bijyanye n\u2019imari, ibaruramari, imisoro, imiyoborere y\u2019ibigo, amabwiriza ya AML / CFT, hamwe n\u2019urwego rwigisha ibigendanye no gucunga neza amafaranga."}
