{"id": "18019", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18019", "title": "IKIGO NDERABUZIMA CYA RUHUNDA", "text": "Ikigo nderabuzima cya ruhunda ni kimwe mu bigo nderabuzima byo mu karere ka Rwamagana, iki kigo cyubatswe ahasaga 1986 kikaba giherereye mu murenge wa Gashari. mukagari ka ruhunda mumudugudu wa nyagahinga ikikigo Kandi kikaba gifite nibitaro bita materinete bifasha abadamu kubyara ndetse nizindi serivise zigiye zitandukanye \nAmateka.\nkuva muri 1986 iki kigo cyatangiye kwakira abarwayi batandukanye baturukaga mu mirenge igikikije dore ko aricyo cyari cyegereye abaturage bo mu mirenge ya Gishari na Munyiginya. kubere ubwinshi bw' abasaba serivisi z' ubuzima icyo kigo cyashyiho amavuriro y' ingoboka yo kugifasha gutanga izo serivisi. \nAmashakiro.\n3.https://www.rwamagana.gov.rw/soma-ibindi/gishali-hon-senateri-narcisse-musabeyezu-na-hon-senateri-perrine-mukankusi-basuye-ikigo-nderabuzima-cya-ruhunda"}
