{"id": "18083", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18083", "title": "Gasaro Helen Nathalie", "text": "Gasaro Helen Nathalie, ni umuyobozi ushinzwe ishami muri Amerika, Loni n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga (Icyongereza: Division Manager in charge of Americas, UN and International Organizations) kuva ku wa 27 Gashyantare 2024. \nAmateka.\nNathalie Gasaro yabaye umufasha wihariye wa Minisitiri w\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga n\u2019ubufatanye mpuzamahanga bwa Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda. Yinjiye muri Minisiteri muri 2019 aho yagiye akora mu nzego zitandukanye. Yanditse inyandiko kubinyamakuru byigisha nibisohokayandikiro mubijyanye n'ubuyobozi, abimukira, ubucuruzi, ingufu, inshingano rusange mubigo, n'ibindi.\nAmashuri.\nNathalie afite impamyabumenyi mu mibanire n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ubuyobozi (Mu icyongereze: International Relations and Business Management and Leadership from Chartered Management Institute-UK), akaba n'umuhanga mukuvuga ururimi rw' igifaransa na Kinyarwanda."}
{"id": "18085", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18085", "title": "Kabasinga Florida", "text": "Kabasinga ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamategeko ni we washinze Fondasiyo ya CERTA akaba n'Umuyobozi mukuru. Nkumuyobozi mukuru wurwego rwamategeko rwa Certa, Florida nitsinda rye basanze bakira kandi baburana imanza za SRHR n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina pro bono. Bitewe no gukorana bya hafi n\u2019indi miryango y\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga muri uru rwego, harimo n\u2019umuhuza w\u2019abagore ku isi hose, Florida yafashe icyemezo cyo gutangiza Fondasiyo kugira ngo iki gikorwa gikorwe mu rwego rw\u2019inshingano z\u2019imibereho ya Law Firm. Florida azana uburambe bukomeye haba mumahanga ndetse no mugihugu. Ni Perezida wa Komite ishinzwe gukemura amakimbirane y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba akaba n'umwe mu bagize Urugaga rw\u2019Abavoka muri Amerika.\nAmashuri.\nMadamu Florida afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Magna cum Laude) mu mategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Notre Dame (Indiana, Amerika) na Bachelor of Laws Degree (LLB Hons) wo muri kaminuza ya Makerere (Kampala, Uganda). Yakiriye kandi amahugurwa atandukanye mu bigo bizwi cyane, kaminuza ya Pretoriya, Afurika y'Epfo, kaminuza ya Erasimusi, La Haye, mu Buholandi, ndetse n'ikigo gishinzwe ubukemurampaka, London.\nAmateka y'Akazi.\nAfite uburambe bwimyaka 20 nkumushinjacyaha no mubikorwa byemewe n'amategeko, harimo no kuburana ingamba no kuburana inyungu rusange. Ni n'umuhuza wemejwe n'Ikigo Mpuzamahanga gishinzwe gukemura no gukemura amakimbirane akaba n'umukemurampaka ukomeye mu kigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe ubukemurampaka cya Kigali aho yari ahagarariye abakiriya mpuzamahanga ndetse n'ab'imbere mu gihugu, barimo Umuryango mpuzamahanga uharanira kubungabunga ibidukikije (IUCN). \nYigishije, mu bihe bitandukanye, Amategeko mpanabyaha mpuzamahanga, Inkiko za Moot hamwe n\u2019amahame rusange y\u2019imanza n\u2019ubuhanga, hamwe n\u2019izindi, muri za kaminuza zitandukanye zo mu Rwanda ndetse no mu mahanga, harimo no mu kigo gishinzwe amategeko n\u2019iterambere mu Rwanda (ILPD). Usibye kwigisha, ni n'umutoza aho ahora akora amahugurwa y\u2019abavoka bunganira abategarugori bayobowe n\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abavoka mu Rwanda rugamije gushishikariza no kuzamura ubushobozi bwabo ndetse n\u2019umwirondoro wabo mu bikorwa by\u2019amategeko mu Rwanda no mu muryango w\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba. Madamu Florida yabanje gukorera guverinoma y'u Rwanda nk'umujyanama mukuru mu by'amategeko ku mushinjacyaha mukuru ndetse n'ishami mpuzamahanga rishinzwe ibyaha, ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubushinjacyaha, mu Rwanda.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, Madamu Florida na we agaragara neza aho yakoraga nk'umujyanama w\u2019ubujurire, umujyanama wungirije w\u2019ubujurire akaba n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe imanza mu biro by\u2019ubushinjacyaha, Urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye mu Rwanda (ICTR). Madamu Florida ni umunyamuryango w\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abavoka mu Rwanda, Umuryango w\u2019Amategeko y\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba, Urugaga rw\u2019Abavoka muri Amerika, Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Abashinjacyaha, akaba n'umwe mu bagize Ikigo gishinzwe ubukemurampaka mu kigo cy\u2019ubukemurampaka cya Kigali. Avuga mu nama zitandukanye ku bijyanye n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera ikiremwamuntu n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha ku isi, vuba aha i Washington DC, Michigan, Nairobi, na San Diego.\nIzindi nshingano.\nUmunyamategeko w\u2019u Rwanda, Florida Kabasinga yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019amategeko muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EALS). Umuryango w'Amategeko EA urimo amashyirahamwe y'abavoka mu gihugu yose ya EAC, harimo Umuryango w'Amategeko muri Kenya, Umuryango w'Amategeko wa Tanganyika, Umuryango w'Amategeko wa Uganda, Umuryango w'Amategeko wa Zanzibar, Urugaga rw'Abavoka mu Rwanda, Urugaga rw'Abavoka mu Burundi n'Urugaga rw'Abavoka muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo.\nIndimi akoresha.\nAvuga indimi enye arizo Kinyarwanda, Igifaransa, Icyongereza n'Igiswahili."}
{"id": "18086", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18086", "title": "Mukiza Shaki", "text": "MUKIZA Shaki ni Umuhuzabikorwa wa Gahunda- Ubukungu n\u2019Uburinganire Ubutabera mu Ikigo cy\u2019ubutabera n\u2019ubuvugizi muri CERTA Foundation. \nAmashuri.\nMUKIZA Shaki afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko (LLB) (Hons) yakuye muri kaminuza Gatolika yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, Kenya.\nAmateka.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri Fondasiyo, yakoraga mu cyumba cy\u2019amategeko cya Certa nk'umukozi ushinzwe amategeko mu gihe kirenze imyaka ibiri, aho yagize uruhare mu manza kuva ku mategeko y\u2019umuryango kugeza ku mategeko agenga ibigo binyuze mu gusesengura no gutegura inyandiko zemewe n'amategeko. Mbere yibyo, Shaki yakoze gahunda yo kwimenyereza umwuga muri societe y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EALS) i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya mu gihe yakuyemo ubumenyi bwinshi ku Mategeko rusange no gusobanukirwa Amategeko mu karere.\nAfite ishyaka ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu ashishikajwe cyane cyane n'uburenganzira bw'umwana, uburenganzira bw\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imyororokere n\u2019imyororokere y\u2019abagore kimwe n\u2019amategeko y\u2019umuryango. Usibye ibyo, ashishikajwe cyane na Criminology &amp; Forensics mu zindi nyungu. \nIndimi.\nMUKIZA avuga Kinyarwanda, Icyongereza n'Igiswahili."}
{"id": "18087", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18087", "title": "Mupiganyi Appolinaire", "text": "Mupiganyi Appolinaire ni umunyarwanda, akaba ari umuyobozi nshingwabikorwa w'ishami ry'umuryango urwanya ruswa n'akarengane mu Rwanda (mu cyongereza: Transparency International Rwanda).\nImirimo.\nMupiganyi afite uburambe bw' igihe kirenga imyaka makumyabiri aho yagiye akora mu bigo by'igenga ndetse no mu miryango itegamiye kuri leta."}
{"id": "18088", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18088", "title": "Harerimana Euphrasie", "text": "Euphrasie Harerimana ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamategeko wunganira abana muri Fondasiyo ya CERTA ikorera mu Karere ka Gatsibo. \nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko (LLB) yakuye muri Universit\u00e9 Libre de Kigali (ULK) kandi ni umunyamuryango w'Urugaga rw'Abavoka mu Rwanda. \nAkazi.\nEuphrasie afite uburambe bwimyaka 10 akorana nabakiriya mubunzi, ubushakashatsi no gutegura imanza k'uburanisha. \nIndimi.\nAvuga Icyongereza, Igifaransa, Kinyarwanda na Kiswahili."}
{"id": "18089", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18089", "title": "Mukamasabo Gloriose", "text": "Mukamasabo Gloriose niumunyarwandakazi w' Umuvugizi urengera Abana muri Fondasiyo ya CERTA ikorera mu Karere ka Nyagatare. \nAmashuri.\n\"Gloriose yize amashuli yisumbuye muri Lycee Saint Alexandre Sauli/MUHURA kuva Nzeri/2002 kugera Ugushyingo/2005 mu ishami ry'amategeko n'ubutegetsi (A2), Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse kandi mu by'amategeko (LLB) yakuye mu kigo cyigenga cy\u2019Abadiventisti b'Abalayiki ba Kigali (UNILAK), akaba n'umwe mu bagize Urugaga rw'Abavoka mu Rwanda.Mbere yo kwinjira muri fondasiyo ya Certa, Gloriose yakoranye na Polisi y'u Rwanda mu ishami rishinzwe iperereza ku byaha nk'abapolisi babo b'ubucamanza bashinzwe imanza za SGBV, yanakoraga mu butumwa bw'umuryango w'abibumbye i Darfur (UNAMID) nk'umuyobozi wabo mu by'amategeko. \"\nIndimi.\nAvuga Icyongereza, Igifaransa, Kinyarwanda na Kiswahili."}
{"id": "18090", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18090", "title": "Munganyinka Taima Lydia", "text": "Munganyinka Taima Lydia ni Umuyobozi w'ikigo gishinzwe ubutabera n'ubuvugizi muri Certa Foundation. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Fondasiyo, yakoranye na Conrad N. Hilton Foundation mu Mudugudu wa Westlake, muri Kaliforuniya aho yakoreye ubushakashatsi kuri Initiative ya Mushikiwabo Gatolika ku mishinga iri mu nshingano z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuntu ndetse anashyiramo politiki yo kurengera abana mu gutanga inkunga muri Afurika.\nAmashuri.\nNiwe wahawe buruse ya Ford Foundation mu ishuri ry\u2019amategeko rya Loyola i Los Angeles aho yakiriye Master's of Laws (LLM) mu mategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubucuruzi. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya Kabiri mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda (Huye).\nAmateka.\nMbere, yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe gahunda muri sosiyete ishinzwe amategeko muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EALS) i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya aho yakoraga imishinga yo guteza imbere demokarasi, kugendera ku mategeko n'imiyoborere myiza igamije iterambere rirambye, imibereho myiza n'ubukungu. Mbere yibyo, yakoraga nkumuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda yurubyiruko rwa USAID / IREX kugirango bahinduke - kubaka amahoro mumiryango yu Rwanda.\nAkazi.\nMuri 2009, yakoreye umuryango w\u2019ubutabera mbonezamubano Never Rwanda, muri gahunda yo kubaka umuganda Amateka y'ibyiringiro u Rwanda ndetse n'umushinga wo kubaka amahoro mu rubyiruko munsi y'ikigo cya Amerika gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga.\nMu 2011, Munganyinka yabaye umuyobozi mu by'amategeko ushinzwe ubuvugizi ku nyungu rusange no kwishyira hamwe kw'akarere hamwe na Sosiyete ishinzwe amategeko muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Umuryango w\u2019abavoka bo mu karere ufite uburenganzira mu masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba kurega ibihugu by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa mu rukiko rwihariye rw\u2019ubutabera rwa Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba ku bibazo bifitanye isano n\u2019inyungu rusange."}
{"id": "18091", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18091", "title": "Murava Annette", "text": "Murava Annette ni umuhanzikazi Nyarwanda,muri muzika z'iyobokamana akaba ari umu Kristo w'umuramyi,indirimbo ye yambere yise\"NIHONKIRI\" ni indirimbo yatumye amenyekana ndetse akundwa na benshi,usibye kuririmba kandi Annette Murava yambitswe Impeta n'umukuzi we ndetse avuga ko yamwishimiye cyane.Nyuma baje kubana \nUbuzima bwite[hindura | hindura inkomoko].\nMurava Annette ni umuramyi wavukiye mu karere ka kamonyi aranahakurira ndetse ahiga amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye, ubusanzwe asengera mu itorero rya Vivante i Kavuga mu mugi wa Kigali,Yashakanye na HABIYAREMYE Zackarie uzwi ku izina rya Bishop Gafaranga ku italiki ya 11 z'ukwezi kwa kabiri mu mwaka wa 2023 nibwo barushinze.\nUyu muhanzikazi afite indirimbo enye kujyeza ubu zose ziramya Imana, kandi ahora avuga ko mu mpano ye yo kuririmba avuga Imana no gukomera kwayo,kandi akaba ariho anyuza ivuga butumwa ndetse n'ibohora mitima \nreferences.\n1.https://inyarwanda.com/inkuru/117481/annette-murava-uzwi-mu-ndirimbo-niho-nkiri-yambitswe-impeta-ahita-asohora-ndakwibutse-vide-117481.html\n2. https://www.igihe.com/imyemerere/article/annette-murava-umunyempano-wihariye-mu-muziki-uhimbaza-imana"}
{"id": "18092", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18092", "title": "Isobel Acquah", "text": "Isobel Acquah n'umucuruzi wujuje ibyangombwa kandi umunyamategeko wunganira ibigo ufite uburambe mu ishoramari rya banki no gushora imari. Ni umunyamwuga ufite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 20 muby'amategeko n'ubucuruzi mu nkiko nyinshi zo mu Burayi, Aziya, Uburasirazuba bwo hagati na Afurika.\nAmashuri.\nIsobel afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya Kabiri cya Kaminuza mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza ya Londere mu Bwongereza (afite uburambe mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cologne,mu Budage) na MA mu itumanaho ry\u2019imico itandukanye yakuye muri kaminuza ya Birkbeck, mu Bwongereza. Yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo akore amategeko mu Bwongereza no muri Gana.\nAkazi.\nUbunararibonye yakoze mu kazi bukubiyemo gutera inkunga umutungo (indege z\u2019amasosiyete, umutungo wo mu nyanja, ikoranabuhanga), imyenda n\u2019imigabane, gutegura imishinga mito n'iciriritse ikoresha ikoranabuhanga mu ishoramari no gutanga ibisubizo byubaka kubakiriya ba sosiyete.\nYakoranye n\u2019abakora imari, abatangiza Tech hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete manini kugira ngo batange ubugenzuzi bw\u2019amategeko n\u2019ibikorwa, imiyoborere n\u2019ibigo, imicungire y\u2019ubucuruzi ndetse n\u2019inkunga ikwiye ku bashoramari b\u2019amahanga. Ni ibicuruzwa bya Banki ya Amerika Merrill Lynch (UK / Amerika), CMS Cameron McKenna Law (UK / Ububiligi), Itsinda rya Whitaker (Gana), AB &amp; David Law (Gana / Amerika), Yaro Capital (Gana) na Globetrotters Afurika yemewe (Gana / Senegali).\nNk\u2019umuvugizi w'urubyiruko mu nzego zitandukanye, Isobel yakoranye na Banki ya Amerika Merrill Lynch (UK) gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda yabo yo kwimenyereza umwuga muri Afurika no gutanga amahugurwa ku bimenyereza umwuga ndetse n\u2019abanyeshuri bageze muri za kaminuza. Yashyizwe mu nama nyobozi ya mbere ya YALI Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba, yatewe inkunga n\u2019ikigo cya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga (USAID) na Mastercard Foundation, yagenzuye ihinduka rikomeye ry\u2019abasore barenga 4000 b\u2019Abanyafurika, harimo n\u2019abagore bagaragaye binyuze muri CAMFED. Ni nyampinga mu buyobozi bw'urubyiruko muri Afurika kandi yorohereza amasomo yo kongerera ubushobozi abanyeshuri na ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato ku bufatanye na UNFPA (Gana), kaminuza ya Ashesi (Gana), kaminuza ya Legon (Gana) na kaminuza nyafurika y'ubuyobozi (u Rwanda).\nIbyo akunda.\nIsobel ashishikajwe no kuvuganira umugore n'urubyiruko muri rusange. Ni umunyamuryango washinze umutwe wa Gana w'Ihuriro Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Abagore, umuyoboro mpuzamahanga ukwira mu bihugu 33 bifite intego imwe yo guteza imbere ubuyobozi bw\u2019umugore no guharanira uburinganire ku isi yose. Mu byo akunda harimo gusoma, ubuhanzi bugezweho, kwandika no gutembera.\nIbikorwa bwite.\nYashinze Lady Initiative muri Gana, yibasiye abakobwa barenga 300 ndetse anashinga Pearl Safe Haven, yibanda ku guharanira no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abarokotse ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina."}
{"id": "18093", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18093", "title": "Mutesi Jeanne", "text": "Mutesi Jeanne ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuyobozi ushinzwe imari n\u2019imari muri CERTA Foundation. \nAmashuri.\nMutesi afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) mu by'imari.\nAkazi.\nJeanne afite uburambe mubijyanye na MS Office, QuickBooks IFMIS na SAGE100. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Fondasiyo ya CERTA, Jeanne yakoreshwaga n'inzego zitandukanye nka Komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe abana aho yakoraga nk'umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe imari, MRB ATTORNEYS nk'umufasha w\u2019ubuyobozi, Banki ya populaire du Rwanda nk'umukozi ushinzwe gufungura konti, Ignite Power Rwanda nk'umukozi wo gukusanya. no muri Rwanda Iterambere Banki nkumwanditsi wamakuru.\nIndimi.\nMutesi avuga ururimi rw' Ikinyarwanda, Cyongereza n'Igifaransa."}
{"id": "18094", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18094", "title": "Gatesi Renita", "text": "Gatesi Renita ni umuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda ya Startup Bluebook mu kigo gishinzwe amategeko no guhanga udushya muri Certa Foundation. Ni umuvugizi ushishikajwe no kubona ubutabera kandi yitangiye umwuga we mu guteza imbere gukorera mu mucyo no mu mucyo binyuze mu bisubizo bishya bigezweho. Ni umwe muri Centre ishinzwe amategeko no guhanga udushya mu Rwanda. \nAmashuri.\nUbwo yakurikiranaga amasomo ye muby'abategeko muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, yashyize ubumenyi bwe mu bushakashatsi kugira ngo akore nk'umufasha w\u2019ubushakashatsi mu muryango utegamiye kuri Leta witwa Benishaka ukora isuzuma ry\u2019ingaruka z\u2019abana mu bipimo by\u2019ihohoterwa rikorerwa abana, kutita ku bana, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina n\u2019amarangamutima.\nAmateka n' Akazi.\nGatesi Renita n'umwe mu bakobwa 70 bitabiriye amarushanwa y'ubwiza mu Rwanda azwi nka Miss Rwanda kuwa 16 Gashyantare 2022. yakoranye na gahunda y'amahugurwa y'abunzi n'ubwiyunge muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda nk'umuhuzabikorwa wabo. Ashishikajwe n'uburenganzira bwa muntu no gukemura amakimbirane. Mu kigo gishinzwe amategeko no guhanga udushya, Renita yishora mu gukemura amakimbirane (gukemura amakimbirane, ubukemurampaka, no gusuzuma bitabogamye) ubushakashatsi n'ibikorwa bijyanye.\nIbyo kwishimira.\nBinyuze muri Startup Bluebook Program, Gatesi yafashije abatangije tekinoloji gutsinda no gutera imbere birambye. Ibikorwa bye byashyizeho urwego rushya rwo gushyigikira gutangiza no guteza imbere ubudasa no kwinjiza mu nganda zikoranabuhanga. Yizera ko ikoranabuhanga rishobora gukoreshwa mu koroshya inzira zubahirizwa no kugabanya ingaruka z\u2019amategeko ku batangiye, amaherezo bikazamura iterambere ryabo kandi rirambye mu bukungu bwa digitale.\nIbyo yagezeho.\nKimwe mubyo yagezeho ni ugushyira mu bikorwa gahunda ya Startup Bluebook Program, gahunda yambere itanga inkunga ya bono inkunga kumategeko atandukanye. Porogaramu itanga ubuzimagatozi kugirango ifashe abitangira kugendana no kubahiriza ibibazo bigoye no kubahiriza amategeko, kubarinda ingaruka zamategeko no guteza imbere imikorere myiza no gukora neza."}
{"id": "18095", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18095", "title": "Isaro Nadia", "text": "Isaro Nadia ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye i Gisenyi mu akarere ka Rubavu yavutse muri 2003. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'ubwiza mu Rwanda ryabaye 16 Gashyantare 2022. \nUmushinga we.\nYamuritse umushinga wo gukangurira abantu gusoma. Yagite ati\" ibitabo byihishemo ubumenyi bwinshi' bitwongera ubumenyi ndetse no gufasha kwiyungura ubumenyi mu itumanaho.\u201d Muri uyu mushinga we yashaka gukora na Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi, iy\u2019umuco n\u2019urubyiruko mu gikorwa cyo gukwirakwiza amasomero aho atari ariko cyane cyane mu cyaro no kongera ibitabo ku bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona."}
{"id": "18098", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18098", "title": "Nzamukosha Shema Patricia", "text": "Nzamukosha Shema Patricia ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse mu mwaka wa 2003,ni rwiyemezamirimo warashinze sosiyete ikora imyambaro ya Inkindi Design ndetse imyambaro irimo niwe uyikorera. Shema yitabiriye irushanwa ry'ubwiza rizwi nka Miss Rwanda riheruka kuba kuwa 16 Gashyantare 2022. \nAmashuri.\nNzamukosha yize muri King David Academy mubijyanye n'imibare, ubugenge n'ubumenyi bw'isi. yifuza kuzagira impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu birebana no kwihangira imirimo. Yabaye umwarimu w'ungirije mu kigo cya Green hills Academy, akaba ari n'umwe mu banyamuryango b'imbere ba Kigali protocal imaze kumenyekana nugutanga serivise za protocal.\nUmushinga we.\nUbwo yitabiraga iri rushanwa yari afite umushinga wo ujyanye no gufasha abantu kugira umuco wo w'ishoramari binyuze mu gufasha urubyiruko kwigirira icyizere no kurushaho gutezimbere umuryango Nyarwanda."}
{"id": "18099", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18099", "title": "Usanase Zawadi", "text": "Usanase Zawadi Umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru mubagore wavutse 2000..\nNumukinnyi wabigize umwuga akinira amakipe atandukanye mu rwanda. Nkumwataka uca kuruhande rwibumoso yatsinze ibitego byinci mu makipe yakiniye nubu agitsinda mwikipe akinamo ubu. \nUmwanya akina.\nAkina aca kuruhande rwibumuso \nIbikombe yatwaye.\nShampiyona ebyiri(2)\npeace cup ebyiri(2)\nSuper cup imwe(1)\nAmakipe yanyuzemo..\nZawadi Usanaze yanyuzemo mu makipe atandukanya mu Rwanda.\nIkipe akinira ubu.\nAs Kigali WFC.\nIriburiro.\nhttps://www-newtimes-co-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/www.newtimes.co.rw/article/10589/sports/football/usanase-extends-as-kigali-wfc-stay/amp?amp_js_v=a9&amp;amp_gsa=1&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM=#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111225029372&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newtimes.co.rw%2Farticle%2F10589%2Fsports%2Ffootball%2Fusanase-extends-as-kigali-wfc-stay\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/imikino/football/article/as-kigali-wfc-yegukanye-igikombe-cyo-kwizihiza-umunsi-w-umugore-amafoto"}
{"id": "18100", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18100", "title": "Eliane ubalijoro", "text": "Incamake.\nDr Ubaljoro yavukiye mu Rwanda kandi akurira ku migabane itatu,\u00a0 yari azi kuva akiri muto ko yifuza umwuga wo gukorera isi. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buhinzi muri rusange n'impamya bumenyi y ikirenga(doctorat) muri genetique yakuye muri kaminuza ya McGill, aho yize kuzamura umusaruro mu buhinzi. Akora umwuga wo kwiga amashuri makuru, abikorera ku giti cyabo ndetse n\u2019imiryango idaharanira inyungu n\u2019iterambere mpuzamahanga, yatangiye ari umuyobozi wa siyansi mu rwego rw\u2019ibinyabuzima ikora ibijyanye no gusuzuma indwara ya molekile, nyuma yibanda ku iterambere rirambye ndetse no kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abagore na abahinzi-borozi bato mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere.\nImirimo yakoze.\nKu wa kabiri, taliki ya 17 Mutarama, Eliane Ubalije ni Umuyobozi mukuru mushya w'ikigo gishinzwe ubushakashatsi ku mashyamba mpuzamahanga n\u2019ubuhinzi bw\u2019ibiti bivangwa niimyaka ku isi (CIFOR-ICRAF),kuri ubu akaba ari Porofeseri mubyubufatanye bw\u2019inzego za Leta n\u2019abikorera mu kigo cya kaminuza ya McGill cyo muri canada gishinzwe ubushakashatsi ku iterambere mpuzamahanga biteganijwe ko azatangira imirimo ku mugaragaro muri Gicurasi, 2023.\nKuva mu 2021 kugeza muri Werurwe 2023, yari Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa wo Kuramba mu gihe cya Digital ndetse n\u2019umuyobozi wa canada Hub ushinzwe ejo hazaza. Ni umwe mu bagize Inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda n\u2019inama ngishwanama ya Perezida wa Repubulika, Inama Ngishwanama ku ngaruka z\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019africa, Siyanse ya Afurika, Akanama gashinzwe kugenzura imiyoborere y\u2019imigabane, Komite Ngishwanama yo hanze y\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe ibarurishamibare rya canada n\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe canada ku Ibarura rusange rya mbere ry\u2019ibidukikije rya canada n'ibindi. Ni umwe kandi mu nama mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubumenyi.\nIbihembo n'amashimwe.\nYashimiwe ibikorwa bye mu buyobozi no mu buringanire, Dr Ubalijolo ni we wahawe igihembo cy\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abayobozi mu 2022 mu bagore n\u2019ubuyobozi kubera ibikorwa by\u2019indashyikirwa byagize uruhare runini, kandi akaba ari mu itsinda ry\u2019abagize akanama gashinzwe ubumenyi mpuzamahanga bashyizweho mu rwego rwo gushimira indashyikirwa. umusanzu mu guteza imbere siyanse nkibyiza rusange byisi. Yorohereje Gahunda y'Ubuyobozi bwa UNAIDS ku bagore muri kaminuza y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe abakozi. Dr Ubaljoro yari umunyamuryango wa FemStep, umuyoboro w\u2019ubushakashatsi ugaragaza imyumvire y\u2019abakobwa n\u2019abagore bo mu cyaro mu gushyiraho ingamba zo kugabanya ubukene mu Rwanda, Afurika yepfo, Tanzaniya, DR Congo na Ethiopia hakoreshejwe uburyo bushingiye ku buhanzi. Muri 2018, yafatanije n\u2019abagore ba kabiri ku isi mu mahugurwa yo kuyobora ubumenyi mu Rwanda abifashijwemo n\u2019ikigo cya Kanada gishinzwe ubushakashatsi buhanitse. Inzira ye yumwuga yagaragaye muri Forbes mu rwego rwo kwizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019abagore 2019."}
{"id": "18101", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18101", "title": "Ndakimana Angeline", "text": "Ndakimana Angeline Umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru mubagore ukina mwizamu.\nAngeline Wigeze kwifuzwa nikipe yo muri Saudi Arabia AL NORS mucyiciro cyambere.\nAmakipe yanyuzemo.\n1.As Kigali WFC\n2. Amavubi Women Football National Team \nUmwanya akina.\nUmunyezamu\nIbikombe yegukanye.\nShampiyona ebyiri \nPeace cup Imwe \n Igikombe cyokwizihiza umunsi wabagore 2024 \nIriburiro.\nhttps://www-newtimes-co-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/www.newtimes.co.rw/article/11608/sports/football/as-kigali-women-put-30000-price-tag-on-goalie-ndakimana/amp?amp_js_v=a9&amp;amp_gsa=1&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM=#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111805165576&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newtimes.co.rw%2Farticle%2F11608%2Fsports%2Ffootball%2Fas-kigali-women-put-30000-price-tag-on-goalie-ndakimana\nhttps://www-newtimes-co-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/www.newtimes.co.rw/article/11664/sports/football/al-nors-pull-out-of-ndakimana-deal/amp?amp_js_v=a9&amp;amp_gsa=1&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM=#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111805165576&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newtimes.co.rw%2Farticle%2F11664%2Fsports%2Ffootball%2Fal-nors-pull-out-of-ndakimana-deal"}
{"id": "18102", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18102", "title": "Uwimbabazi Immacul\u00e9e", "text": "Uwimbabazi Immacul\u00e9e Numukinnyi wumupira wamaguru mubagore ukina Muri bamyugariro. Mu mumakipe atandukanye ndetse nikipe yigihugu Amavubi Women Football National Team.\nAmakipe yanyuzemo.\n1.Kamonyi WFC \n2.As Kigali WFC \n3.Rayon sports WFC ndetse nikipe yigihugu Amavubi Women Football National Team.\nIbikombe yegukanye.\nShampiyona ebyiri na AS Kigali WFC \nShampiyona Imwe Na Rayon sports WFC 2023/2024 \nPeace cup Imwe \nIbikombe yegukanye kugiti cye.\n2024 Uwimbabazi Immacul\u00e9e yegukanye igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza w'ukwezi kwa kabiri muri Rayon sports WFC.\nIshakiro.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20240323083230/https://umuseke-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/umuseke.rw/2023/12/rayon-yabagore-yakuye-abakinnyi-babiri-muri-as-kigali/amp/?amp_gsa=1&amp;amp_js_v=a9&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM%3D#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111818201440&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fumuseke.rw%2F2023%2F12%2Frayon-yabagore-yakuye-abakinnyi-babiri-muri-as-kigali%2F\nhttps://umuseke-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/umuseke.rw/2023/12/immaculee-na-alodie-batangiye-akazi-mu-kipe-nshya-amafoto/amp/?amp_gsa=1&amp;amp_js_v=a9&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM%3D#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111818201440&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fumuseke.rw%2F2023%2F12%2Fimmaculee-na-alodie-batangiye-akazi-mu-kipe-nshya-amafoto%2F"}
{"id": "18103", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18103", "title": "Kayitesi Alodie", "text": "Kayitesi Alodie Umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru mubagore ukina Hagati Mukibuga \nKayitse Alodie watangiye gukina umupira wa Maguru 2014 Mu Bana bato ba As Kigali WFC afite inywaka 14 yamavuko. \nKayitesi Alodie ni muntu ki?\nkayitse Alodie wavukiye mukarere ka Nyarugenge.\nAlodie uvuka Mu muryango wabana Bane akaba ariwe muhererezi iwabo.\nUbuzima Bwihariye.\nKayitesi Alodie nkabandi bana yakinaga nkabandi Ariko uko agenda akura yagiye akunda Umukino wumupira wamaguru \nAbikundisha nincutiye biganaga wakiniraga As Kigali WFC yabatoya (AS KIGALI WFC ACADEMY).\nAlodie yage kugira ibibazo byumuryango byanatumye Ahagarika ishuri aho yaje gusubukura muri 2023 akora ikizami gisoza Amashuri yisumbuye nkumukandida wigenga.\nAlodie yahamagawe Mwikipe yigihugu Amavubi Women Football National Team Bwambere muri 2016\nAmashuri yize..\nKayitesi Alodie yize Amashuri abanza ku Kagasunsu muri Nyarugenge District.\nAmashuri yisumbuye yayize APACE Secondary school \nAmakipe yanyuzemo.\n1.As Kigali WFC ACADEMY \n2.As Kigali WFC \n3.Rayon sports WFC akinamo ubu.\nIbikombe yatwaye.\nShampiyona umunani(8) zikurikirana hamwe na As Kigali WFC\nShampiyona Imwe na Rayon sports WFC 2023/2024 \nPeace cup enye(4) na As Kigali WFC.\nIshakiro.\nhttps://www-newtimes-co-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/www.newtimes.co.rw/article/7436/sports/football/meet-kayitesi-as-kigali-women-midfield-maestro/amp?amp_js_v=a9&amp;amp_gsa=1&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM=#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111828342796&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newtimes.co.rw%2Farticle%2F7436%2Fsports%2Ffootball%2Fmeet-kayitesi-as-kigali-women-midfield-maestro\nhttps://www-newtimes-co-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/www.newtimes.co.rw/article/13645/sports/football/kayitesi-opens-up-on-dream-rayon-wfc-move/amp?amp_js_v=a9&amp;amp_gsa=1&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM=#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111828342796&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newtimes.co.rw%2Farticle%2F13645%2Fsports%2Ffootball%2Fkayitesi-opens-up-on-dream-rayon-wfc-move\nhttps://umuseke-rw.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/umuseke.rw/2023/12/immaculee-na-alodie-batangiye-akazi-mu-kipe-nshya-amafoto/amp/?amp_gsa=1&amp;amp_js_v=a9&amp;usqp=mq331AQIUAKwASCAAgM%3D#amp_tf=From%20%251%24s&amp;aoh=17111828342796&amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com&amp;ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fumuseke.rw%2F2023%2F12%2Fimmaculee-na-alodie-batangiye-akazi-mu-kipe-nshya-amafoto%2F\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/imikino/football/article/rayon-sports-y-abagore-yongeye-kugura-abakinnyi-bakomeye-muri-as-kigali-wfc"}
{"id": "18104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18104", "title": "Bimenyimana Marie", "text": "Marie Bimenyimana (yavutse 30 ugushyingo 1996):ni umunyarwandakazi ukina wa w\u2019u Rwanda akaba na kapiteni w\u2019ikipe. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe (WT20I) mu Rwanda ku ya 26 Mutarama 2019, na Nigeria, mu mukino wa mbere WT20I. Wari umukino wambere WT20I wakinnye nu Rwanda. \nMuri Gicurasi 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe y'u Rwanda mu marushanwa yo muri Zimbabwe. Muri Kamena 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe y'u Rwanda mu mu Rwanda. Ku ya 21 Kamena 2019 yatsinze 114 Mali, amanota yari ikinyejana cya mbere ku bagore bo mu Rwanda mu mukino wa WT20I. Muri Gicurasi 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe y'u Rwanda mu mu Rwanda. Muri Kanama 2021, Bimenyimana yasimbuye nk'umuyobozi w\u2019ikipe yu Rwanda, mbere y\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019amajonjora. Muri kamena 2022 Bimenyimana yongeye gutorerwa kuba kapiteni wikipe yu Rwanda mu. Muri Werurwe 2023 Bimenyimana yahisemo kandi kuba kapiteni w'ikipe y'u Rwanda mu. "}
{"id": "18105", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18105", "title": "Balikungeri Mary", "text": "Balikungeri Mary, yavukiye mu Rwanda 1987, ni umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019urugaga rw\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umugore mu Rwanda (icyongereza: Rwanda Women\u2019s Community Development Network (RWN). Umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta ufasha abapfakazi, abakorewe ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, abantu banduye virusi itera SIDA n'imfubyi. Itanga ihuriro ryo guhuza, gukangurira, gukangurira, amahugurwa, ubujyanama nubufasha bwibikoresho. Kubera imbaraga zayo, abagore n\u2019imfubyi barenga igihumbi bongeye kubaka ubuzima bwabo. Umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta wafashije kandi kubaka amavuriro, aho gutura ndetse n\u2019ibigo byigisha.\nAmateka.\nMary yari afite imyaka 6 gusa mu igihe cya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994 yatangiraga maze umuryango we uhatirwa kwimukira muri Uganda. Yakuze ari impunzi yahuye n'akarengane, ariko akavuga ko yabonye amahirwe abandi batabonye, \u200b\u200bnko kubona amashuri. Ubu ni umuyobozi n' uwashinze ihuriro ry\u2019abagore mu Rwanda. Mary yagize intego y'ubuzima bwe guhagarika ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina mu Rwanda aha imbaraga abahohotewe gukira no guhinduka abayobozi bigenga, bakomeye mu baturage babo.\nMariya yumvise inkuru z\u2019ihohoterwa ridasubirwaho rikorerwa abagore mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi, Mariya yumvise ko agomba gukora no guha amahirwe abagore nk\u2019uko yari afite. Mu 1995 Yagarutse mu Rwanda ashinga Urugaga rw'Abagore mu Rwanda. Mariya yashyizeho ahantu hizewe ku bagore, abahohotewe bishingiye ku gitsina, badafite aho bajya. Yashakaga kubaha amahirwe yo gukira, kandi guhera ku munsi wa mbere yemeje ko ahantu hizewe ari ahantu abagore bahurira kugira ngo bishyirireho ejo hazaza heza. Yabikoze atanga inyigisho zijyanye n\u2019imari no guteza imbere ubuhanga bwo kuyobora muri gahunda zose ziyobowe nu Rwanda rw\u2019Abagore. Ati: \u201cIyo abagore bafite imbaraga mu bukungu, bashoboye gukemura ibibazo by'ihohoterwa, barashobora kwibeshaho, kwita ku muryango wabo, ntibazakomeza gukomera ku ihohoterwa.\nMariya ibikorwa byo guhindura imibereho bigera kurwego mpuzamahanga. Kugeza ubu ni Umuyobozi w\u2019Urugaga Nyafurika rw\u2019Abagore (ANWS), ishami ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ry\u2019abagore (GNWS) aho akora nk'umuyobozi uhagarariye komisiyo ya Huairou akaba n'umwe mu bagize Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye w\u2019abagore VAW - Itsinda ryerekeye amahoro n\u2019umutekano. Igikorwa cya Mariya cyamenyesheje cyane uburinganire n'ubwuzuzanye bwa gahunda z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu, uturere ndetse n\u2019amahanga. Harimo Profemmes Twese Hamwe, FEMNET, hamwe na Afurika y'Iburasirazuba Gutangiza Inkunga yo Guteza Imbere Abagore (EASSI) hamwe na Global Network y'abagore bubaka amahoro.\nMuri 2018 Mariya yahawe n'Umwamikazi Elizabeth hamwe na 'Point of Light' mu rwego rwo kubahiriza ibikorwa bye bitangaje kandi bidasanzwe mu gushyigikira ibihumbi by'abahohotewe bishingiye ku gitsina."}
{"id": "18106", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18106", "title": "Mucunguzi Izere Joselyne", "text": "Mucunguzi Izere Joselyne, ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu akarere ka Nyaruguru mu intara y'amajyepfo mu mwaka 2000. Unu n'umwe mubagize itsinda \"Global young influencer group\" ry'umushinga Plan International, rikora ubuvugizi ku Isi hose hagamijwe kurandura inzitizi zose zikibangamiye umwana w\u2019umukobwa mu iterambere.\nAmashuri.\nIzere afite icyiciro cya Kabiri cya Kamuniza muri Biochemistry ya kuye muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Izere ashimira madam nyakubahwa Jeannette Kagame, kubwo imbuto yabibye mu bana b'u Rwanda binyuze mu mushinga Imbuto foundation.\nAkazi.\nIzere ni umuyobozi wa gahunda cyangwa porogaramu (icyongereza: program lead) mu mushinga uharanira uburenganzira ndetse ugafasha abakobwa kwiteza imbere, (icyongereza: Impanuro Girls initiative. Muri 2018, yitabiriye ibikorwa y\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019u Bwongereza ahagarariye i gihugu cy'u Rwanda (icyongereza: House of Lord Chamber) mu gihugu cy'Ubwongereza.\nImpano.\nIzere ni umusizi "}
{"id": "18107", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18107", "title": "Uwumukiza Fran\u00e7oise", "text": "Fran\u00e7oise Uwumukiza (yavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1973 mu Karere ka Rwamagana ni umugore w'umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda akaba n'umuririmbyi.\nImibereho n'imirimo akora.\nFrancoise (yavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1973 mu Karere ka Rwamagana (ahahoze ari Komine Rutonde) mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda, ubu ni umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA), yashyize hanze indirimbo yise \u2018Peace for Health\u2019 igaruka ku kwimakaza amahoro n\u2019ubumwe mu Karere, n\u2019inshingano Abanyafurika basangiye zo gufatanyiriza hamwe. Uwumukiza yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu badepite icyenda bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko.\nIbihangano.\nTariki 21 Mutarama 2024,Uwumukiza Yasohoye indirimbo ivuga ku mahoro n\u2019ubumwe (Icyongereza: Peace for Health), yakozwe na Genius, ndetse amagambo yayo ari mu ndimi eshatu zikoreshwa cyane mu Karere ka Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba ari zo; Icyongereza, Ikinyarwanda n\u2019Igiswahili.\nUwumukiza afite izindi zirimo nka \u201cHappy New Year\u201d, \u201cMerry Christmas\u201d, \u201cTuribuka abazize Jenoside\u201d, \u201cInshuti yo mu bwana\u201d, \u201cIbuka ntute igiti\u201d, \u201cYezu ndakwizera\u201d, \u201cIntore \u0443\u2019Imana iratashye\u201d, \u201cNshuti Nziza\u2019\u2019 yageneye Perezida Paul Kagame, \u201cNzakorera u Rwanda\u201d n\u2019izindi."}
{"id": "18108", "revid": "9213", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18108", "title": "Prof Beth Kaplin", "text": "Incamacye.\nBeth Kaplin umunyamerika w'umuhanga mu kubungabunga ibidukikije, akaba umwarimu n'umushakashatsi mubumenyi bwo kubungabunga ibidukikije muri College of Science and Technology muri kaminuza yu Rwanda.\nAmateka kumyigigire ye ndetse n'ubushakashatsi.\nBeth Kaplin muburezi ni umurezi ufite impamyabumenyi yikirenga mumibereho nimibanire y'inyamanswa (Zoology) yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Wisconsin/Madison, Amerika 1998. M.Sc (ishami rya kaminuza y\u2019ibinyabuzima ya Wisconsin/ Madison, USA1994B.Sc Ibinyabuzima, kaminuza ya Leta ya Colorado, Fort Collins, 1986. kandi yari umunyeshuri wa kaminuza mu masomo, Ubumenyi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima Purdue University W. Lafayette, mu 1981/1983 aho yibanze ku kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nKaplin akora nk'umuyobozi w'ikigo cy\u2019indashyikirwa mu binyabuzima no gucunga umutungo kamere (CoEB) muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda. CoEB yibanze ku guteza imbere ubushakashatsi no kungurana ubumenyi n\u2019imikorere irambye mu kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima no gucunga umutungo kamere. Ku buyobozi bwa Kaplin, iki kigo cyahindutse ihuriro rikomeye ryo kubungabunga no kumenya ubumenyi mu karere."}
{"id": "18109", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18109", "title": "Munyampenda Nathalie", "text": "Amateka ya Munyampenda Nathalie.\nMunyampenda Nathalie ni umuyobozi wa Kaminuza yigenga Izwi kw'izina rya KEPLER iri i Kigali ikaba ikorana na kaminuza yo muri America yitwa Southern New Hampshire University(SNHU) Mu gutanga impamyabumenyi iri kurwego rwo hejuru. Munyampenda Nathalie yabaye Umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho muri IAMS ayobora n'ihuriro Next Einsten Forum rigamije gukora bikaba byageza kuri Africa kugira umuhanga wundi umeze nka Einstein."}
{"id": "18110", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18110", "title": "Iradukunda Alodie", "text": "Iradukunda Alodie ni umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA). Alodie yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu badepite icyenda bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko.\nAmashuri.\nAlodie muri 2013 yarangije amasomo ya science mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Gashora Girls Academy of Science and Technology riri mu Karere ka Bugesera. 2018 yarangije icyiciro cya mbere cya Kaminuza muri Trinity College i Harford, muri Leta ya Connecticut muri America, mu masomo ya mudasobwa.\nAkazi.\nMu 2022 yabaye mu Inama nkuru y\u2019urubyiruko(mu icyongereza: Rwanda National Youth Council) mu Rwanda. Urungano rwe rwamutoye aturutse mu gihugu hose kugira ngo ahagararire inyungu n'ibyifuzo by'urubyiruko ku rwego rw'igihugu. Ubu yatorerwa kuba umudepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba aho azakorera manda y'imyaka itanu nk'umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba 2022-2027."}
{"id": "18111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18111", "title": "Rutazana Francine", "text": "Rutazana Francine ni umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA). Rutazana yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu ba depite icyenda(9) bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko."}
{"id": "18112", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18112", "title": "Young Leaders Conference", "text": "Miracle Corners Rwanda (MCR Rwanda) yashinzwe mu 2011 nk'umuryango udaharanira inyungu mu Karere ka Bugesera, mu Rwanda nk'ishami rya Miracle Corners of the World (MCW). MCR Rwanda yakiriye inama y'abayobozi bato kuva ku ya 25-27 Werurwe 2024 muri Hoteli Lapalisse mu karere ka Bugesera. \nAmateka.\nMiracle Corners Rwanda yafunguwe muri Kanama 2011, itangira gahunda yo guteza imbere ubumenyingiro bwemewe na TVET. Mu 2021 Miracle Corners Rwanda yashyize mu bikorwa gahunda yo gutera ibiti mu karere ka Bugesera, umurenge wa Rweru, akagari ka Nkanga mu umudugudu wa Kivusha.\nMCR Rwanda ibifashijwe na Miracle Corners of the World kuva mu 2012 yatangiye gufasha aturage mu kubungabunga imibereho myiza y'abaturage n'iterambere rirambye mu Karere ka Bugesera. "}
{"id": "18113", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18113", "title": "Rutazana Angeline", "text": "Rutazana Angeline ni umunyarwandakazi w'umucamanza wo mu Rwanda ubu akora nk'umugenzuzi mukuru w'inkiko mu Rwanda. Yabaye uhagarariye akarere mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacamanza muri Common wealth rizwi nka Common wealth Magistrates and Judges Association(CMJA) kuva 2012 kugeza 2015.\nAmashuri n'akazi.\nRutazana yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda naho impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Ottawa. Afite impamyabumenyi nyinshi zirimo kunoza ubutabera bw\u2019ubucamanza n\u2019imiyoborere myiza y\u2019ubucamanza kuva i Seoul, (2014), ibyaha mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019amahanga mpuzamahanga kuva muri Tanzaniya (2015), n\u2019Ubuyobozi mu micungire y\u2019Inkiko kuva muri Singapuru y\u2019ubucamanza ya Singapore (2020). \nRutazana yabaye perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacamanza n\u2019abanditsi b\u2019u Rwanda kuva mu 2012 kugeza 2017 kandi yari perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacamanza n\u2019abacamanza bo muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba kuva mu 2017 kugeza 2019. Yari umwe mu bagize komite nyobozi y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacamanza n\u2019abacamanza ba Commonwealth akurikirana ibibazo by\u2019uburinganire mu Burasirazuba, Intara y'Amajyepfo na Hagati kuva 2012 kugeza 2015"}
{"id": "18114", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18114", "title": "Nyiramana Aisha", "text": "Nyiramana Aisha ni umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA). Aisha yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu badepite icyenda bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko\nAmashuri.\nDr Aisha NYIRAMANA, Yabaye Umwarimu muri kaminuza yu Rwanda, Ishami rya CST / Ibinyabuzima, afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD yakuye muri Mus\u00e9um National d'Histoire Naturelle, mu Bufaransa mu ishami rya Ecologie et gestion de la Biodiversit\u00e9. Aisha ifite inyungu nyinshi zubushakashatsi mubice bigari byibidukikije, kubungabunga urusobe rwibinyabuzima hamwe n\u2019amashyamba. Ni umuhanga mubidukikije ushishikajwe ningaruka zubwoko bwibiti byingenzi yibanda ku ruhare rwimbuto n'imbuto zirya intangangabo nkikwirakwiza imbuto mu mashyamba yimvura. Ni n'umufatanyabikorwa w\u2019ubushakashatsi mu kigo cy\u2019indashyikirwa mu micungire y\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019umutungo kamere ukorera muri UR-CST."}
{"id": "18115", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18115", "title": "Ndangiza Nyirakobwa Fatuma", "text": "Ndangiza Nyirakobwa Fatuma, wavutse 1968) ni umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA). Fatuma yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu badepite icyenda bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko. Ni umuvugizi uharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore, impuguke mu bya politiki, n'umunyapolitiki. \nAkazi.\nUsibye kuba umuyobozi wungirije w\u2019inama y\u2019imiyoborere y\u2019u Rwanda, intego yayo ikaba ari uguteza imbere imiyoborere myiza no kwegereza ubuyobozi abaturage mu Rwanda, Ambasaderi Ndangiza yabaye Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda na Komiseri Mukuru muri Tanzaniya kandi yemerwa muri Malawi, Zambiya, Seychelles na Madagasikari. Kuva mu 2002 kugeza 2009, Ambasaderi Ndangiza yari umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa komisiyo y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge yayoboye gukira n\u2019ubwiyunge mu banyarwanda. Yatangije kandi umuryango uharanira inyungu za sosiyete sivile y'abagore no guteza imbere ubushobozi bw'umugore n'uburinganire mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "18116", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18116", "title": "Kayonga Rwivanga Caroline", "text": "Kayonga Rwivanga Caroline, umunyarwandakazi uhagarariye u Rwanda mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu Muryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EALA). Kayonga yatorewe kujya mu Nteko ya EALA muri manda ya 2022-2027 akaba ari umwe mu badepite icyenda bahagarariye u Rwanda muri iyo Nteko."}
{"id": "18117", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18117", "title": "Umwiza Phiona", "text": "Umwiza Phiona (Yavutse 1999) ni umunyarwandakazi wabaye Igisonga cya mbere cya Miss Rwanda 2020. Ni umwe mubahataniraga umwanya mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019Umuryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba ahagarariye Urubyiruko."}
{"id": "18118", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18118", "title": "Umutoni Kazimbaya Shakilla", "text": "Umutoni Kazimbaya Shakilla, ni Ambassaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu Bwami bwa Maroc,kuva ku ya 1 Kanama 2023. Ni Umuyobozi mukuru wa Afurika mu biro bizwi nka Directorate General of Africa, kuva muri Gicurasi 2020. \nAmateka.\nKuva mu 2013 kugeza mu ntangiriro za 2020, Madamu Kazimbaya yabaye Charg\u00e9e d'Affaires a.i muri Komisiyo Nkuru y'u Rwanda i Ottawa, muri Kanada. Mbere yibyo, yabaye umunyamabanga wa mbere akaba n'umujyanama wa mbere muri Tanzaniya. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Minisiteri mu 2007, Madamu Kazimbaya yakoraga mu rwego rw\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta yo mu karere ndetse n\u2019amahanga ndetse na Banki y\u2019isi, PEPFAR, USAID n\u2019ikigega cy\u2019isi gishinzwe kurwanya gahunda ziterwa na virusi itera SIDA, igituntu na Malariya mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi mu micungire yavanye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda mu 2001 (Icyongereza: Bachelor's degree in Management). Hanze y'akazi, Madamu Kazimbaya akunda gutembera, sinema, gusoma.\nIndimi.\nAkoresha ururimi rw' Ikinyarwanda, Igifaransa, Icyongereza n'Igiswahiri kandi afite ubumenyi bwibanze bw'icyarabu na Lingala."}
{"id": "18119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18119", "title": "Urujeni Feza Bakuramutsa", "text": "Urujeni Feza Bakuramutsa,ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda, ubu ni Umuyobozi w'Inama y'Abaminisitiri mu biro bya Perezida kuva Werurwe 2020. Bakuramutsa yabaye Umuyobozi w'Inama y'Abaminisitiri mu biro bya Perezida, asimbuye Ines Mpambara wari umaze imyaka irenga 10 akora kuri uyu mwanya mbere yo kugirwa Minisitiri ushinzwe imirimo y'abaminisitiri mu biro Minisitiri w\u2019intebe. Urujeni yabaye umunyamabanga uhoraho muri minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga n\u2019ubutwererane mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "18120", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18120", "title": "Monique Mujawamariya", "text": "Hon. Dr. Monique Mujawamariya (wavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1955) ni impirimbanyi y' uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda wimukiye muri Kanada hanyuma muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yarokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 mu Rwanda kandi yatsindiye igihembo mpuzamahanga mu 1995. Muri 2014 yari atuye muri Afurika y'Epfo aho ahangayikishijwe n'uburenganzira bw'umugore.\nUbuzima bwe.\nMujawamariya yavukiye i Butare mu Rwanda mu 1955. Yitaye ku burenganzira bwa muntu maze ashinga umuryango witwa Rwanda ADL (French &lt;/link&gt;). \nMugihe cya Jenoside.\nKu ya 6 Mata 1994, Perezida w'u Rwanda Juvenal Habyarimana yapfuye igihe indege ye yaraswaga kandi iki gikorwa cyahise kibanziriza icyari kizwi ku izina rya jenoside yo mu Rwanda aho abantu batekereza ko bapfuye 800.000 kugeza 1.000.000. Mujawamariya yari umuntu wibasiwe i Kigali, aho Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines yamwise \"gukunda igihugu gikwiye gupfa\". Yavuganaga na Alison Des Forges buri minota 30 kubera iri terabwoba hamwe nindege. Des Forges yari umunyamuryango wa Human Rights Watch maze asabwa kwita ku bana be igihe Mujawamariya yarangirizaga umuhamagaro kugira ngo yirinde inshuti ye kumva ko apfa. Nkuko byari bimeze, Mujawamariya yarokotse. \nMujawamariya yashoboye gutoroka yiruka mu busitani bwe kugeza abasirikare bagiye. Yahise yihisha mu gisenge mugihe cy'amasaha 40 mbere yo kwegera abasirikare yitwaje ifoto gusa y' uwari umugabo we wapfuye yambaye imyenda yagisirikare. nyuma atanga ruswa nyinshi, yashoboye gutoroka no kuvugana na Des Forges. Des Forges yateguye ko ashyirwa ku rutonde rwo kwimurwa, maze aherekeza Mujawamariya abinyujije ku basirikare bagose ikibuga cy'indege. Mujawamariya yaratorotse, amaze kohereza abana be mu majyepfo y'igihugu. Nyuma y'ibyumweru, ntiyari azi ibyabaye ku bana be batatu. \nMujawamariya yashoboye guhaguruka yerekeza i Washington, ahahurira na Anthony Lake wari umujyanama wa Perezida Clinton. Yari mu itsinda ryahuye na Clinton mu Kuboza gushize. Icyakora, habaye impuhwe nke kuko byagaragaye ko u Rwanda, n'ibibazo byabwo, bitari inyungu z\u2019Amerika. \nYahawe igihembo cya Demokarasi n'Ikigega cy'igihugu gishinzwe demokarasi mu 1995, kandi muri uwo mwaka ahabwa impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro na Amherst College. \nUyu munsi.\nMujawamariya ubu (2014) atuye Cape Town aho akorera ku bibazo bijyanye n'uburenganzira bw'umugore. Yagarutse mu Rwanda kwitabira ubukwe bw'umuhungu we William mu 2014."}
{"id": "18121", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18121", "title": "Nyirahabineza Valerie", "text": "Valerie Nyirahabineza (wavutse 1969) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda n'umukozi wa Leta. Kuva mu 2020, yabaye umuyobozi wa komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe kuvana no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze ari abasirikare mu Rwanda. Yakoze manda ebyiri, kuva mu 2008 kugeza 2017 mu Nteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w' y'Iburasirazuba nk'umudepite mu Rwanda. Yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango imyaka itanu."}
{"id": "18122", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18122", "title": "Amarushanwa y' ubwiza mu Rwanda 2018", "text": "Amarushanwa y' ubwiza mu Rwanda 2018, ku nshuro ya 8 irushanwa rya Miss Rwanda, ryabaye ku wa 24 Gashyantare 2018 ahitwa Camp Kigali Grounds mu mujyi ya Kigali.\nUwatsinze, Liliane Iradukunda wo mu ntara y'Iburengerazuba yasimbuye Elsa Iradukunda wo mu ntara y'Iburengerazuba. "}
{"id": "18123", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18123", "title": "Uwanyiligira Agnes", "text": "Uwanyiligira Agnes ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe gahunda muri Access to Finance Rwanda (AFR). Ashinzwe gutegura imishinga ya AFR no kuyobora ishyirwa mu bikorwa ryayo kugira ngo byorohereze iterambere ry\u2019urwego rw\u2019imari rwuzuye mu Rwanda. \nIbirebana n'akazi.\nAgnes yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019inkingi y\u2019ubwishingizi muri AFR, ayobora ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya gahunda z\u2019ubwishingizi na pansiyo zirimo gahunda yo kuzigama igihe kirekire (Ejo Heza - LTSS) na gahunda y\u2019ubwishingizi bw\u2019ubuhinzi mu gihugu (NAIS). Mbere yo kwinjira muri AFR, yakoraga nkumwuga wa actuarial imyaka 10.\nAmashuri.\nNi Umunyeshuri wujuje ibyangombwa (Mugenzi w'Ikigo n'Ishami rya Acuaries) akaba n'impuguke yemewe mubijyanye na Microinsurance. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiriro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza (BA Hons) mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Greenwich na Master's degree (MSc) mu by'ubukungu n\u2019imari yakuye muri kaminuza ya Warwick, mu Bwongereza."}
{"id": "18124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18124", "title": "Uwanyiligira Marie Chantal", "text": "Uwanyiligira Marie Chantal, ni umunyarwandakazi uyobora Banki y'Isi muri C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, Benin, Gineya, na Togo kuva ku ya 1 Nyakanga 2023.Mbere, Marie Chantal yari Umuyobozi wa Banki y'Isi mu gihugu cya Madagasikari imyaka ine (4).\nAmateka.\nUwanyiligira yinjiye muri Banki y'Isi mu 1995 nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikorwa mu biro by'igihugu cy' u Rwanda mu mujyi wa Kigali. Kuva icyo gihe yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye, harimo nk'umuyobozi mukuru wungirije mu biro bya Perezida, Umuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda z\u2019igihugu mu ishami rishinzwe imicungire y\u2019igihugu cya Senegali, Umuyobozi ushinzwe imyitozo mu mazi y\u2019amazi n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ibiro by\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki y\u2019isi.\nAmashuri.\nMarie Chantal Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu no gucunga ubucuruzi (icyongereza: master\u2019s degree in economics and business administration)."}
{"id": "18125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18125", "title": "Mutesi Patience", "text": "Mutesi Patience yavutse mu 1981, mu mudugudu witwa Murang'a muri Kenya, ni Umuyobozi wa BPR Bank Rwanda PLC kuva Gashyantare 1, 2023.Mutesi yabaye umuyobozi wa Mark East East mu igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda kuva mu 2016.\nAmashuri.\nMutesi yavukiye muri Kenya ku babyeyi b'impunzi z'u Rwanda ariko1994 yimukira muri Uganda aho yize amashuri kugera kuri Kaminuza. Yize icyiciro cya mbere cy'amashuri y'isumbuye mu ishuri rya Maryhill High School riherereye mu burengerazuba bwa Uganda, nyuma yakomereje ku ishuri rya Nabisunsa Girls\u2019 School in central Uganda. Muri 2001 yakomeje muri Kaminuza ya Makerere University, Kampala. Aho yakuye Impamyabumenyi ya siyanse muri Quantitative Economics mu 2004.\nMuri 2012, Mutesi yarangije Masters 'mu buyobozi bw'ubucuruzi yavanye mu ishuri rya Maastrich School of Management. \nAmateka.\nMutesi mbere yakoze muri Ecobank y'u Rwanda nk'umuyobozi wa Corporate Banking, kandi yagiye akora no mu nzego zitandukanye nk'umwe mu bagize Inama y'Ubuyobozi. Yabaye umwe mu bagize inama y'ubutegetsi muri BPR Bank Rwanda, MTN Rwanda, Ubufatanye bw'u Rwanda (icyongereza: Rwanda Cooperation (RCI) no mu nama ngishwanama y'Ikigega cya One Acre Fund-Rwanda."}
{"id": "18126", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18126", "title": "Shema Mico Gibril", "text": "Shema Mico Gibril (wavutse 20 Ugushingo 2004) uzwi kw'izina ry'ubuhanzi nka Shemi ni Umunyarwanda w'umuhanzi uririmba ndetse akanandika indirimbo z'urukundo. \nubuzima bwo hambere.\nShema yavutse tariki ya 20 ugushyingo 2004, "}
{"id": "18127", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18127", "title": "Lumumba Rose", "text": "Lumumba Rose, yashinze umuryango w'abategarugori uzwi nka Women on Boards Network and IFC Corporate Governance Officer. Lumumba ni umwunganizi mu Rukiko Rukuru rwa Kenya.\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by'amategeko n\u2019icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi (Strategic Management) yakuye muri kaminuza ya Nairobi. Yakoze impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya Doctorat mu bucuruzi bw'inzobere mu myitwarire ya Organisation kuri kaminuza ya Nairobi.\nAkazi.\nRose yakoze neza mu bucuruzi bw\u2019isoko ry\u2019imari mu gihe cyimyaka 20 aho yagiye akora imyanya itandukanye. Yinjiye mu kigo gishinzwe amasoko y\u2019imari mu 1994 maze ategura amategeko agenda inganda kandi atunganya ibyifuzo byo gusaba gushora imari no gutanga uruhushya rw\u2019abunzi ku isoko ry\u2019imari. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse muby'ubuyobozi bukuru, yinjiye muri banki muby' ishoramari aho yagiriye inama ibigo byinshi mu gushora imari mu ruhame no kubishyira mu bikorwa."}
{"id": "18128", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18128", "title": "Kareba Rutagemwa Diana", "text": "Kareba Rutagemwa Diana,ni Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa wa \"Rugori Investment Network\". Muri 2018 Diana yari Umuyobozi ushinzwe ishoramari na Portfolio kigega cyo Gutezimbere Ubucuruzi (BDF)\nAmashuri.\nMuri 2019 kugera 2020 yize Agriculture Financing mu ishuri rya Frankfurt School of Finance &amp; Management. Afite kandi Impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor mu Ibaruramari hamwe no kwihangira imirimo yakuye muri kaminuza ya Edinburgh Napier University."}
{"id": "18129", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18129", "title": "Nibishaka Annie", "text": "Nibishaka Annie, ni Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019Ubwishingizi bwa Old Mutual Insurance Rwanda kuva 2015, ninyuma yo kugura iyahoze ari UAP Rwanda, UAP yatangiraga ibikorwa mu Rwanda mu 2012. Nibishaka, yakoze muri UAP nk'umuyobozi wungirije akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe kwamamaza ibikorwa no gushaka abakiriya mumushinga.Kuwa 06 Ukwakira 2020, yatorewe kandi kuyobora ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abishingizi mu Rwanda (ASSAR). \nAkazi.\nAnnie Nibishaka yatangiye kuyobora Old Mutual Insurance Rwanda kuva 2015. Old Mutual yatangiye gukorera mu Rwanda guhera mu 2015, nyuma yo kugura imigabane myinshi muri UAP Insurance Holdings. Mu 2022, icyo kigo cyahinduye amazina, icyari UAP gitangira gukora mu mazina ya Old Mutual Insurance Rwanda Plc. "}
{"id": "18130", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18130", "title": "Uwihoreye Leah", "text": "Uwihoreye Leah, (yavutse 1993) ni umunyarwandakazi akaba Umuyobozi w'akarere, Ushinzwe Amabwiriza &amp; Umubano wa Guverinoma muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, Flutterwave (Icyongereza: Regional Lead, Regulatory Affairs &amp; Gov\u2019t Relations, Eastern Africa, Flutterwave). Muri Gicurasi 2017, yashinze urubuga rwe rwa e-ubucuruzi 'Golden Thinkts', isosiyete ikora ibijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga ikorera mu Rwanda ishaka gutanga ibisubizo by'ibibazo byo kwihangira imirimo muri sosiyete.\nAmashuri.\nUwihoreye afite impamyabumenyi ya Computer Engineering yakuye muri kaminuza yu Rwanda, College of Science and Technology. Leah yatwaye igihembo cya bronze mu marushanwa ya YouthConnekt Africa; Ubu ni Ambasaderi wa YouthConnekt muri Afurika 2017."}
{"id": "18131", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18131", "title": "Kahonda Rwitare Shelagh", "text": "Shelagh Kahonda Rwitare, ni umugore w'abana batatu, atuye mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ni n'umucungamari wemewe, wemewe. Shelagh ni we uyobora John Mazwell Leadership Foundation mu RwandaShelagh Rwitare ni Umuyobozi mukuru muri Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (NBR)\nAkazi.\nShelagh Rwitare ni umunyamwuga w\u2019imari n\u2019ibaruramari (ACCA) ufite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 19 mu kuyobora amakipe atandukanye cyane cyane mu bijyanye n\u2019amabanki, ubugenzuzi, imicungire y\u2019imari, ingamba, igenamigambi ry\u2019ibigo, Inkomoko y\u2019ikigega, umubano w\u2019abaterankunga n\u2019ubuyobozi. Yahoze ayobora ibikorwa muri gahunda y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye mu Rwanda, CFO ku bigo byinshi, ibyinshi bikaba ari Imari. yatangiye umwuga we wumwuga muri Ernst &amp; Young Rwanda nkumugenzuzi.\nAmashuri.\nShelagh Kahonda Rwitare afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'imari (hibandwa kuri Strategy &amp; Economics) yakuye muri kaminuza ya Harvard n'impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ibaruramari yavanye muri kaminuza ya Oxford Brookes."}
{"id": "18133", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18133", "title": "Mukundwa Dianah", "text": "Dianah Mukundwa ni Umuyobozi mukuru muri Sonarwa Life Assurance Limited. Mbere yibyo, yari Umuyobozi w\u2019Inganda, Ishoramari n\u2019Imibereho Myiza muri Equity Bank Rwanda Plc.\nAmashuri.\nDianah afite impamyabumenyi ya MBA yakuye mu Ishuri ry\u2019Ubucuruzi rya Edinburgh - Herriot Watt mu Bwongereza, n'impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ubucuruzi (Ibaruramari) yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda - Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubucuruzi n'Ubukungu. Ni umucungamari wa Leta wemewe (CPA) akaba n'umwe mu bagize Ikigo cy\u2019abacungamari ba Leta bemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR).\nAkazi.\nAfite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 12 mubigo byamabanki n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo bafite ubumenyi bwinshi kuri banki n\u2019imari, isesengura ryamakuru, igenamigambi n\u2019ubuyobozi, ubwishingizi n\u2019ishoramari.\nYagiye mu myanya itandukanye y'ubuyobozi mu bihe byashize mu mashyirahamwe atandukanye azwi nka Equity Bank Rwanda Plc, Crystal Ventures Ltd, Real contractors Ltd, CVL Developers Ltd, na New Century Development Ltd Akorera ku mbaho \u200b\u200bnk'umuyobozi utari Umuyobozi mukuru."}
{"id": "18134", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18134", "title": "Kamikazi Cynthia Liliane", "text": "Cynthia Liliane Kamikazi, ni Umuyobozi - Ubufatanye no kwegera uburinganire, abagore n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri leta muri Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere (Icyongereza: African Development Bank). Muri urwo rwego, ayoboye ubufatanye no gukusanya umutungo kuri gahunda y\u2019uburinganire bwa Banki. Yakoranye n\u2019inama ngishwanama yo mu rwego rwo hejuru y\u2019abayobozi bakuru ba Afurika, Madamu Kamikazi yayoboye ishyirwaho rya gahunda yo gutera inkunga Afurika muri Afurika hagamijwe kongerera ubushobozi ubukungu bw\u2019umugore, igikorwa cy\u2019imari ishinzwe abagore muri Afurika. \nMbere y\u2019umwanya asanzweho, yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019agateganyo ku biro bya Banki bya Visi Perezida akaba n\u2019intumwa idasanzwe y\u2019uburinganire, atanga inama zifatika ku ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019ingamba z\u2019uburinganire bwa Banki no kugenzura igenamigambi n\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari.\nAmateka y'akazi.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri AfDB, Madamu Kamikazi yayoboye gahunda yo kunganira amajyepfo ya Global Alliance ishinzwe inkingo no gukingira i Geneve, aho yayoboye uruhare rw\u2019abafatanyabikorwa n\u2019ubufatanye. Hagati ya 2002 na 2010, yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye harimo kuba Umujyanama mu bijyanye n'uburenganzira bwa muntu n'iterambere mu butumwa buhoraho bw'u Rwanda muri Loni i Geneve; Umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019umushinga w\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri federasiyo y\u2019isi ya Lutherani akaba n'umujyanama w\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri komisiyo y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nAfite Impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu myumvire no mu bikorwa by'uburenganzira bwa muntu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Essex i Colchester, mu Bwongereza n'impamyabumenyi ya Psychologiya, Imicungire y'Ubucuruzi &amp; Ubuvanganzo bw'igifaransa yakuye muri Luther College, muri Amerika mu (icyongereza: She holds a Master\u2019s Degree in the Theory and Practice of Human Rights from the University of Essex in Colchester, UK and degrees in Psychology, Business Management &amp; French Literature from Luther College, US.)"}
{"id": "18135", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18135", "title": "Kamikazi Sandrine", "text": "Kamikazi Sandrine, ni Umujyanama wa Tekinike w\u2019ibidukikije ku muyobozi mukuru muri Rwanda Green Fund. Aho ayoborra isuzuma n'imicungire y'imishinga ya Leta.\nAkazi.\nAfite uburambe bw'imyaka irenga irindwi mugucunga ibidukikije. Nkumujyanama wa tekinike kumuyobozi mukuru, ashyigikira umuyobozi mukuru gufata ibyemezo byingirakamaro, atanga ubushishozi nisesengura kubibazo byingenzi by'umuryango. Mbere yo kwinjira mu kigega cy\u2019ibidukikije cy\u2019u Rwanda (icyongereza: Rwanda Green Fund), yakoraga muri Minisiteri ishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ubutabazi (MINEMA) kandi yari umujyanama w\u2019ibidukikije mu mishinga myinshi yo mu Rwanda\nAmashuri.\nSandrine afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu micungire y\u2019ibidukikije yakuye muri kaminuza ya Massey yo muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande ndetse n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu bw\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubuhinzi yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda."}
{"id": "18136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18136", "title": "Bangerezako Portia", "text": "Portia Bangerezako, ni umuyobozi wa Sustainability, Old Mutual Limited, amaze imyaka isaga 20 mubijyanye no gucunga ibidukikije no kuramba.\nAmaze gukora mu masangano y'ubukungu, ibidukikije n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage. Binyuze muri ubu busabane, Portia yizeye kuzagira icyo ihindura muburyo tubona no kwiyobora tugamije kugira ingaruka nziza. Yizera gutwara gahunda zigihugu cyacu - cyane cyane ibijyanye n\u2019imyanda n\u2019amazi.\nAmashuri.\nPortia ifite B Soc Sci yo muri kaminuza ya KwaZulu Natal kandi ifite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buyobozi bukomeza muri kaminuza ya Cambridge. \nAkazi.\nYakoze nk'inzobere mu bidukikije n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage mu rwego rwa serivisi ishinzwe imari kuva mu 2002 kandi afite uburambe mu mishinga mito n'iciriritse. Muri 2015 yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa UNEP FI (Ishami ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku bidukikije gahunda y\u2019imari) Afurika na Taskforce yo mu burasirazuba bwo hagati."}
{"id": "18137", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18137", "title": "Mudenge Hortense", "text": "Mudenge Hortense, ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ingamba muri Rwanda Finance Limited, isosiyete ishizwe kwagura no guteza imbere u Rwanda nk'ahantu hambere mu bijyanye n' ishoramari mpuzamahanga no gucuruza imipaka muri Afurika.\nUburambe n'akazi.\nHortense ni umujyanama w'inararibonye mu micungire, afite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 10 mu kugira inama z\u2019iterambere mpuzamahanga n\u2019abakiriya b\u2019abikorera ku iterambere ry\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019isoko.\nMbere yo kwinjira mu Rwanda rw\u2019imari, Hortense yakoranye na Dexis Consulting Group hamwe na Global Alliance ishinzwe kunoza imirire, nk'umujyanama, batanga ubumenyi bwa tekinike mu itangwa rya gahunda z\u2019ishoramari zatewe inkunga n'abaterankunga n'ibikoresho bitanga inkunga.\nAmashuri.\nHortense afite impamyabumenyi ya MBA yakuye mu ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga rya Hult muri Amerika kandi yarangije muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga yo muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "18138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18138", "title": "Nikita Pearson", "text": "Nikita Pearson, ni Umuyobozi w'Ibiro bishinzwe umubare muto w'abagore n'abagore (OMWI) muri Federal Insurance Insurance Corporation (FDIC). Nkuko biteganijwe mu ivugurura rya Dodd-Frank Wall Street no Kurengera Abaguzi (Itegeko), Igice cya 342,\nAmateka n'akazi.\nNikita yayoboye isesengura ry' imbogamizi kugira ngo afashe kumenya intandaro zishobora gutera ibibazo bitandukanye muri FDIC kandi yafashije mu gutegura igenamigambi ry\u2019ikigo 2021 DEI, harimo gahunda nshya n\u2019ibisubizo bifatika kugira ngo intego z\u2019ikigo DEI zigerweho. Umwaka 2020, yatanze ubuhamya imbere ya komisiyo ishinzwe imari ya Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika Serivisi ishinzwe ubudasa no kwishyira hamwe kugira ngo baganire ku mbaraga z\u2019ikigo mu kuzamura ubudasa no kwinjiza mu bakozi ba FDIC no mu masezerano, no guteza imbere kwinjiza amafaranga.\nNikita afite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 22 yo kugenzura banki kandi yagiye akora imirimo myinshi yubuyobozi mugihe yakoraga. Akorera muri komite nyobozi za FDIC, harimo n\u2019umuyobozi wungirije wa komite nyobozi nyobozi ishinzwe gutanga ibizamini byo mu rwego rwo hejuru, Umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda rishinzwe guteza imbere DEI mu bakozi basuzuma amabanki, ndetse n\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019itora mu nama itanga inama Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe amakuru.\nAmashuri.\nNikita afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Business Administration mu ibaruramari yakuye muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Savannah, i Savannah, Jeworujiya, ari naho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya magna cum laude. Yize kandi impamyabumenyi ya Graduate School of Banking muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Louisiana, Baton Rouge, Louisiana, n'abayobozi bakuru muri gahunda ya Leta muri kaminuza ya Harvard, Cambridge, Massachusetts."}
{"id": "18139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18139", "title": "Muhorakeye Ritha", "text": "Muhorakeye Ritha, ni umuyobozi ushinzwe umutungo no gutanga amasoko. Ritha ni umunyamwuga mu bucuruzi ufite uburambe bw'imyaka 12 mu buyobozi, imari, ibikoresho, amasoko no gucunga umutungo.\nAmashuri yize.\nRitha afite Impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu icungamari yakuye muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali kandi yayoboye ubuhanga mu micungire y\u2019imari n\u2019imikorere myiza mu masosiyete y\u2019ingufu zishobora kuvugururwa. "}
{"id": "18141", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18141", "title": "Nezerwa Martine", "text": "Nezerwa Martine, ni umunyarwandakazi, akaba Umuyobozi mukuru wa Digital mu rwego rw'ubuhinzi kuva Ukuboza 2020 (Icyongereza: Chief Digital Officer in the agriculture sector) mu kigo k'igihugu gishinzwe ubuhinzi mu Rwanda, Minagri.\nAkazi.\nMbere yo kuba umuyobozi mukuru wa Digital muri Minagri, yakoraga nka Tech Lead muri BK TecHouse kuva muri Gicurasi 2019. Martine n'umuhanga muri software ufite uburambe nubuhanga bwo kuyobora mubikorwa byikoranabuhanga.\nAmashuri.\nAfite Impamyabumenyi ya siyanse muri Computer Engineering na Master of Science in management management yakuye muri kaminuza ya gikirisitu ya Oklahoma ndetse na Master of Science muri sisitemu y'itumanaho hamwe na Networks muri kaminuza ya Pace."}
{"id": "18143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18143", "title": "Ingabire Chantal", "text": "Ingabire Chantal, ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe igenamigambi muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Umutungo mu Rwanda, Minagiri kuva muri Gicurasi 2021. \nAmateka y'akazi.\nMbere y'uwo mwanya, yari umushakashatsi mu mibereho n\u2019ubukungu mu Rwanda rw\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019umutungo w\u2019amatungo (RAB) kuva muri Kanama 2008.\nYinjiye muri Minisiteri afite uburambe buke bwo gukorana n\u2019abahinzi bo mu cyaro ariko anakorana n'itsinda ry\u2019ubushakashatsi butandukanye.\nAfite ubuhanga bwo gutegura ubushakashatsi bwuzuye, bufite ireme kandi buvanze hamwe n'uburambe bw'imyaka irenga 12 mu gucunga amakuru.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2015, ibikorwa bya Dr. Ingabire byibanze ku kwishyira hamwe kw'abagore bato bato mu iterambere ry\u2019ubuhinzi mu Rwanda ndetse n'ingaruka zabyo ku mibereho yabo.\nAmashuri.\nIngabire afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD mu bukungu bw\u2019ubuhinzi, impamyabumenyi ya Masters mu micungire y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubuhinzi. "}
{"id": "18145", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18145", "title": "Mukamugema Alice", "text": "Mukamugema Alice, ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubucuruzi muri minisiteri y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi mu Rwanda, Minagiri, (icyongereza: Agriculture Value Chain Management and Trade) guhera ku ya 25 Mutarama 2024. \nAkazi.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri MINAGRI, yari umufasha wubushakashatsi muri IPAR Rwanda kandi mbere, muri NISR. Uretse ibyo, guhera muri 2019, Alice yagiye akorana nabigisha batandukanye UR mu gusesengura amakuru. \nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Masters mu buhinzi n'Ubukungu bukoreshwa muri kaminuza ya Egerton. "}
{"id": "18146", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18146", "title": "Nyiramongi Odette", "text": "Nyiramongi Odette Unyarwandakazi wavukiye Mu Rwanda Mukarere Ka Rubavu I Rugerero.\nNyiramongi ni Muntu ki?\nOdette Nyiramongi Ni Rwiyemeza mirimo mubijyanye Namahoteli Murwanda Ubikora guhera 1996 Mukarere ka Rubavu Ari naho Yavukiye kandi Anatuye.\nUbuzima.\nNyiramongi Odette Wavukiye murwanda Mbere ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi 1994 Kimimwe nkabandi Yarahigwaga arinabyo Bamuviriyemo guhunga agahungira iburayi Mbere yibyumweru bibiri Ngo Genocide itangire murwanda nyiramongi Odette Yaburiye abagize umuryango we muri Genocide yagarutse mu Rwanda 1996 Nyuma yimyaka ibiri Genocide irangiye Avuye Iburayi.\nImpavu yo gushinga Hoteli.\nNyiramongi Odette Wabaye Rwiyemezamirimo Mubijyanye Namahoteli Afite umwihariko wumuco wakinyarwanda\nKuko yasangaga Amahoteli yose yomurwanda yaribanze kumuco wakizungu ahitamo gukora hoteli zifite umwihariko wakinyarwanda kuva mugikoni kugeza kubitanda byose bigizwe numuco Nyarwanda.\nAmazina yahoteli.\n1.Kivu Paradis Iri kurwego rwinyenyeri eshatu Ihereye Irubavu ahitwa kigufi hafi Yuruganda rwa BRALIRWA \n2.Paradise Malahide Hoteli iri kurwego rwinyenyeri eshatu \nIriburiro.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20240329073306/https://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/hoteli-ya-kinyarwanda-mu-bihuru-byo-ku-kivu-icyizere-nyiramongi-yabyaje-inkovu\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amakuru-mu-rwanda/article/yababariye-abamwangirije-imitungo-muri-jenoside-abafasha-kwiteza-imbere"}
{"id": "18147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18147", "title": "Nkundimfura Rosette", "text": "Nkundimfura Rosette, n'umurwanashyaka w'uburinganire bw'u Rwanda, ashishikajwe no guha imbaraga abagore n\u2019abakobwa. Kugeza ubu akora nk'ushinzwe iterambere ry'ubushobozi muri Profemme Twese Hame, yahoze ari inzobere mu bijyanye n'uburinganire muri ADRA mu Rwanda ndetse anashyigikira gahunda zigamije kugabanya ubusumbane bushingiye ku gitsina.\nAkazi.\nRosette niwe washinze kandi uhagarariye amategeko mu ihuriro ry\u2019abayobozi b\u2019abakobwa (GLF) rihuza abayobozi b\u2019abakobwa bose muri za kaminuza 20 n\u2019Amashuri Makuru ndetse n\u2019Amashuri 5 yisumbuye mu Rwanda na Visi-Perezida w\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019imiryango iharanira iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu burambye (NSEDO). Yizera ko Abakobwa b'Imico myiza bahinduka abagore b'ibintu.\nMbere yibyo, yagiye akora kandi nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe uburinganire bw'umugabo n'umugore ushinzwe ihuriro ry'imiyoborere muri minisiteri y'uburinganire no guteza imbere umuryango. Yabaye kandi komiseri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019ubuvugizi mu kongerera ubushobozi abakobwa muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019Abanyeshuri b\u2019u Rwanda. Usibye kuri ibyo, niwe washinze Koperative Omega Yahawe imbaraga.\nAmashuri.\nRosette afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bwa politiki n'ubutegetsi hamwe na Master's Degree of Social Science in Gender and Development yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nIbihembo.\nMuri 2019, Yabonye igihembo cy'umunyeshuri witwaye neza muri gahunda ya Gender and Development Masters program muri kaminuza yu Rwanda / Centre for Gender Studies.Rosette yagize uruhare runini mu bushakashatsi, gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda ziharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore; Abagore Kongera ubushobozi mu bukungu no guteza imbere uburinganire; Kubaka amahoro; Kubaka ubufatanye; Yagize kandi uruhare mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019ibikoresho bitandukanye by\u2019igihugu, uturere ndetse n\u2019amahanga bigamije guteza imbere uburinganire."}
{"id": "18148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18148", "title": "Ingabire Julian", "text": "Ingabire Julian, ni umunyarwanda akaba ari nawe washinze PlayHub, ni umuhanga mu iterambere kandi akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe imishinga wemewe (PMP) ufite imyaka irenga 15 akora haba mu nzego za Leta n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo mu bijyanye no kongerera ubushobozi, gukusanya umutungo, ubushakashatsi, imicungire y\u2019imishinga ndetse na gahunda z\u2019ubugenzuzi.\nAkazi.\nUbu ni Umuyobozi w\u2019ubushakashatsi, ubujyanama n\u2019udushya muri kaminuza y\u2019ubukerarugendo, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019ubucuruzi (UTB). Julian ashishikaye kandi aharanira inyungu zo kubona uburezi bufite ireme. Ni rwiyemezamirimo kandi mu rwego rw\u2019Uburezi, yamenyekanye cyane ku bikorwa yakoze mu burezi bw\u2019abakobwa na Cartier Womens Initiative Awards kandi aherutse guhabwa igihembo na Fondasiyo y\u2019Amerika ishinzwe iterambere kubera ibikorwa bye byo guharanira ko gahunda zo guteza imbere abana bato mu Rwanda ziyongera."}
{"id": "18149", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18149", "title": "Ingabire Angelique", "text": "Ingabire Angelique, n'umufasha wubushakashatsi muri Global Health Equity Universit. Ni umwe mubarangije amahugurwa muri Rx One Health Field Institute attended in 2022 and the Mandela Washington fellowship 2018.\nAmateka.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri IGHER, Angelique yakoraga mu kigo cy\u2019Ubusuwisi gishinzwe Ubuzima nk\u2019umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019ubushakashatsi ushinzwe kugenzura imikorere y\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe, anatanga inkunga nini mu igenamigambi no guhuza ibikorwa byo gukurikirana ibikorwa bya interineti hifashishijwe ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze bugamije iterambere ibisubizo byubuzima bwabana, kugabanya imiti ya antibiotique no guteza imbere igisonga cya mikorobe mu Rwanda.\nYakoze kandi muri Association des Guides du Rwanda nk'umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019akarere ushinzwe kongerera ubushobozi abakobwa 12+ kandi ahuza gahunda ya \u201cGushyigikira abangavu bato cyane uko bakura ubwenge\u201d hamwe n\u2019ikigo cya kaminuza ya Georgetown gishinzwe ubuzima bw\u2019imyororokere mu Rwanda, aho muri iyo mishinga yombi yahuzaga. imyitozo, gukurikirana inzira no kwerekana agaciro gakomeye kayobora amakipe no kubaka umubano mwiza nabafatanyabikorwa.\nMbere, Ang\u00e9lique yabaye umukorerabushake w\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe yoherejwe na Ashoka muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, muri Kenya, aho yakoraga nka Gahunda ya Fellowship and Youth Years Programs Associate kugira ngo abone umwanya wo kuganira ku biganiro by\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019intungamubiri mu baturage ba Ashoka.\nAmashuri.\nAngelique afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gucunga neza ingaruka z\u2019ubuzima muri Global y'Amajyepfo yakuye muri kaminuza ya Li\u00e8ge, na Bachelor of Science mu buhinzi bw\u2019inyamanswa muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nAngelique agira ishyaka hamwe nuburambe bugera kumyaka 8 mumirimo itandukanye mubuzima rusange; kuva mubushakashatsi bushingiye kubaturage kugeza kuba igice cyibikorwa byinshi byingimbi byingimbi ziteza imbere ubuzima no kubona amakuru binyuze mubuzima bwimyororokere n\u2019imyororokere n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira."}
{"id": "18150", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18150", "title": "Kangondo Angelique", "text": "Angelique Kangondo is a Rwandan agricultural economist and lecturer. She holds a PhD in Agricultural Economics (Sokoine University of Agriculture, 2020), an M.Sc. in Agricultural and Applied Economics (Sokoine University of Agriculture &amp; University of Pretoria), and a B.Sc. in Agricultural Economics and Agribusiness from University of Rwanda. Since April 2021, she has worked at the Rwanda Institute for Conservation Agriculture (RICA), leading programs in agricultural economics, agribusiness, teaching related courses and mentoring student entrepreneurship projects. Her research and interests focus on Agricultural and Rural Development, Agribusiness and Entrepreneurship Development; Agri-food systems and value chain development; Environmental and Natural resource economics; Land Economics and Governance; Economics of Climate Change; Livelihood analysis and youth aspirations."}
{"id": "18151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18151", "title": "Zaninka Marie Chantal", "text": "Marie Chantal, n'umucungamari wabigize umwuga. Ni Umuyobozi Mukuru ushinzwe serivisi z\u2019amasosiyete muri Minisiteri y\u2019ibikorwa remezo.\nAmateka n'akazi.\nNyuma yinshingano zisanzweho, Chantal yagize uruhare mukugenzura no gucunga imari yinzego zinyuranye za leta n\u2019abikorera barimo; Isosiyete yo gutwara abantu mu Rwanda (RITCO Ltd), nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ubugenzuzi bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019umutungo w\u2019amatungo, umugenzuzi w\u2019imbere mu gihugu mu biro by\u2019umugenzuzi mukuru w\u2019imbere mu gihugu, Minisiteri y\u2019Imari n\u2019igenamigambi ry\u2019ubukungu, nk'umuyobozi w'itsinda ubishinzwe. ya Guverinoma yo hagati, hiyongereyeho Minisiteri ishinzwe amakuru nk'umukozi ushinzwe abakozi.\nMarie Chantal yabaye umuyobozi w'agateganyo wa Soft Gold Ltd akaba n'umuhuzabikorwa wa Gacaca Jurisdiction mu karere ka Gisozi. Ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacungamari bemewe (ACCA) akaba n'umwe mu bagize Ikigo cy\u2019umucungamari wa Leta wemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR) kuva mu 2015. Chantal yari umwe mu bagize komite y'ubugenzuzi mu biro bishinzwe gukurikirana uburinganire (GMO).\nAmashuri.\nMarie Chantal afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ubuhinzi, yakuye muri kaminuza ya Egerton, na BSc mu bumenyi bw'ubuhinzi afite icyubahiro muri Agroforestry, muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, n'icyahoze ari Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi. Yari afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD mu bijyanye n'ubuhinzi n'icyaro muri kaminuza ya Egerton muri Kenya"}
{"id": "18152", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18152", "title": "Kayitesi Marcelline", "text": "Kayitesi Marcelline, ni Impuguke mu bijyanye n\u2019amazi n\u2019isuku n\u2019umutoza, ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe amazi n\u2019isukura muri Minifra.\nAkazi.\nMadamu Marcelline ni Umwarimu w'inararibonye wabaye Umwarimu w'igihe gito w'amasomo yo gutanga amazi no gucunga umutungo w'amazi mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga rya Kigali. Yabaye Uhagarariye Umuturage w\u2019umuryango wa Panafrican, Amazi n\u2019isuku muri Afurika (WSA), kandi afite uburambe mu gukorera ahantu h\u2019imico itandukanye. Afite ubunararibonye mu guhuza imiyoboro myinshi y\u2019abafatanyabikorwa, koroshya kwiga no gusangira amahuriro, no gucunga ubushakashatsi niterambere ryimishinga na gahunda. Yabaye kandi Umujyanama wa Tekinike wa Minisitiri w\u2019ibikorwa Remezo.\nAmashuri.\nMarcelline afite Masters mu micungire y\u2019amazi y\u2019amazi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Dar Es Salaam, yibanda ku mazi ku bantu bo muri Polytechnic ya Namibiya; a Bsc mu bijyanye n\u2019ubwubatsi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019ibidukikije kuva muri Kigali Institute of Science and Technology (KIST)."}
{"id": "18153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18153", "title": "Sezibera Eustochie", "text": "Eustochie Sezibera ni Umuyobozi wa CorpsAfrica / Rwanda.\nAkazi.\nKuva mu 2017, yabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019igihugu wa FHI360 mu Rwanda aho yari ayoboye umushinga uterwa inkunga na FHI360 USAID warangiye muri Gicurasi 2018. Iyi yari inshuro ye ya kabiri yohereza muri FHI360 ubwo yari ayoboye undi mushinga wa USAID mu 2008. Byashyizwe mu bikorwa na Academy ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019uburezi, umuryango waguzwe na FHI360 mu 2011. Mbere yibi, yayoboye umushinga uterwa inkunga na Banki yisi yibanze kuri ICT mu iterambere. Ari mu mashyirahamwe menshi yimibereho aho ari mubuyobozi ndetse n\u2019aho yitanga. Kugeza ubu, umurimo we w'ingenzi muri rimwe mu mashyirahamwe arimo ni ugukusanya inkunga ku matsinda atishoboye. Afite ubushake n'ubwitange ku buyobozi bw'urubyiruko, iterambere ry'abaturage bagize uruhare, gusuzuma ingaruka, gukorera mu mucyo, no kubazwa ibyo bakora. Afite ubuyobozi, ibiganiro, nubuhanga bwa diplomasi bukenewe kugirango gahunda itangire kandi ishyirwe mubikorwa neza.\nAmashuri.\nEustochie afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubumenyi mu micungire y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ibarurishamibare yakuye muri kaminuza ya Maryland, Parike ya Koleji, na Master of Arts mu micungire y\u2019itumanaho kuva KIST na UKTA. (KIST: Kigali Institute of Science and Technology; UKTA: Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019itumanaho mu Bwongereza)."}
{"id": "18154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18154", "title": "Impumbya Anitha", "text": "Impumbya Anitha, avuka mu akarere ka Rwamagana, mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. n'umuhuza wabakorerabushake muri CorpsAfrica / Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nAnitha afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Geografiya no Gutegura Imijyi ahitamo Igishushanyo mbonera cy'imijyi yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda / College of Science and Technology.\nAkazi.\nYabanje gukora nk'ushinzwe kurengera ibidukikije no kugurisha ibidukikije muri WAKA WAKA Ltd mbere yo kwinjira muri CorpsAfrica nk'umukorerabushake. Mu myaka yisumbuye, Anitha yagize uruhare runini mu gushinga iyo kipe (CARITAS Rwanda), aho yayoboye imbaraga zo gukusanya ibikoresho bagenzi babo bigana bo mu miryango itemewe kandi akangurira abanyeshuri bakeneye ubufasha kwakira impano zikomeye. Anitha yabonye kandi impamyabumenyi nyinshi, zirimo Ibikorwa Byingenzi, Urubuga GIS, na Arc GIS App yo gukusanya amakuru yo mu murima kuva muri ESRI Rwanda."}
{"id": "18155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18155", "title": "Bigirimana Noella", "text": "Bigirimana Noella, ni Umuyobozi mukuru wungirije mu kigo cy\u2019ubuvuzi cy'u Rwanda, ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe gushyira mu bikorwa ubuzima mu Rwanda (Icyongereza: Rwanda Biomedical Center).\nAmashuri.\nNoella, afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Biologiya ya muntu, Ubuzima na Sosiyete yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cornell, n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri politiki mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubuzima n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ishuri rya Heller muri kaminuza ya Brandeis.\nAkazi.\nNoella mbere yakoraga nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ishami ry'ubushakashatsi, guhanga udushya n'ubumenyi muri RBC. Yabaye kandi Umufatanyabikorwa wa Precision Medicine mu Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi, aho yibanze ku gushyiraho ingamba za politiki n\u2019imiyoborere kugira ngo yihutishe ikoreshwa ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rigenda ryiyongera mu buryo buke. Noella yakoze kandi nk'umujyanama mu mishinga iterwa inkunga na OMS na USAID mu Rwanda na Gineya-Conakry mu gihe cya nyuma ya Ebola.\nNoella kuri ubu akora mu Nama Ngishwanama y'Ikigo cya Transparency Institute, kandi akora nk'umuyobozi w'Inama Ngishwanama y'Urubyiruko Kurwanya NTDs. Ni Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi ku Isi muri Kigali Hub, akaba n'umuterankunga mu Ihuriro ry\u2019ejo hazaza."}
{"id": "18156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18156", "title": "Mutegaraba Nathalie", "text": "Mutegaraba Nathalie, ni division manager muri Rwanda Biomedical Centre -RBC. Mbere yo kwinjira muri RBC, Yakoraga ku Biro by'Umugenzuzi Mukuru w'imyaka 15 nk'umugenzuzi w'imari kandi yari Umuyobozi ushinzwe ubugenzuzi igihe yagenwaga muri RBC.\nAmashuri.\nMutegaraba afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buyobozi yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.Yabonye MBA muri kaminuza ya Herriot Watt, Ishuri ry'ubucuruzi rya Edinburgh, mu Bwongereza. Ni umucungamari wabigize umwuga (ACCA yujuje ibyangombwa) kuva mu 2013 kandi yabonye icyemezo cya Fellowship muri 2019."}
{"id": "18157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18157", "title": "Musanabaganwa Clarisse", "text": "Musanabaganwa Clarisse umuyobozi ushinzwe isesengura ry'ubuvuzi, Ubushakashatsi, Guhanga udushya na Data Science muri RBC.\nMusanabaganwa ni Umuhanga mu bya siyansi muri Novartis/ Ubusuwisi akaba n'ishami ry\u2019ikigo cy\u2019irondakoko ry\u2019abantu muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda aho ubu ari mugenzi wa Postdoc ku mushinga w\u2019ubushakashatsi bwa podoconiose uterwa inkunga na NIHR kandi arimo akora iperereza ku ruhare rw\u2019imikorere ya epigenetike muri etiologiya ya podoconiose. Ni n'umushakashatsi mugenzi we munsi yubumenyi bwisi yose / Vrije Universiteit Bruxelles / Ububiligi. Yabaye umwe mu bagize komite nyobozi y\u2019ubushakashatsi ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu, umuyobozi wa komite nyobozi ishinzwe ibibazo by\u2019ubushakashatsi ku karere ndetse n\u2019igihugu cyibanze kuri komisiyo ishinzwe ubushakashatsi ku buzima bwa EAC.\nAmashuri.\nMusanabaganwa afite impamyabumenyi ya PhD mu bumenyi bw'ubuvuzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Radboud yo mu Buholandi. Azwiho ubuhanga muri epigenetics na bioinformatics mubijyanye na siyanse y'ubuvuzi.\nMusanabaganwa yiyandikishije nkumushakashatsi muri Vrije Universteit Bruxelles / Ububiligi (VUB). Afite impamyabumenyi ya siyanse muri epidemiologiya yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda na master ya kabiri mu buzima rusange yakuye muri kaminuza ya Manchester metropolitan / Ubwongereza ndetse n\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya siyansi mu bijyanye n\u2019ibinyabuzima yakuye muri kaminuza ya Bangalore / Ubuhinde. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri bioinformatics n'ubushakashatsi ku mavuriro.\nAkazi.\nClarisse afite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 12 mubushakashatsi niterambere (RD) murwego rwubuzima.Ni PI mumishinga myinshi yubushakashatsi cyane cyane kanseri, indwara zifata ubwonko bwo mu mutwe, covid19 n'indwara z'umutima. Yasohoye inyandiko nyinshi za siyansi kandi ni umusubiramo ibinyamakuru bya siyansi byo mu gihugu no mu mahanga."}
{"id": "18158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18158", "title": "Zeo Trap", "text": "Amateka.\nZeo Trap umuhanzi ukiri muto wigaruriye imitima y'abenshi mu rwanda Kandi akaba yaravukiye nyamirambo.akaba akora indirimbo nziza za hip-hop free style kandi zirimo ubutumwa akaba akunda kuvuga Kavukire akaba azwi no kumushinga witwa visit Nyamirambo.\nIbikorwa.\nYasohoye album ebyiri(2) Iyambere yitwa Abafana ibihumbi ijana irimo indirimbo zigera kwi cumi nk'umwanda,My ghee, ten10,Abafana 100k, kabosi, n'izindi.\nIyakabiri yitwa Ntago anoga irimo indirimbo zigera kuri makumyabiri(20) harimo street goat, Impane, hard work, Ntago anoga, ibisimba byaje, Therapy n'izindi."}
{"id": "18159", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18159", "title": "Umutesi Francine", "text": "Umutesi Francine, ni Umunyarwandakazi wavutse 1981, ni Umuyobozi w\u2019ishami ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu buvuzi, mu ishami rya serivisi zita ku buzima muri Rwanda Biomedical Centre (RBC). Afite uburambe muri kwihangira imirimo, gucunga ibikorwa byubucuruzi no gucunga umushinga.\nAmashuri.\nYize muri Kaminuza ya Technology muri Polonye aho yavanye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri mu by\u2019ubuzima (Biomedical Engineering) (Icyongereza: Lodz University of Technology in Poland), Afite kandi icyiciro cya gatatu muri Kaminuza ya Cark University Poland aho akurikiranye amasomo ku by\u2019imicungire y\u2019ubuzima (Health Management)\nAkazi.\nAkora nk'Umuyobozi w\u2019Inama y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019u Rwanda rw\u2019Abashakashatsi b\u2019ibinyabuzima (Icyongereza:Rwanda Association of Biomedical Engineers (RAME), umwe mu bagize Inama y\u2019Inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019umwuga w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019u Rwanda (Icyongereza:National Council Board of the Rwanda Health Allied Professional Council (RHAPC), yatumiwe n\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ubuvuzi n\u2019ibinyabuzima muri bo Igice cya Clinical Engineering Division (Icyongereza: International Federation for Medical and Biological Engineering in their Clinical Engineering Division (IFMBE\u2013CED).\nInyandiko.\nUmutesi yanditse igitabo yise \u201cForgiveness\u2026 The Rwandan Way\u201d kivuga ubuzima bw\u2019umuryango we mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "18160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18160", "title": "Dushimire Alice", "text": "Dushimire Alice, numucungamari wemewe kandi ni umunyamuryango w'ikigo gishinzwe ibaruramari rya Leta ryu Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nDushimire afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu icungamutungo ry\u2019ubucuruzi (BBA) yakuye mu kigo cya Kigali Institute of Science Technology and Management; Impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi (MBA) yakuye muri kaminuza ya Heriot Watt-Edinburgh."}
{"id": "18161", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18161", "title": "Nteziryayo Rusine Stella", "text": "Stella Rusine Nteziryayo kuri ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki y' Amajyambere y' u Rwanda (Development Bank of Rwanda - BRD). Mbere y' aho, Madame Nteziryayo yari umuyobozi w\u2019ishami rishinzwe imyenda rusange muri minisiteri y\u2019imari n\u2019igenamigambi ry\u2019ubukungu (MINECOFIN) mu Rwanda. Ni Impuguke mu by'ubukungu ifite uburambe mu micungire y\u2019imyenda n\u2019ibisabwa byinguzanyo byigenga, kuri ubu akaba ari umwe mu bagize inama y'ubutegetsi muri Banki ishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda. \nAmashuri.\nStella afite Msc mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda 2019. "}
{"id": "18162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18162", "title": "Karekezi Angelique", "text": "Karekezi Angelique ni umuyobozi mukuru wa RWASHOSCCO LTD, u Rwanda Ruto Ruto Rwihariye rwa Kawa Abahinzi.\nAkazi.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, Angelique yavuye mu micungire y\u2019imari aba umuyobozi mukuru wa Rwashoscco aho ari ubu, atwara icyerekezo rusange cy\u2019isosiyete yo kwamamaza, guteka no kohereza ikawa yihariye y\u2019u Rwanda. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Rwashoscco, Angelique yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye mu makoperative y\u2019ikawa kandi akora iterambere ry\u2019ubuhanga ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abahinzi b\u2019ikawa mu mushinga wa SPREAD USAID guhera mu 2003.\nAmashuri.\nAngelique afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Business Administration mu bukungu kandi ni na perezida w\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019ikawa w\u2019abagore mu Rwanda Umutwe."}
{"id": "18163", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18163", "title": "Tengera Gloria", "text": "Gloria Tengera, ufite icyicaro mu Rwanda, kuri ubu ni umunyamabanga wa sosiyete akaba n'umujyanama mukuru muri Banki ishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda, azana uburambe ku nshingano zabanjirije iyi muri AB Bank Rwanda PLC, AB Bank Rwanda Ltd na RwandAir.\nAkazi.\nGloria Tengera yagizwe Umuyobozi w'Ikibazo muri Mata 2018 nyuma yo kuba umuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe amategeko kuva mu 2015. Iyi gahunda ibaye mu gihe, Banki irashaka gushyiraho imikorere yigenga ya Risk mu myaka itanu iriho mu Isoko ry'u Rwanda. Gloria Tengera yahawe kandi inshingano yo gushinga ishami ry'amategeko igihe banki yari itangiye imirimo yayo muri 2014.\nAmaze kwinjira muri banki mu Kwakira 2013 nk'umujyanama mu by'amategeko, nyuma aza kugirwa Umuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe amategeko muri Werurwe 2015, Gloria yagize uburambe n'ubumenyi mu gukemura ibibazo bikomeye mu by'amategeko. Yagize uruhare mu gutegura amasezerano no gusuzuma iperereza ryakozwe n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubuyobozi byaje kumuha icyerekezo gikenewe ku bucuruzi bwa banki. Iri murika ryamenyesheje kandi icyemezo cyo kumwimurira mu ishami rishinzwe ibyago.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri banki, yakoranye n\u2019ibindi bigo birimo indege, ibigo bya leta, imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta na Minisiteri y\u2019ubuzima mu nzego zitandukanye.\nAmashuri.\nGloria yarangije amategeko muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda akaba yararangije LLM mu bucuruzi, yakuye muri kaminuza ya Erasimusi, Rotterdam mu Buholandi. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bukemurampaka yaturutse mu kigo gishinzwe ubukemurampaka. (icyongereza: Gloria Tengera holds a 2012 - 2013 Master's Degree in LLM Business, Corporate and Maritime @ Erasmus University Rotterdam. With a robust skill set that includes Management, Microsoft Office, Customer Service, Banking, Risk Management and more, Gloria Tengera contributes valuable insights to the industry)"}
{"id": "18164", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18164", "title": "Munezero Clarisse", "text": "= MUNEZERO Clarisse =\nAmashuri yize.\nAfite ubunararibonye bw\u2019imyaka 13 mu kazi kuko yarangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu mategeko muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali mu mwaka w\u2019 i 2006, yatangiye icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Kaminuza y\u2019i Nantes mu gihugu cy\u2019Ubufaransa. Mu mwaka w\u20192008 yabonye indi mpamyabumenyi imwemerera kunganira abantu mu nkiko ayikuye mu gihugu cya Uganda, ILI - Kampala."}
{"id": "18165", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18165", "title": "Tengera Kayitare Francoise", "text": "Fran\u00e7oise Kayitare Tengera, Umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe imari muri iki gihe afite inshingano zo kugenzura imari, serivisi z\u2019amasosiyete, amasoko ndetse n\u2019ishami rishinzwe gushyira mu bikorwa imishinga imwe ya kaminuza y'u Rwanda (SPIU).\nAkazi.\nMbere yibi, yakoraga muri kaminuza yu Rwanda-College of Business and Economics nk'umuyobozi w'agateganyo. Yabaye kandi umwarimu akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ishami ry\u2019imari n\u2019ishami rinini mu Ishuri ry\u2019Ubucuruzi muri Koleji imwe. \nNi umwe mu bagize Inama y'Ubuyobozi akaba n'Umuyobozi mu bigo bitandukanye birimo Ikigo gishinzwe ubwiteganyirize bw'u Rwanda, ActionAid Rwanda, INATEK (Ikigo cy\u2019ubuhinzi, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019uburezi cya Kibungo), RIM s.a (Reseau Interdioc\u00e9sain de Microfinance) na Don Bosco Initiative.\nTengera yabonye buruse ya perezida kugira ngo akore impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza muri kaminuza ya gikirisitu ya Oklahoma (USA) aho yarangirije impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi, afite impamyabumenyi mu by'imari.\nIcyifuzo cye ni uguhindura urubyiruko rufite uburezi bufite ireme rugamije kuzamura imibereho yabo no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019imiryango yabo ndetse n\u2019igihugu muri rusange. Mu mwaka wa 2012, nubwo yari abakozi bato bato, Tengera yatoranijwe na bagenzi be nk'umukozi mwiza w'umwaka kubera ishyaka n'ubwitange yagize mu masomo. "}
{"id": "18166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18166", "title": "Mukamurenzi Nociata", "text": "Mukamurenzi Nociata ni umuhuzabikorwa wa minisiteri yuburezi ishami rishinzwe gushyira mu bikorwa umushinga umwe (SPIU).\nAmashuri.\nMukamurenzi afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye mu Ishuri ry\u2019Ubuyobozi ry\u2019Ubuholandi rya Maastricht, n\u2019impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere yo muri Uganda afite uburambe bw\u2019imyaka irenga 15 mu bijyanye n\u2019imari, ibaruramari, imiyoborere n\u2019ubuyobozi.\nAkazi.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi, yari Umuyobozi Mukuru mu Kigega cyo Kubungabunga Umuhanda, Gusura Umwarimu muri UNILAK, n\u2019Umugenzuzi Mukuru mu Kigo cy\u2019imisoro n\u2019u Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ayobora imishinga yose yashyizwe mu bikorwa kandi igahuzwa na Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi binyuze muri SPIU. Ni umuyobozi kandi w'Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya Rwanda Engineering and Manufacturing Corporation."}
{"id": "18167", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18167", "title": "Boneza Angelique", "text": "Boneza Angelique ni umuyobozi w\u2019ishami ry\u2019uburezi bwibanze n\u2019ubuziranenge bwa TVET mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe ibizamini n\u2019ubugenzuzi bw\u2019ishuri NESA. \nAmashuri.\nBoneza afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu buyobozi bw'ubucuruzi, uburyo bwo gucunga imishinga muri kaminuza ya Mount Kenya na Bachelor of Science hamwe n'uburezi yakuye mu Ishuri Rikuru Nderabarezi rya Kigali. Afite kandi PhD mu burezi bw'imibare yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nAkazi.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri NESA, yakoranye na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi mu myanya itandukanye, nk'Umugenzuzi w\u2019Uburezi ndetse n\u2019Umwuga Ukomeye mu gukurikirana no gusuzuma imishinga y\u2019ubushakashatsi.\nBoneza kandi yakoranye n'Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ibarurishamibare mu Rwanda ndetse n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze nk'Abashinzwe Ibarurishamibare kandi yahoze ari umwarimu w'Imibare mu Ishuri rya kabiri."}
{"id": "18168", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18168", "title": "Murungi Joan", "text": "Murungi Joan ni Umuyobozi w\u2019inyigisho zo kwigisha no kwiga mu kigo cy\u2019uburezi bw\u2019ibanze mu Rwanda. Mbere yibi yari umwarimu muri College of Education; Kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nMurungi afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gutegura igenamigambi n'ubuyobozi ndetse n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Med) mu isesengura rya politiki mu burezi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Witwatersrand muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yakoze kandi ubushakashatsi bwimbitse mu rwego rw\u2019Abagore n\u2019Urwanda rwo Kwubaka Amakimbirane. Ibyifuzo bye byabashakashatsi byabaye mubyigisho byuburezi n\u2019abagore byumwihariko \"abagore muri Post Conflict kwiyubaka &amp; gahunda yo kubaka amahoro\"."}
{"id": "18170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18170", "title": "Rugege Sam", "text": "Rugege Sam (yavutse mu mwaka 1947) ni umunyarwanda akaba yarabaye Perezida w'Urukiko rw'ikirenga rw'u Rwanda kuva mu mwaka wa 2011 kugeza 2019, asezeye ku mirimo ye kubera yaramaze kugera mu gihe cy'izabukuru aho yaje gusimburwa na Faustin Nteziryayo.\nUbuzima bwe bwite na amashuri yize.\nNyakubahwa Sam Rugege yavutse mu mwaka 1947. Akomoka kuri se Canon Mutware William Iyakaremye Rugege witabye imana afite imyaka 98. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n' amategeko yakuye muri Makerere university(LLB). Afite kandi impamyabumenyi ihanitse (LLM) yakuye muri Yale Law School, ndetse kandi n' impanyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Phil. D) yakuye muri University of Oxford.\nImirimo yakoze.\nYatangiye umwuga we wo kuba umwalimu mu by'amategeko muri kaminuza ya Makerere, mbere yo guhatirwa guhunga iterabwoba ry\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Idi Amin mu mwaka 1976. Nyuma yigisha muri kaminuza za Lesotho, Makerere na Swaziland. Mbere yo kuzamurwa ku ntebe ya perezida w'urukiko rw'ikirenga, Rugege yari umwarimu w\u2019amategeko muri kaminuza y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Cape (UWC) muri Afurika yepfo, aho yigishaga amategeko shinga n\u2019ivugurura ry\u2019ubutaka nyuma y'ivangura ruhu mu rurimi rw'icyongereza byitwa \"Apartheid\". Yabaye kandi umwarimu mukuru mu by'amategeko, mu cyahoze ari kaminuza nkuru y'uRwanda,\nYabaye Kandi umujyanama wa komisiyo yateguye Itegeko Nshinga rya repubulika yu Rwanda nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi 1994. yabaye kandi Perezida w\u2019Urukiko rw\u2019ikirenga rw\u2019u Rwanda. \nImirimo akora ubu.\nNyuma yo gusezera mu mirimo yo kuba perezida w'urukiko rw'ikirenga rw'uRwanda ubu akora muri The Weinstein International Foundation, umuryango udaharanira inyungu uharanira ko imishyikirano iboneka kandi ikagerwaho ku isi hose mu gihe hagenda hagaragara ibibazo n'amakimbirane ku isi. "}
{"id": "18171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18171", "title": "Inama nyafurika yiga k' ikoranabuhanga mu Miyoborere", "text": "Inama nyafurika ku ikoranabuhanga mu miyoborere ni inama yabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda kuva ku ya 12 kugeza ku ya 14 Werurwe 2024 muri Kigali convention Centre. Icyari kigamijwe kwari ukuganira no gucukumbura uburyo ikoranabuhanga rituma serivisi zitangwa kand zinoze ku baturage ba Afurika. \nIntego z' Inama.\nInama nyafurika ku ikoranabuhanga mu miyoborere, nk\u2019inama nyafurika, yari igamije gukoresha ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho n\u2019 isakaza bumenyi kugira ngo byorohereze iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bushingiye ku ikoranabuhanga, guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019imiyoborere muri Afurika no gushyigikira uburyo bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga rihindura isi ndetse na guverinoma imbaraga zo gukoresha ikoranabuhanga mu kunoza imitangire ya serivisi. "}
{"id": "18172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18172", "title": "Lubna Dajani", "text": "Lubna Dajani ni Umunyamerikakazi ukomoka muri Palestine, akaba impuguke mu ikoranabuhanga rigezweho, aha yakoranye ni ibiga biyandukanye by' ikoranabuhanga nka google, Nokia, Microsoft nibindi. kuri ubu yatangije companyi y' ikoranabuhanga yitwa Allternet ikorera muri Amerika no mu Bwongereza, kubufatanye niyi companyi barigutangiza ikigo (ALLA Hub) mu Rwanda aho kizaba ku gushaka ibisubizo bikemura ibibazo by' abaturage cyane cyane mu buzima, ikoranabuhanga, uburezi, imihindagurikire y' ikirera no guhanga udushya. \nImirimo yakoze.\nLubna Dajani yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w' igenamigambi mu kigo cy' abongereza cya Digital identity and credentials Management company. ni ambasaderi wa Connectpreneur platform, Ni umuyobozi mukuru n' uwashinze Allternet.co, yakoreye Google nka IOT Expert, muri Microsoft nka telecomminucation expert ndetse yakoreye Nokia nibindi bigo bikomeye by' ikoranabuhanga kw' isi \nImyidagaduro.\nLubna Dajani yakoze filime mbarankuru yitwa \"MY HAIFA\" hari mu mwaka wa 2022, iyi filime nibwo ya korwaga kandi iyoborwa na Lubna Dajani, byakorewe mu ngoro ndangamuya y' abanyepalisitine iherereye muri leza zunze ubumwe z' Amerika, aho yavugaga ku mateka n' inkuru zo mubuto by' abari batuye muri HAIFA wari umugi wwakera muri za 1948 ndetse ukaba arinawo mugi wari munini muri ibyo bihe. "}
{"id": "18174", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18174", "title": "Soline Mukamana", "text": "MUKAMANA Solin e ni umuyobozi w' akarere ka Burera, akaba umubyeyi w' abana batanu, yavukiye mu murenge wa Gatumba mu karere ka Nyaruguru muri 1974, guhera muri 1997 ubwo yari asoje amasomo mu mashuri yisumbuye yatangiye gukora imirimo inyuranye aho yavukiye muri Ngororero. \nAmateka.\nMUKAMANA Soline yavutse muri 1974 avukira muri Ngororero mu murenge wa Gatumba, yatangiriye amashuri ku ishuri ribanza rya Gatumba, amashuri yisumbuye ayiga kuri GS. Rulindo aho muri 1994 yarageze muwa gatanu ariko kubera ibihe bitoroshye bya jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994 kwiga byarahagaze nyuma muri 1997 yaje gusoza amashuri yisumbuye muri Rambura. nyuma yokurangiza ayisumbuye yatsinze neza abona buruse yo gukomeza muri kaminuza, gusa ntiyakomeje kubera ibihe by' imidugararo no gutakaza icyizere cy' ubuzima, yahisemo gushakisha akazi yakoze ikizamini abona akazi muri food international for Hungry wari umushinga wakoreraga mu karere kiwabo bidatinze umushinga waje guhagarara bitewe n' intambara y' abacengezi atakaza akazi atyo. yongeye gushaka akandi kazi aba umwarimu mu mashuri yisumbuye nyumagato kuko utari yarize uburezi kimwe nabandi nkawe bahagarikwa mukazi. yongeye kubona ahandi akora, hari mu kigonderabuzima cya Muhororo biturutse ku mirimo y' ubukorerabushake yakoze mubijyanye n' imirire y' abana. nyuma gato yaje kubaka urugo ndetse abifashijwemo muwo bashakanye akomeza amashuri mu ishuri rikuru Gatulika rya kabgayi, muri 2009 yabonye impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza muri sociologie ndetse ayakomereje muri Mount Kenya mubyerekeye Ubuzima rusange. kugeza ubu afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse (Masters) yakuye muri kaminuza y' abadivantisite ya Kigali. "}
{"id": "18175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18175", "title": "Valentine Mukase", "text": "Valentine MUKASE, ni Umunyarwandakazi w' umunyapolitiki wavukiye mu Rwanda, akaba umuyobozi w' akarere ka Karongi yasimbuye MUKARUTESI Vestine wegujwe na njyanama imishinja kutanoza inshingano. \nImirimo yakoze.\nmukase Valentine yabaye umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza y' abaturage mu karere ka karongi mbere yuko atorerwa kuyobora ako karere muri 2023. "}
{"id": "18176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18176", "title": "Vestine Mukandayisenga", "text": "Vestine Mukandayisenga ni umunyepolitiki w' umunyarwandakazi yavutse muri 1987 avukira mu murenge wa Jabana mu karere ka Gasabo, arubatse afite abana babiri, kuri ubu ni umuyobozi w' akarere ka Gakenke. \nAmashuri yize.\nVestine Mukandayisenga yize amashuri ubuvuzi bw' amatungo mu mashuri yisumbuye muri EAV Rushashi ho mu karere ka Gakenke, akomereza muri kaminuza nkuru y' urwanda aho yize Ubuhinzi n' ubworozi akahakura impamyabumenyi ' icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza. yize icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mubijyanye no kuyobora ubucuruzi no gucunga imishinga (BusIness Administration and Project Management) muri kaminuza ya UNILAK. \nImirimo yakoze.\nMukandayisenga Vestine yakoze muri DUHAMIC - ADRI kuva arangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza aho yayobaraga imishinga y' ubuhinzi n' ubworozi muri uyu muryango uharanira amajyambere y' icyaro, nyuma yaje kuyobora imishinga y' umuzima ndetse ayobora na methodolodie ya IFAD yo kwimakaza ahame ry' uburinganire mu muryango, aha niho yavuye ajya kuba umuyobozi w' akarere (Mayor). \nImyidagaduro.\nMayor Vastine MUKANDAYISENGA yabaye umukinnyi w' umupira w' amaguru ubwa yari umunyeshuri muri EAVRushashi yari kapiteni w' ikipe y' abakobwa kuri iryo shuri, kandi Mayor ni umufana ukomeye wa ruhago guka kugeza ubu ibyo gufana yabivuyemo kuko amakipe yari yarihebeye yagiye amutenguha agatsindwa cyane kuburya yananiwe kubyihanganira. yafanaga Rayon sports yo mu Rwanda na Manchester united yo mu Bwongereza. "}
{"id": "18177", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18177", "title": "Dative Kayitesi", "text": "Dative Kayitesi ni umuyobozi w' akarere ka Rutsiro, akaba umunyapolitike w' umunyarwandakazi akande numwe mu bayobozi b' uturere bakiri bato, kumyaka 39 yatorewe kuyobora akarere. \nImirimo yakoze.\nKayitesi Dative yabaye umuhuzabikorwa w' inama y' igihugu y' abagore kurwego rw' intara y' uburengerazuba, yabaye umuyobozi mu ishami ry' imari muri IPRC Karongi. \nAmashuri.\nKAYITESI Dative nk' umunyarwanda yize amashuri abanza, ayisumbuye ndetse yiga kaminuza aho yize ibyerekeye n' icungamari."}
{"id": "18180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18180", "title": "Umutoni Carine", "text": "Umutoni Carine ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse 1982, ubu n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Ecobank u Rwanda, umwanya yafashe mu Gushyingo 2022. Ni umwe mu bagize Komite Nyobozi y\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyamabanki mu Rwanda (RBA).\nAmateka y'akazi.\nUmutoni yakoraga imirimo itandukanye mu mabanki atandukanye, nk'icyahoze cyitwa Banque Commercial du Rwanda (ubu ni I&amp;M Bank Rwanda), Banki ya Kigali, na KCB Bank Rwanda, n'izindi.\nAmashuri.\nUmutoni afite impamyabumenyi ya MBA muri Strategy Strategy na Politiki y\u2019ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Maastricht, mu Buholandi."}
{"id": "18181", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18181", "title": "Baingana Maggie", "text": "Baingana Maggie, ni umwe mu bashinze hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ishami rya Shield Associates, ikigo cy\u2019amategeko gikorera muri Kigali-Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nBaingana yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (LLB) yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, muri Uganda; impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'amategeko mu kigo cya Uganda gishinzwe iterambere; impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (LLM) mu mategeko ya Leta na Politiki rusange yakuye muri kaminuza ya pasifika, Californiya-Amerika; kandi afite ibyemezo byinshi byumwuga. \nAmateka.\nMadamu Baingana afite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 17 akorera haba mu nzego za Leta n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga mu nzego z\u2019ubutabera, ubuzima n\u2019Amashuri Makuru. Yamaze imyaka irenga icumi acunga inkunga ingana na miliyoni y'amadolari ya Amerika yo gufasha tekinike mu mashuri makuru yo mu Rwanda. Akomeje kugira uruhare runini mu bujyanama muri kaminuza ya Tulane yo mu Rwanda, aho atanga inama ku iterambere ry\u2019abarimu no kwiga e-kaminuza ya Rwanda.\nMbere y\u2019ibyo, yamaze imyaka itari mike mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe ubushinjacyaha aho yakoraga ibijyanye no gukurikirana no gukurikirana imanza za Jenoside n\u2019ibindi byaha by\u2019intambara byakozwe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Kugeza ubu akora nk'umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa w'ishyirahamwe ry'abavoka mu Rwanda kandi ni umunyamuryango wa Fellowship y'u Rwanda. Afite ishyaka ryo guhugura abakobwa bakiri bato babigize umwuga kugirango bongere ubushobozi bwabo kandi babeho neza mugihe batanga umusanzu ugaragara mumiryango yabo."}
{"id": "18182", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18182", "title": "Kirenga Stella", "text": "Kirenga Stella, ni umunyarwandakazi utuye mu Rwanda, kuri ubu ni umuyobozi wa banki y\u2019abaguzi muri Ecobank Rwanda na MTN Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nStella Kirenga afite Master of Business Administration (MBA) mu 2009 - 2011 mu micungire yimishinga yakuye mu ishuri ry\u2019imiyoborere rya Maastricht. Afite ubuhanga bukomeye bukubiyemo Itumanaho, Amahugurwa, Kuvugira mu ruhame, Ubuyobozi, gucunga ibicuruzwa n'ibindi, Stella Kirenga atanga ibitekerezo byingirakamaro mu nganda."}
{"id": "18183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18183", "title": "Mutamba Diane", "text": "Mutamba Diane, yavukiye mu mujyi wa Kigali ku ya 8 Mata 1982, avukira Faustin Bizimungu na Appolonie. Mutamba akorana na Minisiteri y\u2019ubuzima mu ishami ry\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ababyeyi n\u2019abana. \nAmashuri.\nMutamba yize muri APE Rugunga amashuri abanza mbere yo kwinjira muri Lycee De Kigali. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'ubuvuzi muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (NUR)."}
{"id": "18184", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18184", "title": "Haguma Diana", "text": "Haguma Diane, ni Umuyobozi wigenga utari Umuyobozi mukuru mu nama y'ubuyobozi muri Banque Populaire Du Rwanda Plc.\nAmashuri.\nHaguma afite impamyabumenyi ya siyanse mu by'imari yakuye muri kaminuza ya stirling-scotland, n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu micungire y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, icyemezo cy\u2019amafaranga ya Digital Money yavuye mu kigo cya Digital Frontiers Institute, ubu akaba ari mu rwego rwa nyuma rw\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abacungamari bemewe (ACCA) -UK)"}
{"id": "18186", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18186", "title": "Kivumbi King", "text": "KIVUMBI King ni umuhanzi w'umunyarwanda wavutse tariki 26 Ukuboza 1998 akaba ari umwe mu baraperi bagezweho mu Rwanda\nIbigwi bye mu muziki.\nKivumbi King ni umuhanzi w'umunyarwanda umenyerewe mu njyana ya Hip Hop y'u Rwanda, akaba ari n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo, byongeyeho kandi akaba ari n'umusizi ukora imivugo. Kivumbi King ni umushakashatsi utarabigize umwuga aho abikora agamije kugira amakuru ahagije ku muntu runaka bijyanye n'igihangano yakoze cyangwa yenda gukora. Aha twavuga nk'ubushakashatsi aheruka gukora kuri Richard Kandt ufatwa nk'uwahanze umujyi wa Kigali, yari amaze no gukoraho umuvugo yise \"More about Richard Kandt\" yakoranye na Kaya Free.Kivumbi King yitabiriye kandi igitaramo cyiswe \"Blankets&amp;Wine\" cyabereye muri Uganda mu mujyi wa Kampala kuwa 17 Ukuboza 2023, aho yahuriye n'umuhanzi w'icyamamare mu muziki wa Jamaica Garfied Spence wabaye ikirangirire ku izina rya Konshens.\nUyu muhanzi Kivumbi King kandi afite indirimbo zirimo \"Captain\" yakoranye na A Pass uri mu bahanzi bafite izina muri Uganda, \"Wine, Keza\" n'izindi nyinshi."}
{"id": "18187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18187", "title": "Kayitesi Dativa", "text": "Kayitesi Dativa ni umwe mu bagore bari muri Politiki bakiri bato, yabaye umuhuzabikorwa w'inama y'igihugu y'abagore mu ntara y' Uburengerazuba, ndetse abaye n'umukozi w'imari mu ishami rya IPRC Karongi. ubu akaba ari umuyobozi w'akarere ka Rutsiro yatowe ku italiki ya 7 ukuboza 2023. ubwo bamutoreraga rimwe na nyobozi nshya isimbura iyari yasheshwe izira kutuzuza inshingano.\nKayitesi Dativa niwe uyobora akarere ka Rutsiro nubwo nta gihe kinini aramara ariko avuga ko azagerageza kumva abaturajye ndetse no kugira ahantu ajyeza aka karere nubwo kabarirwa mu turere dukennye mu Rwanda,avuga ko yiteguye kuzana impinduka muri aka karere ka Rutsiro hamwe no gukorana neza Nabo bakorana mubuyobozi ndetse n'abaturage ayoboye muri Rusange."}
{"id": "18189", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18189", "title": "Uruhabuzo", "text": "Uruhabuzo ni kimwe mu bikoresho nikoreshwa\nmu kwahira ubwatsi bw'inka cyangwa se mu gukata amashara \nari ku nsina mugihe yabaye menshi"}
{"id": "18190", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18190", "title": "Inkangara", "text": "Inkangara.\ninkangara ni bimwe mu bikoresho by'ahambere\nna nubu bigikoreshwa mumuco nya Rwanda\nakaba bari bikikoresho biboshye mu migwegwe \nbikaba bikoreshwa mu guhunika imyaka ndetse \nno mu misango y'ubukwe by'ifashishwa cyane"}
{"id": "18191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18191", "title": "Dj Alisha", "text": "Dj Alishi ni umunyarwandakazi ukorera akazi ke mu gihugu cya Uganda, akaba ari umukobwa w'iyambazwa mu banyamuzika i kampala.DJ Alisha akaba acuranga mu tubyiniriro dutandukanye mu mugi wa Kampala, Haba radio cyangwa se televiziyo muri icyo gihugu. Dj Alisha akaba ari we watumye umugore uzwi w'umugande witwa Zari Hassan atandukana n'umugabo we Shakib Lutaaya. "}
{"id": "18192", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18192", "title": "Ilibagiza Immacul\u00e9e", "text": "Ilibagiza Immacul\u00e9e (wavutse 1972) ni umwanditsi w\u2019umunyarwandakazi akaba azi n'okuvugira muruhame. Igitabo cye cya mbere, cyitwa \"Ibumoso Kubwira: Kuvumbura Imana Hagati y\u2019itsembatsemba ry\u2019u Rwanda\", yacyanditse (2006), ni igitabo cyandika ku buzima bwe cyerekana uko yarokotse muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Yagaragaye kuri imwe muri gahunda za PBS ya Wayne Dyer, ndetse no ku ya 3 Ukuboza 2006, igice cy'iminota \"60\" (cyongeye gutambuka ku ya 1 Nyakanga 2007).\nIlibagiza Immacul\u00e9e asangira ubunararibonye bwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda muri 1994. Yarokotse iminsi 91 yihishe hamwe n'abandi bagore barindwi mu bwiherero buto, butarenza metero 3 kuri metero 4 (ubuso bwa metero kare 12). Ubwiherero bwari bwihishe mu cyumba inyuma y\u2019imyenda yo mu rugo rw\u2019umupasitori. Mu gihe cya jenoside, benshi mu muryango wa Ilibagiza (nyina, se, na barumuna be bombi Damascene na Vianney) birishwe n'abasirikare. Usibye we, abandi barokotse mu muryango we ni murumuna we Aimable, wigaga hanze y'igihugu muri Senegali kandi akaba atazi jenoside. Ilibagiza avuga uko ukwemera kwe gatolika kwamuyoboye mu mibabaro ye kandi asobanura imbabazi n'impuhwe yagiriye abicanyi bo mu muryango we.\nMuri 2006, inkuru ngufi imuvugaho, yitwa \"The Diary of Immacul\u00e9e\", yasohowe na kaminuza ya Academy Award yatowe hamwe na Peter LeDonne na Steve Kalafer. \nIlibagiza avuga ku isi yose kandi ni we wahawe igihembo cya Mahatma Gandhi muri 2007 n'Ubwiyunge n'amahoro. Mu mwaka wa 2012, ni we watanze disikuru yo ku ya 9 Kamena ya Robert E. na Bonnie Cone Hooper Ijambo rusange ry\u2019inama y\u2019intiti za gikirisitu muri kaminuza ya Lipscomb.\nMuri 2013, Ilibagiza yabaye umunyamerika ufite ubwenegihugu. Yize ibijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi n\u2019ubukanishi muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda kandi ahabwa impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro na kaminuza ya Notre Dame mu 2007 na kaminuza ya Mutagatifu Yohani mu 2008. "}
{"id": "18193", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18193", "title": "Mapendo Rose", "text": "Rose Mapendo (wavutse 1963) ni umuntu uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu. Yashinze Fondasiyo ye yise Rose Mapendo ifite intego yo guha ubushobozi abagore bo mu Rwanda, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo n'Uburundi kugira ngo bave hejuru y'ibibazo byabo maze bishyire hamwe kugira ngo amahoro mu karere kabo.\nUbuzima.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nRose Mapendo yavukiye i Mulenge, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC), muri 1963. Yakuriye mu muryango uciye bugufi, bakuriye mu idini rya gikristo. Akomoka mu bwoko bwa Banyamulenge. Yakuriye mu gushyingirwa no kubyara akurikije umuco w'umuryango we, Mapendo ntabwo yigeze ajya ku ishuri. Yashatse afite imyaka 16, nkuko bisanzwe mu bagore bo mu muryango wabo. Nyuma, muri 1994, yimukiye mu mujyi wa Mbuji-Mayi kugira ngo abana be bashobore kujya ku ishuri maze umugabo we atangira umwuga we wo kubaga. \nMuri Nyakanga 2000, Mapendo n'abana be bahawe impunzi maze bimukira muri Amerika. Muri kiriya gihe, Rose ntiyari azi niba Nangabire yarokotse. Nyuma yo gushakisha igihe kirekire, Rose yakiriye ijambo avuga ko ababyeyi be n\u2019umukobwa bari bazima. Muri 2007, Nangabire yabonye impunzi maze ahura n'umuryango we muri Amerika. Nubwo yari yarababajwe cyane, atandukanijwe n\u2019umuryango we, yatsinze ingorane zose zo kwimukira mu kindi gihugu, kwiga ururimi rushya, no kubona inzira binyuze muri gahunda y\u2019uburezi, ubu akaba ari umugore na nyina ufite imyaka 20 kandi akora nk'umurezi (yizeye kuzaba umuforomo).\nUbuzima bwite.\nMapendo kuri ubu aba i Phoenix, muri Arizona, kandi afite abana icumi. Biga mu mashuri makuru na kaminuza zaho, basengera mu rusengero rwaho kandi bakora mu bice bitandukanye mu rusengero. Impanga zavutse zikiri mu nkambi y'urupfu zarangije amashuri yisumbuye mu mpeshyi o muri 2017. Rose ubu ni nyirakuru w'abana batandatu.\nIbihembo.\n2007 - Igihembo cya Volvo 2008 - Intwari ya CNN 2009 - Uwatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye cyita ku buntu 2015 - Igihembo cya Muhammad Ali Ikiremwamuntu cyumwaka kubera uburinganire"}
{"id": "18194", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18194", "title": "Karadereye Mategeko Caritas", "text": "Karadereye Caritas Mategeko yari umunyapolitiki n'umurwanashyaka, wari wagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019ibibazo by\u2019Abagore, yabaye umwe mu bagore ba mbere bakoreye muri guverinoma igihe yagirwa Minisitiri w\u2019imibereho myiza muri 1982. Muri icyo gihe, yari visi-umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019abagore. Yagumye muri guverinoma kugeza mu 1987. Mu mwuga we, yamaze kandi igihe ahagarariye umuyobozi mukuru wa UNESCO. ; we, umunyeshuri, yari mu bishwe mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo muri 1972. Karadereye yanditse kandi ku ngingo y\u2019abagore n\u2019umuryango, asohora impapuro kuri iyo ngingo muri 1969. \nBigaragara ko yagumye kuba umwe mu bagize guverinoma kugeza nibura muri 1992; guhera muri 1997 yari umunyamuryango wa \"conseil des sage\" washinzwe gukora iperereza kuri jenoside yo muri 1994. "}
{"id": "18195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18195", "title": "Mutoni Angell", "text": "Mutoni Angell ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umuhanzi ufite ikizere uzobereye mu muziki mu ijyana ya Hip hop na RnB Kuva akiri muto cyane, ise umubyara yamwigishije umuziki, ariryo soko y'umuziki akora. Albumu yambere yasohoye kugeza ubu zirimo indirimbo nka Pandemic Pack na Imbuto, kandi yanagaragaye mu ndirimbo ya DJ Toxxyk yitwa Kurura, aho yatangaje ibintu bitangaje abinyujije ku murongo wa rap. Uyu muraperikazi kandi afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bw\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye mui kaminuza nkuru ya Cardiff Metropolitan University yo mu gihugu cyu Bwongereza."}
{"id": "18196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18196", "title": "Kagaju Rita Ange", "text": "Kagaju Rita Ange ni umunyarwandakazi w'avukiye i Kigali mu Rwanda, Ubu akaba aba muri America. ufite ijwi ryiza rikurura abaryumva mu kuririmba. Yavumbutse kandi akuza impano ye yo kuririmba kuva afite imyaka 12 gusa, yashyize ahagaragara amashusho y'indirimbo aririmba mugihe acuranga gitari, atangira gukora alubumu yise amusezeranya aza kuyishyira kuri ya IDA yiwe, ubu akaba yaratangiye kuririmba kuva muri Werurwe 2019. \nMu Rwanda.\nYatumiwe kuririmbira mu Rwanda, mu bitaramo bitandukaye nka Konnect Gala, ikurura abantu benshi mu Rwanda baza kumureba, Kagaju akunda ahanini akunda kuririmba indirimbo ze zigaragaza ibyiyumvo n'amarangamutima maze bigakurura umutima yabeshi. Muri 2020 yasohoye alubumu ya mbere yise Sweet Thunder ' ikubiyemo indirimbo nka 'Ibihe byiza,' Ok 'n'izindi ndirimbo nka' Jamaa \" Inshuti ',' Nta cyaha ', yari afite ubufatanye na Bumuntu Andy, Kevin Skaa na Kivumbi King."}
{"id": "18197", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18197", "title": "The Sisters", "text": "The Sisters yatangiye muri 2008, ubundi ni ihuriro rya baririmbyi bahimba,bakaririmba ndetse bagahimbaza indirimbo z'Imana, Aha harimo abagore bane, aribo abarimo Gahongayire Aline wari uvuye muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Uwitonze Clementine uzwi nka Tonzi wigaga muri APACE akaba yari umudivantisite w'umunsi wa karindwi na Kamanzi Gaby wasengeraga muri Zion Temple, aho aba bahanzi bose bishyize hamwe maze bakora itsinda bahuriyemo.\nMbere.\nUbu the Sisters batangiye ari abahanzi bagera kuri batanu ba bakobwa, dore uko bari abahanzi batanu ni ukuvuga harimo Queen, Tonzi, Phanny Wibabara, Gaby na Gahongayire. Bakoreraga imyitozo kuri Maison de Jeunes ku Kimisagara. Aho Igitaramo cyabo cyagenze neza ndetse kibahesha n\u2019akazi aho bahawe ubutumire bwo kuririmba mu iserukiramuco ryabereye kuri Sitade Amahoro."}
{"id": "18200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18200", "title": "Rutayisire Chantal", "text": "Chantal Ritayisire \"ni\" umunyarwandakazi utuye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, yavukiye mu Karere ka Gisagara mu Majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda. Akaba ari umubyeyi w'abana babiri.Akaba yaranditse igitabo yise A Smile After tears. Gikubiyemo amateka ye y'urugendo rw'I nzira y'umusaraba yanyuzemo muri Jenocide yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda. \nyavutse mu mwaka wa 1980 ukwezi kwa 9 tariki 14\nAmashuri yize.\nChantal yize amashuri abanza mu rwunge rw'amashuri Intwari riherereye i Nyamirambo.\nyiga segonderi kuri APACE kabusunzu na APADE Kicukiro. yarangije kaminuza kuri Kigali Independent University aho afite impamya bumenyi m'ububanyi mpuzamahanga. \nUmwuga akora.\nRutayisire Chantal ni umwanditsi w\u2019igitabo yise \u201d A Smile After Tears \u201c akaba ari umushoramari mu bijyanye no kugura no kugurisha cyangwa gukodesha amazu, akabifatanya n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibikorerwa mu Rwanda akabimurika ku isoko mpuzamahanga.\u201dAkariza collection\u201c\nshe is also the owner of a home remodeling and Interior decoration company,home improve "}
{"id": "18201", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18201", "title": "Nyirandabaruta Agnes", "text": "Nyirandabaruta Agnes ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umucamanza wu munyarwandakazi akaba na visi perezida w\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ubujurire mu Rwanda kuva muri 2020. \nUburezi n'umwuga.\nNyirandabaruta Agnes yabonye impamyabumenyi ya mbere muri kaminuza ya Lubumbashi, muri DR Congo muri 1996 n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu mategeko mpuzamahanga. Yize amategeko mu ishyirahamwe ry'abavoka rya Kigali ryarangiye kuva muri 1997 kugeza 2001. Yatangiye umwuga w'ubucamanza nk'umucamanza w'Urukiko Rukuru muri 2004 maze azamuka mu ntera aba umugenzuzi w'inkiko kandi akora kuri uyu mwanya imyaka umunani. yazamuwe mu Rukiko rw'Ikirenga mu Rwanda muri 2015 nk'ubutabera. Nyuma y\u2019ishyirwaho ry\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ubujurire mu Rwanda muri 2018, Nyirandabaruta n\u2019abandi bacamanza 12 bashyizwe mu rukiko. Muri 2020, yagizwe visi perezida w'urukiko rw'ubujurire. Yashimiwe ubwo yari umwe mu bacamanza bavuguruye inzego z\u2019ubutabera mu Rwanda kuva hagati ya 2003 na 2004. "}
{"id": "18202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18202", "title": "Mukamurera Clotilde", "text": "Mukamurera Clotilde ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umucamanza wumunyarwandakazi, aho usanzwe akora nka perezida w\u2019urukiko rukuru rw\u2019ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. Yashyizweho na perezida wa repubulika yu Rwanda Paul Kagame kandi yemejwe na Sena ku ya 28 Mata 2021, aho yasimbuye Kamere Emanuel. \nUburezi n'umwuga.\nMukamurera Clotilde afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu n'amategeko y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town, muri Afurika yepfo kandi yize ibijyanye n\u2019ubukemurampaka, amabanki, amasoko, ubukode n\u2019umutungo mu by\u2019ubwenge. Mukamurera yatangiye umwuga we w'ubucamanza nk'umucamanza mu rukiko rwisumbuye rwa Gisenyi muri 2000, nyuma agirwa visi perezida w'urukiko rwisumbuye rwa Rusizi. Yabaye umwe mu bagize Inama Nkuru y\u2019Ubucamanza mu Rwanda kuva mu 2008 kugeza 2015 ubwo yatorewe kuba umucamanza mu Rukiko rw\u2019Ubutabera rw\u2019isoko rusange ry\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019Amajyepfo (Comesa). Yabonye amajwi 13 kuri 15 yatanzwe mu matora. "}
{"id": "18203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18203", "title": "Nyirinkwaya Immacul\u00e9e", "text": "Immacul\u00e9e Nyirinkwaya (wavutse 1958) yari umucamanza wumunyarwanda kandi akaba umugore wa mbere warushyiwze ubutabera mu rukiko rw\u2019ikirenga mu Rwanda muri 1996. Yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa kaminuza nkuru ishinzwe imyitozo n\u2019iterambere (ILPD). \nUburezi n'umwuga.\nNyirinkwaya muri 1982, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko muri kaminuza ya Paris II-Assas n'indi mpamyabumenyi mu mategeko y'ubwishingizi. Yatangiye umwuga w'ubucamanza mu Bufaransa aho yakoranye n\u2019amasosiyete atandukanye arimo Ikigo cy\u2019indege cy\u2019Ubufaransa, Isosiyete y\u2019ubwishingizi y\u2019igihugu ya Zurich ndetse na SONARWA nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe imanza. Agarutse mu Rwanda, yagizwe mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019amategeko n\u2019iterambere (ILPD) nk'umuyobozi wungirije wa mbere. Yakoze kuri uwo mwanya kugeza muri 1996 igihe yagirwa ubutabera bw'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rw'u Rwanda. Niwe mugore wa mbere wicaye mu rukiko rw\u2019ikirenga rw\u2019u Rwanda utanga ubutabera ahakora imyaka 27 mbere yokujya mu kiruhuko cy\u2019izabukuru muri 2023. "}
{"id": "18204", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18204", "title": "Mugeni Anita", "text": "Mugeni Anita (wavutse 1970) ni umucamanza w\u2019umunyawandakazi akaba na perezida w\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ubutabera muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (EACJ) yari kandi perezida w\u2019agateganyo w\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abavoka mu Rwanda. \nIbyo yize.\nMugeni Anita afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse ya kaminuza yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda muri 1996 naho impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri FUSL-UC Louvain, mu Bubiligi muri 2005. Yatangiye umwuga mu by'amategeko mu 1998 nk'umuburanira mu by'amategeko nu bucuruzi. Ni umufatanyabikorwa kandi washinze urugaga rw'abavoka ba MRB. Yari umwe mu bagize akanama k\u2019umuryango w\u2019abanyamategeko b\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba, kandi yabaye komiseri wa komisiyo ishinzwe abakozi ba Leta na komite nyunguranabitekerezo ku rwego rwa politiki ya EAC. Yashyizwe mu ishami ry\u2019ubujurire mu rukiko rw\u2019ubutabera muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba mu 2021, agirwa perezida w\u2019urukiko muri Gicurasi 2023 asimbuye umucamanza ukomoka muri Tanzaniya, Sauda Mjasiri nyuma yokujya mukiruhuko cy\u2019izabukuru. "}
{"id": "18205", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18205", "title": "Kalihangabo Isabelle", "text": "Kalihangabo Isabelle (yavutse 1972) ni umunyamategeko w\u2019umunyarwanda akaba yarabaye n'umunyapolitiki wabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ibiro bishinzwe iperereza mu Rwanda (RIB) kuva mu 2018. \nUmwuga.\nKalihangabo ni yari umunyeshuri urangije amategeko muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Mwamikazi Mary y'i Londere. Hagati yo 2000 na 2004 yakoraga mu Rukiko rw'Ikirenga rw'u Rwanda mu ishami ry\u2019inkiko za Gacaca. Muri 2004 yagizwe umucamanza mu Rukiko Rukuru rw'u Rwanda, yahakoraga kugeza muri 2007. Mu 2007 yagizwe umufasha wungirije muri minisiteri y\u2019ubutabera ashinzwe serivisi z\u2019ubujyanama mu by'amategeko. Aza Kuzamurwa mu ntera muri Werurwe 2014 byatumye agirwa Umunyamabanga uhoraho akaba n'Umucamanza Mukuru muri Minisiteri y'Ubutabera Yagumye kuri urwo mwanya kugeza ku ya 9 Mata 2018, ubwo yagenwaga na Perezida wa repubulika nk'umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ibiro bishinzwe iperereza mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "18206", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18206", "title": "Nkubana Janet", "text": "Janet Nkubana ni umunyarwandakazi uboha ibiseke. Azwiho akazi ko guhuza imbaraga z\u2019abagore mu Rwanda mu gukora ibiseke bigurishwa muri Amerika.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nNkubana yakuriye mu nkambi y'impunzi muri Uganda kubera itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda. Yabanje guhura no kuboha uduseke mu nkambi y'impunzi, yitegereza nyina n'abandi bagore bakora ibiseke. Amaze gukura, Nkubana na mushiki we Joy Ndungutse bayoboye resitora mu murwa mukuru wa Uganda, Kampala. Nkubana yahise ayobora hoteri mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda, Kigali. Nkubana yari afite amateka mu buhanzi kandi yibuka kubona nyina n'abandi bagore bo mu gace atuyemo akiri muto. \nUmwuga.\nNkubana Janet ni we washinze isosiyete yitwa \" Gahaya Links \" hamwe na mushiki we Ndungutse Joy. Isosiyete yashinzwe mu 2003 kandi yashinzwe mu 2004. Bakoresheje abagore bari abapfakazi mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994. Yatangiye kugurisha ibyo biseke ku masoko ya fla maze atangira kubyohereza muri Uganda, Kenya, Tanzaniya, na Amerika. Gahaya Links yafatanije na EDImports gukora ibitebo kumasoko ya USA. Mu 2004 Gahaya Links yakoze ibitebo 12,000 kumasoko yo muri Amerika kandi igurishwa ryarenze 50.000 by'amadorale. Muri 2005 \" Gahaya Links \" yahujwe na Willa Shalit kugirango habe ubufatanye nububiko bwa Macy's. Kohereza ibicuruzwa bya mbere byagurishijwe mugihe kitarenze ukwezi mububiko bwa Macy. \nKugeza mu 2012, Nkubana yakoresheje abagore barenga 4000 bakora mu gukora ibiseke. Bamwe bita ibiseke byakozwe nisosiyete ya Nkubana 'ibitebo byamahoro' kubera ko abagore bakora ibiseke bakomoka mumiryango yarwanaga muri jenoside yo mu 1994. \nIbihembo n'icyubahiro.\nMuri 2008, Nkubana yasangiye igihembo cya Afurika cyo kuba yarafashije kugirango inzara ishire hamwena Faiza Jama Mohamed. Yaboye igihembo cya Afurika muri 2008. "}
{"id": "18207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18207", "title": "Keza Angelique", "text": "Keza Anglique ni umunyarwandandakazi w'avukiye mu burundi, akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mu bagore.Keza Angelique ubu akinira ikipe ya reyon sport y'abagore, uyu akaba yarakiniraga ikipe y'inyemera nyuma aza kuza muri reyon sport y'abagore, aho yatsinze ibitego bigera kuri 49."}
{"id": "18208", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18208", "title": "Kana Bennie Axella", "text": "Kana Bennie Axella ni umukobwa w'umunyarwanda, wavukiye iburundi akaba arinaho yiga amashuri y'ishumbuye ndetse na mashuri abanza akaza gukomeza ashuri makuru ya kaminuza mu Rwanda. Kana Bennie Axella yaje gukora mu ikipe ya rayon sport y'abagabo aho yari ashinze umutungo n'imari, kuri ubu Kana Bennie Axella ni umunyamaabanga wa ikipe ya rayon sport yabagore kuri yazamuka mu cyiciro cy'ambere cy'umupira w'abogore mu Rwanda muri 2023."}
{"id": "18209", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18209", "title": "Nibagwire Liberee", "text": "Ni umunyarwandakazi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda Amavubi.Akaba kandi akinira ikipe y'abagore y'umujyi wa kigali (AS Kigali)."}
{"id": "18210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18210", "title": "Benurugo Emmilienne", "text": "Benurugo Emmilienne ni umugore w'umunyrwandakazi, akaba ari umwe m'ubakozi bakuru b'uruganda rwa Skol rwenga ibinyobwa bisembuye n\u2019ibidasembuye, akabi numwe mu mashyiga ridashyigurwa mu baterankunga ba Tour du Rwanda mu gagare, aho bagenera iri rushanwa inkunga y\u2019Amafaranga arenga miliyoni 50. Benurugo Emilienne ni umwe mu bashinzwe gutegura ibikorwa muri Skol hirya nohino ku isi. "}
{"id": "18211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18211", "title": "Umuhoza Angelique", "text": "Umuhoza Angelique ni umugore akaba umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru mu bagore wavukiye mu karere ka bugesera. yegukanye igihembo cya shampiyona mu ikipe ya Rayon sports WFC y'abagore. Umuhoza Angelique amakipe yakiniye harimo Ikipe ya bagore ya Bugesera n'a rayon sport arimo ubu."}
{"id": "18212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18212", "title": "Uwimana Francine", "text": "Uwimana Francine ni umugore akaba umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru mu bagore wavukiye mu karere ka Gicumbi. yegukanye igihembo cya shampiyona mu ikipe ya Rayon sports WFC y'abagore mu mwaka w'ashampiyona 2023 kugeza 2024. Uwimana Francine amakipe yakiniye harimo Ikipe ya bagore ya Inyemera Wfc n'a rayon sport arimo ubu."}
{"id": "18213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18213", "title": "Muhazi WFC", "text": "Muhazi WFC (Muhazi Women Football Club) \u00a0yashinzwe \u00a0muri 2023, ikipe yashizwe kandi irebererwa na karere ka Muhazi, ni ikipe y\u2019umupira wa maguru wa babigize umwuga. Ni ikipe igaragaramo abagore n\u2019abakobwa mu gukina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu I tegurwa na FERWAFA, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019amahoro cy\u2019igihugu. Muhazi WFC yakinnye mu shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019akabiri mu Rwanda, irazamuka ubu ikaba iri mu cyiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona mu mupira w\u2019amaguru mu bari na bategarugori. iyi kipe ika izwiho umwihariko wo gutsinda wo gutsinda amakipe yo mukiciro cya mbere."}
{"id": "18214", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18214", "title": "Alice Muhoza Mutoni", "text": "Ni umunyarwandakazi\nAmashuri yize.\nAlice Muhoza Mutoni afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali, kuri ubu akaba akurikirana Master of Gender and Development Studies muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nAlice afite uburambe mu kurinda no kurengera abana. Afite kandi gusobanukirwa neza uburinganire n\u2019imibereho, kubona ubutabera, ubufasha mu by'amategeko, abagore, urubyiruko n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abana.\nUmwuga.\nAlice ni umuyobozi muri Kaminuza yigisha ibijyanye n'ubuzima mu Rwanda yitwa Global Health Equity University (UGHE). Mbere yo kwinjira muri UGHE, Madamu Alice Muhoza Mutoni yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe kurengera abana no kurinda umutekano mu gihugu muri World Vision International Rwanda.\nAlice yabaye umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n' ubutabera mu ishyirahamwe ry'urubyiruko riharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu n'iterambere (AJPRODHO-JIJUKIRWA)."}
{"id": "18215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18215", "title": "Uwera Lea", "text": "Uwera Lea ni umugore akaba ari umunyarwandakazi uzobereye mu gukina imikono igiye itandukanye harimo imikini y'amaboko. Uwera Lea yakiniye ikipe ya APR VFC mu marushanwa agiye atandukanye. Uwera Lea yakinnye shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya volleyball I tegurwa FRVB, Ishyirahamwe rya Volleyball mu Rwanda, ndetse nibindi bikombe bitandukanye harimo igikombe cy'amahoro, igikombe cya gaciro, n' igikombe gitegurwa na RRA, Rwanda Revenue Authority. Uwera Lea yitabiriye amarushanwa agiye tandukanye ku rwego rwa afurika nki rushanwa ry'imikino ya shampion league mu mukino wa volleyball y'abagore. "}
