{"id": "18270", "revid": "15499", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18270", "title": "Umutoniwase Nadia", "text": "Umutoniwase Nadia ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi akaba azwi cyane muri filime aho akina ari Muganga muri filime yitwa Umuturanyi.\nUbuzima bw'Ubwana n'Amashuri:.\nUmutoniwase Nadia yavutse ku itariki ya 1 Mutarama 2001, akaba ari umwe mu bakobwa b'ibyamamarekazi mu Rwanda, yamenyekanye cyane mu bijyanye no gukina filime. Yize amashuri abanza muri Ecole Primaire St. Famile kuva mu mwaka wa 2008 kugeza 2013. Nyuma yaje gukomereza amashuri yisumbuye muri Nyamyumba Secondary School kuva mu mwaka wa 2014 kugeza 2016. Yasoje icyiciro cya kabiri cy'amashuri yisumbuye (Advanced Level) mu mwaka wa 2019, aho yize Software Development muri Ecole Secondaire St. Joseph le Travailleur. Mu mwaka wa 2025 akaba yarabashije kubona certificate ya ALX muri program ya Virtual Assistant.\nUmwuga:.\nGukina Filime:\nUmutoniwase Nadia ni umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime bakunzwe cyane mu Rwanda, akaba yamenyekanye cyane kubera uruhare rwe mu nkuru zitandukanye. Yakinnye muri filime zitandukanye nka:\nUretse gukina filime, Nadia yagiye agaragara muri zimwe mu ndirimbo z'abahanzi bakomeye mu Rwanda nka:\nIbihembo:.\nMu mwaka wa 2026, Nadia yegukanye ibihembo bibiri aribyo \"BEST STAR ACTRESS OF THE YEAR IN TV SERIES\" muri Shinning star Africa Awards, ndetse na BEST FEMALE BRAND INFLUENCER CONTENT CREATOR OF THE YEAR 2026 muri Africa content creator awards.\nMuri 2025 Umutoniwase Nadia yegukanye igihembo cya \"Best Breakout actress of the Year 2025\" muri MVAA awards.\nMu mwaka wa 2021 Umutoniwase Nadia yitabiriye irushanwa rya Miss Global Beauty Rwanda, aho yabashije kwegukana ikamba rya Miss Popularity.\nImibereho:.\nUmutoniwase Nadia ni ingaragu, uretse gukina filime akaba akunze kugaragara mu bikorwa bitandukanye byo kwamamaza ndetse no gutegura ibirori.\nInama.\nUmutoniwase Nadia kandi aherutse gucyebura abantu abasaba kutaba ntibindeba kubikorwa byo ku ibuka genocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994."}
{"id": "18272", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18272", "title": "Indatwa Hampshire CC", "text": "Indatwa Hampshire CC (Cricket club) ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaboko ikaba iri muri Shampiyona ya cricket mu Rwanda mu Icyiciro cya mbere mu Bagore. Ikipe ya Indatwa Hampshire CC ya bagore ikaba yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere mu mupira w\u2019a cricket w\u2019abagore mu Rwanda. \nAho Ibarizwa.\nIndatwa Hampshire CC ni ikipe ibarizwa mu karere ka Gasabo mu murenge wa Ndera i ndera yashizwe mu mwaka 2016. Indatwa Hampshire CC yagiye itwara ibikombe bitandukanye, ndetse nabakinnyi yabo bahabwa kugeza kurwngo mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "18273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18273", "title": "Charity Cricket Club", "text": "Charity Cricket Club ni ikipe ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere muri cricket mu rwanda, ikaba ari ikipe ikinamo abagore n'abakobwa gusa. Charity Cricket Club yashinzwe muri 2014. Club Cricket Charity ni ikipe yabatarabigize umwuga bitwa Amateur Cricket, ifite abaterankunga baturuka mu Bwongereza ndetse no ku isi yose."}
{"id": "18274", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18274", "title": "Queens of Victory Cricket Club", "text": "Queens of Victory Cricket Club ni ikipe ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere muri cricket mu rwanda, ikaba ari ikipe ikinamo abagore n'abakobwa gusa. Queens of Victory Cricket Club ni ikipe yatwaye ibikombe bitandukanye, niyo yatwaye ikigombe cya champiyona yi cyiciro cya kabili mu bagore muri cricket mu Rwanda.\nIntangiriro.\nQueens of Victory Cricket Club (VCC) yashinzwe mu ntangiriro za 2006 nitsinda ryabakunzi bu mukino wa cricket bari bayizi bayikunda."}
