{"id": "18281", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18281", "title": "Keza Nadia", "text": "Keza Nadia, ni umuyobozi wa Rwanda tours and travel Association. Isosiyete, International Travel Agency (ITA) u Rwanda, iyobowe na BCD, isosiyete ikora ingendo ku isi, yafunguwe mu 1995, ariko, Keza yatangiye kuba umuyobozi mu 2005, icyemezo avuga ko yishimiye. Yasangiye nabagore uyumunsi Sharon Kantengwa uburambe bwe hamwe ningendo zigenda zihinduka kwisi yose. \nAmateka.\nKeza yize bio-chimie muri kaminuza ya Montreal, yari itandukanye rwose, nuko ngarutse mu 2004, natangiye gukora nka bio-chemiste muri laboratoire no gukomeza ubucuruzi bwumuryango. Nibyiza bio-chimie yampumuye amaso, nize gukora cyane kandi nubwo atari murwego rumwe, nuburyo bumwe bwo gukora bushobora gukoreshwa mubice bitandukanye."}
{"id": "18282", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18282", "title": "Keza Anna", "text": "Keza Anna ni Ushinzwe Guhuza Ubuyobozi mu Kigega cya Rwanda Green Fund. \nAmateka.\nAnna mbere yo gushyirwaho, yakoranye na Pay Way Uganda nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe kugurisha no kwamamaza mu karere k'iburengerazuba, yanabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe gukurikirana no gusuzuma mu Rwanda Ex-barwanyi ndetse n'abandi bafite ubumuga.\nAmashuri.\nAnna afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse yikiciro cyambere cya kaminuza(Bachelor's degree) mu bushakashatsi bw\u2019iterambere yakuye muri kaminuza ya gikirisitu ya Mukono muri Uganda."}
{"id": "18283", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18283", "title": "Keza Tracy", "text": "Keza Tracy n'umuhanzi w'umunyarwandakazi ukora muri videwo no gufotora. Binyuze mu mirimo ye, yiyemeje gucukumbura imyumvire iranga, umuco, no kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nAmakuru.\nTracy yizeye gukoresha inkuru kugirango yandike inkuru zitera abantu guhuza ubumwe, inyamaswa nisi. Mu 2022, ishyaka rye ryo kubungabunga inyanja n\u2019inyanja ryamuteye gukurikirana kwibiza mu mazi kugira ngo yongere inkuru z\u2019amazi muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Noneho PADI Yemerewe Gutabara, Tracy yizeye gucukumbura ibitangaza byisi yisi.\nTracy numunyamerika wo kubungabunga amajwi ya Media Media Lab Mugenzi (2021), Mugenzi wa Jackson Wild Summit (2022), Mugenzi wa NEWF, hamwe numutabazi wa PADI wemewe. Kwinjiza amasomo yubumenyi mubidukikije kuva muri Trinite College hamwe nishyaka ryinkuru zishingiye kubantu, umurimo wa Tracy wibanze kubibazo byiki gihe mukubungabunga, ikirere, ubuvuzi nuburezi."}
{"id": "18284", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18284", "title": "Kayibanda Alice", "text": "Kayibanda Alice n'umunyarwandakazi w'umufotozi ukomoka muri Kigali \nAmateka.\nKayibanda akora ku mishinga itandukanye mu Rwanda ndetse no mu mahanga, hamwe n'abakiriya kuva ku miryango itegamiye kuri Leta kugeza ku miryango ya Leta ndetse n'abashoramari bato n'abantu ku giti cyabo."}
{"id": "18285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18285", "title": "Ineza Umuhoza Grace", "text": "Ineza Umuhoza Grace, (wavutse 1996) ni impirimbanyi y'ibidukikije, n' ikirere, akomoka i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Green Protector, umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019urubyiruko akaba n\u2019umufasha w\u2019ubushakashatsi mu mushinga wa CCLAD. Yatsindiye igihembo cya mu 2023.\nAmashuri.\nGrace afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor's Degree in Water &amp; Environmental Engineering yabonye 2018 muri kaminuza yu Rwanda. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yize dipolomasi y\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye gishinzwe amahugurwa n\u2019ubushakashatsi () n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ubucuruzi hamwe n\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019umugore nyafurika w\u2019ubucuruzi."}
{"id": "18286", "revid": "12433", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18286", "title": "Glucose", "text": "Glucose, cyangwa umutobe, nisoko nyamukuru yingufu muri anabolism. Iraboneka hamwe no gusya isukari na karubone-hydrata mugihe cya glycolysis. Iyi molekile ni monosaccharide ikenewe muburyo bukomeye bwo guhinduranya ibintu mubinyabuzima byabantu ninyamaswa.\nAkamaro ka glucose kubantu\nGlucose nisoko nyamukuru yingufu zingenzi kubuzima bwabantu. Mu binyabuzima bikora, selile metabolize glucose ivuye mubiryo byingufu. Muri iki gikorwa, hashyizweho molekile yingufu yitwa ATP. ATP ni isoko yingufu zingirakamaro mumikorere isanzwe yimitsi, ubwonko nizindi ngingo. Byongeye kandi, glucose itanga ububiko bwingufu nigikorwa cyingirabuzimafatizo zitukura binyuze mumisemburo igenga imikorere yubwonko hamwe nisukari yamaraso. Inkomoko nimwe muri molekile zifite akamaro mubuzima kandi zingirakamaro kubuzima bwabantu.\nAgaciro gasanzwe ka glucose mumaraso yabantu kari hagati ya 70 na 100 mg / dL.[1]\nUrwego rwa glucose rugomba gupimwa mugitondo mugihe rufunguye. Abantu barengeje imyaka 40 basabwa kwipimisha glucose buri myaka 3.\nInkunga ya glucose.\nInkunga ya glucose, nuburyo butandukanye nuburyo butandukanye bwo kongera ibiryo bya glucose cyangwa gufata isukari mu maraso. Inzira zimwe zisanzwe zirimo ibi bikurikira (ugomba guhora uganira kubufasha bwa glucose na muganga wawe):"}
{"id": "18293", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18293", "title": "Umutozo", "text": "Umutozo ni kimwe mugikoresho cyifashishwaga mu gukubita amata yabaga agiye kunyobwa cyangwa gucundwa bashaka kuyabuganiza musabo bitewe nuko umutozo ukoreshwa mugukubita amata yavuze yabaye ikivuguto. Umutozo ni agati gato kabazwaga mugiti bita umutozo cyara cibwaga kigashyirwa ahantu kikuma nyuma kikabazwa neza bakagisiga ugatora(ukamenyera) hanyuma ugakoreshwa ukubita(uvuruga)amata (Kuvuruga).\nNi kimwe mu bikoresho bya kera byifashishwaga mu ngo z'Abanyarwanda. Umutozo ni igikoresho cy'ingenzi cyagaragazaga uburyo amata yabungabungwaga mu muco Nyarwanda. "}
{"id": "18294", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18294", "title": "Magdalene Odundo", "text": "Dame Magdalene Anyango Namakhiya Odundo DBE (wavutse 1950) ni umubumbyi wa studio ukomoka muri Kenya, ubu uba i Farnham, muri Surrey. Ibikorwa bye biri mu byegeranyo by\u2019ingoro ndangamurage zizwi zirimo Ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Chicago, Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Abongereza, Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Ubuhanzi ya Metropolitan, n\u2019Ingoro y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubuhanzi nyafurika. \nYabaye umuyobozi wa kaminuza ishinzwe ubuhanzi bwo guhanga kuva 2018. \nUbuzima bwambere n' Amashuri.\nMagdalene Odundo yavukiye i Nairobi muri Kenya, kandi yize amashuri abanza mu Buhinde no muri Kenya. Yize muri Kabete National Polytechnic muri Kenya yiga ibijyanye n\u2019ubugeni n\u2019ubucuruzi nyuma aza kwimukira mu Bwongereza mu 1971 kugira ngo akurikire umuhamagaro yahisemo mu bugeni bw' ibishushanyo mbonera. Amaze guhugura i Farnham, muri Surrey, yarangije impamyabumenyi ye mu buhanzi bwa fondasiyo n\u2019ubushushanyo mu ishuri ry\u2019ubukorikori rya Cambridge, aho yatangiye kwimenyereza umwuga w\u2019ububumbyi. \nNyuma yigihe gito mubwongereza yavumbuye ububumbyi, maze mu 1974\u201375 asura Nijeriya, asura ikigo cyigisha ububumbyi i Abuja, na Kenya yiga tekiniki gakondo zo kubaka hakoreshejwe intoki. Yagiye kandi i San Ildefonso Pueblo, muri New Mexico, kugira ngo yitegereze uko hajyaho amato yatwitse umukara. Mu 1976, Odundo yabonye impamyabumenyi ya BA yakuye muri West Surrey College of Art &amp;amp; Design (ubu ni kaminuza ishinzwe ubuhanzi). Nyuma yaje kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Royal College of Art i Londres. Yigishije mu Ishuri Rikuru rya Commonwealth i Londres kuva 1976 kugeza 1979 no muri Royal College of Art i Londres kuva 1979 kugeza 1982, mbere yo gusubira kwigisha muri Surrey Institute of Art &amp;amp; Design (ubu ni kaminuza y\u2019ubuhanzi bwo guhanga) mu 1997, aba umwarimu w'ububumbyi mu 2001. Muri Werurwe 2016, yatangajwe ku mugaragaro nka Porofeseri Emerita wa kaminuza ishinzwe ubuhanzi bwo guhanga, hamwe n\u2019ibirori byo kwizihiza byabereye mu kigo cya Farnham bitewe n\u2019akazi ke gakomeye mu kirahure, \"Inzibacyuho II\". Yibera kandi akora muri Surrey.\nUbukorikori buzwi cyane bwa Odundo bwubatswe n'intoki, hakoreshejwe tekinike yo kwizinga. Igice cyose kirashya, kigatwikirwa nigifuniko kinyerera, hanyuma kikongera gutwikwa. Ibi bice bishyirwa mukumba kabyongerera ogisijeni, bigahinduka umutuku-orange. Bishyirwamo bwa kabiri, bikajya mukumba gakennye ogisijeni, bigatuma iryo bumba gihinduka umukara; ibi bizwi nko kugabanya-kurasa. Akoresha ubwoko bumwe bwa tekinike yakoreshejwe n'Abagereki n'Abaroma ba kera kandi akunda gukura ibitekerezo bishya mu bihugu nk'Ubushinwa na Mexico. Ubuhanga bwe bwo gushushanya buracyagumana na we kuko akenshi ashushanya ko ashishikajwe nimiterere karemano ndetse nigishushanyo mbonera kugirango bimufashe mu kubumba kwe. Ibyinshi mu bikoresho Odundo akora biributsa imiterere yumuntu, akenshi bikurikiza umurongo wumugongo, igifu, cyangwa umusatsi. Byongeye kandi, imiterere yo kwerekana imiyoboro y'ibibumbano bye igereranya umubiri wumugore; kimwe mu bice bye bizwi cyane ni icyombo cy'umukara na ocher gifite umusingi uhetamye kandi ijosi rirerire risa n'imiterere y'umugore utwite. Ibikorwa bye ubu biri mubice byegeranijwe bihoraho byingoro ndangamurage zigera kuri 50 harimo:\nMu 2006, ibikorwa bye byerekanwe mu imurikagurisha ryiswe \"Resonance and Inspiration\" mu nzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Samuel P. Harn ya kaminuza ya Floride. Iyi yari imurikagurisha rye rya mbere muri Amerika kuva mu 1997 ndetse anagaragara bwa mbere muri Floride. Iri murika kandi riba, bwari ubwambere ibishushanyo bye byerekanwe ku bikoresho bye. Uburyo bwe bwo gushushanya bwigana imiterere n'imikorere y'ibikoresho bye, bikora nk'incamake y'uburyo Odundo abona imirimo ye y'ibice bitatu mubice bibiri.\nMuri 2019 habaye imurikagurisha rikomeye ryibanze ku itsinda ry\u2019ibikorwa bye birenga 50, hamwe n\u2019ibindi bihangano Odundo yabonaga bifitanye isano cyangwa bigira ingaruka ku mirimo ye; imurikagurisha ryiswe 'The Journey of Things (Urugendo rw'ibintu)'. Igitaramo cyerekanwe ahantu habiri: Hepworth Wakefield, i West Yorkshire hanyuma ikigo cya Sainsbury gishinzwe ubuhanzi bugaragara, i Angliya y'Uburasirazuba. \nKumenyekana n'Ibyubahiro.\nOdundo yahawe igihembo cya Afurika cyo Kumenyekanisha Ubuhanzi n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Detroit mu 2008, n\u2019igihembo cy\u2019umurage nyafurika cyagezweho mu buhanzi mu mwaka wa 2012, hamwe na dogitora z\u2019icyubahiro zaturutse muri kaminuza ya Florida (2014) na kaminuza y\u2019ubuhanzi London (2016). Yagizwe Umuyobozi ushinzwe Iteka ry\u2019Ingoma y\u2019Ubwongereza (OBE) kubera serivisi z\u2019ubuhanzi mu cyubahiro cy\u2019amavuko ya 2008 na Dame Commander of the Order of the Empire Empire (DBE) mu cyubahiro cy\u2019umwaka mushya wa 2020 kubera serivisi z\u2019ubuhanzi n'iyiga ry'ubuhanzi. \nOdundo yamenyekanye nk'umukinnyi ukomeye mu bubumbyi bwa none, bituma izina rye rigira uruhare runini mu buhanzi bwa Afurika muri Amerika mu myaka ya za 90. Nkuko byagaragajwe na Augustus Casely-Hayford, \"\" Yifashishije ikintu runaka cyubwenge nubunararibonye bwa Leach, cyangwa umurongo watijwe kuva kera cyane muburayi, kugirango ashyireho uburyo bwo kureba amashusho ku isi yose, yigihe gito;, nyamara icyarimwe gishaje, umunyafurika nyamara ushikamye muburayi... \" \nMuri 2017 hatangajwe ko Odundo azatangira imirimo ya Chancellor wa kaminuza ishinzwe ubuhanzi bwo guhanga guhera muri Kamena 2018. \nOdundo, mu 2008 yagizwe Umuyobozi ushinzwe Iteka ry\u2019Ingoma y\u2019Ubwongereza (OBE) kugira ngo akorere Ubuhanzi, yagizwe Dame (DBE) mu cyubahiro cy\u2019umwaka mushya wa Umwamikazi 2020. Mu 2022 ni umuhanzi uzwi cyane ku isi akaba na Chancellor wa kaminuza yubuhanzi bwo guhanga. Mu mwaka wa 2008 yahawe igihembo cy\u2019ubuhanzi nyafurika n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Detroit naho muri 2012 igihembo cy\u2019imyaka 40 y\u2019umurage nyafurika. Muri 2019 yahawe igihembo cya \"Lifetime Achievement Award\" mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ubukorikori maze mu 2020 agirwa DBE ku rutonde rw\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019umwamikazi w\u2019umwaka mushya wa Serivisi ishinzwe uburezi n\u2019ubuhanzi. Mu 2022 yahawe impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro na kaminuza ya Anglia Ruskin."}
{"id": "18295", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18295", "title": "Mo Abbaro", "text": "Mo Abbaro (17 Ukwakira 1933 - 12 Werurwe 2016), [1 uzwi kandi nka Mo Abdalla cyangwa Mohammed Ahmed Abdalla Abbaro, yari umuhanzi ubumba wo muri Sudani warutuye i London wasobanuwe na Oliver Bloom nk \"umwe mu ba bumbyi beza ku isi\".\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nMohammed Ahmed Abdalla Abbaro yavukiye Abu Jibayha, muri Sudani. Yarangije mu buhanzi n\u2019ubukorikori yakuye mu kigo cya tekiniki cya Khartoum mu 1958, umwaka wakurikiyeho atsindira buruse i Londres yiga ububumbyi mu ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ubukorikori n'ubuhanzi. Yize impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye no kubumba mu Ishuri Rikuru rya Staffordshire College of Ceramics, nyuma yaho afata igihe cyo kwihugura mu gusesengura imiti y\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019ubutaka mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019abakozi bo mu majyaruguru y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ry'ubu bumbyi. Yasubiye muri Sudani kwigisha ubukorikori imyaka runaka, ariko ahitamo gusubira mu Bwongereza mu 1966 kugira ngo akomeze umwuga we mu Bwongereza. \nYigishije ububumbyi mu kigo cy\u2019ubukorikori cya Camden mu myaka irenga makumyabiri, kandi agira amamurikagurisha menshi i Londres - harimo no muri Centre ya Barbican, Gallery ya Whitechapel (mu gice cya Afurika '95), Mall Galleries, na Ikigo ndangamuco cya Iraki - n'ahandi mu Bwongereza, ndetse no muri Amerika na Suwede. Studio ye n\u2019icyumba cye cyo kwerekana byari mu Muhanda wa King Henry, hafi y\u2019umusozi wa Primrose. \nYaje gukunda kwandika mubuzima bwanyuma, asohora ibitabo byubuhanga bw'ububumbyi, nka Modern Ceramics (Ububumbyi \"bwa Kijyambere) - Ku mikoranire yimiterere nubuso\" (2000), ndetse no mumateka yumuryango we, harimo \"The History of the Abbaros of Sudan since the 15th Century (Amateka ya Abbaros ya Sudani. kuva mu kinyejana cya 15)\" (1997). \nUbukorikori bwe buri mu byegeranyo by\u2019ingoro ndangamurage y\u2019Ubwongereza ya Londres, Institut du Monde Arabe i Paris, n\u2019inzu ndangamurage ya Smithsonian, Washington. Ibikorwa bye byerekanwe mu imurikagurisha rya 2017 rya Frederique Cifuentes\": Kuba havutse ubudahangarwa\" muri P21 Gallery, London. \nUmuryango.\nYashakanye na Rose (wavutse yitwa Glennie), kuva mu 1964, umukobwa w'uwahimbye Elisabeth Lutyens akaba n'umwuzukuru wa Sir Edwin Lutyens. \nAbbaro yapfuye afite imyaka 80 i Londres ku ya 12 Werurwe 2016, apfa afite umugore, n'umuhungu wabo n'abakobwa babiri. "}
{"id": "18296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18296", "title": "1da Banton", "text": "Godson Ominibie Epelle (wavutse 27 Kamena 1994), uzwi ku izina ry'umwuga nka 1da Banton, ni umuririmbyi wo muri Nigeriya, umwanditsi w'indirimbo ndetse nutunganya amajwi. Yamenyekanye cyane mu ndirimbo ye \" No Wahala \", yagiye hanze bwa mbere mu 2021, yongera gusohora mu 2022 nk'iyasubiwemo irimo Kizz Daniel na Tiwa Savage.\nAMATEKA YA 1da Banton.\n1da Banton yavukiye kandi akurira i Port Harcourt, muri Leta ya Rivers muri Nijeriya, afite impamyabumenyi mu bijyanye n'ubwubatsi mbere yo gufata icyemezo cyo kureka ishuri rye agakurikira umwuga w'ubuhanzi. Yimukiye i Lagos mu 2014 nyuma yo gusinyana amasezerano na Squareball Entertainment hamwe na Adasa Cooke.\nMbere yo gushyira ahagaragara indirimbo ye ya mbere mu 2015, 1da Banton yavuze ko yaririmbaga mu bitaramo ndetse akanahimba umuziki nka producer nyuma yuko nyina apfuye mu 2008, bikamuvana mu mupira w'amaguru bikamwerekeza mu muziki. \nMuri Nyakanga 2018,yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere yagutse (EP) yise \"The Banton EP\". Imwe mu ndirimbo z'iyo alubumu, \"Way Up\", yakoreshejwe nk'indirimbo yibanze mu gice cya gatatu cya Big Brother Naija. Yamenyekanye ku isi yose nyuma yo gusohora \" No Wahala \", imwe mu ndirimbo ziri kuri alubumu ye \"Original Vibe Machine\", yasohotse mu 2021. Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Leta Zunze ubumwe za Amerika, Antony Blinken yashyize iyi ndirimbo ku rutonde rw'indirimbo za Spotify yakunzwe cyane n'abatari bacye muri 2021. \nMuri 2022, 1da Banton yasohoye remix ya \"No Wahala\" yagaragayemo Kizz Daniel na Tiwa Savage. Yakoranye kandi n'umuririmbyi wo muri Jamayike Kranium, umucuranzi wa Dancehall wo muri Gana Stonebwoy, n'abahanzi bo muri Nijeriya Zlatan, Seyi Shay na Blaqbonez. \nMu 2023, \"No Wahala\" yagaragaye mugice cya gatatu cyurukurikirane rw'amakinamico yo muri Amerika \"Ted Lasso\". \nKu ya 10 Mata 2023, \"No Wahala\" yumviswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 100 kuri Spotify, bituma iba imwe mu ndirimbo za Afrobeat zikunzwe cyane kuri urwo rubuga. \nURUTONDE RW'INDIRIMBO ZA 1da Banton.\nAlubum za studio\nImikino yagutse\nIndirimbo yasohoye wenyine\nNkumuhanzi ugaragara mu zindi ndirimbo\nIbikorwa bye byatoranijwe.\n\"Barrawo\" ya Ajebo hustler \n\"Barrawo\" (remix) ya Ajebo hustler irimo Davido "}
{"id": "18297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18297", "title": "Izina Igbo", "text": "Amazina ya Igbo yubatswe gakondo n'amateka. Muri aya masezerano nta mazina yumuryango, ahubwo umuntu azwi binyuze kubisekuru by'abagabo.\nMubihe byashize, aba Igbo - abagabo n'abagore - bitirirwaga iminsi ine yisoko (eke, orie, afor, na nkwo) muri Igboland. Ingero: Mgb\u1ecdaf\u1ecd, Mgborie, Nwanyinkw\u1ecd, Mgbeeke, Nkw\u1ecdja, na Ugweke ku bagore, mu gihe abagabo bitwaga Okonkw\u1ecd, Okorie, Okoeke, Okoaf\u1ecd, Okoroaf\u1ecd. \nKwita izina.\nMu masezerano yo kwita izina rya Igbo, umwana ahabwa izina akivuka rivuga ibyabaye bijyanye no kuvuka, umukurambere wapfuye, cyangwa igihe na / cyangwa aho yavukiye. Iri niryo zina bazamenyekanaho cyane. Kugirango habemo itandukaniro hagati y'umuntu n'undi mu gisekuru kimwe bafite izina rimwe, umuntu yatangaga izina rya mbere rya se. Abanyaburengerazuba ba mbere bavugana na aba nya Igbo bakunze kwitiranya iri zina nk'izina ry'umuryango, ariko, aho bitandukaniye naryo n'uko ryo ryo ridahererekanwa nk'izina rya kabiri kubisekuruza bikurikiraho.\nIyi sisiteme yo kwita izina yaragutse igera no mu bashakanye. Aho bitandukanye no mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe by\u2019iburengerazuba, umugore ntabwo buri gihe ahindura izina. Mugihe abikoze, byaba izina ryumugabo we.\nMurugero ruvuzwe haruguru, ababyara, \"Onodugo\" na \"Nkechi\", bashobora gutandukanywa nabandi mubisekuru byabo nizina rya se. Urugero, \"Onodugo\" na \"Nkechi\" bafite ba se bafite amazina yambere \"Okonkwo\" na \"Agu\" nk'uko urutonde ruri. Nibo se na nyina wumukobwa numuhungu, bombi bubatse. Umuhungu n'umukobwa buri wese yabyaye umwana. Uwa mbere wari ufite umwana yita umwana wabo Ezenwa. Umuvandimwe ukurikiraho kubyara yahaga umwana wabo irindi zina ritandukanye, kubera ko binyuranyije n'muco kwita umwana izina ry'umunyamuryango uriho, cyane cyane umwe mubisekuruza bimwe cyangwa byabanjirije. Ezenwa na mubyara we buri wese yabona izina rya se ryambere rikababera iryanyuma. Nyuma yo gushyingirwa, Nkechi, Adanna na Oluchi bazwi ku izina rya ba se cyangwa abagabo babo.\nMu ntangiriro no hagati mu kinyejana cya 20, nyuma yo gukwirakwiza Ubukristo ubu buryo bwendaga gukurwaho burundu kugira ngo izina rya sekuru (ari naryo zina rya se \"rya nyuma\") ribe ariryo zina. Mubihe byinshi, izina ry'icyongereza cyangwa izina rya se rihinduka izina rya kabiri ry'umwana."}
{"id": "18298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18298", "title": "Ikintu cyo Kubaho (Album ya Phyno)", "text": "Something to live for ni alubumu ya kane ya studio yumuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya Phyno. Yasohotse ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 2021. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nIyi alubumu y'indirimbo 16 imara iminota mirongo itanu n'itanu, kandi igaragaramo Flavour, Cavemen, Olamide, D Smoke, Peruzzi, Jay Teazer, J Dess, Bee Pee, Pappy Kojo na Anjulite. Ubusesenguzi bw'amajwi bwakozwe na Chillz, Rexxie, Masterkraft, Ransombeatz, Blaq Jerzee, TYMG, Eli, Runcheck, Marvie, Soularge na Flengy. Swaps, STG, MixMonster, Exraordinaire na Jaysynths bakoze ibyerekeranye kuvanga amajwi no gukora kuburyo bifite injyana. \nIndirimbo yasohoye wenyine.\nKu ya 9 Nyakanga 2021, Phyno yasohoye \"Bia\" hamwe na videwo yayo nk'imwe kuri alubumu. \nMotolani Alake wo muri \"Pulse Nijeriya\" yavuze ko iyi alubumu ari nk'imyitozo ya Phyno mu ngingo zikuze zijyanye no gushimira, urugendo rwe, urukundo, ibihombo, ubwirasi n'ibindi. Twabonye kandi ko alubumu ari ndende cyane kubera ifite indirmbo 16 n'iminota 55, kandi ko \"Paracetamol\", \"Love Me Right\" na \"Bia\" bitari bikenewe. Album byarangiye ihawe amanota ya 6.1/10. \nJoy Dennis wo muri \"Naijaloaded\" yayihayeamanota 7/10, yongeraho ko iyi alubumu ari ikintu muzika yari yarabuze kandi ko ari nko \"Guhumeka umwuka mwiza\". "}
