{"id": "18309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18309", "title": "RUGAJU LEAGAN", "text": "ubusanzwe Rugaju afite umuyoboro atagiraho amakuru,cyane ko asanzwe ari mubanyamakuru bakunzwe nabenshi murwanda ubwo yariyatumiye mugenzi we,biganiro mucyo antha ukorera RadioTV10,yatunguwe noguhabwa igifurumba cyamafaranga ubwo bari mu kiganiro kuri youTube ya Rugaju biganiro uretse kwegukana igikombe mwirushanwa ryagaciro pre-season Tournament,yahayeRugaju amafaranga arimo inoti zibihumbi 5frwnyinshi,murwego rwokushyigikira mu mushinga mushya yatangije mukumushyigikira,Antha yahise akora mumufuka wi pantaro akuramo amafaranga ibihumbi 50frw bihereza Reagan akimara kuyamuha,biganiroyagize ati\"niyompamvu ngushimira rwose nkumuvandimwe tuva inda imwe.akaba akorera mu rwanda ndetse kurubu akaba ari umunyamakuru ukorera ikigo kitangazamakuru murwanda aricyo RBA,akaba ari umusesenguzi wamakuru yimikino \nUyu ni umwe mu banyamakuru b\u2019abahanga u Rwanda rufite by\u2019umwihariko mu gusesengura umupira w\u2019amaguru, gusa iyo bigeze kuri rutahizamu Cristiano Ronaldo arafana agakabya, urugero ni ku mukino wa UEFA Champions League wahuje Manchester United na VillaReal, aho CR7 yatsinze igitego akamwogeza atanga akabizu kuri Radiyo, ibi ni bimwe mu bitaravuzweho rumwe n\u2019abafana ba Messi kuko ku Mbuga Nkoranyambaga benshi bagiye bavuga ko n\u2019ubwo kogeza bisaba kuzana udushya dukurura abantu ariko ko we yakabije gufana.."}
{"id": "18310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18310", "title": "Ish kevin", "text": "Ish Kevin.\nSEMANA Kevin umaze kwamamara munjyana ya hipop uzwi ku izina rya Ish kevin ni umuraperi hano mu u Rwanda akaba tariki28/5/2023 yaje gutangariza abakunzi be ko agiye gusohora album ye yambere yise Blood,Sweat and Tears ni mugihe yaramaze gukora mixtap ebyiri na IP ebyiri kuva yatangira urugendo rwe rwa muzika mumwaka wa 2019\nIsh kevin yashinze inzu itunganya umuziki.\nIsh Kevin uri mu bahanzi bagezweho cyane mu muziki Nyarwanda ugezweho cyane cyane mu jyana ya Trappish Music.\nKuri ubu uyu muhanzi ufatwa nk\u2019uyoboye ikiragano gishya, yamaze gushinga inzu ye itunganya umuziki yise Trappish Records, ihereye mu Mujyi wa Kigali, Kacyiru\nUyu muhanzi yaganiriye na radio 1 yabajijwe icyamuteye Studio ye nk\u2019umuhanzi ukiri muto yakagombye kuba yarakozemo ibindi.\nIsh Kevin yasubije umunyamakuru ko we urukundo akunda umuziki aricyo kintu cyatumye agira igitekerezo cyo gushinga Studio.\nIsh Kevin yakomeje avuga ko iyo nzu ifunguye umuryango no ku bandi bahanzi niyo baba bakora izindi njyana zitandukanye."}
